#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/ansible-compliance-as-code.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Compliance as Code"
msgstr "ການປະຕິບັດຕາມຂໍ້ກຳນົດໃນຮູບແບບລະຫັດ (Compliance as Code)"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/ansible-compliance-as-code.adoc:2
msgid ""
"This document provides insight on running compliance as code remediation "
"using an Ansible Playbook."
msgstr "ເອກະສານນີ້ໃຫ້ຂໍ້ມູນກ່ຽວກັບການແກ້ໄຂບັນຫາການປະຕິບັດຕາມຂໍ້ກຳນົດ (compliance remediation) ໂດຍໃຊ້ Ansible Playbook."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/ansible-compliance-as-code.adoc:3
msgid ""
"For more infomation about running compliance as code remediation using a "
"bash script, see xref:administration:openscap.adoc#remediation[Remediation]."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບການແກ້ໄຂໂດຍໃຊ້ bash script, ເບິ່ງໄດ້ທີ່ xref:administration:openscap.adoc#remediation[Remediation]."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/administration/pages/ansible-compliance-as-code.adoc:4
#, no-wrap
msgid "Remediation Using an Ansible Playbook"
msgstr "ການແກ້ໄຂໂດຍໃຊ້ Ansible Playbook"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/ansible-compliance-as-code.adoc:5
msgid ""
"An Ansible control node is required.  For more information, see "
"xref:administration:ansible-setup-control-node.adoc[]."
msgstr "ຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງມີ Ansible control node. ເບິ່ງຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມໄດ້ທີ່ xref:administration:ansible-setup-control-node.adoc[]."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/ansible-compliance-as-code.adoc:6
msgid ""
"The following procedure will guide you through running remediation using an "
"Ansible playbook."
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນຕໍ່ໄປນີ້ຈະແນະນຳທ່ານກ່ຽວກັບການແກ້ໄຂໂດຍໃຊ້ Ansible playbook."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/administration/pages/ansible-compliance-as-code.adoc:7
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Run Remediation Using an Ansible Playbook"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການປະມວນຜົນການແກ້ໄຂໂດຍໃຊ້ Ansible Playbook"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/ansible-compliance-as-code.adoc:8
msgid ""
"From the control node system menu select menu:Ansible[Playbooks], and click "
"a playbook, for example:"
msgstr "ຈາກເມນູລະບົບ control node, ເລືອກ menu:Ansible[Playbooks], ແລະ ຄລິກ playbook, ຕົວຢ່າງ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/ansible-compliance-as-code.adoc:9
#, no-wrap
msgid "sle15-playbook-stig.yml\n"
msgstr "sle15-playbook-stig.yml\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/ansible-compliance-as-code.adoc:10
msgid ""
"To run the playbook, select the `Inventory Path` for the clients, for "
"example:"
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/ansible-compliance-as-code.adoc:11
#, no-wrap
msgid "/etc/ansible/sles15\n"
msgstr "/etc/ansible/sles15\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/ansible-compliance-as-code.adoc:12
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap.adoc:97
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap.adoc:104
msgid "Click btn:[Schedule]."
msgstr "ຄລິກ btn:[Schedule]."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/ansible-compliance-as-code.adoc:13
msgid "Check the status of the scheduled event under the `Events` tab."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/ansible-compliance-as-code.adoc:14
msgid ""
"In case playbooks are in a different directory, you can follow the link to "
"`Setup Ansible Control Node` to find out how to add it."
msgstr ""

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/ansible-integration.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Ansible Integration"
msgstr "ການເຊື່ອມໂຍງ Ansible"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/ansible-integration.adoc:2
msgid ""
"Ansible is a tool to manage computer client systems.  For more information, "
"see https://www.ansible.com."
msgstr "Ansible ແມ່ນເຄື່ອງມືສຳລັບບໍລິຫານຈັດການລະບົບຄອມພິວເຕີ Client. ເບິ່ງຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມໄດ້ທີ່ https://www.ansible.com."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/ansible-integration.adoc:3
msgid ""
"{productname} supports managing Ansible control nodes.  For more "
"information, see "
"xref:administration:ansible-setup-control-node.adoc#at.ansible.overview[]."
msgstr "{productname} ຮອງຮັບການບໍລິຫານຈັດການ Ansible control nodes. ເບິ່ງຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມໄດ້ທີ່ xref:administration:ansible-setup-control-node.adoc#at.ansible.overview[]."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/ansible-integration.adoc:4
msgid ""
"The supported version for the Ansible Control Node is Ansible 11.3.  It "
"should be obtained from the operating system vendor's official "
"repositories.  For example, on {sle} 15 SP6 and SP7, Ansible is available "
"through the `Systems Management Module.` For Control Nodes running operating "
"systems other than {sle}, use Ansible shipped together with that "
"distribution."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/ansible-integration.adoc:5
msgid ""
"Ansible software is also available for {productname} Proxy and {productname} "
"{smr} Branch Server."
msgstr "ຊອບແວ Ansible ຍັງມີໃຫ້ສຳລັບ {productname} Proxy ແລະ {productname} {smr} Branch Server."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/administration/pages/ansible-integration.adoc:6
#, no-wrap
msgid "Feature Overview"
msgstr "ພາບລວມຂອງຟີເຈີ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/ansible-integration.adoc:7
msgid ""
"{productname} enables system administrators to operate their Ansible Control "
"Nodes.  Supported features are:"
msgstr "{productname} ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ຜູ້ບໍລິຫານລະບົບສາມາດຄວບຄຸມ Ansible Control Nodes ໄດ້. ຟີເຈີທີ່ຮອງຮັບມີດັ່ງນີ້:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/ansible-integration.adoc:8
msgid "inspection of inventory files"
msgstr "ການກວດສອບໄຟລ໌ inventory"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/ansible-integration.adoc:9
msgid "discovery of playbooks"
msgstr "ການຄົ້ນຫາ playbooks"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/ansible-integration.adoc:10
msgid "execution of playbooks"
msgstr "ການປະມວນຜົນ playbooks"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/ansible-integration.adoc:11
msgid "For more information:"
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/ansible-integration.adoc:12
msgid ""
"The inventory is a sorted list of managed Ansible nodes.  For more "
"information about organizing an inventory, see "
"https://docs.ansible.com/ansible/latest/inventory_guide/intro_inventory.html."
msgstr "Inventory ແມ່ນລາຍການທີ່ຈັດລຽງຂອງ Ansible nodes ທີ່ຖືກຄວບຄຸມ. ເບິ່ງຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບການຈັດການ inventory ໄດ້ທີ່ https://docs.ansible.com/ansible/latest/inventory_guide/intro_inventory.html."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/ansible-integration.adoc:13
msgid ""
"Playbooks are a way to describe how the inventory is to be managed.  For "
"more information about playbooks, see "
"https://docs.ansible.com/ansible/latest/playbook_guide/playbooks_intro.html."
msgstr "Playbooks ແມ່ນວິທີການອະທິບາຍວ່າຈະຈັດການ inventory ແນວໃດ. ເບິ່ງຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມໄດ້ທີ່ https://docs.ansible.com/ansible/latest/playbook_guide/playbooks_intro.html."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/administration/pages/ansible-integration.adoc:14
#, no-wrap
msgid "Requirements and Basic Configuration"
msgstr "ຂໍ້ກຳນົດ ແລະ ການຕັ້ງຄ່າເບື້ອງຕົ້ນ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/ansible-integration.adoc:15
msgid ""
"To use Ansible features, you need to register the already existing Ansible "
"Control Node to the {productname} Server.  In the {webui}, on the "
"menu:System Details[Properties] page of the registered system, you must "
"enable the `Ansible Control Node` system type of the `Add-on System Types` "
"list."
msgstr ""

#.  FIXME: check it!
#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/ansible-integration.adoc:16
msgid ""
"Enabling the `Ansible Control Node` system type ensures that the `ansible` "
"package is installed on the system by adding it in the highstate and "
"activates the Ansible features under the menu:System Details[Ansible] tab."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/ansible-integration.adoc:17
msgid ""
"As the next step, configure the paths to your Ansible playbook directories "
"and inventory files on the menu:System Details[Ansible > Control Node] "
"page.  As an inventory path, you can use the standard Ansible inventory path "
"`/etc/ansible/hosts`.  As a playbook directory, you can use any directory on "
"the control node, where your playbook files are stored.  A playbook "
"directory either contains `.yml` files or subdirectories with `.yml` files."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/ansible-integration.adoc:18
msgid ""
"For installing and setting up an Ansible Control Node, see "
"xref:administration:ansible-setup-control-node.adoc[]."
msgstr "ສຳລັບການຕິດຕັ້ງ ແລະ ຕັ້ງຄ່າ Ansible Control Node, ເບິ່ງໄດ້ທີ່ xref:administration:ansible-setup-control-node.adoc[]."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/administration/pages/ansible-integration.adoc:19
#, no-wrap
msgid "Inventory Inspection"
msgstr "ການກວດສອບ Inventory"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/ansible-integration.adoc:20
msgid ""
"After defining an inventory path, you can use {productname} to inspect its "
"contents."
msgstr "ຫຼັງຈາກກຳນົດ inventory path ແລ້ວ, ທ່ານສາມາດໃຊ້ {productname} ເພື່ອກວດສອບເນື້ອໃນຂອງມັນໄດ້."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/administration/pages/ansible-integration.adoc:21
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Inspecting an Inventory from the {webui}"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການກວດສອບ Inventory ຈາກ {webui}"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/ansible-integration.adoc:22
msgid ""
"In the {productname} {webui}, navigate to menu:System Details[Ansible > "
"Inventories]"
msgstr "ໃນ {productname} {webui}, ໄປທີ່ menu:System Details[Ansible > Inventories]"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/ansible-integration.adoc:23
msgid ""
"Click an inventory path to execute the inventory inspection on the Control "
"Node in real-time."
msgstr "ຄລິກທີ່ inventory path ເພື່ອເລີ່ມກວດສອບ inventory ເທິງ Control Node ແບບຣຽວທາມ (real-time)."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/administration/pages/ansible-integration.adoc:24
#, no-wrap
msgid "Playbook Discovery"
msgstr "ການຄົ້ນຫາ Playbook"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/ansible-integration.adoc:25
msgid ""
"After defining a playbook directory, you can discover playbooks on the "
"menu:System Details[Ansible > Playbooks] page."
msgstr "ຫຼັງຈາກກຳນົດ playbook directory ແລ້ວ, ທ່ານສາມາດຄົ້ນຫາ playbooks ໄດ້ໃນໜ້າ menu:System Details[Ansible > Playbooks]."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/ansible-integration.adoc:26
msgid ""
"As with the inventory inspection, the playbook discovery operations run on "
"the Control Node in real-time."
msgstr "ເຊັ່ນດຽວກັນກັບການກວດສອບ inventory, ການຄົ້ນຫາ playbook ຈະເຮັດວຽກເທິງ Control Node ແບບຣຽວທາມ."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/administration/pages/ansible-integration.adoc:27
#, no-wrap
msgid "Playbook Execution"
msgstr "ການປະມວນຜົນ Playbook"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/ansible-integration.adoc:28
msgid ""
"You can schedule a playbook execution from the menu:System Details[Ansible > "
"Playbooks] page.  After selecting the playbook you wish to execute, you can "
"select the inventory file for the execution from the `Inventory Path` "
"drop-down menu of the `Schedule Playbook Execution` dialog.  If you do not "
"select any item, the default inventory configured in your Control Node will "
"be used.  The drop-down menu is populated with the inventories you defined "
"in your Inventory paths and with inventories that have been locally "
"discovered in your playbook directories.  These are displayed as `Custom "
"Inventory` items in the playbook details.  You can also enter an arbitrary "
"inventory path."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/ansible-integration.adoc:29
msgid ""
"You can also pass variables to the playbook execution to override previously "
"defined variables.  To pass variables, locate the [guimenu]``Playbook "
"Content`` section and click btn:[Edit variables].  In the [guimenu]``Edit "
"Variables`` dialog, you can add or edit variables as a list, dictionary, "
"string, or boolean.  Alternatively, click btn:[Edit YAML] to edit the "
"variables directly as YAML. Click btn:[Save] to apply the variables to the "
"playbook content."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/ansible-integration.adoc:30
msgid ""
"Afterwards, you choose the time of the playbook execution or select an "
"action chain.  Eventually, {productname} executes the playbook as an action "
"on the Control Node.  You can see the result of the operation on the action "
"details page."
msgstr "ຫຼັງຈາກນັ້ນ, ໃຫ້ເລືອກເວລາທີ່ຈະປະມວນຜົນ ຫຼື ເລືອກ action chain. ໃນທີ່ສຸດ {productname} ຈະເລີ່ມເຮັດວຽກ playbook ເປັນການດຳເນີນການໜຶ່ງເທິງ Control Node. ທ່ານສາມາດເບິ່ງຜົນການເຮັດວຽກໄດ້ໃນໜ້າລາຍລະອຽດການດຳເນີນການ."

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/ansible-setup-control-node.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Setup Ansible Control Node"
msgstr "ການຕັ້ງຄ່າ Ansible Control Node"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/ansible-setup-control-node.adoc:2
msgid ""
"To set up an Ansible control node, execute the following steps from the "
"{productname} {webui}."
msgstr "ເພື່ອຕັ້ງຄ່າ Ansible control node, ໃຫ້ເຮັດຕາມຂັ້ນຕອນຕໍ່ໄປນີ້ຈາກ {productname} {webui}."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/ansible-setup-control-node.adoc:3
msgid ""
"To configure a client as the Ansible Control Node, the Ansible package must "
"be installed on that system.  Usually, the Ansible package should be "
"obtained from the operating system vendor's official repositories.  For "
"example, on {sle} 15 SP6 and SP7, Ansible is available through the `Systems "
"Management Module.`"
msgstr ""

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/administration/pages/ansible-setup-control-node.adoc:4
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Setting up Ansible Control Node on a {sle} 15 SP6 or SP7 system"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການຕັ້ງຄ່າ Ansible Control Node ເທິງລະບົບ {sle} 15 SP6 ຫຼື SP7"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/ansible-setup-control-node.adoc:5
msgid ""
"In the {productname} {webui}, navigate to menu:Admin[Setup Wizard > "
"Products], verify that `SUSE Linux Enterprise Server 15 SP6 x86_64` (or "
"later) with the `Systems Management Module` and the required `Python 3 "
"Module` are selected and synchronized."
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/ansible-setup-control-node.adoc:6
msgid "Deploy a {sle} 15 SP6 (or later) client."
msgstr "ຕິດຕັ້ງ Client {sle} 15 SP6 (ຫຼື ໃໝ່ກວ່າ)."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/ansible-setup-control-node.adoc:7
msgid ""
"In the {productname} {webui}, navigate to the menu:Systems[Overview] page of "
"the client.  Select menu:Software[Software Channels] and subscribe the "
"client to the `SUSE Linux Enterprise Server 15 SP6 x86_64` (or later SP), "
"`Systems Management Module` and `Python 3 Module` channels."
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/ansible-setup-control-node.adoc:8
msgid ""
"Select menu:Details[Properties] of your client.  From the `Add-On System "
"Types` list enable `Ansible Control Node` and click btn:[Update Properties]."
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/ansible-setup-control-node.adoc:9
msgid ""
"Navigate to the client overview page, select menu:State[Highstate], and "
"click btn:[Apply Highstate]."
msgstr "ໄປທີ່ໜ້າພາບລວມຂອງ Client, ເລືອກ menu:State[Highstate], ແລ້ວຄລິກ btn:[Apply Highstate]."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/ansible-setup-control-node.adoc:10
msgid "Select the menu:Events[] tab and verify the status of the highstate."
msgstr "ເລືອກແທັບ menu:Events[] ແລະ ກວດສອບສະຖານະຂອງ highstate."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/ansible-setup-control-node.adoc:11
msgid ""
"If you want to install a newer Ansible on a {sle} 15 SP4 or SP5 client, you "
"must enable the `Python 3 Module`."
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/ansible-setup-control-node.adoc:12
msgid ""
"Newer versions of Ansible no longer support managing nodes with outdated "
"Python versions.  If a managed node still defaults to an older Python "
"version, you may encounter connection errors or failures during playbook "
"runs.  To address this, user should upgrade Python on the managed node, if "
"possible and set the correct Python interpreter in the Ansible inventory or "
"configuration."
msgstr "Ansible ເວີຊັນໃໝ່ໆຈະບໍ່ຮອງຮັບການຈັດການ nodes ທີ່ໃຊ້ Python ເວີຊັນເກົ່າ. ຖ້າ node ຍັງໃຊ້ Python ລຸ້ນເກົ່າ, ທ່ານອາດຈະພົບບັນຫາການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ ຫຼື ການເຮັດວຽກຂອງ playbook ຫຼົ້ມເຫຼວ. ເພື່ອແກ້ໄຂ, ຜູ້ໃຊ້ຄວນອັບເກຣດ Python ໃນ node ນັ້ນ ແລະ ຕັ້ງຄ່າ Python interpreter ໃຫ້ຖືກຕ້ອງໃນ Ansible inventory ຫຼື ການຕັ້ງຄ່າ."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/administration/pages/ansible-setup-control-node.adoc:13
#, no-wrap
msgid "Create Ansible Inventory Files"
msgstr "ສ້າງໄຟລ໌ Ansible Inventory"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/ansible-setup-control-node.adoc:14
msgid ""
"Ansible Integration tools deploy a playbook as an inventory file.  Create "
"one inventory file for each operating system listed in _Table 1_."
msgstr "ເຄື່ອງມືການເຊື່ອມໂຍງ Ansible ຈະໃຊ້ playbook ເປັນໄຟລ໌ inventory. ໃຫ້ສ້າງໄຟລ໌ inventory ຢ່າງໜ້ອຍໜຶ່ງໄຟລ໌ສຳລັບແຕ່ລະລະບົບປະຕິບັດການທີ່ລະບຸໃນ _Table 1_."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/administration/pages/ansible-setup-control-node.adoc:15
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Creating Ansible Inventory Files"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການສ້າງໄຟລ໌ Ansible Inventory"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/ansible-setup-control-node.adoc:16
msgid ""
"Create and add your hosts to an inventory file to be managed by Ansible.  "
"The default path for an Ansible inventory is `/etc/ansible/hosts`."
msgstr ""

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/administration/pages/ansible-setup-control-node.adoc:17
#, no-wrap
msgid "Inventory Example"
msgstr "ຕົວຢ່າງ Inventory"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/ansible-setup-control-node.adoc:18
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"client240.mgr.example.org\n"
"client241.mgr.example.org\n"
"client242.mgr.example.org\n"
"client243.mgr.example.org "
"ansible_ssh_private_key_file=/etc/ansible/some_ssh_key\n"
msgstr ""
"client240.mgr.example.org\n"
"client241.mgr.example.org\n"
"client242.mgr.example.org\n"
"client243.mgr.example.org ansible_ssh_private_key_file=/etc/ansible/some_ssh_key\n"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/ansible-setup-control-node.adoc:19
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"[mygroup1]\n"
"client241.mgr.example.org\n"
"client242.mgr.example.org\n"
msgstr ""
"[mygroup1]\n"
"client241.mgr.example.org\n"
"client242.mgr.example.org\n"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/ansible-setup-control-node.adoc:20
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"[mygroup2]\n"
"client243.mgr.example.org\n"
msgstr ""
"[mygroup2]\n"
"client243.mgr.example.org\n"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/ansible-setup-control-node.adoc:21
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"[all:vars]\n"
"ansible_ssh_public_key_file=/etc/ansible/my_ansible_private_key\n"
msgstr ""
"[all:vars]\n"
"ansible_ssh_public_key_file=/etc/ansible/my_ansible_private_key\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/ansible-setup-control-node.adoc:22
msgid ""
"In the {productname} {webui}, from the `Ansible` tab navigate to "
"menu:Ansible[Control Node] to add inventory files to the control node."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/ansible-setup-control-node.adoc:23
msgid ""
"Under the `Playbook Directories` section add "
"`/usr/share/scap-security-guide/ansible` to the `Add a Playbook Directories` "
"field and click btn:[Save]."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/ansible-setup-control-node.adoc:24
msgid ""
"Under `Inventory Files` add your inventory file locations to the `Add an "
"Inventory file` field and click btn:[Save]."
msgstr ""

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/administration/pages/ansible-setup-control-node.adoc:25
#, no-wrap
msgid "Examples"
msgstr "ຕົວຢ່າງ"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/ansible-setup-control-node.adoc:26
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"/etc/ansible/sles15\n"
"/etc/ansible/sles12\n"
"/etc/ansible/centos7\n"
msgstr ""
"/etc/ansible/sles15\n"
"/etc/ansible/sles12\n"
"/etc/ansible/centos7\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/ansible-setup-control-node.adoc:27
msgid ""
"For additional playbook examples, see "
"https://github.com/ansible/ansible-examples."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຕົວຢ່າງ playbook ເພີ່ມເຕີມ, ເບິ່ງໄດ້ທີ່ https://github.com/ansible/ansible-examples."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/administration/pages/ansible-setup-control-node.adoc:28
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Establishing Communication with Ansible Nodes"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການສ້າງການສື່ສານກັບ Ansible Nodes"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/ansible-setup-control-node.adoc:29
msgid "Create the SSH keys that you are using in your inventory."
msgstr "ສ້າງ SSH keys ທີ່ທ່ານຈະໃຊ້ໃນ inventory ຂອງທ່ານ."

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/ansible-setup-control-node.adoc:30
#, no-wrap
msgid "ssh-keygen -f /etc/ansible/my_ansible_private_key\n"
msgstr "ssh-keygen -f /etc/ansible/my_ansible_private_key\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/ansible-setup-control-node.adoc:31
msgid "Copy the generated SSH keys to the Ansible managed clients.  Example:"
msgstr "ກັອບປີ້ SSH keys ທີ່ສ້າງຂຶ້ນໄປຍັງ Client ທີ່ Ansible ຈັດການ. ຕົວຢ່າງ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/ansible-setup-control-node.adoc:32
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"ssh-copy-id -i /etc/ansible/my_ansible_public_key "
"root@client240.mgr.example.org\n"
msgstr "ssh-copy-id -i /etc/ansible/my_ansible_public_key root@client240.mgr.example.org\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/ansible-setup-control-node.adoc:33
msgid "Declare the private key in `/etc/ansible/ansible.cfg` as follows:"
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/ansible-setup-control-node.adoc:34
#, no-wrap
msgid "private_key_file = /etc/ansible/my_ansible_private_key\n"
msgstr "private_key_file = /etc/ansible/my_ansible_private_key\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/ansible-setup-control-node.adoc:35
msgid ""
"Replace `my_ansible_private_key` with the name of the file containing the "
"private key."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/ansible-setup-control-node.adoc:36
msgid ""
"Test that Ansible is working by executing the following commands from the "
"control node:"
msgstr "ທົດສອບວ່າ Ansible ເຮັດວຽກໄດ້ຫຼືບໍ່ ໂດຍການໃຊ້ຄຳສັ່ງຕໍ່ໄປນີ້ຈາກ control node:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/ansible-setup-control-node.adoc:37
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"ansible all -m ping\n"
"ansible mygroup1 -m ping\n"
"ansible client240.mgr.example.org -m ping\n"
msgstr ""
"ansible all -m ping\n"
"ansible mygroup1 -m ping\n"
"ansible client240.mgr.example.org -m ping\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/ansible-setup-control-node.adoc:38
msgid ""
"You may now run remediations.  For more information, see "
"xref:administration:ansible-compliance-as-code.adoc[]."
msgstr "ດຽວນີ້ທ່ານສາມາດເລີ່ມການແກ້ໄຂ (remediations) ໄດ້ແລ້ວ. ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ, ເບິ່ງໄດ້ທີ່ xref:administration:ansible-compliance-as-code.adoc[]."

#.  bsc#1213077 #9
#.  section on how to create playbooks, and how to schedule their execution.
#.  Add a description of the "Playbooks" tab, in general context.
#.  There is a very summarized descriptions in next section "Compliance as code", but we // need a description of the playbooks tab that is independent of usage with openscap.
#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auditing.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Auditing"
msgstr "ການກວດສອບ (Auditing)"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auditing.adoc:2
msgid ""
"In {productname}, you can keep track of your clients through a series of "
"auditing tasks.  You can check that your clients are up to date with all "
"public security patches (CVEs), perform subscription matching, and use "
"OpenSCAP to check for specification compliance."
msgstr "ໃນ {productname}, ທ່ານສາມາດຕິດຕາມ Client ຂອງທ່ານຜ່ານວຽກງານການກວດສອບຕ່າງໆ. ທ່ານສາມາດກວດສອບວ່າ Client ໄດ້ອັບເດດແພັດຊ໌ຄວາມປອດໄພ (CVEs) ຄົບຖ້ວນຫຼືບໍ່, ເຮັດການຈັບຄູ່ການສະໝັກໃຊ້, ແລະ ໃຊ້ OpenSCAP ເພື່ອກວດສອບການປະຕິບັດຕາມຂໍ້ກຳນົດ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auditing.adoc:3
msgid "In the {productname} {webui}, navigate to `Audit` to perform auditing tasks."
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auditing.adoc:4
#, no-wrap
msgid "CVE audits"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auditing.adoc:5
msgid ""
"A CVE (Common Vulnerabilities and Exposures) is a fix for a publicly known "
"security vulnerability."
msgstr "CVE (Common Vulnerabilities and Exposures) ແມ່ນການແກ້ໄຂສຳລັບຊ່ອງໂຫວ່ຄວາມປອດໄພທີ່ຖືກເປີດເຜີຍຕໍ່ສາທາລະນະ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auditing.adoc:6
msgid "You must apply CVEs to your clients as soon as they become available."
msgstr "ທ່ານຄວນຕິດຕັ້ງ CVE ໃຫ້ກັບ Client ຂອງທ່ານທັນທີທີ່ມີການເຜີຍແຜ່."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auditing.adoc:7
msgid ""
"Each CVE contains an identification number, a description of the "
"vulnerability, and links to further information.  CVE identification numbers "
"use the form `CVE-YEAR-XXXX`."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auditing.adoc:8
msgid ""
"In the {productname} {webui}, navigate to menu:Audit[CVE Audit] to see a "
"list of all clients and their current patch status."
msgstr "ໃນ {productname} {webui}, ໃຫ້ໄປທີ່ menu:Audit[CVE Audit] ເພື່ອເບິ່ງລາຍການ Client ທັງໝົດ ແລະ ສະຖານະແພັດຊ໌ຂອງພວກເຂົາ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auditing.adoc:9
msgid ""
"By default, the patch data is updated at 23:00 every day.  We recommend that "
"before you begin a CVE audit you refresh the data to ensure you have the "
"latest patches."
msgstr "ໂດຍປົກກະຕິ, ຂໍ້ມູນແພັດຊ໌ຈະຖືກອັບເດດເວລາ 23:00 ຂອງທຸກໆວັນ. ພວກເຮົາແນະນຳໃຫ້ທ່ານຣີເຟຣຊຂໍ້ມູນກ່ອນເລີ່ມການກວດສອບ CVE ເພື່ອໃຫ້ໝັ້ນໃຈວ່າມີຂໍ້ມູນແພັດຊ໌ຫຼ້າສຸດ."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auditing.adoc:10
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Updating patch data"
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auditing.adoc:11
msgid ""
"In the {productname} {webui}, navigate to menu:Admin[Task Schedules] and "
"select the `cve-server-channels-default` schedule."
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auditing.adoc:12
msgid "Click btn:[cve-server-channels-bunch]."
msgstr "ຄລິກ btn:[cve-server-channels-bunch]."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auditing.adoc:13
msgid ""
"Click btn:[Single Run Schedule] to schedule the task.  Allow the task to "
"complete before continuing with the CVE audit."
msgstr "ຄລິກ btn:[Single Run Schedule] ເພື່ອກຳນົດວຽກ. ລໍຖ້າໃຫ້ວຽກເຮັດສຳເລັດກ່ອນທີ່ຈະດຳເນີນການກວດສອບ CVE ຕໍ່ໄປ."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auditing.adoc:14
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Verifying patch status"
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auditing.adoc:15
msgid "In the {productname} {webui}, navigate to menu:Audit[CVE Audit]."
msgstr "ໃນ {productname} {webui}, ໄປທີ່ menu:Audit[CVE Audit]."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auditing.adoc:16
msgid ""
"To check the patch status for a particular CVE, type the CVE identifier in "
"the `CVE Number` field."
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auditing.adoc:17
msgid ""
"Select the patch statuses you want to look for, or leave all statuses "
"checked to look for all."
msgstr "ເລືອກສະຖານະແພັດຊ໌ທີ່ທ່ານຕ້ອງການຄົ້ນຫາ, ຫຼື ໝາຍເລືອກທັງໝົດເພື່ອຄົ້ນຫາທຸກສະຖານະ."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auditing.adoc:18
msgid ""
"Click btn:[Audit Servers] to check all systems, or click btn:[Audit Images] "
"to check all images."
msgstr "ຄລິກ btn:[Audit Servers] ເພື່ອກວດສອບທຸກລະບົບ, ຫຼື ຄລິກ btn:[Audit Images] ເພື່ອກວດສອບທຸກອິມເມຈ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auditing.adoc:19
msgid ""
"For more information about the patch status icons used on this page, see "
"xref:reference:audit/audit-cve-audit.adoc[]."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບໄອຄອນສະຖານະແພັດຊ໌ທີ່ໃຊ້ໃນໜ້ານີ້, ເບິ່ງໄດ້ທີ່ xref:reference:audit/audit-cve-audit.adoc[]."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auditing.adoc:20
msgid ""
"For each system, the `Actions` column provides information about what you "
"need to do to address vulnerabilities.  If applicable, a list of candidate "
"channels or patches is also given.  You can also assign systems to a `System "
"Set` for further batch processing."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auditing.adoc:21
msgid ""
"You can use the {productname} API to verify the patch status of your "
"clients.  Use the `audit.listSystemsByPatchStatus` API method.  For more "
"information about this method, see the {productname} API Guide."
msgstr ""

#. type: Labeled list
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auditing.adoc:22
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auditing.adoc:26
#, no-wrap
msgid "OVAL"
msgstr "OVAL"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auditing.adoc:23
msgid ""
"The CVE Audit operation relies on two primary data sources: channels and "
"OVAL (Open Vulnerability and Assessment Language).  These two sources "
"provide the metadata for conducting CVE audits, each serving a distinct "
"purpose."
msgstr "ການກວດສອບ CVE ຈະອີງຕາມແຫຼ່ງຂໍ້ມູນຫຼັກສອງຢ່າງຄື: ຊ່ອງທາງ (channels) ແລະ OVAL (Open Vulnerability and Assessment Language). ແຫຼ່ງຂໍ້ມູນທັງສອງນີ້ຈະໃຫ້ຂໍ້ມູນເມຕາສຳລັບການກວດສອບ CVE ເຊິ່ງແຕ່ລະຢ່າງມີຈຸດປະສົງຕ່າງກັນ."

#. type: Labeled list
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auditing.adoc:24
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap.adoc:110
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap.adoc:122
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap.adoc:132
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap.adoc:142
#, no-wrap
msgid "Channels"
msgstr "ຊ່ອງທາງ (Channels)"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auditing.adoc:25
msgid ""
"Channels include the updated software packages, including the patches, and "
"provide insights into the essential patches required to address "
"vulnerabilities."
msgstr "ຊ່ອງທາງຕ່າງໆຈະລວມເອົາແພັກເກັດຊອບແວທີ່ອັບເດດໃໝ່, ລວມເຖິງແພັດຊ໌, ແລະ ໃຫ້ຂໍ້ມູນກ່ຽວກັບແພັດຊ໌ທີ່ຈຳເປັນເພື່ອແກ້ໄຂຊ່ອງໂຫວ່."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auditing.adoc:27
msgid ""
"In contrast, OVAL data supply the information about vulnerabilities "
"themselves, and packages that render a system vulnerable to a CVE."
msgstr "ໃນທາງກົງກັນຂ້າມ, ຂໍ້ມູນ OVAL ຈະໃຫ້ຂໍ້ມູນກ່ຽວກັບຕົວຊ່ອງໂຫວ່ເອງ ແລະ ແພັກເກັດທີ່ເຮັດໃຫ້ລະບົບສ່ຽງຕໍ່ CVE ນັ້ນໆ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auditing.adoc:28
msgid ""
"While it is possible to conduct CVE audits using only channels data, "
"synchronizing OVAL data enhances the accuracy of the results, particularly "
"in cases involving zero-day vulnerabilities or partially patched "
"vulnerabilities."
msgstr "ເຖິງວ່າຈະສາມາດກວດສອບ CVE ໂດຍໃຊ້ພຽງແຕ່ຂໍ້ມູນຊ່ອງທາງໄດ້, ແຕ່ການຊິງຂໍ້ມູນ OVAL ຈະຊ່ວຍເພີ່ມຄວາມຖືກຕ້ອງຂອງຜົນລັດ, ໂດຍສະເພາະໃນກໍລະນີຊ່ອງໂຫວ່ແບບ zero-day ຫຼື ຊ່ອງໂຫວ່ທີ່ຍັງແກ້ໄຂບໍ່ຄົບຖ້ວນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auditing.adoc:29
msgid ""
"OVAL data is much more lightweight than channels data.  For example, OVAL "
"data for {opensuse} Leap 15.4 is around 50{nbsp}MB."
msgstr "ຂໍ້ມູນ OVAL ມີຂະໜາດເບົາບາງກວ່າຂໍ້ມູນຊ່ອງທາງຫຼາຍ. ຕົວຢ່າງ: ຂໍ້ມູນ OVAL ສຳລັບ {opensuse} Leap 15.4 ມີຂະໜາດປະມານ 50 MB."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auditing.adoc:30
msgid ""
"Having synced OVAL data only, you can already perform CVE audits and check "
"if your systems are vulnerable or not to a CVE, but you can't apply patches "
"since they come from channels."
msgstr "ຖ້າຊິງພຽງແຕ່ຂໍ້ມູນ OVAL, ທ່ານກໍສາມາດກວດສອບ CVE ແລະ ເບິ່ງວ່າລະບົບສ່ຽງຫຼືບໍ່ໄດ້ແລ້ວ, ແຕ່ທ່ານຈະຍັງບໍ່ສາມາດຕິດຕັ້ງແພັດຊ໌ໄດ້ ເພາະແພັດຊ໌ຕ້ອງມາຈາກຊ່ອງທາງ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auditing.adoc:31
msgid "Key characteristics of the OVAL feature include:"
msgstr "ລັກສະນະທີ່ສຳຄັນຂອງຟີເຈີ OVAL ມີດັ່ງນີ້:"

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auditing.adoc:32
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"*Enabled by default*: The feature is enabled by default and requires no "
"additional configuration.\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auditing.adoc:33
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"*Reversible*: If needed, users can disable OVAL data and revert to the "
"standard channel-based CVE audit.\n"
"See <<disable-oval-data,Disabling OVAL Data Support>> below.\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auditing.adoc:34
msgid ""
"OVAL data is updated at 23:00 every day by default.  We recommend that "
"before you begin a CVE audit you refresh the data to ensure you have the "
"latest vulnerabilities metadata."
msgstr "ຂໍ້ມູນ OVAL ຈະຖືກອັບເດດເວລາ 23:00 ຂອງທຸກໆວັນ. ພວກເຮົາແນະນຳໃຫ້ທ່ານຣີເຟຣຊຂໍ້ມູນກ່ອນເລີ່ມການກວດສອບ CVE ເພື່ອໃຫ້ໝັ້ນໃຈວ່າມີຂໍ້ມູນເມຕາຂອງຊ່ອງໂຫວ່ຫຼ້າສຸດ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auditing.adoc:35
msgid ""
"The following procedures can be used to enable, disable, or update OVAL "
"data."
msgstr ""

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auditing.adoc:36
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Enabling OVAL data support"
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auditing.adoc:37
msgid ""
"Add or modify the following setting in file `/etc/rhn/rhn.conf` in the "
"container:"
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auditing.adoc:38
#, no-wrap
msgid "java.cve_audit.enable_oval_metadata=true\n"
msgstr "java.cve_audit.enable_oval_metadata=true\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auditing.adoc:39
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auditing.adoc:45
msgid "Restart the Tomcat and Taskomatic services:"
msgstr "ຣີສະຕາດບໍລິການ Tomcat ແລະ Taskomatic:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auditing.adoc:40
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auditing.adoc:46
#, no-wrap
msgid "systemctl restart tomcat taskomatic\n"
msgstr "systemctl restart tomcat taskomatic\n"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auditing.adoc:41
msgid "Alternatively, use the procedure for disabling OVAL data support."
msgstr ""

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auditing.adoc:42
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Disabling OVAL data support"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auditing.adoc:43
msgid "Add or modify the following setting in `rhn.conf`:"
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auditing.adoc:44
#, no-wrap
msgid "java.cve_audit.enable_oval_metadata=false\n"
msgstr "java.cve_audit.enable_oval_metadata=false\n"

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auditing.adoc:47
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Updating OVAL data"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auditing.adoc:48
msgid ""
"In the {productname} {webui}, navigate to menu:Admin[Task Schedules] and "
"select the `oval-data-sync-default` schedule."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auditing.adoc:49
msgid "Click btn:[oval-data-sync-bunch]."
msgstr "ຄລິກ btn:[oval-data-sync-bunch]."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auditing.adoc:50
msgid "Click btn:[Single Run Schedule] to schedule the task."
msgstr "ຄລິກ btn:[Single Run Schedule] ເພື່ອກຳນົດວຽກ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auditing.adoc:51
msgid "Allow the task to complete before continuing with the CVE audit."
msgstr "ລໍຖ້າໃຫ້ວຽກເຮັດສຳເລັດກ່ອນທີ່ຈະດຳເນີນການກວດສອບ CVE ຕໍ່ໄປ."

#. type: Title ===
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auditing.adoc:52
#, no-wrap
msgid "Collect CPE"
msgstr "ການເກັບກຳ CPE"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auditing.adoc:53
msgid ""
"To be able to accurately identify what vulnerabilities apply to a certain "
"client, we need to identify the operating system product that client uses.  "
"To do that, we collect the CPE (Common Platform Enumeration) of the client "
"as a {salt} grain, then we save it to the database."
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auditing.adoc:54
msgid ""
"The CPE of newly registered clients will be automatically collected and "
"saved to the database.  However, for existing clients, it is necessary to "
"execute the `Update Packages List` action at least once."
msgstr ""

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auditing.adoc:55
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Update packages list"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auditing.adoc:56
msgid ""
"In the {productname} {webui}, navigate to menu:Systems[System List > All] "
"and select a client."
msgstr "ໃນ {productname} {webui}, ໄປທີ່ menu:Systems[System List > All] ແລ້ວເລືອກ Client."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auditing.adoc:57
msgid "Then go to the `Software` tab and select the `Packages` sub-tab."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auditing.adoc:58
msgid ""
"Click btn:[Update Packages List] to update packages and collect the CPE of "
"client."
msgstr "ຄລິກ btn:[Update Packages List] ເພື່ອອັບເດດແພັກເກັດ ແລະ ເກັບກຳ CPE ຂອງ Client."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auditing.adoc:59
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auditing.adoc:61
#, no-wrap
msgid "OVAL Sources"
msgstr "ແຫຼ່ງຂໍ້ມູນ OVAL"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auditing.adoc:60
msgid ""
"To ensure the integrity and currency of the OVAL data, {productname} "
"exclusively consumes OVAL data from the official maintainers of every "
"product. Below, you can find the list of OVAL data sources."
msgstr "ເພື່ອໃຫ້ໝັ້ນໃຈໃນຄວາມຖືກຕ້ອງ ແລະ ທັນສະໄໝຂອງຂໍ້ມູນ OVAL, {productname} ຈະດຶງຂໍ້ມູນ OVAL ຈາກຜູ້ດູແລຢ່າງເປັນທາງການຂອງແຕ່ລະຜະລິດຕະພັນເທົ່ານັ້ນ. ທ່ານສາມາດເບິ່ງລາຍການແຫຼ່ງຂໍ້ມູນ OVAL ໄດ້ລຸ່ມນີ້."

