#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auditing.adoc:63
msgid ""
"OVAL metadata is used in CVE auditing for only a subset of clients, namely, "
"clients that use openSUSE Leap, SUSE enterprise products, RHEL, Debian or "
"Ubuntu. This is due to the absence of OVAL vulnerability definitions "
"metadata for the other products."
msgstr "ຂໍ້ມູນເມຕາ OVAL ຈະຖືກໃຊ້ໃນການກວດສອບ CVE ສຳລັບ Client ບາງກຸ່ມເທົ່ານັ້ນ, ຄື: Client ທີ່ໃຊ້ openSUSE Leap, SUSE enterprise products, RHEL, Debian ຫຼື Ubuntu. ເນື່ອງຈາກຍັງບໍ່ມີຂໍ້ມູນ OVAL vulnerability definitions ສຳລັບຜະລິດຕະພັນອື່ນໆ."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auditing.adoc:64
#, no-wrap
msgid "CVE Status"
msgstr "ສະຖານະ CVE"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auditing.adoc:65
msgid ""
"The CVE status of clients is usually either `affected`, `not affected`, or "
"`patched`.  These statuses are based only on the information that is "
"available to {productname}."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auditing.adoc:66
msgid "Within {productname}, these definitions apply:"
msgstr "ພາຍໃນ {productname}, ມີຄຳນິຍາມດັ່ງນີ້:"

#. type: Labeled list
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auditing.adoc:67
#, no-wrap
msgid "System affected by a certain vulnerability"
msgstr "ລະບົບທີ່ໄດ້ຮັບຜົນກະທົບຈາກຊ່ອງໂຫວ່ໃດໜຶ່ງ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auditing.adoc:68
msgid ""
"A system which has an installed package with version lower than the version "
"of the same package in a relevant patch marked for the vulnerability."
msgstr "ລະບົບທີ່ມີແພັກເກັດທີ່ຕິດຕັ້ງໄວ້ເປັນເວີຊັນທີ່ຕໍ່າກວ່າເວີຊັນໃນແພັດຊ໌ທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງກັບຊ່ອງໂຫວ່ນັ້ນ."

#. type: Labeled list
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auditing.adoc:69
#, no-wrap
msgid "System not affected by a certain vulnerability"
msgstr "ລະບົບທີ່ບໍ່ໄດ້ຮັບຜົນກະທົບຈາກຊ່ອງໂຫວ່ໃດໜຶ່ງ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auditing.adoc:70
msgid ""
"A system which has no installed package that is also in a relevant patch "
"marked for the vulnerability."
msgstr "ລະບົບທີ່ບໍ່ມີແພັກເກັດໃດໆທີ່ຕິດຕັ້ງໄວ້ກົງກັບແພັກເກັດໃນແພັດຊ໌ທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງກັບຊ່ອງໂຫວ່ນັ້ນ."

#. type: Labeled list
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auditing.adoc:71
#, no-wrap
msgid "System patched for a certain vulnerability"
msgstr "ລະບົບທີ່ລົງແພັດຊ໌ແກ້ໄຂຊ່ອງໂຫວ່ໃດໜຶ່ງແລ້ວ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auditing.adoc:72
msgid ""
"A system which has an installed package with version equal to or greater "
"than the version of the same package in a relevant patch marked for the "
"vulnerability."
msgstr "ລະບົບທີ່ມີແພັກເກັດທີ່ຕິດຕັ້ງໄວ້ເປັນເວີຊັນທີ່ເທົ່າກັບ ຫຼື ສູງກວ່າເວີຊັນໃນແພັດຊ໌ທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງກັບຊ່ອງໂຫວ່ນັ້ນ."

#. type: Labeled list
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auditing.adoc:73
#, no-wrap
msgid "Relevant patch"
msgstr "ແພັດຊ໌ທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auditing.adoc:74
msgid "A patch known by {productname} in a relevant channel."
msgstr "ແພັດຊ໌ທີ່ {productname} ຮູ້ຈັກໃນຊ່ອງທາງທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງ."

#. type: Labeled list
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auditing.adoc:75
#, no-wrap
msgid "Relevant channel"
msgstr "ຊ່ອງທາງທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auditing.adoc:76
msgid ""
"A channel managed by {productname}, which is either assigned to the system, "
"the original of a cloned channel which is assigned to the system, a channel "
"linked to a product which is installed on the system or a past or future "
"service pack channel for the system."
msgstr "ຊ່ອງທາງທີ່ຈັດການໂດຍ {productname}, ເຊິ່ງອາດຈະເປັນຊ່ອງທາງທີ່ກຳນົດໃຫ້ລະບົບ, ຊ່ອງທາງຕົ້ນສະບັບຂອງຊ່ອງທາງທີ່ກັອບປີ້ມາ, ຊ່ອງທາງທີ່ເຊື່ອມໂຍງກັບຜະລິດຕະພັນທີ່ຕິດຕັ້ງໃນລະບົບ ຫຼື ຊ່ອງທາງ service pack ໃນອະດີດ ຫຼື ອະນາຄົດຂອງລະບົບນັ້ນ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auditing.adoc:77
msgid ""
"Because of the definitions used within {productname}, CVE audit results "
"might be incorrect in some circumstances.  For example, unmanaged channels, "
"unmanaged packages, or non-compliant systems might report incorrectly."
msgstr "ເນື່ອງຈາກຄຳນິຍາມທີ່ໃຊ້ໃນ {productname}, ຜົນການກວດສອບ CVE ອາດຈະບໍ່ຖືກຕ້ອງໃນບາງກໍລະນີ. ຕົວຢ່າງ: ຊ່ອງທາງທີ່ບໍ່ໄດ້ຖືກຈັດການ, ແພັກເກັດທີ່ບໍ່ໄດ້ຖືກຈັດການ, ຫຼື ລະບົບທີ່ບໍ່ໄດ້ປະຕິບັດຕາມຂໍ້ກຳນົດ ອາດຈະມີການລາຍງານທີ່ຜິດພາດ."

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-pam.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Authentication With PAM"
msgstr "ການຢືນຢັນຕົວຕົນດ້ວຍ PAM"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-pam.adoc:2
msgid ""
"{productname} supports network-based authentication systems using pluggable "
"authentication modules (PAM) using SSSD.  PAM is a suite of libraries that "
"allows you to integrate {productname} with a centralized authentication "
"mechanism, eliminating the need to remember multiple passwords.  "
"{productname} supports LDAP, Kerberos, and other network-based "
"authentication protocols."
msgstr "{productname} ຮອງຮັບລະບົບການຢືນຢັນຕົວຕົນຜ່ານເຄືອຂ່າຍໂດຍໃຊ້ pluggable authentication modules (PAM) ຜ່ານ SSSD. PAM ແມ່ນຊຸດຂອງໄລບຣາຣີທີ່ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ທ່ານເຊື່ອມໂຍງ {productname} ເຂົ້າກັບກົນໄກການຢືນຢັນຕົວຕົນແບບລວມສູນ, ເຮັດໃຫ້ບໍ່ຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງຈື່ລະຫັດຜ່ານຫຼາຍອັນ. {productname} ຮອງຮັບ LDAP, Kerberos, ແລະ ໂປຣໂຕຄອນການຢືນຢັນຕົວຕົນຜ່ານເຄືອຂ່າຍອື່ນໆ."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-pam.adoc:3
#, no-wrap
msgid "SSSD Configuration"
msgstr "ການຕັ້ງຄ່າ SSSD"

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-pam.adoc:4
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Configuring SSSD"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການຕັ້ງຄ່າ SSSD"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-pam.adoc:5
msgid ""
"In the {productname} {webui}, navigate to menu:Users[Create User] and enable "
"a new or existing user to authenticate with PAM."
msgstr "ໃນ {productname} {webui}, ໄປທີ່ menu:Users[Create User] ແລະ ເປີດໃຊ້ງານໃຫ້ຜູ້ໃຊ້ໃໝ່ ຫຼື ຜູ້ໃຊ້ທີ່ມີຢູ່ແລ້ວສາມາດຢືນຢັນຕົວຕົນດ້ວຍ PAM."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-pam.adoc:6
msgid ""
"In usernames, additionally to alphanumeric characters, `-`, `_`, `.`, and "
"`@` are allowed."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-pam.adoc:7
msgid "Check the `Pluggable Authentication Modules (PAM)` checkbox."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-pam.adoc:8
msgid ""
"Configure SSSD in the server container.  At the command prompt of the "
"{productname} container host, as root, enter the server container:"
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຄ່າ SSSD ໃນ server container. ທີ່ໜ້າຕ່າງຄຳສັ່ງຂອງ container host, ໃນນາມ root, ໃຫ້ເຂົ້າໄປໃນ server container:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-pam.adoc:9
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-bootstrap-repo-for-eol-products.adoc:6
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-logintimeout.adoc:7
#, no-wrap
msgid "mgrctl term\n"
msgstr "mgrctl term\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-pam.adoc:10
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-bootstrap-repo-for-eol-products.adoc:7
msgid "Inside the container, execute the following steps:"
msgstr "ພາຍໃນ container, ໃຫ້ເຮັດຕາມຂັ້ນຕອນຕໍ່ໄປນີ້:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-pam.adoc:11
msgid ""
"Edit `/etc/sssd/sssd.conf` according to your configuration.  For an example, "
"see xref:administration:auth-methods-pam.adoc#auth-methods-pam-ad[]."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-pam.adoc:12
msgid "When done, exit the container:"
msgstr "ເມື່ອສຳເລັດແລ້ວ, ໃຫ້ອອກຈາກ container:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-pam.adoc:13
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-wicked-to-networkmanager.adoc:46
#, no-wrap
msgid "exit\n"
msgstr "exit\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-pam.adoc:14
msgid "Restart {productname} using:"
msgstr "ຣີສະຕາດ {productname} ດ້ວຍຄຳສັ່ງ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-pam.adoc:15
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso-example.adoc:81
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso.adoc:43
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore.adoc:28
#: en/modules/administration/pages/mirror-sources.adoc:9
#: en/modules/administration/pages/repo-metadata.adoc:28
#: en/modules/administration/pages/space-management.adoc:18
#: en/modules/administration/pages/space-management.adoc:30
#: en/modules/administration/pages/space-management.adoc:44
#: en/modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs-imported.adoc:39
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-diskspace.adoc:32
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-salt-clients-down-and-dns.adoc:13
#, no-wrap
msgid "mgradm restart\n"
msgstr "mgradm restart\n"

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-pam.adoc:16
msgid ""
"Changing the password in the {productname} {webui} changes only the local "
"password on the {productname} Server.  If PAM is enabled for that user, the "
"local password might not be used at all.  In the above example, for "
"instance, the Kerberos password is not changed.  Use the password change "
"mechanism of your network service to change the password for these users."
msgstr "ການປ່ຽນລະຫັດຜ່ານໃນ {productname} {webui} ຈະປ່ຽນສະເພາະລະຫັດຜ່ານທ້ອງຖິ່ນໃນ {productname} Server ເທົ່ານັ້ນ. ຖ້າເປີດໃຊ້ PAM ສຳລັບຜູ້ໃຊ້ນັ້ນ, ລະຫັດຜ່ານທ້ອງຖິ່ນອາດຈະບໍ່ໄດ້ຖືກໃຊ້ເລີຍ. ຕົວຢ່າງເຊັ່ນ: ລະຫັດຜ່ານ Kerberos ຈະບໍ່ຖືກປ່ຽນ. ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ກົນໄກການປ່ຽນລະຫັດຜ່ານຂອງບໍລິການເຄືອຂ່າຍຂອງທ່ານເພື່ອປ່ຽນລະຫັດຜ່ານສຳລັບຜູ້ໃຊ້ເຫຼົ່ານີ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-pam.adoc:17
msgid ""
"For more information about PAM configuration, see the {sles} Security "
"Guide. The Security Guide contains a generic example that also works for "
"other network-based authentication methods.  It also describes how to "
"configure an Active Directory (AD) service.  For more information, see "
"{sles-base-os-documentation}/part-auth.html."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບການຕັ້ງຄ່າ PAM, ເບິ່ງໄດ້ໃນຄູ່ມືຄວາມປອດໄພຂອງ {sles}. ເຊິ່ງຈະມີຕົວຢ່າງທົ່ວໄປທີ່ໃຊ້ໄດ້ກັບວິທີການຢືນຢັນຕົວຕົນຜ່ານເຄືອຂ່າຍອື່ນໆ ແລະ ວິທີຕັ້ງຄ່າບໍລິການ Active Directory (AD). ເບິ່ງເພີ່ມເຕີມໄດ້ທີ່ {sles-base-os-documentation}/part-auth.html."

#. type: Title ===
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-pam.adoc:18
#, no-wrap
msgid "LDAP Integration with Active Directory Example"
msgstr "ຕົວຢ່າງການເຊື່ອມໂຍງ LDAP ກັບ Active Directory"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-pam.adoc:19
msgid ""
"For LDAP integration with Active Directory, you can use the following "
"example."
msgstr "ສຳລັບການເຊື່ອມໂຍງ LDAP ກັບ Active Directory, ທ່ານສາມາດໃຊ້ຕົວຢ່າງຕໍ່ໄປນີ້ໄດ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-pam.adoc:20
msgid ""
"In the code snippet, change the following placeholders according to your "
"environment:"
msgstr "ໃນສ່ວນຂອງໂຄ້ດ, ໃຫ້ປ່ຽນຕົວປ່ຽນຕໍ່ໄປນີ້ຕາມສະພາບແວດລ້ອມຂອງທ່ານ:"

#. type: Labeled list
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-pam.adoc:21
#, no-wrap
msgid "`$domain`"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-pam.adoc:22
msgid "Your domain name"
msgstr "ຊື່ໂດເມນຂອງທ່ານ"

#. type: Labeled list
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-pam.adoc:23
#, no-wrap
msgid "`$ad_server`"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-pam.adoc:24
msgid ""
"FQDN of the AD server if it is not auto-detected from the `$domain` "
"`$uyuni-hostname`: The name of the machine this AD client is supposed to be "
"known.  If not set, it will be `uyuni-server.mgr.internal`."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-pam.adoc:25
msgid "Example snippet for `/etc/sssd/sssd.conf`:"
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-pam.adoc:26
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"[sssd]\n"
"config_file_version = 2\n"
"services = nss, pam\n"
"domains = $domain\n"
msgstr ""
"[sssd]\n"
"config_file_version = 2\n"
"services = nss, pam\n"
"domains = $domain\n"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-pam.adoc:27
#, no-wrap
msgid "[nss]\n"
msgstr "[nss]\n"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-pam.adoc:28
#, no-wrap
msgid "[pam]\n"
msgstr "[pam]\n"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-pam.adoc:29
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"[domain/$domain]\n"
"id_provider = ad\n"
"chpass_provider = ad\n"
"access_provider = ad\n"
"auth_provider = ad\n"
msgstr ""
"[domain/$domain]\n"
"id_provider = ad\n"
"chpass_provider = ad\n"
"access_provider = ad\n"
"auth_provider = ad\n"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-pam.adoc:30
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"ad_domain = $domain\n"
"ad_server = $ad_server\n"
"ad_hostname = $uyuni-hostname\n"
msgstr ""
"ad_domain = $domain\n"
"ad_server = $ad_server\n"
"ad_hostname = $uyuni-hostname\n"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-pam.adoc:31
#, no-wrap
msgid "ad_gpo_map_network = +susemanager\n"
msgstr "ad_gpo_map_network = +susemanager\n"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-pam.adoc:32
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"krb5_keytab = FILE:/etc/rhn/krb5.conf.d/krb5.keytab\n"
"krb5_ccname_template = FILE:/tmp/krb5cc_%{uid}\n"
msgstr ""
"krb5_keytab = FILE:/etc/rhn/krb5.conf.d/krb5.keytab\n"
"krb5_ccname_template = FILE:/tmp/krb5cc_%{uid}\n"

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso-example.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Example SSO Implementation"
msgstr "ຕົວຢ່າງການຕິດຕັ້ງ SSO"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso-example.adoc:2
msgid ""
"In this example, SSO is implemented by exposing three endpoints with "
"{productname}, and using Keycloak 26.5.3 or later as the identity service "
"provider (IdP)."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso-example.adoc:3
msgid ""
"To set up Single Sign-On (SSO) with {productname} and Keycloak, you first "
"configure the Keycloak identity provider, obtain its public SAML "
"certificate, and set up the client and users. After that, you configure the "
"{productname} Server to trust Keycloak."
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso-example.adoc:4
msgid ""
"This example is provided for illustrative purposes only.  {suse} does not "
"recommend or support third-party identity service providers, and is not "
"affiliated with Keycloak.  For Keycloak support, see "
"https://www.keycloak.org/."
msgstr "ຕົວຢ່າງນີ້ມີໄວ້ເພື່ອເປັນການອະທິບາຍເທົ່ານັ້ນ. {suse} ບໍ່ໄດ້ແນະນຳ ຫຼື ຮອງຮັບຜູ້ໃຫ້ບໍລິການຢືນຢັນຕົວຕົນຈາກພາກສ່ວນທີສາມ, ແລະ ບໍ່ໄດ້ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງກັບ Keycloak. ສຳລັບການຊ່ວຍເຫຼືອ Keycloak, ເບິ່ງໄດ້ທີ່ https://www.keycloak.org/."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso-example.adoc:5
msgid ""
"You can install Keycloak directly on your machine, or run it in a "
"container.  In this example, we run Keycloak in a Podman container.  For "
"more information about installing Keycloak, see the Keycloak documentation "
"at https://www.keycloak.org/guides#getting-started."
msgstr "ທ່ານສາມາດຕິດຕັ້ງ Keycloak ໂດຍກົງໃນເຄື່ອງຂອງທ່ານ, ຫຼື ຣັນໃນ container. ໃນຕົວຢ່າງນີ້, ພວກເຮົາຣັນ Keycloak ໃນ Podman container. ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບການຕິດຕັ້ງ Keycloak, ເບິ່ງຄູ່ມື Keycloak ທີ່ https://www.keycloak.org/guides#getting-started."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso-example.adoc:6
#, no-wrap
msgid "Setting up the identity service provider (Keycloak)"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso-example.adoc:7
msgid ""
"First, run Keycloak, create a realm, obtain the SAML public certificate, and "
"configure the client."
msgstr ""

#. type: Block title
