#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso-example.adoc:83
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:126
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:263
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-intro.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Troubleshooting"
msgstr "ການແກ້ໄຂບັນຫາ"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso-example.adoc:84
msgid ""
"If you encounter issues when authenticating with single sign-on, use these "
"steps to diagnose:"
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso-example.adoc:85
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**Verify Logs:** Look for SSO errors in "
"`/var/log/rhn/rhn_web_ui.log`. Detailed logging is enabled when "
"`java.sso.onelogin.saml2.debug = true` is set in `/etc/rhn/rhn.conf`.\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso-example.adoc:86
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**User Not Found:** If you see \"User not found\" or redirection fails after "
"Keycloak authentication, ensure the username in Keycloak matches the "
"username in {productname} exactly. Users must be pre-created in "
"{productname}.\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso-example.adoc:87
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**Signature and certificate errors:** If you see \"Signature verification "
"failed\", verify that the certificate in "
"`java.sso.onelogin.saml2.idp.x509cert` matches the active RSA certificate "
"displayed under the `Keys` tab in Keycloak Realm Settings, and ensure that "
"`Sign assertions` is toggled to `On` in the client settings.\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso-example.adoc:88
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**Invalid Redirect URI:** If Keycloak displays \"Invalid parameter: "
"redirect_uri\" on redirection, verify that `Valid redirect URIs` in client "
"settings in Keycloak is set to `https://<FQDN_MLM>/rhn/manager/sso/acs`.\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Authentication With Single Sign-On (SSO)"
msgstr "ການຢືນຢັນຕົວຕົນດ້ວຍການລົງຊື່ເຂົ້າໃຊ້ຄັ້ງດຽວ (SSO)"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso.adoc:2
msgid ""
"{productname} supports single sign-on (SSO) by implementing the Security "
"Assertion Markup Language (SAML){nbsp}2 protocol."
msgstr "{productname} ຮອງຮັບການລົງຊື່ເຂົ້າໃຊ້ຄັ້ງດຽວ (SSO) ໂດຍການນຳໃຊ້ໂປຣໂຕຄໍ Security Assertion Markup Language (SAML){nbsp}2."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso.adoc:3
msgid ""
"Single sign-on is an authentication process that allows a user to access "
"multiple applications with one set of credentials.  SAML is an XML-based "
"standard for exchanging authentication and authorization data.  A SAML "
"identity service provider (IdP) provides authentication and authorization "
"services to service providers (SP), such as {productname}.  {productname} "
"exposes three endpoints which must be enabled for single sign-on."
msgstr "ການລົງຊື່ເຂົ້າໃຊ້ຄັ້ງດຽວ ແມ່ນຂະບວນການຢືນຢັນຕົວຕົນທີ່ອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ຜູ້ໃຊ້ເຂົ້າເຖິງຫຼາຍແອັບພລິເຄຊັນໄດ້ດ້ວຍຂໍ້ມູນການເຂົ້າໃຊ້ພຽງຊຸດດຽວ. SAML ແມ່ນມາດຕະຖານທີ່ອີງໃສ່ XML ສຳລັບການແລກປ່ຽນຂໍ້ມູນການຢືນຢັນຕົວຕົນ ແລະ ການອະນຸຍາດສິດ. ຜູ້ໃຫ້ບໍລິການຕົວຕົນ SAML (IdP) ຈະໃຫ້ບໍລິການຢືນຢັນຕົວຕົນ ແລະ ການອະນຸຍາດສິດແກ່ຜູ້ໃຫ້ບໍລິການ (SP) ເຊັ່ນ: {productname}. {productname} ຈະເປີດນຳໃຊ້ສາມຈຸດເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ (endpoints) ເຊິ່ງຕ້ອງໄດ້ຮັບການເປີດນຳໃຊ້ເພື່ອເຮັດວຽກຮ່ວມກັບການລົງຊື່ເຂົ້າໃຊ້ຄັ້ງດຽວ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso.adoc:4
msgid "SSO in {productname} supports:"
msgstr "SSO ໃນ {productname} ຮອງຮັບ:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso.adoc:5
msgid "Log in with SSO."
msgstr "ລົງຊື່ເຂົ້າໃຊ້ດ້ວຍ SSO."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso.adoc:6
msgid ""
"Log out with service provider-initiated single logout (SLO), and Identity "
"service provider single logout service (SLS)."
msgstr "ອອກຈາກລະບົບດ້ວຍການເລີ່ມຕົ້ນໂດຍຜູ້ໃຫ້ບໍລິການ (SLO), ແລະ ບໍລິການອອກຈາກລະບົບຄັ້ງດຽວຂອງຜູ້ໃຫ້ບໍລິການຕົວຕົນ (SLS)."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso.adoc:7
msgid "Assertion and nameId encryption."
msgstr "ການເຂົ້າລະຫັດ Assertion ແລະ nameId."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso.adoc:8
msgid "Assertion signatures."
msgstr "ລາຍເຊັນ Assertion."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso.adoc:9
msgid "Message signatures with AuthNRequest, LogoutRequest, and LogoutResponses."
msgstr "ລາຍເຊັນຂໍ້ຄວາມດ້ວຍ AuthNRequest, LogoutRequest, ແລະ LogoutResponses."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso.adoc:10
msgid "Enable an Assertion consumer service endpoint."
msgstr "ເປີດນຳໃຊ້ endpoint ຂອງບໍລິການຜູ້ບໍລິໂພກ Assertion."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso.adoc:11
msgid "Enable a single logout service endpoint."
msgstr "ເປີດນຳໃຊ້ endpoint ຂອງບໍລິການອອກຈາກລະບົບຄັ້ງດຽວ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso.adoc:12
msgid "Publish the SP metadata (which can be signed)."
msgstr "ເຜີຍແຜ່ metadata ຂອງ SP (ເຊິ່ງສາມາດເຊັນລາຍເຊັນໄດ້)."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso.adoc:13
msgid "SSO in {productname} does not support:"
msgstr "SSO ໃນ {productname} ບໍ່ຮອງຮັບ:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso.adoc:14
msgid "Product choosing and implementation for the identity service provider (IdP)."
msgstr "ການເລືອກຜະລິດຕະພັນ ແລະ ການຕິດຕັ້ງສຳລັບຜູ້ໃຫ້ບໍລິການຕົວຕົນ (IdP)."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso.adoc:15
msgid ""
"SAML support for other products (check with the respective product "
"documentation)."
msgstr "ການຮອງຮັບ SAML ສຳລັບຜະລິດຕະພັນອື່ນໆ (ກະລຸນາກວດສອບກັບເອກະສານຂອງຜະລິດຕະພັນນັ້ນໆ)."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso.adoc:16
msgid ""
"For an example implementation of SSO, see "
"xref:administration:auth-methods-sso-example.adoc[]."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຕົວຢ່າງການຕິດຕັ້ງ SSO, ກະລຸນາເບິ່ງ xref:administration:auth-methods-sso-example.adoc[]."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso.adoc:17
msgid ""
"If you change from the default authentication method to single sign-on, the "
"new SSO credentials apply only to the {webui}.  Client tools such as "
"`mgr-sync` or `spacecmd` continue to work with the default authentication "
"method only."
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso.adoc:18
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore-db.adoc:12
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-wicked-to-networkmanager.adoc:15
#, no-wrap
msgid "Prerequisites"
msgstr "ເງື່ອນໄຂເບື້ອງຕົ້ນ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso.adoc:19
msgid ""
"Before you begin, you need to have configured an external identity service "
"provider with these parameters.  Check your IdP documentation for "
"instructions."
msgstr "ກ່ອນທີ່ທ່ານຈະເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ, ທ່ານຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງໄດ້ຕັ້ງຄ່າຜູ້ໃຫ້ບໍລິການຕົວຕົນພາຍນອກດ້ວຍພາຣາມິເຕີເຫຼົ່ານີ້. ກວດສອບເອກະສານ IdP ຂອງທ່ານສຳລັບຄຳແນະນຳ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso.adoc:20
msgid ""
"The mapping between the IdP user and the {productname} user is specified in "
"a SAML:Attribute.  The SAML:Attribute must be configured in the IdP and must "
"be passed to {productname} in the SAML authentication.  The attribute must "
"be named `uid` and must contain the {productname} user mapped to it after "
"login.  The {productname} user must be created before you activate single "
"sign-on."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso.adoc:21
msgid "You need these endpoints:"
msgstr "ທ່ານຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງມີ endpoints ເຫຼົ່ານີ້:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso.adoc:22
msgid ""
"Assertion consumer service (or ACS): an endpoint to accept SAML messages to "
"establish a session into the Service Provider."
msgstr "Assertion consumer service (ຫຼື ACS): ເປັນ endpoint ເພື່ອຮັບຂໍ້ຄວາມ SAML ສຳລັບການສ້າງເຊສຊັນ (session) ເຂົ້າໃນຜູ້ໃຫ້ບໍລິການ (Service Provider)."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso.adoc:23
msgid ""
"The endpoint for ACS in {productname} is: "
"https://server.example.com/rhn/manager/sso/acs"
msgstr "Endpoint ສຳລັບ ACS ໃນ {productname} ແມ່ນ: https://server.example.com/rhn/manager/sso/acs"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso.adoc:24
msgid ""
"Single logout service (or SLS): an endpoint to initiate a logout request "
"from the IdP."
msgstr "Single logout service (ຫຼື SLS): ເປັນ endpoint ເພື່ອເລີ່ມຕົ້ນການຮ້ອງຂໍອອກຈາກລະບົບຈາກ IdP."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso.adoc:25
msgid ""
"The endpoint for SLS in {productname} is: "
"https://server.example.com/rhn/manager/sso/sls"
msgstr "Endpoint ສຳລັບ SLS ໃນ {productname} ແມ່ນ: https://server.example.com/rhn/manager/sso/sls"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso.adoc:26
msgid "Metadata: an endpoint to retrieve {productname} metadata for SAML."
msgstr "Metadata: ເປັນ endpoint ເພື່ອດຶງຂໍ້ມູນ metadata ຂອງ {productname} ສຳລັບ SAML."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso.adoc:27
msgid ""
"The endpoint for metadata in {productname} is: "
"https://server.example.com/rhn/manager/sso/metadata"
msgstr "Endpoint ສຳລັບ metadata ໃນ {productname} ແມ່ນ: https://server.example.com/rhn/manager/sso/metadata"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso.adoc:28
msgid ""
"After the authentication with the IdP using the user `orgadmin` is "
"successful, you are logged in to {productname} as the `orgadmin` user, "
"provided that the `orgadmin` user exists in {productname}."
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso.adoc:29
#, no-wrap
msgid "Enable SSO"
msgstr "ເປີດນຳໃຊ້ SSO"

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso.adoc:30
msgid ""
"Using SSO is mutually exclusive with other types of authentication: it is "
"either enabled or disabled.  SSO is disabled by default."
msgstr "ການໃຊ້ SSO ບໍ່ສາມາດໃຊ້ຮ່ວມກັບການຢືນຢັນຕົວຕົນປະເພດອື່ນໄດ້: ມັນຈະຕ້ອງຖືກເປີດ ຫຼື ປິດຢ່າງໃດຢ່າງໜຶ່ງ. ໂດຍປົກກະຕິແລ້ວ SSO ຈະຖືກປິດໄວ້ເປັນຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso.adoc:31
#: en/modules/administration/pages/mirror-sources.adoc:4
#: en/modules/administration/pages/reports.adoc:5
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-delclients.adoc:2
#: en/modules/administration/pages/tuning-changelogs.adoc:3
msgid "Use `mgrctl term` before running steps inside the server container."
msgstr "ໃຊ້ `mgrctl term` ກ່ອນທີ່ຈະດຳເນີນຂັ້ນຕອນຕ່າງໆພາຍໃນ server container."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso.adoc:32
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Enabling SSO"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການເປີດນຳໃຊ້ SSO"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso.adoc:33
msgid "If your users do not yet exist in {productname}, create them first."
msgstr "ຫາກຜູ້ໃຊ້ຂອງທ່ານຍັງບໍ່ທັນມີຢູ່ໃນ {productname}, ໃຫ້ສ້າງພວກເຂົາຂຶ້ນມາກ່ອນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso.adoc:34
msgid "Edit `/etc/rhn/rhn.conf` and add this line at the end of the file:"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso.adoc:36
msgid ""
"Find the parameters you want to customize in "
"`/usr/share/rhn/config-defaults/rhn_java_sso.conf`."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso.adoc:37
msgid ""
"Insert the parameters you want to customize into `/etc/rhn/rhn.conf` and "
"prefix them with `java.sso`.  For example, in "
"`/usr/share/rhn/config-defaults/rhn_java_sso.conf` find:"
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso.adoc:38
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"onelogin.saml2.sp.assertion_consumer_service.url = "
"https://YOUR-PRODUCT-HOSTNAME-OR-IP/rhn/manager/sso/acs\n"
msgstr "onelogin.saml2.sp.assertion_consumer_service.url = https://YOUR-PRODUCT-HOSTNAME-OR-IP/rhn/manager/sso/acs\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso.adoc:39
msgid ""
"To customize it, create the corresponding option in `/etc/rhn/rhn.conf` by "
"prefixing the option name with `java.sso.`:"
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso.adoc:40
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"java.sso.onelogin.saml2.sp.assertion_consumer_service.url = "
"https://YOUR-PRODUCT-HOSTNAME-OR-IP/rhn/manager/sso/acs\n"
msgstr "java.sso.onelogin.saml2.sp.assertion_consumer_service.url = https://YOUR-PRODUCT-HOSTNAME-OR-IP/rhn/manager/sso/acs\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso.adoc:41
msgid ""
"To find all the occurrences you need to change, search in the file for the "
"placeholders `YOUR-PRODUCT` and `YOUR-IDP-ENTITY`.  Every parameter comes "
"with a brief explanation of what it is meant for."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso.adoc:42
msgid "Restart the spacewalk service to pick up the changes:"
msgstr "ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນການບໍລິການ spacewalk ໃໝ່ເພື່ອໃຫ້ການປ່ຽນແປງມີຜົນ:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso.adoc:44
msgid ""
"When you visit the {productname} URL, you are redirected to the IdP for SSO "
"where you are requested to authenticate.  Upon successful authentication, "
"you are redirected to the {productname} {webui}, logged in as the "
"authenticated user.  If you encounter problems with logging in using SSO, "
"check the {productname} logs for more information."
msgstr "ເມື່ອທ່ານເຂົ້າໄປທີ່ URL ຂອງ {productname}, ທ່ານຈະຖືກສົ່ງໄປຍັງ IdP ສຳລັບ SSO ເພື່ອຢືນຢັນຕົວຕົນ. ເມື່ອຢືນຢັນຕົວຕົນສຳເລັດ, ທ່ານຈະຖືກສົ່ງກັບມາຍັງ {productname} {webui} ໃນສະຖານະຜູ້ໃຊ້ທີ່ເຂົ້າລະບົບແລ້ວ. ຫາກທ່ານພົບກັບບັນຫາໃນການລົງຊື່ເຂົ້າໃຊ້ດ້ວຍ SSO, ກະລຸນາກວດສອບ log ຂອງ {productname} ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ."

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auth-methods.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Authentication Methods"
msgstr "ວິທີການຢືນຢັນຕົວຕົນ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auth-methods.adoc:2
msgid ""
"{productname} supports several different authentication methods.  This "
"section discusses pluggable authentication modules (PAM) and single sign-on "
"(SSO)."
msgstr "{productname} ຮອງຮັບວິທີການຢືນຢັນຕົວຕົນທີ່ແຕກຕ່າງກັນຫຼາຍວິທີ. ສ່ວນນີ້ຈະເວົ້າເຖິງ pluggable authentication modules (PAM) ແລະ ການລົງຊື່ເຂົ້າໃຊ້ຄັ້ງດຽວ (SSO)."

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore-db.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Database Backup Management"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore-db.adoc:2
msgid ""
"This guide describes how to manage online database backups for the "
"{productname} server using `mgradm`.  The backup system is based on "
"{postgresql} continuous archiving Write-Ahead Logging (WAL), similarly like "
"`smdba` in previous versions."
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore-db.adoc:3
msgid ""
"To ensure the system can be fully recovered, perform regular backups of both "
"the database and other system volumes."
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore-db.adoc:4
msgid ""
"Regularly copy your backup volumes and WAL files to an external storage "
"device or an off-site location for disaster recovery."
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore-db.adoc:5
#, no-wrap
msgid "Overview"
msgstr "ພາບລວມ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore-db.adoc:6
msgid ""
"Continuous archiving reduces the risk of data loss by constantly backing up "
"the transaction logs (WAL) to a dedicated volume."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore-db.adoc:7
msgid ""
"The backup system utilizes a dedicated Podman volume named "
"`var-pgsql-walbackup` to store:"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore-db.adoc:8
msgid "A base backup (a full snapshot of the database)."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore-db.adoc:9
msgid "WAL segments (incremental changes since the last base backup)."
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore-db.adoc:10
msgid ""
"Point-in-time recovery is currently not supported by `mgradm` and requires a "
"manual workflow."
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore-db.adoc:11
msgid ""
"Only full recovery is supported by `mgradm` tool.  The restore procedure "
"will restore everything from the backup location."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore-db.adoc:13
msgid "`mgradm` tool installed on the host."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore-db.adoc:14
msgid "{productname} server running in a Podman environment."
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore-db.adoc:15
#, no-wrap
msgid "Enabling backups"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore-db.adoc:16
msgid "To enable continuous archiving, run the following command:"
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore-db.adoc:17
#, no-wrap
msgid "mgradm backup db enable\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore-db.adoc:18
msgid "This command:"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore-db.adoc:19
msgid "Verifies that the backup is not already enabled."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore-db.adoc:20
msgid ""
"Configures {postgresql} (`postgresql.conf`) to enable `archive_mode` and "
"sets the `archive_command`."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore-db.adoc:21
msgid "Configures the `var-pgsql-walbackup` volume for the database service."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore-db.adoc:22
msgid "Restarts the database service to apply changes."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore-db.adoc:23
msgid "Performs an initial base backup inside the container."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore-db.adoc:24
msgid ""
"If the backup is already configured but you need to re-initialize it, use "
"the `--force` flag."
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore-db.adoc:25
#, no-wrap
msgid "Checking backup status"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore-db.adoc:26
msgid "You can verify the current state of the database backup system at any time:"
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore-db.adoc:27
#, no-wrap
msgid "mgradm backup db status\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore-db.adoc:28
msgid "The command will report one of the following statuses:"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore-db.adoc:29
#, no-wrap
msgid "*enabled*: Backup is correctly configured and active.\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore-db.adoc:30
#, no-wrap
msgid "*disabled*: Continuous archiving is explicitly turned off.\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore-db.adoc:31
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"*misconfigured*: There is a discrepancy between the configuration and the "
"runtime state (for example, missing volume, incorrect archive command).\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore-db.adoc:32
#, no-wrap
msgid "Maintaining backups (rebasing)"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore-db.adoc:33
msgid ""
"Over time, the number of WAL segments can grow significantly, consuming disk "
"space and increasing restoration time.  It is recommended to periodically "
"\"rebase\" the backup by creating a new base backup and starting a new WAL "
"chain."
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore-db.adoc:34
#, no-wrap
msgid "mgradm backup db rebase\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore-db.adoc:35
msgid ""
"This command creates a fresh full snapshot of the database without requiring "
"a service restart."
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore-db.adoc:36
msgid ""
"Regularly rebase your database backups using command `mgradm backup db "
"rebase` to minimize the time required for restore operations."
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore-db.adoc:37
#, no-wrap
msgid "Restoring from backup"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore-db.adoc:38
msgid ""
"Restoring from a backup is a *destructive operation* that replaces the "
"current database data with the content of the backup."
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore-db.adoc:39
#, no-wrap
msgid "mgradm backup db restore\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore-db.adoc:40
msgid "The restoration process:"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore-db.adoc:41
msgid "Stops the database service."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore-db.adoc:42
msgid "Clears the current database data directory."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore-db.adoc:43
msgid "Extracts the base backup from the backup volume."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore-db.adoc:44
msgid "Configures {postgresql} for recovery."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore-db.adoc:45
msgid "Starts the database service."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore-db.adoc:46
msgid "Replays the WAL segments to bring the database to the latest possible state."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore-db.adoc:47
msgid ""
"The command will wait until the database has fully recovered and is ready to "
"accept connections."
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore-db.adoc:48
msgid ""
"Ensure you have a recent base backup and all necessary WAL segments in the "
"`var-pgsql-walbackup` volume before performing a restore."
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore-db.adoc:49
#, no-wrap
msgid "Disabling backups"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore-db.adoc:50
msgid "To turn off continuous archiving:"
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore-db.adoc:51
#, no-wrap
msgid "mgradm backup db disable\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore-db.adoc:52
msgid ""
"By default, this command disables archiving in the configuration and "
"restarts the database but preserves the backup volume."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore-db.adoc:53
msgid "To also remove the backup volume and all stored backups, use:"
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore-db.adoc:54
#, no-wrap
msgid "mgradm backup db disable --purge-volume\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore-db.adoc:55
msgid ""
"Regularly test your restore procedures to verify data integrity and ensure "
"you are prepared for a recovery."
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore-db.adoc:56
#, no-wrap
msgid "External documentation"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore-db.adoc:57
msgid ""
"For more information on {postgresql}, see "
"https://www.postgresql.org/docs/{postgresql-version}/continuous-archiving.html[{postgresql} "
"{postgresql-version}: Continuous Archiving and Point-in-Time Recovery "
"(PITR)]"
msgstr ""

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Backup and Restore"
msgstr "ການສຳຮອງຂໍ້ມູນ ແລະ ການກູ້ຄືນ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore.adoc:2
msgid ""
"This chapter contains information on the files you need to back up.  With "
"the built-in backup and restore solution (`mgradm backup`) you create "
"{productname} backups.  Information about restoring from your backups in the "
"case of a system failure completes this chapter."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore.adoc:3
msgid ""
"Because {productname} relies on a database as well as the installed program "
"and configurations, it is important to back up all components of your "
"installation.  Back up your {productname} installation regularly to prevent "
"data loss and enable quick recovery."
msgstr "ເນື່ອງຈາກ {productname} ເພິ່ງພາຖານຂໍ້ມູນ ລວມທັງໂປຣແກຣມທີ່ຕິດຕັ້ງ ແລະ ການກຳນົດຄ່າຕ່າງໆ, ມັນຈຶ່ງສຳຄັນທີ່ຈະຕ້ອງສຳຮອງຂໍ້ມູນທຸກພາກສ່ວນຂອງການຕິດຕັ້ງ. ສຳຮອງຂໍ້ມູນການຕິດຕັ້ງ {productname} ຂອງເຈົ້າຢ່າງສະໝ່ຳສະເໝີເພື່ອປ້ອງກັນການສູນເສຍຂໍ້ມູນ ແລະ ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ກູ້ຄືນໄດ້ໄວ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore.adoc:4
msgid ""
"Regardless of the backup method you use, you must have available at least "
"three times the amount of space your current installation uses.  Running out "
"of space can result in backups failing, so check this often."
msgstr "ບໍ່ວ່າທ່ານຈະໃຊ້ວິທີການສຳຮອງຂໍ້ມູນແບບໃດ, ທ່ານຕ້ອງມີພື້ນທີ່ຫວ່າງຢ່າງໜ້ອຍສາມເທົ່າຂອງພື້ນທີ່ ທີ່ການຕິດຕັ້ງປັດຈຸບັນຂອງທ່ານໃຊ້ຢູ່. ຫາກພື້ນທີ່ເຕັມອາດຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ການສຳຮອງຂໍ້ມູນຫຼົ້ມເຫຼວ, ສະນັ້ນຄວນກວດສອບເລື້ອຍໆ."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore.adoc:5
#, no-wrap
msgid "Disable old method with smdba"
msgstr "ປິດການໃຊ້ງານວິທີການເກົ່າດ້ວຍ smdba"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore.adoc:6
msgid ""
"Skip this section if you installed {productname} {productnumber} from "
"scratch."
msgstr "ຂ້າມສ່ວນນີ້ໄປ ຫາກທ່ານໄດ້ຕິດຕັ້ງ {productname} {productnumber} ໃໝ່ແຕ່ຕົ້ນ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore.adoc:7
msgid ""
"With the advent of the built-in solution, the old method with the `smdba` "
"backup tool is deprecated.  If you migrated from an old system with `smdba` "
"to the new solution, you must disable the old funtionality and remove the "
"old backup archives."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore.adoc:8
msgid ""
"Either disable `smdba` before migrating (recommended) or later on the "
"migrated {productname} {productnumber} system."
msgstr ""

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore.adoc:9
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Disabling old method with installed smdba before migration"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການປິດວິທີການເກົ່າດ້ວຍ smdba ທີ່ຕິດຕັ້ງໄວ້ກ່ອນການຍ້າຍລະບົບ"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore.adoc:10
msgid "This procedure only works when smdba is still installed."
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນນີ້ຈະເຮັດວຽກໄດ້ກໍຕໍ່ເມື່ອຍັງມີ smdba ຕິດຕັ້ງຢູ່ໃນລະບົບເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore.adoc:11
msgid ""
"Commands are different on SUSE Manager 4.3 (non-containerized installation) "
"or SUSE Manager 5.0 (containerized installation)  present (so 5.0 or on 4.3 "
"before migration):"
msgstr "ຄຳສັ່ງຈະແຕກຕ່າງກັນລະຫວ່າງ SUSE Manager 4.3 (ການຕິດຕັ້ງແບບບໍ່ແມ່ນ container) ຫຼື SUSE Manager 5.0 (ການຕິດຕັ້ງແບບ container) (ທັງໃນເວີຊັນ 5.0 ຫຼື 4.3 ກ່ອນການຍ້າຍລະບົບ):"

#. type: Labeled list
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore.adoc:12
#, no-wrap
msgid "SUSE Manager 4.3"
msgstr "SUSE Manager 4.3"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore.adoc:13
msgid "On the command line, as root, execute:"
msgstr "ໃນ command line, ໃນນາມ root, ໃຫ້ລັນຄຳສັ່ງ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore.adoc:14
#, no-wrap
msgid "smdba backup-hot --enable=off\n"
msgstr "smdba backup-hot --enable=off\n"

#. type: Labeled list
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore.adoc:15
#, no-wrap
msgid "SUSE Manager 5.0"
msgstr "SUSE Manager 5.0"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore.adoc:16
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore.adoc:18
msgid "On the command line of the container host, as root, execute:"
msgstr "ໃນ command line ຂອງ container host, ໃນນາມ root, ໃຫ້ລັນຄຳສັ່ງ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore.adoc:17
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore.adoc:19
#, no-wrap
msgid "mgrctl exec -- smdba backup-hot --enable=off\n"
msgstr "mgrctl exec -- smdba backup-hot --enable=off\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore.adoc:20
msgid ""
"This will change `archive_command` in `/var/lib/pgsql/data/postgresql.conf` "
"as follows:"
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore.adoc:21
#, no-wrap
msgid "archive_command = '/bin/true'\n"
msgstr "archive_command = '/bin/true'\n"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore.adoc:22
msgid ""
"Now your old system is ready to be migrated to {productname} "
"{productnumber}."
msgstr "ຕອນນີ້ລະບົບເກົ່າຂອງທ່ານພ້ອມທີ່ຈະຖືກຍ້າຍໄປຍັງ {productname} {productnumber} ແລ້ວ."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore.adoc:23
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Procedure: Disabling old method on {productname} {productnumber} after "
"migration"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການປິດວິທີການເກົ່າໃນ {productname} {productnumber} ຫຼັງຈາກການຍ້າຍລະບົບ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore.adoc:24
msgid "Use this procedure after migration, when smdba is no longer available."
msgstr "ໃຊ້ຂັ້ນຕອນນີ້ຫຼັງຈາກການຍ້າຍລະບົບ, ເມື່ອບໍ່ມີ smdba ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ງານອີກຕໍ່ໄປ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore.adoc:25
msgid ""
"On the container host, as root, edit "
"`/var/lib/containers/storage/volumes/var-pgsql/_data/postgresql.conf` and "
"set these options:"
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore.adoc:26
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"archive_mode = off\n"
"archive_command = '/bin/true'\n"
msgstr ""
"archive_mode = off\n"
"archive_command = '/bin/true'\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore.adoc:27
msgid "Restart the container:"
msgstr "ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ container ໃໝ່:"

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore.adoc:29
#, no-wrap
msgid "Back up {productname}"
msgstr "ສຳຮອງຂໍ້ມູນ {productname}"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore.adoc:30
msgid ""
"The most comprehensive method for backing up your {productname} installation "
"is to use `mgradm backup create` command.  This can save you time in "
"administering your backup, and can be faster to reinstall and re-synchronize "
"in the case of failure.  However, this method requires significant disk "
"space and could take a long time to perform the backup."
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore.adoc:31
msgid ""
"`mgradm backup create` command performs backup to a directory.  This "
"directory can be both local or mounted remote storage."
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore.adoc:32
msgid ""
"`mgradm backup create` command allows various customizations of the content "
"of the backup.  For all available options, see `mgradm backup create "
"--help`."
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ===
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore.adoc:33
#, no-wrap
msgid "Full backup of {productname}"
msgstr "ການສຳຮອງຂໍ້ມູນແບບເຕັມຂອງ {productname}"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore.adoc:34
msgid ""
"A full backup of the {productname} consists of backing up the following "
"components:"
msgstr "ການສຳຮອງຂໍ້ມູນເຕັມຮູບແບບຂອງ {productname} ປະກອບດ້ວຍການສຳຮອງສ່ວນປະກອບດັ່ງຕໍ່ໄປນີ້:"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore.adoc:35
msgid "{productname} volumes"
msgstr "ວໍລຸມ (volumes) ຂອງ {productname}"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore.adoc:36
msgid "database volumes"
msgstr "ວໍລຸມຂອງຖານຂໍ້ມູນ"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore.adoc:37
msgid "podman network configuration"
msgstr "ການຕັ້ງຄ່າເຄືອຂ່າຍ podman"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore.adoc:38
msgid "podman secrets"
msgstr "ຄວາມລັບ (secrets) ຂອງ podman"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore.adoc:39
msgid "{productname} systemd services"
msgstr "ບໍລິການ systemd ຂອງ {productname}"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore.adoc:40
msgid "{productname} container images"
msgstr "container images ຂອງ {productname}"

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore.adoc:41
msgid ""
"The {productname} service is automatically stopped for the time it takes to "
"create a full backup.  The downtime can be significant.  After backup is "
"done, service is automatically restarted."
msgstr "ບໍລິການ {productname} ຈະຖືກຢຸດໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດໃນລະຫວ່າງການສ້າງການສຳຮອງຂໍ້ມູນແບບເຕັມ. ເວລາທີ່ລະບົບຢຸດເຮັດວຽກອາດຈະດົນສົມຄວນ. ຫຼັງຈາກສຳຮອງຂໍ້ມູນສຳເລັດ, ບໍລິການຈະເລີ່ມຕົ້ນໃໝ່ໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore.adoc:42
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Creating full backup with `mgradm backup create`"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore.adoc:43
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore.adoc:51
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore.adoc:55
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore.adoc:63
msgid "On the container host, as root, create backup with:"
msgstr "ໃນ container host, ໃນນາມ root, ໃຫ້ສ້າງການສຳຮອງຂໍ້ມູນດ້ວຍ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore.adoc:44
#, no-wrap
msgid "mgradm backup create $path\n"
msgstr "mgradm backup create $path\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore.adoc:45
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore.adoc:53
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore.adoc:57
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore.adoc:65
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore.adoc:80
msgid "Replace `$path` by the path to the backup location."
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ===
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore.adoc:46
#, no-wrap
msgid "Partial backup of {productname}"
msgstr "ການສຳຮອງຂໍ້ມູນບາງສ່ວນຂອງ {productname}"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore.adoc:47
msgid ""
"`mgradm backup create` tool allows creating partial backups.  It is possible "
"to skip individual or all volumes, skip database backup and images."
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore.adoc:48
msgid ""
"Particularly when database backup is skipped, backup is created without "
"stopping {productname} services and can act as a one phase in two phase "
"backup procedure."
msgstr "ໂດຍສະເພາະເມື່ອຂ້າມການສຳຮອງຖານຂໍ້ມູນ, ການສຳຮອງຂໍ້ມູນຈະຖືກສ້າງຂຶ້ນໂດຍບໍ່ຕ້ອງຢຸດບໍລິການຂອງ {productname} ແລະ ສາມາດໃຊ້ເປັນຂັ້ນຕອນໜຶ່ງໃນຂະບວນການສຳຮອງຂໍ້ມູນແບບສອງໄລຍະໄດ້."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore.adoc:49
msgid ""
"Partial backups are only considering a part of the data, and do not take "
"potential dependencies with other parts which may not have been backed up in "
"consideration.  Therefore they cannot guarantee backup/restore consistency."
msgstr "ການສຳຮອງຂໍ້ມູນບາງສ່ວນຈະພິຈາລະນາພຽງແຕ່ບາງສ່ວນຂອງຂໍ້ມູນ, ແລະ ບໍ່ໄດ້ຄຳນຶງເຖິງຄວາມກ່ຽວພັນທີ່ອາດມີກັບສ່ວນອື່ນໆ ທີ່ບໍ່ໄດ້ຖືກສຳຮອງໄວ້. ດັ່ງນັ້ນ, ພວກມັນຈຶ່ງບໍ່ສາມາດຮັບປະກັນຄວາມສອດຄ່ອງຂອງການສຳຮອງ/ກູ້ຄືນໄດ້."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore.adoc:50
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Creating partial backup by skipping database backup"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການສ້າງການສຳຮອງຂໍ້ມູນບາງສ່ວນໂດຍການຂ້າມການສຳຮອງຖານຂໍ້ມູນ"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore.adoc:52
#, no-wrap
msgid "mgradm backup create --skipdatabase $path\n"
msgstr "mgradm backup create --skipdatabase $path\n"

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore.adoc:54
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Creating partial backup by skipping a volume"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການສ້າງການສຳຮອງຂໍ້ມູນບາງສ່ວນໂດຍການຂ້າມວໍລຸມ"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore.adoc:56
#, no-wrap
msgid "mgradm backup create --skipvolumes $volumes $path\n"
msgstr "mgradm backup create --skipvolumes $volumes $path\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore.adoc:58
msgid ""
"Replace `$volumes` by the name of the volume name to be excluded from the "
"backup, or by a comma separated list of volumes to be excluded."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore.adoc:59
msgid "Use `all` to skip all volumes, except database volumes."
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ===
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore.adoc:60
#, no-wrap
msgid "Backing up extra volumes"
msgstr "ການສຳຮອງຂໍ້ມູນວໍລຸມເພີ່ມເຕີມ"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore.adoc:61
msgid ""
"`mgradm backup` command uses internal list of {productname} volumes.  If "
"additional volumes were configured during the installation, or additional "
"volumes should be added to the backup, they need to be specified using "
"`--extravolumes $volumes`."
msgstr ""

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore.adoc:62
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Creating backup with additional custom volume"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການສ້າງການສຳຮອງຂໍ້ມູນດ້ວຍວໍລຸມທີ່ປັບແຕ່ງເພີ່ມເຕີມ"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore.adoc:64
#, no-wrap
msgid "mgradm backup create --extravolumes $volume $path\n"
msgstr "mgradm backup create --extravolumes $volume $path\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore.adoc:66
msgid ""
"Replace `$volumes` by the name of the volume name to be included in the "
"backup. or by a comma separated list of volumes to be included."
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ===
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore.adoc:67
#, no-wrap
msgid "Perform a manual database backup"
msgstr "ດຳເນີນການສຳຮອງຖານຂໍ້ມູນດ້ວຍຕົນເອງ"

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore.adoc:68
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Performing a manual database backup"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການສຳຮອງຖານຂໍ້ມູນດ້ວຍຕົນເອງ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore.adoc:69
msgid "Allocate permanent storage space for your backup."
msgstr "ຈັດສັນພື້ນທີ່ເກັບຂໍ້ມູນແບບຖາວອນສຳລັບການສຳຮອງຂໍ້ມູນຂອງທ່ານ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore.adoc:70
msgid "At the command prompt of the {productname} container host, as root, use:"
msgstr "ທີ່ command prompt ຂອງ {productname} container host, ໃນນາມ root, ໃຫ້ໃຊ້:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore.adoc:71
#, no-wrap
msgid "mgradm backup create --skipvolumes all --skipconfig --skipimages $path\n"
msgstr "mgradm backup create --skipvolumes all --skipconfig --skipimages $path\n"

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore.adoc:72
#, no-wrap
msgid "Restore {productname} from the existing backup"
msgstr "ກູ້ຄືນ {productname} ຈາກການສຳຮອງຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ມີຢູ່"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore.adoc:73
msgid ""
"Restoring {productname} from the existing backup will enumerate backup for "
"volumes, images and configuration to restore. Unlike in backup create "
"scenario, restore operation is not using an internal volume list, but "
"automatically detect every volume or image present in the backup."
msgstr "ການກູ້ຄືນ {productname} ຈາກການສຳຮອງຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ມີຢູ່ ຈະກວດສອບລາຍການສຳຮອງສຳລັບວໍລຸມ, images ແລະ ການຕັ້ງຄ່າເພື່ອເລີ່ມການກູ້ຄືນ. ແຕກຕ່າງຈາກການສ້າງການສຳຮອງຂໍ້ມູນ, ການກູ້ຄືນຈະບໍ່ໃຊ້ລາຍຊື່ວໍລຸມພາຍໃນ ແຕ່ຈະກວດຫາທຸກວໍລຸມ ຫຼື image ທີ່ມີຢູ່ໃນໄຟລ໌ສຳຮອງໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore.adoc:74
msgid ""
"After the list of items to restore is gathered, presence and integrity check "
"is performed. Presence check ensures backup restore will not accidentally "
"overwrite existing volumes, image or configurations. Integrity check is done "
"by computing backup items checksums."
msgstr "ຫຼັງຈາກລວບລວມລາຍການທີ່ຈະກູ້ຄືນແລ້ວ, ຈະມີການກວດສອບການມີຢູ່ ແລະ ຄວາມຖືກຕ້ອງຂອງຂໍ້ມູນ. ການກວດສອບການມີຢູ່ຈະຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ໝັ້ນໃຈວ່າການກູ້ຄືນຈະບໍ່ໄປຂຽນທັບວໍລຸມ, image ຫຼື ການຕັ້ງຄ່າທີ່ມີຢູ່ໂດຍບໍ່ໄດ້ຕັ້ງໃຈ. ສ່ວນການກວດສອບຄວາມຖືກຕ້ອງແມ່ນເຮັດໂດຍການຄຳນວນຄ່າ checksum ຂອງລາຍການສຳຮອງ."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore.adoc:75
msgid "After both checks are successful, actual backup restore is performed."
msgstr "ເມື່ອການກວດສອບທັງສອງຢ່າງສຳເລັດແລ້ວ, ການກູ້ຄືນຂໍ້ມູນຕົວຈິງຈຶ່ງຈະເລີ່ມຂຶ້ນ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore.adoc:76
msgid ""
"{productname} services are not automatically started after backup restore is "
"finished."
msgstr "ບໍລິການຂອງ {productname} ຈະບໍ່ຖືກເລີ່ມຕົ້ນໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ ຫຼັງຈາກການກູ້ຄືນຂໍ້ມູນສຳເລັດ."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore.adoc:77
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Restoring from an existing backup"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການກູ້ຄືນຈາກການສຳຮອງຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ມີຢູ່"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore.adoc:78
msgid "On the container host, as root, re-deploy the {productname} Server with:"
msgstr "ໃນ container host, ໃນນາມ root, ໃຫ້ຕິດຕັ້ງ (re-deploy) {productname} Server ຄືນໃໝ່ດ້ວຍ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore.adoc:79
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"mgradm stop\n"
"mgradm backup restore $path\n"
"mgradm start\n"
msgstr ""
"mgradm stop\n"
"mgradm backup restore $path\n"
"mgradm start\n"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore.adoc:81
msgid ""
"Verification of the backup can be a time-consuming operation. If backup "
"integrity is ensured by other means, verification can be skipped by using "
"`--skipverify` option."
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore.adoc:82
msgid ""
"If for some reason it is needed to skip restoring a volume present in the "
"backup, `--skipvolumes $volumes` option can be used."
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ===
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore.adoc:83
#, no-wrap
msgid "Recommended steps after restoring a backup"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນທີ່ແນະນຳຫຼັງຈາກການກູ້ຄືນຂໍ້ມູນສຳຮອງ"

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore.adoc:84
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Recommended steps after {productname} restore"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ຂັ້ນຕອນທີ່ແນະນຳຫຼັງຈາກການກູ້ຄືນ {productname}"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore.adoc:85
msgid ""
"Re-synchronize your {productname} repositories using either the "
"{productname} {webui}, or with the `mgr-sync` tool at the command prompt in "
"the container.  You can choose to re-register your product, or skip the "
"registration and SSL certificate generation sections."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore.adoc:86
msgid ""
"On the container host, check whether you need to restore "
"`/var/lib/containers/storage/volumes/var-spacewalk/_data/packages/`.  If "
"`/var/lib/containers/storage/volumes/var-spacewalk/_data/packages/` was not "
"in your backup, you need to restore it.  If the source repository is "
"available, you can restore "
"`/var/lib/containers/storage/volumes/var-spacewalk/_data/packages/` with a "
"complete channel synchronization:"
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore.adoc:87
#, no-wrap
msgid "mgrctl exec -ti -- mgr-sync refresh --refresh-channels\n"
msgstr "mgrctl exec -ti -- mgr-sync refresh --refresh-channels\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore.adoc:88
msgid ""
"Schedule the re-creation of search indexes next time the `rhn-search` "
"service is started."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore.adoc:89
msgid ""
"This command produces only debug messages, it does not produce error "
"messages."
msgstr "ຄຳສັ່ງນີ້ຈະສ້າງພຽງຂໍ້ຄວາມ debug ເທົ່ານັ້ນ, ມັນຈະບໍ່ສ້າງຂໍ້ຄວາມຜິດພາດ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore.adoc:90
msgid "On the container host, enter:"
msgstr "ທີ່ໂຮສຄອນເທນເນີ, ໃຫ້ປ້ອນ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore.adoc:91
#, no-wrap
msgid "mgrctl exec -ti -- rhn-search cleanindex\n"
msgstr "mgrctl exec -ti -- rhn-search cleanindex\n"

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/channel-management.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Channel Management"
msgstr "ການຈັດການຊ່ອງທາງ (Channel Management)"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/channel-management.adoc:2
msgid "Channels are a method of grouping software packages."
msgstr "ຊ່ອງທາງ (Channels) ແມ່ນວິທີການໃນການຈັດກຸ່ມແພັກເກັດຊອບແວ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/channel-management.adoc:3
msgid ""
"In {productname}, channels are grouped into base and child channels, with "
"base channels grouped by operating system type, version, and architecture, "
"and child channels being compatible with their related base channel.  When a "
"client has been assigned to a base channel, it is only possible for that "
"system to install the related child channels.  Organizing channels in this "
"way ensures that only compatible packages are installed on each system."
msgstr "ໃນ {productname}, ຊ່ອງທາງຈະຖືກຈັດກຸ່ມເປັນຊ່ອງທາງຫຼັກ (base channels) ແລະ ຊ່ອງທາງຍ່ອຍ (child channels). ໂດຍຊ່ອງທາງຫຼັກຈະຖືກຈັດກຸ່ມຕາມປະເພດຂອງລະບົບປະຕິບັດການ, ເວີຊັນ, ແລະ ສະຖາປັດຕະຍະກຳ, ສ່ວນຊ່ອງທາງຍ່ອຍຈະຕ້ອງເຮັດວຽກຮ່ວມກັບຊ່ອງທາງຫຼັກທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງໄດ້. ເມື່ອເຄື່ອງໄຄເອັນຖືກກຳນົດໃຫ້ໃຊ້ຊ່ອງທາງຫຼັກໃດໜຶ່ງແລ້ວ, ລະບົບນັ້ນຈະສາມາດຕິດຕັ້ງໄດ້ສະເພາະຊ່ອງທາງຍ່ອຍທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງເທົ່ານັ້ນ. ການຈັດລະບຽບຊ່ອງທາງແບບນີ້ຈະຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ໝັ້ນໃຈວ່າ ມີພຽງແພັກເກັດທີ່ເຮັດວຽກຮ່ວມກັນໄດ້ເທົ່ານັ້ນທີ່ຈະຖືກຕິດຕັ້ງໃນແຕ່ລະລະບົບ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/channel-management.adoc:4
msgid ""
"Software channels use repositories to provide packages.  The channels mirror "
"the repositories in {productname}, and the package names and other data are "
"stored in the {productname} database.  You can have any number of "
"repositories associated with a channel.  The software from those "
"repositories can then be installed on clients by subscribing the client to "
"the appropriate channel."
msgstr "ຊ່ອງທາງຊອບແວຈະໃຊ້ຄັງເກັບຊອບແວ (repositories) ເພື່ອໃຫ້ບໍລິການແພັກເກັດ. ຊ່ອງທາງເຫຼົ່ານີ້ຈະເປັນຕົວຈຳລອງ (mirror) ຂອງຄັງເກັບຊອບແວໃນ {productname}, ແລະ ຊື່ແພັກເກັດລວມທັງຂໍ້ມູນອື່ນໆ ຈະຖືກເກັບໄວ້ໃນຖານຂໍ້ມູນຂອງ {productname}. ທ່ານສາມາດມີຄັງເກັບຊອບແວຈຳນວນເທົ່າໃດກໍໄດ້ທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງກັບຊ່ອງທາງໃດໜຶ່ງ. ຈາກນັ້ນຊອບແວຈາກຄັງເກັບເຫຼົ່ານັ້ນຈະສາມາດຕິດຕັ້ງໃນເຄື່ອງໄຄເອັນໄດ້ໂດຍການໃຫ້ໄຄເອັນສະໝັກໃຊ້ (subscribe) ຊ່ອງທາງທີ່ເໝາະສົມ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/channel-management.adoc:5
msgid ""
"Clients can only be assigned to one base channel.  The client can then "
"install or update packages from the repositories associated with that base "
"channel and any of its child channels."
msgstr "ເຄື່ອງໄຄເອັນສາມາດຖືກກຳນົດໃຫ້ໃຊ້ຊ່ອງທາງຫຼັກໄດ້ພຽງແຕ່ຊ່ອງທາງດຽວເທົ່ານັ້ນ. ຈາກນັ້ນໄຄເອັນຈະສາມາດຕິດຕັ້ງ ຫຼື ອັບເດດແພັກເກັດຈາກຄັງເກັບຊອບແວທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງກັບຊ່ອງທາງຫຼັກນັ້ນ ແລະ ຊ່ອງທາງຍ່ອຍຂອງມັນໄດ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/channel-management.adoc:6
msgid ""
"{productname} provides a number of vendor channels, which provide you "
"everything you need to run {productname}.  {productname} Administrators and "
"Channel Administrators have channel management authority, which gives them "
"the ability to create and manage their own custom channels.  If you want to "
"use your own packages in your environment, you can create custom channels.  "
"Custom channels can be used as a base channel, or you can associate them "
"with a vendor base channel."
msgstr "{productname} ມີຊ່ອງທາງຈາກຜູ້ຜະລິດ (vendor channels) ຈຳນວນໜຶ່ງ ເຊິ່ງລວມເອົາທຸກຢ່າງທີ່ທ່ານຕ້ອງການ ເພື່ອໃຊ້ງານ {productname}. ຜູ້ດູແລລະບົບ {productname} ແລະ ຜູ້ດູແລຊ່ອງທາງມີອຳນາດໃນການຈັດການຊ່ອງທາງ ເຊິ່ງເຮັດໃຫ້ພວກເຂົາສາມາດສ້າງ ແລະ ຈັດການຊ່ອງທາງທີ່ປັບແຕ່ງເອງໄດ້. ຫາກທ່ານຕ້ອງການໃຊ້ແພັກເກັດຂອງທ່ານເອງ ໃນສະພາບແວດລ້ອມຂອງທ່ານ, ທ່ານສາມາດສ້າງຊ່ອງທາງທີ່ປັບແຕ່ງເອງ (custom channels) ໄດ້. ຊ່ອງທາງເຫຼົ່ານີ້ສາມາດໃຊ້ເປັນຊ່ອງທາງຫຼັກ ຫຼື ຈະນຳໄປເຊື່ອມໂຍງກັບຊ່ອງທາງຫຼັກຂອງຜູ້ຜະລິດກໍໄດ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/channel-management.adoc:7
msgid ""
"For more on creating custom channels, see "
"xref:administration:custom-channels.adoc[]."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບການສ້າງຊ່ອງທາງທີ່ປັບແຕ່ງເອງ, ກະລຸນາເບິ່ງ xref:administration:custom-channels.adoc[]."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/administration/pages/channel-management.adoc:8
#, no-wrap
msgid "Channel Administration"
msgstr "ການດູແລຈັດການຊ່ອງທາງ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/channel-management.adoc:9
msgid ""
"By default, any user can subscribe channels to a system.  You can implement "
"restrictions on the channel using the {webui}."
msgstr "ໂດຍປົກກະຕິແລ້ວ, ຜູ້ໃຊ້ທຸກຄົນສາມາດສະໝັກໃຊ້ຊ່ອງທາງໃຫ້ກັບລະບົບໄດ້. ທ່ານສາມາດກຳນົດຂໍ້ຈຳກັດໃນຊ່ອງທາງໄດ້ໂດຍໃຊ້ {webui}."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/administration/pages/channel-management.adoc:10
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Restricting Subscriber Access to a Channel"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການຈຳກັດການເຂົ້າເຖິງການສະໝັກໃຊ້ຊ່ອງທາງ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/channel-management.adoc:11
msgid ""
"In the {productname} {webui}, navigate to menu:Software[Channel List], and "
"select the channel to edit."
msgstr "ໃນ {productname} {webui}, ໃຫ້ໄປທີ່ເມນູ menu:Software[Channel List], ແລະ ເລືອກຊ່ອງທາງທີ່ຕ້ອງການແກ້ໄຂ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/channel-management.adoc:12
msgid ""
"Locate the `Per-User Subscription Restrictions` section and check `Only "
"selected users within your organization may subscribe to this channel`.  "
"Click btn:[Update] to save the changes."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/channel-management.adoc:13
msgid "Navigate to the `Subscribers` tab and select or deselect users as required."
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/administration/pages/channel-management.adoc:14
#, no-wrap
msgid "Delete Channels"
msgstr "ລຶບຊ່ອງທາງ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/channel-management.adoc:15
msgid "You can delete vendor software channels from the command prompt."
msgstr "ທ່ານສາມາດລຶບຊ່ອງທາງຊອບແວຂອງຜູ້ຜະລິດໄດ້ຈາກ command prompt."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/administration/pages/channel-management.adoc:16
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Deleting Vendor Channels"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການລຶບຊ່ອງທາງຂອງຜູ້ຜະລິດ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/channel-management.adoc:17
msgid ""
"On the {productname} Server, at the command prompt, as root, list the "
"available vendor channels, and make a note of the channel you want to "
"delete:"
msgstr "ໃນ {productname} Server, ທີ່ command prompt, ໃນນາມ root, ໃຫ້ສະແດງລາຍຊື່ຊ່ອງທາງຂອງຜູ້ຜະລິດທີ່ມີຢູ່ ແລະ ຈົດຊື່ຊ່ອງທາງທີ່ທ່ານຕ້ອງການລຶບໄວ້:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/channel-management.adoc:18
#, no-wrap
msgid "mgr-sync list channels\n"
msgstr "mgr-sync list channels\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/channel-management.adoc:19
msgid "Delete the channel:"
msgstr "ລຶບຊ່ອງທາງ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/channel-management.adoc:20
#, no-wrap
msgid "spacewalk-remove-channel -c <channel-name>\n"
msgstr "spacewalk-remove-channel -c <channel-name>\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/channel-management.adoc:21
msgid ""
"For more information about deleting channels manually, see "
"xref:administration:removing-channels.adoc[]."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບການລຶບຊ່ອງທາງດ້ວຍຕົນເອງ, ເບິ່ງ xref:administration:removing-channels.adoc[]."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/channel-management.adoc:22
msgid ""
"For information about deleting custom channels, see "
"xref:administration:custom-channels.adoc[]."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນກ່ຽວກັບການລຶບຊ່ອງທາງທີ່ປັບແຕ່ງເອງ, ກະລຸນາເບິ່ງ xref:administration:custom-channels.adoc[]."

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/confidential-computing.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Confidential Computing"
msgstr "ການຄຳນວນແບບເປັນຄວາມລັບ (Confidential Computing)"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/confidential-computing.adoc:2
msgid ""
"{CoCo} is a technology which allows protection of data in use by using "
"hardware-based Trusted Execution Environment (TEE), the type of environments "
"that provide increased level of security for data integrity, data "
"confidentiality, and code integrity."
msgstr "{CoCo} ແມ່ນເຕັກໂນໂລຊີທີ່ຊ່ວຍໃນການປົກປ້ອງຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ກຳລັງຖືກນຳໃຊ້ ໂດຍການນຳໃຊ້ Trusted Execution Environment (TEE) ທີ່ເຮັດວຽກໃນລະດັບຮາດແວ, ເຊິ່ງເປັນສະພາບແວດລ້ອມທີ່ໃຫ້ຄວາມປອດໄພລະດັບສູງສຳລັບຄວາມຖືກຕ້ອງຂອງຂໍ້ມູນ, ຄວາມລັບຂອງຂໍ້ມູນ, ແລະ ຄວາມຖືກຕ້ອງຂອງຊອດໂຄ້ດ (code integrity)."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/administration/pages/confidential-computing.adoc:3
#, no-wrap
msgid "{CoCo} with {productname}"
msgstr "{CoCo} ຮ່ວມກັບ {productname}"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/confidential-computing.adoc:4
msgid ""
"The trustworthiness of the TEE is checked with the attestation process.  "
"{productname} can be used as an attestation server for the systems "
"registered to it.  It generates a report page for the systems which run in "
"this mode.  These systems need to be attested and checked on regular base.  "
"The history of the past checks is also stored and available per request."
msgstr "ຄວາມໜ້າເຊື່ອຖືຂອງ TEE ແມ່ນຖືກກວດສອບດ້ວຍຂະບວນການຢືນຢັນ (attestation). {productname} ສາມາດໃຊ້ເປັນ attestation server ສຳລັບລະບົບຕ່າງໆ ທີ່ໄດ້ລົງທະບຽນໄວ້. ມັນຈະສ້າງໜ້າລາຍງານສຳລັບລະບົບທີ່ເຮັດວຽກໃນໂໝດນີ້. ລະບົບເຫຼົ່ານີ້ຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງໄດ້ຮັບການຢືນຢັນ ແລະ ກວດສອບເປັນປະຈຳ. ປະຫວັດການກວດສອບໃນອະດີດຈະຖືກເກັບໄວ້ ແລະ ສາມາດເບິ່ງໄດ້ຕາມການຮ້ອງຂໍ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/confidential-computing.adoc:5
msgid ""
"{CoCo} Attestation depends on the used hardware and environment where the "
"attested systems are running on."
msgstr "ການຢືນຢັນ (Attestation) ຂອງ {CoCo} ແມ່ນຂຶ້ນກັບຮາດແວທີ່ໃຊ້ ແລະ ສະພາບແວດລ້ອມທີ່ລະບົບນັ້ນໆ ກຳລັງເຮັດວຽກຢູ່."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/confidential-computing.adoc:6
msgid "{CoCo} Attestation is only available on x86_64 architecture."
msgstr "ການຢືນຢັນ {CoCo} ແມ່ນມີໃຫ້ໃຊ້ສະເພາະໃນສະຖາປັດຕະຍະກຳ x86_64 ເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/administration/pages/confidential-computing.adoc:7
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:14
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:134
#: en/modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:3
#, no-wrap
msgid "Requirements"
msgstr "ຂໍ້ກຳນົດ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/confidential-computing.adoc:8
msgid "{CoCo} can be set up in an environment with the following characteristics:"
msgstr "{CoCo} ສາມາດຕິດຕັ້ງໄດ້ໃນສະພາບແວດລ້ອມທີ່ມີຄຸນລັກສະນະດັ່ງຕໍ່ໄປນີ້:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/confidential-computing.adoc:9
msgid ""
"Attested system (virtual machine) is SLES15 SP6 and bootstrapped to "
"{productname}"
msgstr "ລະບົບທີ່ຖືກຢືນຢັນ (virtual machine) ຕ້ອງເປັນ SLES15 SP6 ແລະ ເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ (bootstrapped) ເຂົ້າກັບ {productname}"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/confidential-computing.adoc:10
msgid "Hardware must have `AMD EPYC Milan CPU` or `AMD EPYC Genoa CPU`"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/confidential-computing.adoc:11
msgid "BIOS must be configured to allow {CoCo} attestation"
msgstr "BIOS ຕ້ອງຖືກຕັ້ງຄ່າເພື່ອອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ມີການຢືນຢັນ {CoCo}"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/confidential-computing.adoc:12
msgid ""
"Host OS and the virtualization software (KVM and libvirt) must support "
"{CoCo}."
msgstr "Host OS ແລະ ຊອບແວການຈຳລອງລະບົບ (KVM ແລະ libvirt) ຕ້ອງຮອງຮັບ {CoCo}."

#. type: Title ===
#: en/modules/administration/pages/confidential-computing.adoc:13
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:270
#, no-wrap
msgid "Limitations"
msgstr "ຂໍ້ຈຳກັດ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/confidential-computing.adoc:14
msgid "SLES15 SP6 has {CoCo} attestation as technology preview."
msgstr "SLES15 SP6 ມີການຢືນຢັນ {CoCo} ໃນຮູບແບບ Technology Preview (ລຸ້ນທົດສອບ)."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/confidential-computing.adoc:15
msgid "{productname} has {CoCo} attestation as technology preview."
msgstr "{productname} ມີການຢືນຢັນ {CoCo} ໃນຮູບແບບ Technology Preview."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/confidential-computing.adoc:16
msgid ""
"Secure boot is attested.  However, currently KVM secure boot and SNP Guest "
"are not working together."
msgstr "Secure boot ໄດ້ຮັບການຢືນຢັນແລ້ວ. ແນວໃດກໍຕາມ, ໃນປັດຈຸບັນ KVM secure boot ແລະ SNP Guest ຍັງບໍ່ສາມາດເຮັດວຽກຮ່ວມກັນໄດ້."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/administration/pages/confidential-computing.adoc:17
#, no-wrap
msgid "Use {CoCo} in {productname}"
msgstr "ການນຳໃຊ້ {CoCo} ໃນ {productname}"

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/confidential-computing.adoc:18
msgid ""
"For the exact steps for setting up and configuring {CoCo} on your host, "
"refer to the OS Vendor documentation."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂັ້ນຕອນທີ່ແນ່ນອນໃນການຕິດຕັ້ງ ແລະ ຕັ້ງຄ່າ {CoCo} ໃນ host ຂອງທ່ານ, ກະລຸນາເບິ່ງເອກະສານຈາກຜູ້ຜະລິດ OS."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/administration/pages/confidential-computing.adoc:19
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Procedure: Enabling Attestation Container During the {productname} "
"Installation"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການເປີດນຳໃຊ້ Attestation Container ໃນລະຫວ່າງການຕິດຕັ້ງ {productname}"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/confidential-computing.adoc:20
msgid ""
"The attestation container is enabled during the installation of "
"{productname} with `mgradm install podman`."
msgstr ""

#. I need full path to this file.
#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/confidential-computing.adoc:21
msgid "Add the following to file `mgradm.yaml`."
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/confidential-computing.adoc:22
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"coco:\n"
"    replicas: 1\n"
msgstr ""
"coco:\n"
"    replicas: 1\n"

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/administration/pages/confidential-computing.adoc:23
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Procedure: Enabling Attestation Container After the {productname} "
"Installation"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການເປີດນຳໃຊ້ Attestation Container ຫຼັງຈາກການຕິດຕັ້ງ {productname}"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/confidential-computing.adoc:24
msgid ""
"To enable the attestation container after the installation, use the command "
"line parameter `mgradm`."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/confidential-computing.adoc:25
msgid "Run the command"
msgstr "ລັນຄຳສັ່ງ"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/confidential-computing.adoc:26
#, no-wrap
msgid "mgradm scale uyuni-server-attestation --replicas 1\n"
msgstr "mgradm scale uyuni-server-attestation --replicas 1\n"

#.  (PLACEHOLDER): In the future instead of number 1, it should be possible to allow more then one container replica.
#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/administration/pages/confidential-computing.adoc:27
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Procedure: Disabling Attestation Container After the {productname} "
"Installation"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການປິດການໃຊ້ງານຄອນເທນເນີຢັ້ງຢືນຫຼັງຈາກການຕິດຕັ້ງ {productname}"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/confidential-computing.adoc:28
msgid "To disable the already enabled attestation container, run the command:"
msgstr "ເພື່ອປິດການໃຊ້ງານ attestation container ທີ່ເປີດຢູ່, ໃຫ້ລັນຄຳສັ່ງ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/confidential-computing.adoc:29
#, no-wrap
msgid "mgradm scale uyuni-server-attestation --replicas 0\n"
msgstr "mgradm scale uyuni-server-attestation --replicas 0\n"

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/administration/pages/confidential-computing.adoc:30
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Enabling Attestation"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການເປີດນຳໃຊ້ Attestation"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/confidential-computing.adoc:31
msgid ""
"For the selected system, go to tab menu:Audit[Confidential Computing > "
"Settings]."
msgstr "ສຳລັບລະບົບທີ່ເລືອກ, ໃຫ້ໄປທີ່ແຖບເມນູ menu:Audit[Confidential Computing > Settings]."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/confidential-computing.adoc:32
msgid "Enable the attestation by selecting the toggle button."
msgstr "ເປີດນຳໃຊ້ການຢືນຢັນ (attestation) ໂດຍການຄລິກປຸ່ມເປີດ/ປິດ (toggle button)."

#. . (PLACEHOLDER) Enable the automatic attestaion at reboot by selecting the toggle button `Execution`.
#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/confidential-computing.adoc:33
msgid ""
"In the field `Environment Type` select the correct option from the drop-down "
"list."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/confidential-computing.adoc:34
msgid "Click button btn:[Save] to save the changes."
msgstr "ຄລິກປຸ່ມ btn:[Save] ເພື່ອບັນທຶກການປ່ຽນແປງ."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/administration/pages/confidential-computing.adoc:35
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Scheduling New Attestation"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການກຳນົດເວລາການຢືນຢັນໃໝ່"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/confidential-computing.adoc:36
#: en/modules/administration/pages/confidential-computing.adoc:42
msgid ""
"For the selected system, go to tab menu:Audit[Confidential Computing > List "
"Attestations]."
msgstr "ສຳລັບລະບົບທີ່ເລືອກ, ໃຫ້ໄປທີ່ແຖບເມນູ menu:Audit[Confidential Computing > List Attestations]."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/confidential-computing.adoc:37
msgid "Click btn:[Schedule Attestation].  The new form opens."
msgstr "ຄລິກ btn:[Schedule Attestation]. ແບບຟອມໃໝ່ຈະຖືກເປີດຂຶ້ນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/confidential-computing.adoc:38
msgid "In the field `Earliest` select the time of running the attestation."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/confidential-computing.adoc:39
msgid ""
"If needed, add the newly created attestation to the action chain by "
"selecting `Add to` option."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/confidential-computing.adoc:40
msgid ""
"Click button btn:[Schedule] to save and schedule the new attestation "
"execution."
msgstr "ຄລິກປຸ່ມ btn:[Schedule] ເພື່ອບັນທຶກ ແລະ ກຳນົດເວລາການດຳເນີນການຢືນຢັນໃໝ່."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/administration/pages/confidential-computing.adoc:41
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Viewing Attestation Reports from System Details"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການເບິ່ງລາຍງານການຢືນຢັນຈາກລາຍລະອຽດຂອງລະບົບ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/confidential-computing.adoc:43
#: en/modules/administration/pages/confidential-computing.adoc:50
msgid "Find and select the report you want to view."
msgstr "ຄົ້ນຫາ ແລະ ເລືອກລາຍງານທີ່ທ່ານຕ້ອງການເບິ່ງ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/confidential-computing.adoc:44
msgid "After clicking the selected attestation report tab `Overview` will open."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/confidential-computing.adoc:45
msgid "Move to the next tab `SEV-SNP`."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/confidential-computing.adoc:46
msgid "Finally, move to the next tab `Secure Boot`."
msgstr ""

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/administration/pages/confidential-computing.adoc:47
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Viewing Attestation Reports from Audit"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການເບິ່ງລາຍງານການຢືນຢັນຈາກ Audit"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/confidential-computing.adoc:48
msgid "From the navigation bar, select menu:Audit[Confidential Computing]."
msgstr "ຈາກແຖບນຳທາງ, ໃຫ້ເລືອກເມນູ menu:Audit[Confidential Computing]."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/confidential-computing.adoc:49
msgid "The list of all attestations will be shown in the main panel."
msgstr "ລາຍຊື່ຂອງການຢືນຢັນທັງໝົດຈະຖືກສະແດງໃນແຜງຫຼັກ."

#. type: Title ===
#: en/modules/administration/pages/confidential-computing.adoc:51
#, no-wrap
msgid "Report Statuses"
msgstr "ສະຖານະຂອງລາຍງານ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/confidential-computing.adoc:52
msgid "Attestation reports can have one of the following statuses:"
msgstr "ລາຍງານການຢືນຢັນສາມາດມີສະຖານະໃດໜຶ່ງດັ່ງຕໍ່ໄປນີ້:"

#. type: Labeled list
#: en/modules/administration/pages/confidential-computing.adoc:53
#, no-wrap
msgid "Pending"
msgstr "ກຳລັງລໍຖ້າ (Pending)"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/confidential-computing.adoc:54
msgid ""
"This is the default status of the scheduled attestation.  The report is "
"still not available, either because the process has not yet started or "
"completed."
msgstr "ນີ້ແມ່ນສະຖານະເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຂອງການຢືນຢັນທີ່ຖືກກຳນົດເວລາໄວ້. ລາຍງານຍັງບໍ່ທັນມີໃຫ້ເບິ່ງ, ອາດເປັນຍ້ອນຂະບວນການຍັງບໍ່ທັນເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ ຫຼື ຍັງບໍ່ທັນສຳເລັດ."

#. type: Labeled list
#: en/modules/administration/pages/confidential-computing.adoc:55
#, no-wrap
msgid "Successful"
msgstr "ສຳເລັດ (Successful)"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/confidential-computing.adoc:56
msgid ""
"When the scheduled attestation creates a report which can be viewed, the "
"status of the process is `Successful`."
msgstr ""

#. type: Labeled list
#: en/modules/administration/pages/confidential-computing.adoc:57
#, no-wrap
msgid "Failed"
msgstr "ຫຼົ້ມເຫຼວ (Failed)"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/confidential-computing.adoc:58
msgid ""
"When the scheduled fails and does not create a report as a result, the "
"status of the process is `Failed`."
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/administration/pages/confidential-computing.adoc:59
#, no-wrap
msgid "Related Topics"
msgstr "ຫົວຂໍ້ທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/confidential-computing.adoc:60
msgid ""
"For more information about {CoCo}, see "
"https://www.fortanix.com/platform/confidential-computing-manager/what-is-confidential-computing[here]."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບ {CoCo}, ເບິ່ງ https://www.fortanix.com/platform/confidential-computing-manager/what-is-confidential-computing[ທີ່ນີ້]."

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Content Lifecycle Management Examples"
msgstr "ຕົວຢ່າງການຈັດການວົງຈອນຊີວິດເນື້ອຫາ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:2
msgid ""
"This section contains some common examples of how you can use content "
"lifecycle management.  Use these examples to build your own personalized "
"implementation."
msgstr "ສ່ວນນີ້ປະກອບດ້ວຍຕົວຢ່າງທົ່ວໄປບາງຢ່າງກ່ຽວກັບວິທີທີ່ທ່ານສາມາດໃຊ້ການຈັດການວົງຈອນຊີວິດເນື້ອຫາ (Content Lifecycle Management). ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ຕົວຢ່າງເຫຼົ່ານີ້ເພື່ອສ້າງການຕິດຕັ້ງທີ່ເໝາະສົມກັບຄວາມຕ້ອງການຂອງທ່ານເອງ."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:3
#, no-wrap
msgid "Creating a Project for a Monthly Patch Cycle"
msgstr "ການສ້າງໂປຣເຈັກສຳລັບຮອບວຽນການອັບເດດແພັດຊ໌ລາຍເດືອນ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:4
msgid "An example project for a monthly patch cycle consists of:"
msgstr "ຕົວຢ່າງໂປຣເຈັກສຳລັບຮອບວຽນການອັບເດດແພັດຊ໌ລາຍເດືອນປະກອບດ້ວຍ:"

#. type: Title ===
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:5
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:10
#, no-wrap
msgid "Creating a `By Date` filter"
msgstr "ການສ້າງຕົວຕອງ 'ຕາມວັນທີ' (By Date)"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:6
msgid "Adding the filter to the project"
msgstr "ການເພີ່ມຕົວຕອງເຂົ້າໃນໂປຣເຈັກ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:7
msgid "Applying the filter to a new project build"
msgstr "ການນຳໃຊ້ຕົວຕອງກັບການສ້າງ (build) ໂປຣເຈັກໃໝ່"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:8
msgid "Excluding a patch from the project"
msgstr "ການຍົກເວັ້ນແພັດຊ໌ (patch) ອອກຈາກໂປຣເຈັກ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:9
msgid "Including a patch in the project"
msgstr "ການລວມແພັດຊ໌ (patch) ເຂົ້າໃນໂປຣເຈັກ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:11
msgid ""
"The `By Date` filter excludes all patches released after a specified date.  "
"This filter is useful for your content lifecycle projects that follow a "
"monthly patch cycle."
msgstr ""

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:12
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Creating the `By Date` filter"
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:13
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:38
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:53
msgid ""
"In the {productname} {webui}, navigate to menu:Content Lifecycle[Filters] "
"and click btn:[Create Filter]."
msgstr "ໃນ {productname} {webui}, ໃຫ້ໄປທີ່ເມນູ menu:Content Lifecycle[Filters] ແລະ ຄລິກ btn:[Create Filter]."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:14
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:90
msgid "In the `Filter Name` field, type a name for your filter."
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:15
msgid "For example, `Exclude patches by date`."
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:16
msgid "In the `Filter Type` field, select `Patch (Issue date)`."
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:17
msgid "In the `Matcher` field, `later or equal` is autoselected."
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:18
msgid "Select the date and time."
msgstr "ເລືອກວັນທີ ແລະ ເວລາ."

#. type: Title ===
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:20
#, no-wrap
msgid "Add a filter to the project"
msgstr "ເພີ່ມຕົວຕອງເຂົ້າໃນໂປຣເຈັກ"

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:21
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Adding a filter to a project"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການເພີ່ມຕົວຕອງເຂົ້າໃນໂປຣເຈັກ"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:22
msgid ""
"In the {productname} {webui}, navigate to menu:Content Lifecycle[Projects] "
"and select a project from the list."
msgstr "ໃນ {productname} {webui}, ໃຫ້ໄປທີ່ເມນູ menu:Content Lifecycle[Projects] ແລະ ເລືອກໂປຣເຈັກຈາກລາຍຊື່."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:23
msgid "Click btn:[Attach/Detach Filters] link to see all available filters"
msgstr "ຄລິກລິ້ງ btn:[Attach/Detach Filters] ເພື່ອເບິ່ງຕົວຕອງທັງໝົດທີ່ມີຢູ່"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:24
msgid "Select the new `Exclude patches by date` filter."
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ===
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:26
#, no-wrap
msgid "Apply a filter to a new project build"
msgstr "ນຳໃຊ້ຕົວຕອງກັບການສ້າງ (build) ໂປຣເຈັກໃໝ່"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:27
msgid ""
"The new filter is added to your filter list, but it still needs to be "
"applied to the project.  To apply the filter you need to build the first "
"environment."
msgstr "ຕົວຕອງໃໝ່ຖືກເພີ່ມເຂົ້າໃນລາຍຊື່ຕົວຕອງຂອງທ່ານແລ້ວ, ແຕ່ມັນຍັງຕ້ອງໄດ້ຮັບການນຳໃຊ້ກັບໂປຣເຈັກ. ເພື່ອເລີ່ມໃຊ້ຕົວຕອງ, ທ່ານຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງສ້າງ (build) ສະພາບແວດລ້ອມທຳອິດກ່ອນ."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:28
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Using the filter"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການນຳໃຊ້ຕົວຕອງ"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:29
msgid "Click btn:[Build] to build the first environment."
msgstr "ຄລິກ btn:[Build] ເພື່ອສ້າງສະພາບແວດລ້ອມທຳອິດ."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:30
msgid "OPTIONAL: Add a message."
msgstr "ທາງເລືອກ: ເພີ່ມຂໍ້ຄວາມ (message)."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:31
msgid "You can use messages to help track the build history."
msgstr "ທ່ານສາມາດໃຊ້ຂໍ້ຄວາມເພື່ອຊ່ວຍໃນການຕິດຕາມປະຫວັດການສ້າງ (build history) ໄດ້."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:32
msgid ""
"Check that the filter has worked correctly by using the new channels on a "
"test server."
msgstr "ກວດສອບວ່າຕົວຕອງເຮັດວຽກຢ່າງຖືກຕ້ອງຫຼືບໍ່ ໂດຍການໃຊ້ຊ່ອງທາງໃໝ່ໃນ server ທົດສອບ."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:33
msgid "Click btn:[Promote] to move the content to the next environment."
msgstr "ຄລິກ btn:[Promote] ເພື່ອເລື່ອນລະດັບເນື້ອຫາໄປຍັງສະພາບແວດລ້ອມຖັດໄປ."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:34
msgid ""
"The build takes longer if you have a large number of filters, or they are "
"very complex."
msgstr "ການສ້າງ (build) ຈະໃຊ້ເວລາດົນຂຶ້ນ ຫາກທ່ານມີຕົວຕອງຈຳນວນຫຼາຍ ຫຼື ຕົວຕອງນັ້ນມີຄວາມຊັບຊ້ອນຫຼາຍ."

#. type: Title ===
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:35
#, no-wrap
msgid "Exclude a patch from the project"
msgstr "ຍົກເວັ້ນແພັດຊ໌ອອກຈາກໂປຣເຈັກ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:36
msgid ""
"Tests may help you discover issues.  When an issue is found, exclude the "
"problem patch released before the `by date` filter."
msgstr "ການທົດສອບອາດຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ທ່ານຄົ້ນພົບຂໍ້ຜິດພາດ. ເມື່ອພົບຂໍ້ຜິດພາດ, ໃຫ້ຍົກເວັ້ນແພັດຊ໌ທີ່ມີບັນຫາ ທີ່ຖືກປ່ອຍອອກມາກ່ອນວັນທີໃນຕົວຕອງ 'ຕາມວັນທີ'."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:37
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Excluding a patch"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການຍົກເວັ້ນແພັດຊ໌"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:39
msgid "In the `Filter Name` field, enter a name for the filter."
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:40
msgid "For example, `Exclude openjdk patch`."
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:41
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:56
