msgstr "ຄລິກ btn:[Save] ເພື່ອບັນທຶກຕົວຕອງ."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:60
msgid ""
"Navigate to menu:Content Lifecycle[Projects] and select your project from "
"the list."
msgstr "ໄປທີ່ເມນູ menu:Content Lifecycle[Projects] ແລະ ເລືອກໂປຣເຈັກຂອງທ່ານຈາກລາຍຊື່."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:61
msgid ""
"Click btn:[Attach/Detach Filters], and select `Include kernel security "
"patch`."
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:63
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:114
msgid "Click btn:[Build] to rebuild the environment."
msgstr "ຄລິກ btn:[Build] ເພື່ອສ້າງສະພາບແວດລ້ອມຄືນໃໝ່."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:64
#, no-wrap
msgid "Update an existing monthly patch cycle"
msgstr "ອັບເດດຮອບວຽນການອັບເດດແພັດຊ໌ລາຍເດືອນທີ່ມີຢູ່"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:65
msgid ""
"When a monthly patch cycle is complete, you can update the patch cycle for "
"the next month."
msgstr "ເມື່ອຮອບວຽນການອັບເດດແພັດຊ໌ຂອງເດືອນໃດໜຶ່ງສຳເລັດແລ້ວ, ທ່ານສາມາດອັບເດດຮອບວຽນແພັດຊ໌ສຳລັບເດືອນຖັດໄປໄດ້."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:66
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Updating a monthly patch cycle"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການອັບເດດຮອບວຽນການອັບເດດແພັດຊ໌ລາຍເດືອນ"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:67
msgid "In the `by date` field, change the date of the filter to the next month."
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:68
msgid "Alternatively, create a new filter and change the assignment to the project."
msgstr "ຫຼື ອີກວິທີໜຶ່ງ, ໃຫ້ສ້າງຕົວຕອງໃໝ່ ແລະ ປ່ຽນການກຳນົດຄ່າໃຫ້ກັບໂປຣເຈັກ."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:69
msgid ""
"Check if the exclude filter for `SUSE-15-2019-1807` can be detached from the "
"project."
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:70
msgid "There may be a new patch available to fix this issue."
msgstr "ອາດຈະມີແພັດຊ໌ໃໝ່ທີ່ອອກມາແກ້ໄຂບັນຫານີ້ແລ້ວ."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:71
msgid "Detach the `allow` filter you added previously."
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:72
msgid "The patch is included by default."
msgstr "ແພັດຊ໌ຈະຖືກລວມເຂົ້າຢູ່ແລ້ວໂດຍຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:73
msgid ""
"Rebuild the project to create a new environment with patches for the next "
"month."
msgstr "ສ້າງ (rebuild) ໂປຣເຈັກຄືນໃໝ່ເພື່ອສ້າງສະພາບແວດລ້ອມໃໝ່ທີ່ລວມແພັດຊ໌ສຳລັບເດືອນຖັດໄປ."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:74
#, no-wrap
msgid "Enhance a project with live patching"
msgstr "ເພີ່ມປະສິດທິພາບໂປຣເຈັກດ້ວຍການເຮັດ live patching"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:75
msgid ""
"This section covers setting up filters to create environments for live "
"patching."
msgstr "ສ່ວນນີ້ຈະກວມເອົາການຕັ້ງຄ່າຕົວຕອງເພື່ອສ້າງສະພາບແວດລ້ອມສຳລັບການເຮັດ live patching."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:76
msgid ""
"When you are preparing to use live patching, there are some important "
"considerations:"
msgstr "ເມື່ອທ່ານກຳລັງກະກຽມທີ່ຈະໃຊ້ live patching, ມີບາງຂໍ້ທີ່ຄວນພິຈາລະນາທີ່ສຳຄັນດັ່ງນີ້:"

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:77
msgid "Only ever use one kernel version on your systems."
msgstr "ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ kernel ພຽງເວີຊັນດຽວເທົ່ານັ້ນໃນລະບົບຂອງທ່ານ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:78
msgid "The live patching packages are installed with a specific kernel."
msgstr "ແພັກເກັດ live patching ຈະຖືກຕິດຕັ້ງກັບ kernel ທີ່ລະບຸໄວ້ສະເພາະ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:79
msgid "Live patching updates are shipped as one patch."
msgstr "ການອັບເດດ live patching ແມ່ນຈະຖືກສົ່ງມາໃນຮູບແບບແພັດຊ໌ດຽວ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:80
msgid ""
"Each kernel patch that begins a new series of live patching kernels displays "
"the `required reboot` flag."
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:81
msgid ""
"These kernel patches come with live patching tools.  When you have installed "
"them, you need to reboot the system at least once before the next year."
msgstr "kernel patches ເຫຼົ່ານີ້ມາພ້ອມກັບເຄື່ອງມື live patching. ເມື່ອທ່ານຕິດຕັ້ງພວກມັນແລ້ວ, ທ່ານຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງ reboot ລະບົບຢ່າງໜ້ອຍໜຶ່ງຄັ້ງພາຍໃນໜຶ່ງປີ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:82
msgid "Only install live patch updates that match the installed kernel version."
msgstr "ໃຫ້ຕິດຕັ້ງສະເພາະການອັບເດດ live patch ທີ່ກົງກັບເວີຊັນຂອງ kernel ທີ່ຕິດຕັ້ງໄວ້ເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:83
msgid "Live patches are provided as stand-alone patches."
msgstr "Live patches ແມ່ນຖືກສະໜອງໃຫ້ໃນຮູບແບບແພັດຊ໌ທີ່ເຮັດວຽກເປັນເອກະລາດ (stand-alone)."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:84
msgid ""
"You must exclude all regular kernel patches with higher kernel version than "
"the currently installed one."
msgstr "ທ່ານຕ້ອງຍົກເວັ້ນ kernel patches ແບບປົກກະຕິທັງໝົດທີ່ມີເວີຊັນ kernel ສູງກວ່າ ເວີຊັນທີ່ຕິດຕັ້ງຢູ່ໃນປັດຈຸບັນ."

#. type: Title ===
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:85
#, no-wrap
msgid "Exclude packages with a higher kernel version"
msgstr "ຍົກເວັ້ນແພັກເກັດທີ່ມີເວີຊັນ kernel ສູງກວ່າ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:86
msgid ""
"In this example you update your systems with the `SUSE-15-2019-1244` patch.  "
"This patch contains `kernel-default-4.12.14-150.17.1-x86_64`."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:87
msgid ""
"You need to exclude all patches which contain a higher version of "
"`kernel-default` and `kernel-default-base`."
msgstr ""

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:88
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Excluding packages with a higher kernel version"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການຍົກເວັ້ນແພັກເກັດທີ່ມີເວີຊັນ kernel ສູງກວ່າ"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:89
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:76
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:94
msgid ""
"In the {productname} {webui}, navigate to menu:Content Lifecycle[Filters], "
"and click btn:[Create Filter]."
msgstr "ໃນ {productname} {webui}, ໃຫ້ໄປທີ່ເມນູ menu:Content Lifecycle[Filters], ແລະ ຄລິກ btn:[Create Filter]."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:91
msgid "For example, `Exclude kernel greater than 4.12.14-150.17.1`."
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:92
msgid "In the `Filter Type` field, select `Patch (Contains Package)`."
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:93
msgid "In the `Matcher` field, select `version greater than`."
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:94
msgid "In the `Package Name` field, type `kernel-default`."
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:95
msgid "Leave the `Epoch` field empty."
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:96
msgid "In the `Version` field, type `4.12.14`."
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:97
msgid "In the `Release` field, type `150.17.1`."
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:100
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:23
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:84
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:102
msgid "Click btn:[Attach/Detach Filters]."
msgstr "ຄລິກ btn:[Attach/Detach Filters]."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:101
msgid "Select `Exclude kernel greater than 4.12.14-150.17.1`, and click btn:[Save]."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:102
msgid "You need to repeat this procedure for the `kernel-default-base` package."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:103
msgid ""
"When you click btn:[Build], a new environment is created.  The new "
"environment contains all the kernel patches up to the version you installed."
msgstr "ເມື່ອທ່ານຄລິກ btn:[Build], ສະພາບແວດລ້ອມໃໝ່ຈະຖືກສ້າງຂຶ້ນ. ເຊິ່ງສະພາບແວດລ້ອມໃໝ່ນີ້ ຈະປະກອບດ້ວຍ kernel patches ທັງໝົດຈົນເຖິງເວີຊັນທີ່ທ່ານໄດ້ຕິດຕັ້ງໄວ້."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:104
msgid ""
"All kernel patches with higher kernel versions are removed.  Live patching "
"kernels remain available as long as they are not the first in a series."
msgstr "kernel patches ທັງໝົດທີ່ມີເວີຊັນ kernel ສູງກວ່າຈະຖືກນຳອອກ. Live patching kernels ຈະຍັງຄົງມີໃຫ້ໃຊ້ ຕາບໃດທີ່ພວກມັນບໍ່ແມ່ນແພັດຊ໌ທຳອິດໃນຊຸດນັ້ນໆ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:105
msgid ""
"This procedure can be automated using a filter template.  For more "
"information on how to apply a live patching filter template, see "
"xref:administration:content-lifecycle.adoc#filter-templates[]."
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນນີ້ສາມາດເຮັດໃຫ້ເປັນອັດຕະໂນມັດໄດ້ໂດຍການໃຊ້ແມ່ແບບຕົວຕອງ (filter template). ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບວິທີການນຳໃຊ້ແມ່ແບບຕົວຕອງ live patching, ກະລຸນາເບິ່ງ xref:administration:content-lifecycle.adoc#filter-templates[]."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:106
#, no-wrap
msgid "Switch to a new kernel version for live patching"
msgstr "ປ່ຽນໄປໃຊ້ kernel ເວີຊັນໃໝ່ສຳລັບ live patching"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:107
msgid ""
"Live patching for a specific kernel version is only available for one year.  "
"After one year you must update the kernel on your systems.  Execute these "
"environment changes:"
msgstr "Live patching ສຳລັບ kernel ເວີຊັນໃດໜຶ່ງໂດຍສະເພາະ ແມ່ນຈະມີໃຫ້ໃຊ້ພຽງແຕ່ເປັນເວລາໜຶ່ງປີ. ຫຼັງຈາກໜຶ່ງປີ ທ່ານຕ້ອງອັບເດດ kernel ໃນລະບົບຂອງທ່ານ. ໃຫ້ດຳເນີນການປ່ຽນແປງສະພາບແວດລ້ອມດັ່ງນີ້:"

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:108
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Switch to a new kernel version"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການປ່ຽນໄປໃຊ້ kernel ເວີຊັນໃໝ່"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:109
msgid "Decide which kernel version to upgrade to."
msgstr "ຕັດສິນໃຈວ່າຈະອັບເກຣດໄປເປັນ kernel ເວີຊັນໃດ."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:110
msgid "For example: `4.12.14-150.32.1`"
msgstr "ຕົວຢ່າງ: `4.12.14-150.32.1`"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:111
msgid "Create a new kernel version Filter."
msgstr "ສ້າງຕົວຕອງເວີຊັນ kernel ໃໝ່."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:112
msgid "Detach all previous Live Patching filters associated with the old kernel."
msgstr "ຖອດຕົວຕອງ Live Patching ກ່ອນໜ້ານີ້ທັງໝົດທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງກັບ kernel ເກົ່າອອກ."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:113
msgid "Attach the new kernel version filter."
msgstr "ເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ (Attach) ຕົວຕອງເວີຊັນ kernel ໃໝ່."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:115
msgid ""
"Once the build is complete, you must immediately re-attach the two filters "
"which:"
msgstr "ເມື່ອການສ້າງ (build) ສຳເລັດ, ທ່ານຕ້ອງເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ສອງຕົວຕອງນີ້ຄືນໃໝ່ທັນທີ ເຊິ່ງຈະຊ່ວຍ:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:116
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:72
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:90
msgid "Deny patches that contain `reboot_suggested` keyword"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:117
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:73
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:91
msgid ""
"Deny patches that contain a package which provides the name "
"`installhint(reboot-needed)`"
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:118
msgid ""
"The new environment contains all kernel patches up to the new kernel version "
"you selected.  You need to reboot systems after they have performed the "
"upgrade.  The new kernel remains valid for one year.  All packages installed "
"during the year match the current live patching kernel filter."
msgstr "ສະພາບແວດລ້ອມໃໝ່ຈະປະກອບດ້ວຍ kernel patches ທັງໝົດຈົນເຖິງເວີຊັນ kernel ໃໝ່ທີ່ທ່ານເລືອກ. ທ່ານຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງ reboot ລະບົບຫຼັງຈາກທີ່ພວກມັນດຳເນີນການອັບເກຣດສຳເລັດແລ້ວ. kernel ໃໝ່ຈະຍັງຄົງໃຊ້ງານໄດ້ເປັນເວລາໜຶ່ງປີ. ທຸກແພັກເກັດທີ່ຕິດຕັ້ງໃນລະຫວ່າງປີ ຈະກົງກັບຕົວຕອງ live patching kernel ໃນປັດຈຸບັນ."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:119
#, no-wrap
msgid "AppStream filters"
msgstr "ຕົວຕອງ AppStream"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:120
msgid ""
"In a content lifecycle management project, you can use the AppStream filter "
"to transform modular repositories into regular repositories.  It does this "
"by keeping the packages in the repository and stripping away the module "
"metadata.  The resulting repository can be used in {productname} in the same "
"way as a regular repository."
msgstr "ໃນໂປຣເຈັກການຈັດການວົງຈອນຊີວິດເນື້ອຫາ, ທ່ານສາມາດໃຊ້ຕົວຕອງ AppStream ເພື່ອປ່ຽນຄັງເກັບຊອບແວແບບ modular ໃຫ້ເປັນຄັງເກັບຊອບແວແບບປົກກະຕິ. ມັນເຮັດວຽກໂດຍການເກັບແພັກເກັດໄວ້ໃນຄັງເກັບຊອບແວ ແລະ ຕັດຂໍ້ມູນ metadata ຂອງໂມດູນອອກ. ຄັງເກັບຊອບແວທີ່ໄດ້ມາຈະສາມາດນຳໃຊ້ໃນ {productname} ໄດ້ຄືກັນກັບຄັງເກັບຊອບແວປົກກະຕິ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:121
msgid "AppStream repositories are natively supported throughout the {webui}."
msgstr "ຄັງເກັບຊອບແວ AppStream ໄດ້ຮັບການຮອງຮັບແບບພື້ນຖານ (native) ຕະຫຼອດທັງ {webui}."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:122
msgid ""
"Since {productname} 5.0, AppStream repositories are natively supported "
"throughout the {webui}."
msgstr "ຕັ້ງແຕ່ {productname} 5.0 ເປັນຕົ້ນມາ, ຄັງເກັບຊອບແວ AppStream ແມ່ນໄດ້ຮັບການຮອງຮັບແບບພື້ນຖານໃນ {webui}."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:123
msgid ""
"Therefore, this process is not mandatory to work with AppStream "
"repositories."
msgstr "ດັ່ງນັ້ນ, ຂະບວນການນີ້ຈຶ່ງບໍ່ແມ່ນເລື່ອງບັງຄັບໃນການເຮັດວຽກກັບຄັງເກັບຊອບແວ AppStream."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:124
msgid ""
"The AppStream filter selects a single module stream to be included in the "
"target repository.  You can add multiple filters to select multiple module "
"streams."
msgstr "ຕົວຕອງ AppStream ຈະເລືອກສາຍໂມດູນ (module stream) ດຽວເພື່ອລວມເຂົ້າໃນຄັງເກັບຊອບແວເປົ້າໝາຍ. ທ່ານສາມາດເພີ່ມຫຼາຍຕົວຕອງເພື່ອເລືອກຫຼາຍສາຍໂມດູນໄດ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:125
msgid ""
"If you do not use an AppStream filter in your CLM project, the module "
"metadata in the modular sources remains intact, and the target repositories "
"contain the same module metadata.  As long as at least one AppStream filter "
"is enabled in the CLM project, all target repositories are transformed into "
"regular repositories."
msgstr "ຫາກທ່ານບໍ່ໃຊ້ຕົວຕອງ AppStream ໃນໂປຣເຈັກ CLM ຂອງທ່ານ, metadata ຂອງໂມດູນໃນແຫຼ່ງຂໍ້ມູນ modular ຈະຍັງຄົງຄືເກົ່າ, ແລະ ຄັງເກັບຊອບແວເປົ້າໝາຍຈະມີ metadata ຂອງໂມດູນອັນດຽວກັນ. ຕາບໃດທີ່ມີການເປີດນຳໃຊ້ຕົວຕອງ AppStream ຢ່າງໜ້ອຍໜຶ່ງອັນໃນໂປຣເຈັກ CLM, ຄັງເກັບຊອບແວເປົ້າໝາຍທັງໝົດຈະຖືກປ່ຽນໃຫ້ເປັນຄັງເກັບຊອບແວປົກກະຕິ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:126
msgid ""
"In some cases, you might wish to build regular repositories without having "
"to include packages from any module.  To do so, add an AppStream filter "
"using the matcher `none (disable modularity)`.  This will disable all the "
"modules in the target repository.  This is especially useful for "
"{rhel}{nbsp}9 clients, where the default versions of most modules are "
"already included in the AppStream repository as regular packages."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:127
msgid ""
"To use the AppStream filter, you need a CLM project with a modular "
"repository such as `{rhel} AppStreams`.  Ensure that you included the module "
"you need as a source before you begin."
msgstr ""

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:128
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Using AppStream filters"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການນຳໃຊ້ຕົວຕອງ AppStream"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:129
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:144
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:158
msgid ""
"In the {productname} {webui}, navigate to your {rhel}{nbsp}8 or 9 CLM "
"project."
msgstr "ໃນ {productname} {webui}, ໃຫ້ໄປທີ່ໂປຣເຈັກ CLM ຂອງ {rhel}{nbsp}8 ຫຼື 9 ຂອງທ່ານ."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:130
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:145
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:159
msgid "Ensure that you have included the AppStream channels for your project."
msgstr "ໃຫ້ໝັ້ນໃຈວ່າທ່ານໄດ້ລວມຊ່ອງທາງ AppStream ສຳລັບໂປຣເຈັກຂອງທ່ານແລ້ວ."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:131
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:146
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:160
msgid "Click btn:[Create Filter] and use these parameters:"
msgstr "ຄລິກ btn:[Create Filter] ແລະ ໃຊ້ພາຣາມິເຕີເຫຼົ່ານີ້:"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:132
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:147
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:161
msgid "In the `Filter Name` field, type a name for the new filter."
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:133
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:148
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:162
msgid "In the `Filter Type` field, select `Module (Stream)`."
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:135
msgid "In the `Module Name` field, type a module name."
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:136
msgid "For example, `postgresql`."
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:137
msgid "In the `Stream` field, type the name of the desired stream."
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:138
msgid ""
"For example, `10`.  If you leave this field blank, the default stream for "
"the module is selected."
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:139
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:164
msgid "Click btn:[Save] to create the new filter."
msgstr "ຄລິກ btn:[Save] ເພື່ອສ້າງຕົວຕອງໃໝ່."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:141
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:166
msgid ""
"Click btn:[Attach/Detach Filters], select your new AppStream filter, and "
"click btn:[Save]."
msgstr "ຄລິກ btn:[Attach/Detach Filters], ເລືອກຕົວຕອງ AppStream ໃໝ່ຂອງທ່ານ, ແລະ ຄລິກ btn:[Save]."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:142
msgid ""
"You can use the browse function in the `Create/Edit Filter` form to select a "
"module from a list of available module streams for a modular channel."
msgstr ""

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:143
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Browsing available module streams"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການເລືອກເບິ່ງສາຍໂມດູນທີ່ມີຢູ່"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:150
msgid "Click `Browse available modules` to see all modular channels."
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:151
msgid "Select a channel to browse the modules and streams:"
msgstr "ເລືອກຊ່ອງທາງເພື່ອເບິ່ງໂມດູນ ແລະ ສາຍໂມດູນ:"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:152
msgid ""
"In the `Module Name` field, start typing a module name to search, or select "
"from the list."
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:153
msgid ""
"In the `Stream` field, start typing a stream name to search, or select from "
"the list."
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:154
msgid ""
"Channel selection is only for browsing modules.  The selected channel is not "
"be saved with the filter, and does not affect the CLM process in any way."
msgstr "ການເລືອກຊ່ອງທາງແມ່ນເພື່ອຈຸດປະສົງໃນການເບິ່ງໂມດູນເທົ່ານັ້ນ. ຊ່ອງທາງທີ່ເລືອກຈະບໍ່ຖືກບັນທຶກ ໄວ້ກັບຕົວຕອງ, ແລະ ຈະບໍ່ມີຜົນກະທົບໃດໆ ຕໍ່ຂະບວນການ CLM."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:155
msgid ""
"You can create additional AppStream filters for any other module stream to "
"be included in the target repository.  Any module streams that the selected "
"stream depends on is automatically included."
msgstr "ທ່ານສາມາດສ້າງຕົວຕອງ AppStream ເພີ່ມເຕີມສຳລັບສາຍໂມດູນອື່ນໆ ເພື່ອລວມເຂົ້າໃນຄັງເກັບຊອບແວເປົ້າໝາຍ. ສາຍໂມດູນໃດໆ ທີ່ສາຍໂມດູນທີ່ເລືອກນັ້ນຕ້ອງໃຊ້ (dependencies) ຈະຖືກລວມເຂົ້າໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:156
msgid ""
"Be careful not to specify conflicting, incompatible, or missing module "
"streams.  For example, selecting two streams from the same module is "
"invalid."
msgstr "ກະລຸນາລະມັດລະວັງໃນການລະບຸສາຍໂມດູນທີ່ຂັດແຍ້ງກັນ, ເຂົ້າກັນບໍ່ໄດ້, ຫຼື ບໍ່ຄົບຖ້ວນ. ຕົວຢ່າງ: ການເລືອກສອງສາຍໂມດູນຈາກໂມດູນດຽວກັນແມ່ນເປັນສິ່ງທີ່ບໍ່ຖືກຕ້ອງ."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:157
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Disabling modularity"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການປິດການໃຊ້ງານ modularity"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:163
msgid "In the `Matcher` field, select `none (disable modularity)`."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:167
msgid ""
"This will effectively remove the module metadata from the target repository, "
"excluding any package that belongs to a module."
msgstr "ສິ່ງນີ້ຈະເປັນການນຳເອົາ metadata ຂອງໂມດູນອອກຈາກຄັງເກັບຊອບແວເປົ້າໝາຍຢ່າງມີປະສິດທິພາບ, ໂດຍຈະຍົກເວັ້ນທຸກແພັກເກັດທີ່ຂຶ້ນກັບໂມດູນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:168
msgid ""
"When you build your CLM project using the btn:[Build] button in the {webui}, "
"the target repository is a regular repository without any modules, that "
"contains packages from the selected module streams."
msgstr "ເມື່ອທ່ານສ້າງໂປຣເຈັກ CLM ຂອງທ່ານໂດຍໃຊ້ປຸ່ມ btn:[Build] ໃນ {webui}, ຄັງເກັບຊອບແວເປົ້າໝາຍຈະກາຍເປັນຄັງເກັບຊອບແວປົກກະຕິໂດຍບໍ່ມີໂມດູນໃດໆ, ເຊິ່ງຈະປະກອບດ້ວຍແພັກເກັດຈາກສາຍໂມດູນທີ່ເລືອກໄວ້."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:169
msgid ""
"Disabling modularity altogether in {rhel}{nbsp}8 projects might result in a "
"faulty environment as some modules are essential for healthy operation in "
"{rhel}{nbsp}8."
msgstr "ການປິດການໃຊ້ງານ modularity ທັງໝົດໃນໂປຣເຈັກ {rhel}{nbsp}8 ອາດຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ສະພາບແວດລ້ອມມີບັນຫາ ເນື່ອງຈາກບາງໂມດູນແມ່ນມີຄວາມຈຳເປັນສຳລັບການເຮັດວຽກທີ່ປົກກະຕິໃນ {rhel}{nbsp}8."

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Content Lifecycle Management"
msgstr "ການຈັດການວົງຈອນຊີວິດເນື້ອຫາ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:2
msgid ""
"Content lifecycle management allows you to customize and test packages "
"before updating production clients.  This is especially useful if you need "
"to apply updates during a limited maintenance window."
msgstr "ການຈັດການວົງຈອນຊີວິດເນື້ອຫາຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ທ່ານສາມາດປັບແຕ່ງ ແລະ ທົດສອບແພັກເກັດກ່ອນທີ່ຈະອັບເດດໃຫ້ກັບໄຄເອັນ ທີ່ໃຊ້ງານຈິງ (production). ສິ່ງນີ້ມີປະໂຫຍດຫຼາຍໂດຍສະເພາະຫາກທ່ານຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງມີການອັບເດດ ໃນຊ່ວງເວລາການບຳລຸງຮັກສາ (maintenance window) ທີ່ຈຳກັດ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:3
msgid ""
"Content lifecycle management allows you to select software channels as "
"sources, adjust them as required for your environment, and thoroughly test "
"them before installing onto your production clients."
msgstr "ການຈັດການວົງຈອນຊີວິດເນື້ອຫາຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ທ່ານສາມາດເລືອກຊ່ອງທາງຊອບແວເປັນແຫຼ່ງຂໍ້ມູນ, ປັບແຕ່ງພວກມັນຕາມຄວາມຕ້ອງການຂອງສະພາບແວດລ້ອມຂອງທ່ານ, ແລະ ທົດສອບຢ່າງລະອຽດ ກ່ອນທີ່ຈະຕິດຕັ້ງລົງໃນໄຄເອັນທີ່ໃຊ້ງານຈິງ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:4
msgid ""
"While you cannot directly modify vendor channels, you can clone them and "
"then modify the clones by adding or removing packages and custom patches.  "
"You can assign these cloned channels to test clients to ensure they work as "
"expected."
msgstr "ເຖິງແມ່ນວ່າທ່ານຈະບໍ່ສາມາດແກ້ໄຂຊ່ອງທາງຂອງຜູ້ຜະລິດໄດ້ໂດຍກົງ, ແຕ່ທ່ານສາມາດສຳເນົາ (clone) ພວກມັນ ແລະ ແກ້ໄຂຊ່ອງທາງທີ່ສຳເນົາມານັ້ນໄດ້ ໂດຍການເພີ່ມ ຫຼື ລຶບແພັກເກັດ ແລະ ແພັດຊ໌ທີ່ປັບແຕ່ງເອງ. ທ່ານສາມາດກຳນົດຊ່ອງທາງທີ່ສຳເນົາມານີ້ໃຫ້ກັບໄຄເອັນທົດສອບ ເພື່ອໃຫ້ໝັ້ນໃຈວ່າພວກມັນເຮັດວຽກໄດ້ຕາມທີ່ຄາດໄວ້."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:5
msgid ""
"By default, cloned vendor channels match the original vendor channel and "
"automatically select the dependencies.  You can disable the automatic "
"selection for cloned channels by adding the following option in "
"`/etc/rhn/rhn.conf`:"
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:6
#, no-wrap
msgid "java.cloned_channel_auto_selection = false\n"
msgstr "java.cloned_channel_auto_selection = false\n"

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:7
msgid ""
"Then, when all tests pass, you can promote the cloned channels to production "
"servers."
msgstr "ຈາກນັ້ນ, ເມື່ອການທົດສອບທັງໝົດຜ່ານແລ້ວ, ທ່ານສາມາດເລື່ອນລະດັບ (promote) ຊ່ອງທາງທີ່ສຳເນົາມາ ໄປຍັງ server ທີ່ໃຊ້ງານຈິງໄດ້."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:8
msgid ""
"This is achieved through a series of environments that your software "
"channels can move through on their lifecycle.  Most environment lifecycles "
"include at least test and production environments, but you can have as many "
"environments as you require."
msgstr "ສິ່ງນີ້ເຮັດໄດ້ໂດຍຜ່ານລຳດັບຂອງສະພາບແວດລ້ອມທີ່ຊ່ອງທາງຊອບແວຂອງທ່ານສາມາດເຄື່ອນຍ້າຍ ໄປຕາມວົງຈອນຊີວິດຂອງມັນ. ວົງຈອນຊີວິດຂອງສະພາບແວດລ້ອມສ່ວນໃຫຍ່ ຈະປະກອບດ້ວຍຢ່າງໜ້ອຍ ສະພາບແວດລ້ອມທົດສອບ (test) ແລະ ໃຊ້ງານຈິງ (production), ແຕ່ທ່ານສາມາດມີຫຼາຍສະພາບແວດລ້ອມ ຕາມທີ່ທ່ານຕ້ອງການໄດ້."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:9
msgid ""
"This section covers the basic content lifecycle procedures, and the filters "
"available.  For more specific examples, see "
"xref:administration:content-lifecycle-examples.adoc[]."
msgstr "ສ່ວນນີ້ຈະກວມເອົາຂັ້ນຕອນພື້ນຖານຂອງວົງຈອນຊີວິດເນື້ອຫາ ແລະ ຕົວຕອງທີ່ມີໃຫ້ໃຊ້. ສຳລັບຕົວຢ່າງທີ່ສະເພາະເຈາະຈົງກວ່າ, ກະລຸນາເບິ່ງ xref:administration:content-lifecycle-examples.adoc[]."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:10
#, no-wrap
msgid "Create a content lifecycle project"
msgstr "ສ້າງໂປຣເຈັກວົງຈອນຊີວິດເນື້ອຫາ"

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:11
msgid ""
"To set up a content lifecycle, you need to begin with a project.  The "
"project defines the software channel sources, the filters used to find "
"packages, and the build environments."
msgstr "ເພື່ອຕັ້ງຄ່າວົງຈອນຊີວິດເນື້ອຫາ, ທ່ານຕ້ອງເລີ່ມຕົ້ນດ້ວຍການສ້າງໂປຣເຈັກ. ໂປຣເຈັກຈະເປັນຕົວກຳນົດແຫຼ່ງຂໍ້ມູນຂອງຊ່ອງທາງຊອບແວ, ຕົວຕອງທີ່ໃຊ້ໃນການຄົ້ນຫາແພັກເກັດ, ແລະ ສະພາບແວດລ້ອມໃນການສ້າງ (build environments)."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:12
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Creating a content lifecycle project"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການສ້າງໂຄງການວົງຈອນຊີວິດເນື້ອຫາ"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:13
msgid ""
"In the {productname} {webui}, navigate to menu:Content Lifecycle[Projects], "
"and click btn:[Create Project]."
msgstr "ໃນ {productname} {webui}, ໃຫ້ໄປທີ່ເມນູ menu:Content Lifecycle[Projects], ແລະ ຄລິກ btn:[Create Project]."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:14
msgid "In the `Label` field, enter a label for your project."
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:15
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:28
msgid ""
"The `Label` field only accepts lowercase letters, numbers, periods, hyphens, "
"and underscores."
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:16
msgid "In the `Name` field, enter a descriptive name for your project."
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:17
msgid ""
"Click the btn:[Create] button to create your project and return to the "
"project page."
msgstr "ຄລິກປຸ່ມ btn:[Create] ເພື່ອສ້າງໂປຣເຈັກຂອງທ່ານ ແລະ ກັບໄປທີ່ໜ້າໂປຣເຈັກ."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:18
msgid "Click btn:[Attach/Detach Sources]."
msgstr "ຄລິກ btn:[Attach/Detach Sources]."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:19
msgid ""
"In the `Sources` dialog, select the source type, and select a base channel "
"for your project."
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:20
msgid ""
"The available child channels for the selected base channel are displayed, "
"including information on whether the channel is mandatory or recommended."
msgstr "ຊ່ອງທາງຍ່ອຍ (child channels) ທີ່ມີໃຫ້ສຳລັບຊ່ອງທາງຫຼັກທີ່ເລືອກຈະຖືກສະແດງຂຶ້ນມາ, ລວມທັງຂໍ້ມູນວ່າຊ່ອງທາງນັ້ນເປັນສິ່ງທີ່ບັງຄັບ ຫຼື ແນະນຳໃຫ້ໃຊ້."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:21
msgid ""
"Check the child channels you require, and click btn:[Save] to return to the "
"project page."
msgstr "ໝາຍເລືອກຊ່ອງທາງຍ່ອຍທີ່ທ່ານຕ້ອງການ, ແລະ ຄລິກ btn:[Save] ເພື່ອຮັບໄປທີ່ໜ້າໂປຣເຈັກ."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:22
msgid "The software channels you selected should now be showing."
msgstr "ຊ່ອງທາງຊອບແວທີ່ທ່ານເລືອກຄວນຈະສະແດງໃຫ້ເຫັນໃນຕອນນີ້."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:24
msgid ""
"In the `Filters` dialog, select the filters you want to attach to the "
"project."
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:25
msgid "To create a new filter, click btn:[Create new Filter]."
msgstr "ເພື່ອສ້າງຕົວຕອງໃໝ່, ໃຫ້ຄລິກ btn:[Create new Filter]."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:26
msgid "Click btn:[Add Environment]."
msgstr "ຄລິກ btn:[Add Environment]."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:27
msgid ""
"In the `Environment Lifecycle` dialog, give the first environment a name, a "
"label, and a description, and click btn:[Save]."
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:29
msgid ""
"Continue creating environments until you have all the environments for your "
"lifecycle completed."
msgstr "ດຳເນີນການສ້າງສະພາບແວດລ້ອມຕໍ່ໄປ ຈົນກວ່າທ່ານຈະໄດ້ສະພາບແວດລ້ອມຄົບຕາມວົງຈອນຊີວິດທີ່ຕ້ອງການ."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:30
msgid ""
"You can select the order of the environments in the lifecycle by selecting "
"an environment in the `Insert before` field when you create it."
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:31
#, no-wrap
msgid "Filter types"
msgstr "ປະເພດຕົວຕອງ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:32
msgid ""
"{productname} allows you to create various types of filters to control the "
"content used for building the project.  Filters allow you to select which "
"packages are included or excluded from the build.  For example, you could "
"exclude all kernel packages, or include only specific releases of some "
"packages."
msgstr "{productname} ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ທ່ານສາມາດສ້າງຕົວຕອງປະເພດຕ່າງໆ ເພື່ອຄວບຄຸມເນື້ອຫາທີ່ໃຊ້ໃນການສ້າງໂປຣເຈັກ. ຕົວຕອງຈະຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ທ່ານເລືອກໄດ້ວ່າແພັກເກັດໃດຈະຖືກລວມເຂົ້າ ຫຼື ຍົກເວັ້ນອອກຈາກການສ້າງ. ຕົວຢ່າງ: ທ່ານສາມາດຍົກເວັ້ນແພັກເກັດ kernel ທັງໝົດ, ຫຼື ລວມສະເພາະບາງລຸ້ນ (releases) ຂອງບາງແພັກເກັດ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:33
msgid "The supported filters are:"
msgstr "ຕົວຕອງທີ່ຮອງຮັບມີດັ່ງນີ້:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:34
msgid "package filtering"
msgstr "ການຕອງແພັກເກັດ (package filtering)"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:35
msgid "by name"
msgstr "ຕາມຊື່"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:36
msgid "by name, epoch, version, release, and architecture"
msgstr "ຕາມຊື່, epoch, ເວີຊັນ, release, ແລະ ສະຖາປັດຕະຍະກຳ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:37
msgid "by provided name"
msgstr "ຕາມຊື່ທີ່ລະບຸ (provided name)"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:38
msgid "patch filtering"
msgstr "ການຕອງແພັດຊ໌ (patch filtering)"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:39
msgid "by advisory name"
msgstr "ຕາມຊື່ການແຈ້ງເຕືອນ (advisory name)"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:40
msgid "by advisory type"
msgstr "ຕາມປະເພດການແຈ້ງເຕືອນ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:41
msgid "by synopsis"
msgstr "ຕາມບົດສະຫຼຸບ (synopsis)"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:42
msgid "by keyword"
msgstr "ຕາມຄຳສຳຄັນ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:43
msgid "by date"
msgstr "ຕາມວັນທີ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:44
msgid "by affected package"
msgstr "ຕາມແພັກເກັດທີ່ໄດ້ຮັບຜົນກະທົບ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:45
msgid "module"
msgstr "ໂມດູນ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:46
msgid "by stream"
msgstr "ຕາມສາຍ (stream)"

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:47
msgid "Package dependencies are not resolved during content filtering."
msgstr "ສິ່ງທີ່ແພັກເກັດຕ້ອງໃຊ້ (Package dependencies) ຈະບໍ່ຖືກແກ້ໄຂ (resolved) ໃນລະຫວ່າງການຕອງເນື້ອຫາ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:48
msgid ""
"There are multiple matchers you can use with the filter.  Which ones are "
"available depends on the filter type you choose."
msgstr "ມີຕົວຈັບຄູ່ (matchers) ຫຼາຍຮູບແບບທີ່ທ່ານສາມາດໃຊ້ກັບຕົວຕອງ. ສິ່ງທີ່ມີໃຫ້ໃຊ້ ແມ່ນຂຶ້ນກັບປະເພດຕົວຕອງທີ່ທ່ານເລືອກ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:49
msgid "The available matchers are:"
msgstr "ຕົວຈັບຄູ່ (matchers) ທີ່ມີໃຫ້ໃຊ້ມີດັ່ງນີ້:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:50
msgid "contains"
msgstr "ປະກອບດ້ວຍ (contains)"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:51
msgid "matches (must take the form of a regular expression)"
msgstr "ກົງກັບ (matches) (ຕ້ອງຢູ່ໃນຮູບແບບຂອງ regular expression)"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:52
msgid "equals"
msgstr "ເທົ່າກັບ (equals)"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:53
msgid "greater"
msgstr "ຫຼາຍກວ່າ (greater)"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:54
msgid "greater or equal"
msgstr "ຫຼາຍກວ່າ ຫຼື ເທົ່າກັບ (greater or equal)"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:55
msgid "lower or equal"
msgstr "ໜ້ອຍກວ່າ ຫຼື ເທົ່າກັບ (lower or equal)"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:56
msgid "lower"
msgstr "ໜ້ອຍກວ່າ (lower)"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:57
msgid "later or equal"
msgstr "ຫຼັງຈາກ ຫຼື ໃນວັນທີ (later or equal)"

#. type: Title ===
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:58
#, no-wrap
msgid "Filter `rule` parameter"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:59
msgid ""
"Each filter has a `rule` parameter that can be set to either `Allow` or "
"`Deny`.  The filters are processed like this:"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:60
msgid ""
"If a package or patch satisfies a `Deny` filter, it is excluded from the "
"result."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:61
msgid ""
"If a package or patch satisfies an `Allow` filter, it is included in the "
"result (even if it was excluded by a `Deny` filter). `Allow` filters for "
"packages only operate on package filters and `Allow` filters for patches "
"only operate on patch filters. This means with a package filter you cannot "
"add packages back in that were filtered out through patch filters or vice "
"versa for patches that where filtered out through package filters."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:62
msgid ""
"This behavior is useful when you want to exclude large number of packages or "
"patches using a general `Deny` filter and \"cherry-pick\" specific packages "
"or patches with specific `Allow` filters."
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:63
msgid ""
"Content filters are global in your organization and can be shared between "
"projects."
msgstr "ຕົວຕອງເນື້ອຫາແມ່ນມີຜົນໃນລະດັບສາກົນພາຍໃນອົງກອນຂອງທ່ານ ແລະ ສາມາດແບ່ງປັນລະຫວ່າງໂປຣເຈັກຕ່າງໆ ໄດ້."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:64
msgid ""
"If your project already contains built sources, when you add an environment "
"it is automatically populated with the existing content.  Content is drawn "
"from the previous environment of the cycle if it had one.  If there is no "
"previous environment, it is left empty until the project sources are built "
"again."
msgstr "ຫາກໂປຣເຈັກຂອງທ່ານມີແຫຼ່ງຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ຖືກສ້າງ (built) ໄວ້ແລ້ວ, ເມື່ອທ່ານເພີ່ມສະພາບແວດລ້ອມໃໝ່ ມັນຈະຖືກດຶງເນື້ອຫາທີ່ມີຢູ່ມາໃສ່ໃຫ້ໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ. ເນື້ອຫາຈະຖືກດຶງມາຈາກສະພາບແວດລ້ອມກ່ອນໜ້າ ໃນຮອບວຽນ (ຫາກມີ). ຫາກບໍ່ມີສະພາບແວດລ້ອມກ່ອນໜ້າ, ມັນຈະຖືກປະໄວ້ໃຫ້ວ່າງ ຈົນກວ່າແຫຼ່ງຂໍ້ມູນຂອງໂປຣເຈັກຈະຖືກສ້າງຂຶ້ນໃໝ່ອີກຄັ້ງ."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:65
#, no-wrap
msgid "Filter templates"
msgstr "ແມ່ແບບຕົວຕອງ (Filter templates)"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:66
msgid ""
"To help with creating filters for some common scenarios, {productname} "
"offers filter templates.  When applied, these templates help creating a set "
"of filters in advance, tailored for a specific use case."
msgstr "ເພື່ອຊ່ວຍໃນການສ້າງຕົວຕອງສຳລັບບາງສະຖານະການທົ່ວໄປ, {productname} ມີແມ່ແບບຕົວຕອງໃຫ້ໃຊ້. ເມື່ອນຳໃຊ້ແລ້ວ, ແມ່ແບບເຫຼົ່ານີ້ຈະຊ່ວຍສ້າງຊຸດຕົວຕອງໄວ້ລ່ວງໜ້າ ເຊິ່ງຖືກອອກແບບມາໃຫ້ເໝາະສົມກັບກໍລະນີການໃຊ້ງານສະເພາະ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:67
msgid "This section describes available templates and their usages."
msgstr "ສ່ວນນີ້ຈະອະທິບາຍເຖິງແມ່ແບບທີ່ມີໃຫ້ໃຊ້ ແລະ ວິທີການນຳໃຊ້ພວກມັນ."

#. type: Title ===
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:68
#, no-wrap
msgid "Live patching based on a {suse} product"
msgstr "Live patching ທີ່ອີງຕາມຜະລິດຕະພັນ {suse}"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:69
msgid ""
"In a project that contains live patching, regular future kernel packages "
"must be excluded so that only live patch packages are offered as updates to "
"clients. On the other hand, already installed regular kernel packages must "
"still be included to keep system integrity."
msgstr "ໃນໂປຣເຈັກທີ່ມີ live patching, ແພັກເກັດ kernel ແບບປົກກະຕິໃນອະນາຄົດຈະຕ້ອງຖືກຍົກເວັ້ນ ເພື່ອໃຫ້ມີພຽງແຕ່ແພັກເກັດ live patch ເທົ່ານັ້ນທີ່ຈະຖືກສະເໜີເປັນການອັບເດດໃຫ້ກັບໄຄເອັນ. ໃນທາງກັບກັນ, ແພັກເກັດ kernel ແບບປົກກະຕິທີ່ຕິດຕັ້ງໄວ້ແລ້ວ ຈະຕ້ອງຍັງຄົງຖືກລວມໄວ້ ເພື່ອຮັກສາຄວາມຄົບຖ້ວນຂອງລະບົບ (system integrity)."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:70
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:88
msgid ""
"When applied, this template creates three filters required to achieve this "
"behavior:"
msgstr "ເມື່ອນຳໃຊ້ແລ້ວ, ແມ່ແບບນີ້ຈະສ້າງສາມຕົວຕອງທີ່ຈຳເປັນເພື່ອໃຫ້ໄດ້ພຶດຕິກຳດັ່ງນີ້:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:71
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:89
msgid ""
"Allow patches that contain `kernel-default` package equal to a base kernel "
"version"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:74
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:92
msgid ""
"For more information on how to set up a live patching project, see "
"xref:administration:content-lifecycle-examples.adoc#exclude-higher-kernel-version[]."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບວິທີການຕັ້ງຄ່າໂປຣເຈັກ live patching, ກະລຸນາເບິ່ງ xref:administration:content-lifecycle-examples.adoc#exclude-higher-kernel-version[]."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:75
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:93
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:112
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Applying the template"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການນຳໃຊ້ແມ່ແບບ"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:77
msgid ""
"In the dialog, click btn:[Use a template]. The inputs will change "
"accordingly."
msgstr "ໃນກ່ອງຂໍ້ຄວາມ, ໃຫ້ຄລິກ btn:[Use a template]. ຊ່ອງຂໍ້ມູນຕ່າງໆ ຈະປ່ຽນໄປຕາມນັ້ນ."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:78
msgid ""
"In the `Prefix` field, type a name prefix. This value will be prepended to "
"the name of every individual filter created by the template. If the template "
"is being applied in the context of a project, this field will be prefilled "
"with the project label."
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:79
msgid "In the `Template` field, select `Live patching based on a SUSE product`."
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:80
msgid ""
"In the `Product` field, select the product you wish to set up live patching "
"for."
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:81
msgid ""
"In the `Kernel` field, select a kernel version from the list of versions "
"available in the selected product. The filter to deny the later regular "
"kernel patches will be based on this version."
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:82
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:100
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:119
msgid "Click btn:[Save] to create the filters."
msgstr "ຄລິກ btn:[Save] ເພື່ອສ້າງຕົວຕອງ."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:85
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:103
msgid ""
"Select the three filters that have the specified prefix, and click "
"btn:[Save]."
msgstr "ເລືອກສາມຕົວຕອງທີ່ມີຄຳນຳໜ້າ (prefix) ທີ່ລະບຸໄວ້, ແລະ ຄລິກ btn:[Save]."

#. type: Title ===
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:86
#, no-wrap
msgid "Live patching based on a system"
msgstr "Live patching ທີ່ອີງຕາມລະບົບ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:87
msgid ""
"When you want to set up a live patching project based on a kernel version "
"installed in a specific registered system, you can use the \"live patching "
"based on a system\" template."
msgstr "ເມື່ອທ່ານຕ້ອງການຕັ້ງຄ່າໂປຣເຈັກ live patching ໂດຍອີງໃສ່ເວີຊັນ kernel ທີ່ຕິດຕັ້ງ ໃນລະບົບສະເພາະໃດໜຶ່ງທີ່ໄດ້ລົງທະບຽນໄວ້, ທ່ານສາມາດໃຊ້ແມ່ແບບ \"live patching based on a system\" ໄດ້."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:95
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:115
msgid ""
"In the dialog, click btn:[Use a template].  The inputs will change "
"accordingly."
msgstr "ໃນກ່ອງຂໍ້ຄວາມ, ໃຫ້ຄລິກ btn:[Use a template]. ຊ່ອງຂໍ້ມູນຕ່າງໆ ຈະປ່ຽນໄປຕາມນັ້ນ."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:96
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:116
msgid ""
"In the `Prefix` field, type a name prefix.  This value will be prepended to "
"the name of every filter created by the template.  If the template is being "
"applied in the context of a project, this field will be prefilled with the "
"project label."
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:97
msgid "In the `Template` field, select `Live patching based on a specific system`."
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:98
msgid ""
"In the `System` field, select a system from the list, or start typing a "
"system name to narrow down the options."
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:99
msgid ""
"In the `Kernel` field, select a kernel version from the list of versions "
"installed in the selected system.  The filter to deny the later regular "
"kernel patches will be based on this version."
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ===
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:104
#, no-wrap
msgid "AppStream modules with defaults"
msgstr "ໂມດູນ AppStream ພ້ອມຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:105
msgid ""
"When you want to have all the modules available in a modular repository "
"included in your project, you can automatically add them using this filter "
"template."
msgstr "ເມື່ອທ່ານຕ້ອງການໃຫ້ທຸກໂມດູນທີ່ມີຢູ່ໃນຄັງເກັບຊອບແວແບບ modular ຖືກລວມເຂົ້າໃນໂປຣເຈັກຂອງທ່ານ, ທ່ານສາມາດເພີ່ມພວກມັນໄດ້ໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດໂດຍການໃຊ້ແມ່ແບບຕົວຕອງນີ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:106
msgid ""
"When applied, this template creates an AppStream filter per module and its "
"default stream."
msgstr "ເມື່ອນຳໃຊ້ແລ້ວ, ແມ່ແບບນີ້ຈະສ້າງຕົວຕອງ AppStream ໜຶ່ງອັນຕໍ່ໜຶ່ງໂມດູນ ແລະ ສາຍໂມດູນເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຂອງມັນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:107
msgid ""
"If this process is done from the project's page, the filters are added to "
"the project automatically. Otherwise, the created filters can be listed in "
"menu:Content Lifecycle[Filters] and be added to any project as needed."
msgstr "ຫາກຂະບວນການນີ້ເຮັດຈາກໜ້າໂປຣເຈັກ, ຕົວຕອງຈະຖືກເພີ່ມເຂົ້າໃນໂປຣເຈັກໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ. ຖ້າບໍ່ດັ່ງນັ້ນ, ຕົວຕອງທີ່ສ້າງຂຶ້ນຈະຖືກສະແດງໃນເມນູ menu:Content Lifecycle[Filters] ແລະ ສາມາດເພີ່ມເຂົ້າໃນໂປຣເຈັກໃດກໍໄດ້ຕາມທີ່ຕ້ອງການ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:108
msgid ""
"Each individual filter can be edited to select a different module stream, or "
"removed altogether to exclude that module from the target repositories."
msgstr "ແຕ່ລະຕົວຕອງສາມາດແກ້ໄຂເພື່ອເລືອກສາຍໂມດູນທີ່ແຕກຕ່າງກັນໄດ້, ຫຼື ສາມາດລຶບອອກທັງໝົດ ເພື່ອຍົກເວັ້ນໂມດູນນັ້ນອອກຈາກຄັງເກັບຊອບແວເປົ້າໝາຍ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:109
msgid ""
"Because not all module streams are compatible with each other, changing "
"individual streams may prevent successful resolution of modular "
"dependencies. When this happens, the filters pane in the project details "
"page will show an error describing the problem, and the build button will be "
"disabled until all the module selections are compatible."
msgstr "ເນື່ອງຈາກບໍ່ແມ່ນທຸກສາຍໂມດູນຈະສາມາດເຮັດວຽກຮ່ວມກັນໄດ້, ການປ່ຽນແປງແຕ່ລະສາຍໂມດູນ ອາດຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ການແກ້ໄຂ modular dependencies ບໍ່ສຳເລັດ. ເມື່ອເກີດເຫດການນີ້, ແຜງຕົວຕອງໃນໜ້າລາຍລະອຽດໂປຣເຈັກຈະສະແດງຂໍ້ຜິດພາດທີ່ອະທິບາຍເຖິງບັນຫາ, ແລະ ປຸ່ມ build ຈະຖືກປິດການໃຊ້ງານ ຈົນກວ່າການເລືອກໂມດູນທັງໝົດຈະສາມາດເຮັດວຽກຮ່ວມກັນໄດ້."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:110
msgid ""
"Since {rhel}{nbsp}9, modules do not have any defined default streams.  "
"Therefore, using this template with {rhel}{nbsp}9 sources will have no "
"effect."
msgstr "ຕັ້ງແຕ່ {rhel}{nbsp}9 ເປັນຕົ້ນມາ, ໂມດູນຕ່າງໆ ຈະບໍ່ມີການກຳນົດສາຍໂມດູນເລີ່ມຕົ້ນໄວ້. ດັ່ງນັ້ນ, ການໃຊ້ແມ່ແບບນີ້ກັບແຫຼ່ງຂໍ້ມູນ {rhel}{nbsp}9 ຈະບໍ່ມີຜົນໃດໆ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:111
msgid ""
"For more information on how to set up AppStream repositories with content "
"lifecycle management, see "
"xref:administration:content-lifecycle-examples.adoc#appstream-filters[]."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບວິທີການຕັ້ງຄ່າຄັງເກັບຊອບແວ AppStream ດ້ວຍການຈັດການວົງຈອນຊີວິດເນື້ອຫາ, ກະລຸນາເບິ່ງ xref:administration:content-lifecycle-examples.adoc#appstream-filters[]."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:113
msgid ""
"In the {productname} {webui}, navigate to menu:Content Lifecycle[Projects], "
"and select your project."
msgstr "ໃນ {productname} {webui}, ໃຫ້ໄປທີ່ເມນູ menu:Content Lifecycle[Projects], ແລະ ເລືອກໂປຣເຈັກຂອງທ່ານ."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:114
msgid ""
"In the `Filters` section, click btn:[Attach/Detach Filters], and then click "
"btn:[Create New Filter]."
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:117
msgid "In the `Template` field, select `AppStream modules with defaults`."
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:118
msgid ""
"In the `Channel` field, select a modular channel to get the modules from. In "
"this dropdown, only the modular channels are displayed."
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:120
msgid "Scroll to the `Filters` section to see the newly attached AppStream filters."
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:121
msgid ""
"You can edit/remove any individual filter to tailor the project to your "
"needs."
msgstr "ທ່ານສາມາດແກ້ໄຂ/ລຶບ ຕົວຕອງແຕ່ລະອັນໄດ້ ເພື່ອປັບແຕ່ງໂປຣເຈັກໃຫ້ເໝາະສົມກັບຄວາມຕ້ອງການຂອງທ່ານ."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:122
#, no-wrap
msgid "Build a content lifecycle project"
msgstr "ສ້າງ (Build) ໂຄງການວົງຈອນຊີວິດເນື້ອຫາ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:123
msgid ""
"When you have created your project, defined environments, and attached "
"sources and filters, you can build the project for the first time."
msgstr "ເມື່ອທ່ານສ້າງໂປຣເຈັກ, ກຳນົດສະພາບແວດລ້ອມ, ແລະ ເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ແຫຼ່ງຂໍ້ມູນລວມທັງຕົວຕອງແລ້ວ, ທ່ານສາມາດເລີ່ມສ້າງໂປຣເຈັກເປັນຄັ້ງທຳອິດໄດ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:124
msgid ""
"Building applies filters to the attached sources and clones them to the "
"first environment in the project."
msgstr "ການສ້າງ (Building) ຈະເປັນການນຳໃຊ້ຕົວຕອງກັບແຫຼ່ງຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ໄວ້ ແລະ ສຳເນົາ (clone) ພວກມັນໄປຍັງສະພາບແວດລ້ອມທຳອິດໃນໂປຣເຈັກ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:125
msgid ""
"You can use the same vendor channels as sources for multiple content "
"projects.  In this case, {productname} does not create new patch clones for "
"each cloned channel.  Instead, a single patch clone is shared between all of "
"your cloned channels.  This can cause problems if a vendor modifies a patch; "
"for example, if the patch is retracted, or the packages within the patch are "
"changed.  When you build one of the content projects, all the channels that "
"share the cloned patch are synchronized with the original by default, even "
"if the channels are in other environments of your content project, or other "
"content project channels in your organization.  You can change this behavior "
"by turning off automatic patch synchronization in your organization "
"settings.  To manually synchronize the patch later for all channels sharing "
"the patch, navigate to menu:Software[Manage > Channels], click the channel "
"you want to synchronize and navigate to the `Sync` subtab.  Even manual "
"patch synchronization affects all organization channels sharing the patch."
msgstr ""

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:126
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Building a content lifecycle project"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການສ້າງໂຄງການວົງຈອນຊີວິດເນື້ອຫາ"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:127
msgid ""
"In the {productname} {webui}, navigate to menu:Content Lifecycle[Projects], "
"and select the project you want to build."
msgstr "ໃນ {productname} {webui}, ໃຫ້ໄປທີ່ເມນູ menu:Content Lifecycle[Projects], ແລະ ເລືອກໂປຣເຈັກທີ່ທ່ານຕ້ອງການສ້າງ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:128
msgid "Make sure you have the environment available before building the project."
msgstr "ໃຫ້ໝັ້ນໃຈວ່າທ່ານມີສະພາບແວດລ້ອມພ້ອມໃຊ້ງານ ກ່ອນທີ່ຈະເລີ່ມສ້າງໂປຣເຈັກ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:129
msgid "Review the attached sources and filters, and click btn:[Build]."
msgstr "ກວດທານແຫຼ່ງຂໍ້ມູນ ແລະ ຕົວຕອງທີ່ເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ໄວ້, ຈາກນັ້ນຄລິກ btn:[Build]."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:130
msgid "Provide a version message to describe the changes or updates in this build."
msgstr "ໃສ່ຂໍ້ຄວາມເວີຊັນເພື່ອອະທິບາຍເຖິງການປ່ຽນແປງ ຫຼື ການອັບເດດໃນການສ້າງຄັ້ງນີ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:131
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:138
msgid "You can monitor build progress in the `Environment Lifecycle` section."
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:132
msgid ""
"After the build is finished, the environment version is increased by one and "
"the built sources, such as software channels, can be assigned to your "
"clients."
msgstr "ຫຼັງຈາກການສ້າງສຳເລັດແລ້ວ, ເວີຊັນຂອງສະພາບແວດລ້ອມຈະເພີ່ມຂຶ້ນໜຶ່ງ ແລະ ແຫຼ່ງທີ່ມາທີ່ຖືກສ້າງຂຶ້ນ, ເຊັ່ນ: ຊ່ອງທາງຊອບແວ, ສາມາດກຳນົດໃຫ້ກັບລູກຂ່າຍຂອງທ່ານໄດ້."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:133
#, no-wrap
msgid "Promote environments"
msgstr "ເລື່ອນລະດັບສະພາບແວດລ້ອມ"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:134
msgid ""
"When the project has been built, the built sources can be sequentially "
"promoted to the environments."
msgstr "ເມື່ອໂຄງການຖືກສ້າງຂຶ້ນແລ້ວ, ແຫຼ່ງທີ່ມາທີ່ຖືກສ້າງຂຶ້ນສາມາດຖືກຍົກລະດັບໄປຫາສະພາບແວດລ້ອມຕ່າງໆຕາມລຳດັບ."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:135
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Promoting environments"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການເລື່ອນລະດັບສະພາບແວດລ້ອມ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:136
msgid ""
"In the {productname} {webui}, navigate to menu:Content Lifecycle[Projects], "
"and select the project you want to work with."
msgstr "ໃນ {productname} {webui}, ໄປທີ່ເມນູ: Content Lifecycle[Projects], ແລະ ເລືອກໂຄງການທີ່ທ່ານຕ້ອງການເຮັດວຽກນຳ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:137
msgid ""
"In the `Environment Lifecycle` section, locate the environment to promote to "
"its successor, and click btn:[Promote]."
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:139
#, no-wrap
msgid "Assign clients to environments"
msgstr "ກຳນົດລູກຂ່າຍໃຫ້ກັບສະພາບແວດລ້ອມ"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:140
msgid ""
"When you build and promote content lifecycle projects, {productname} creates "
"a tree of software channels.  To add clients to the environment, assign the "
"base and child software channels to your client using menu:Software[Software "
"Channels] in the `System Details` page for the client."
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:141
msgid ""
"Newly added cloned channels are not assigned to clients automatically.  If "
"you add or promote sources you need to manually check and update your "
"channel assignments."
msgstr "ຊ່ອງທາງທີ່ຖືກໂຄລນ (cloned) ທີ່ເພີ່ມເຂົ້າໃໝ່ຈະບໍ່ຖືກກຳນົດໃຫ້ກັບລູກຂ່າຍໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ. ຫາກທ່ານເພີ່ມ ຫຼື ຍົກລະດັບແຫຼ່ງຂໍ້ມູນ, ທ່ານຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງກວດສອບ ແລະ ອັບເດດການກຳນົດຊ່ອງທາງດ້ວຍຕົນເອງ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:142
msgid ""
"Automatic assignment is intended to be added to {productname} in a future "
"version."
msgstr "ການກຳນົດແບບອັດຕະໂນມັດມີແຜນທີ່ຈະຖືກເພີ່ມເຂົ້າໃນ {productname} ໃນເວີຊັນອະນາຄົດ."

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-staging.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Content Staging"
msgstr "ການຈັດກຽມເນື້ອຫາ (Content Staging)"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-staging.adoc:2
msgid ""
"Staging is used by clients to download packages in advance, before they are "
"installed.  This allows package installation to begin as soon as it is "
"scheduled, which can reduce the amount of time required for a maintenance "
"window."
msgstr "ການຈັດກຽມ (Staging) ຖືກໃຊ້ໂດຍລູກຂ່າຍເພື່ອດາວໂຫຼດແພັກເກັດໄວ້ລ່ວງໜ້າ ກ່ອນທີ່ຈະຖືກຕິດຕັ້ງ. ສິ່ງນີ້ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ການຕິດຕັ້ງແພັກເກັດເລີ່ມຕົ້ນໄດ້ທັນທີຕາມທີ່ໄດ້ກຳນົດເວລາໄວ້, ເຊິ່ງສາມາດຫຼຸດຜ່ອນໄລຍະເວລາທີ່ຕ້ອງການສຳລັບຊ່ວງເວລາການບຳລຸງຮັກສາ (maintenance window)."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-staging.adoc:3
#, no-wrap
msgid "Enable Content Staging"
msgstr "ເປີດໃຊ້ການຈັດກຽມເນື້ອຫາ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-staging.adoc:4
msgid ""
"You can manage content staging across your entire organization.  In the "
"{productname} {webui}, navigate to menu:Admin[Organizations] to see a list "
"of available organizations.  Click the name of an organization, and check "
"the `Enable Staging Contents` box to allow clients in this organization to "
"stage package data."
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-staging.adoc:5
#: en/modules/administration/pages/organizations.adoc:6
msgid ""
"You must be logged in as the {productname} administrator to create and "
"manage organizations."
msgstr "ທ່ານຕ້ອງເຂົ້າສູ່ລະບົບໃນຖານະຜູ້ເບິ່ງແຍງລະບົບ {productname} ເພື່ອສ້າງ ແລະ ຈັດການອົງກອນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-staging.adoc:6
msgid ""
"You can also enable staging at the command prompt by editing "
"`/etc/sysconfig/rhn/up2date`, and adding or editing these lines:"
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-staging.adoc:7
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"stagingContent=1\n"
"stagingContentWindow=24\n"
msgstr ""
"stagingContent=1\n"
"stagingContentWindow=24\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-staging.adoc:8
msgid ""
"The `stagingContentWindow` parameter is a time value expressed in hours and "
"determines when downloading starts.  It is the number of hours before the "
"scheduled installation or update time.  In this example, content is "
"downloaded 24 hours before the installation time.  The start time for "
"download depends on the selected contact method for a system."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-staging.adoc:9
msgid ""
"Next time an action is scheduled, packages are automatically downloaded, but "
"not installed.  At the scheduled time, the staged packages are installed."
msgstr "ໃນຄັ້ງຕໍ່ໄປທີ່ມີການກຳນົດເວລາການດຳເນີນການ, ແພັກເກັດຕ່າງໆຈະຖືກດາວໂຫຼດໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ ແຕ່ຍັງບໍ່ທັນຖືກຕິດຕັ້ງ. ເມື່ອຮອດເວລາທີ່ກຳນົດໄວ້, ແພັກເກັດທີ່ຖືກຈັດກຽມໄວ້ຈະຖືກຕິດຕັ້ງ."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-staging.adoc:10
#, no-wrap
msgid "Configure Content Staging"
msgstr "ກຳນົດຄ່າການຈັດກຽມເນື້ອຫາ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-staging.adoc:11
msgid "There are two parameters used to configure content staging:"
msgstr "ມີສອງພາລາມິເຕີທີ່ໃຊ້ໃນການກຳນົດຄ່າການຈັດກຽມເນື້ອຫາ:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-staging.adoc:12
msgid ""
"`salt_content_staging_advance` is the advance time for the content staging "
"window to open, in hours."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-staging.adoc:13
msgid ""
"This is the number of hours before installation starts, that package "
"downloads can begin."
msgstr "ນີ້ແມ່ນຈຳນວນຊົ່ວໂມງກ່ອນການຕິດຕັ້ງເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ, ທີ່ການດາວໂຫຼດແພັກເກັດສາມາດເລີ່ມໄດ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-staging.adoc:14
msgid ""
"`salt_content_staging_window` is the duration of the content staging window, "
"in hours."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-staging.adoc:15
msgid ""
"This is the amount of time clients have to stage packages before "
"installation begins."
msgstr "ນີ້ແມ່ນໄລຍະເວລາທີ່ລູກຂ່າຍມີເພື່ອຈັດກຽມແພັກເກັດກ່ອນທີ່ການຕິດຕັ້ງຈະເລີ່ມຂຶ້ນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-staging.adoc:16
msgid ""
"For example, if `salt_content_staging_advance` is set to six hours, and "
"`salt_content_staging_window` is set to two hours, the staging window opens "
"six hours before the installation time, and remain open for two hours.  No "
"packages are downloaded in the four remaining hours until installation "
"starts."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-staging.adoc:17
msgid ""
"If you set the same value for both `salt_content_staging_advance` and "
"`salt_content_staging_window` packages are able to be downloaded until "
"installation begins."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-staging.adoc:18
msgid ""
"Configure the content staging parameters in "
"`/usr/share/rhn/config-defaults/rhn_java.conf`."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-staging.adoc:19
msgid "Default values:"
msgstr "ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-staging.adoc:20
msgid "`salt_content_staging_advance: 8 hours`"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-staging.adoc:21
msgid "`salt_content_staging_window: 8 hours`"
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-staging.adoc:22
msgid "Content staging must be enabled for these parameters to work correctly."
msgstr "ການຈັດກຽມເນື້ອຫາຕ້ອງຖືກເປີດໃຊ້ເພື່ອໃຫ້ພາລາມິເຕີເຫຼົ່ານີ້ເຮັດວຽກໄດ້ຢ່າງຖືກຕ້ອງ."

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Custom Channels"
msgstr "ຊ່ອງທາງກຳນົດເອງ (Custom Channels)"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:2
msgid ""
"Custom channels give you the ability to create your own software packages "
"and repositories, which you can use to update your clients.  They also allow "
"you to use software provided by third party vendors in your environment."
msgstr "ຊ່ອງທາງກຳນົດເອງຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ທ່ານສາມາດສ້າງແພັກເກັດຊອບແວ ແລະ ຄັງເກັບ (repositories) ຂອງທ່ານເອງໄດ້, ເຊິ່ງທ່ານສາມາດໃຊ້ເພື່ອອັບເດດລູກຂ່າຍຂອງທ່ານ. ພວກມັນຍັງຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ທ່ານສາມາດໃຊ້ຊອບແວທີ່ສະໜອງໃຫ້ໂດຍຜູ້ຂາຍພາຍນອກ (third party) ໃນສະພາບແວດລ້ອມຂອງທ່ານໄດ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:3
msgid ""
"This section gives more detail on how to create, administer, and delete "
"custom channels.  You must have administrator privileges to be able to "
"create and manage custom channels."
msgstr "ພາກນີ້ໃຫ້ລາຍລະອຽດເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບວິທີສ້າງ, ບໍລິຫານ, ແລະ ລຶບຊ່ອງທາງກຳນົດເອງ. ທ່ານຕ້ອງມີສິດທິຜູ້ເບິ່ງແຍງລະບົບເພື່ອໃຫ້ສາມາດສ້າງ ແລະ ຈັດການຊ່ອງທາງກຳນົດເອງໄດ້."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:4
#, no-wrap
msgid "Creating custom channels and repositories"
msgstr "ການສ້າງຊ່ອງທາງກຳນົດເອງ ແລະ ຄັງເກັບຊອບແວ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:5
msgid ""
"Before you create a custom channel, determine which base channel you want to "
"associate it with, and which repositories you want to use for content."
msgstr "ກ່ອນທີ່ທ່ານຈະສ້າງຊ່ອງທາງກຳນົດເອງ, ໃຫ້ກຳນົດວ່າຊ່ອງທາງພື້ນຖານໃດທີ່ທ່ານຕ້ອງການເຊື່ອມໂຍງນຳ, ແລະ ຄັງເກັບໃດທີ່ທ່ານຕ້ອງການໃຊ້ສຳລັບເນື້ອຫາ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:6
msgid ""
"If you have custom software packages that you need to install on your client "
"systems, you can create a custom child channel to manage them.  You need to "
"create the channel in the {productname} {webui} and create a repository for "
"the packages, before assigning the channel to your systems."
msgstr "ຫາກທ່ານມີແພັກເກັດຊອບແວກຳນົດເອງທີ່ທ່ານຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງຕິດຕັ້ງໃສ່ລະບົບລູກຂ່າຍຂອງທ່ານ, ທ່ານສາມາດສ້າງຊ່ອງທາງຍ່ອຍກຳນົດເອງເພື່ອຈັດການພວກມັນ. ທ່ານຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງສ້າງຊ່ອງທາງໃນ {productname} {webui} ແລະ ສ້າງຄັງເກັບສຳລັບແພັກເກັດຕ່າງໆ, ກ່ອນທີ່ຈະກຳນົດຊ່ອງທາງໃຫ້ກັບລະບົບຂອງທ່ານ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:7
msgid ""
"Do not create child channels containing packages that are not compatible "
"with the client system."
msgstr "ຢ່າສ້າງຊ່ອງທາງຍ່ອຍທີ່ມີແພັກເກັດທີ່ບໍ່ເຂົ້າກັນກັບລະບົບລູກຂ່າຍ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:8
msgid ""
"You can select a vendor channel as the base channel if you want to use "
"packages provided by a vendor.  Alternatively, select `none` to make your "
"custom channel a base channel."
msgstr ""

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:9
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Creating a custom channel"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການສ້າງຊ່ອງທາງກຳນົດເອງ"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:10
msgid ""
"In the {productname} {webui}, navigate to menu:Software[Manage > Channels], "
"and click btn:[Create Channel]."
msgstr "ໃນ {productname} {webui}, ໄປທີ່ເມນູ: Software[Manage > Channels], ແລະ ຄລິກ btn:[Create Channel]."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:11
msgid ""
"On the `Create Software Channel` page, give your channel a name (for "
"example, `My Tools SLES 15 SP1 x86_64`) and a label (for example, "
"`my-tools-sles15sp1-x86_64`)."
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:12
msgid "Labels must not contain spaces or uppercase letters."
msgstr "ປ້າຍຊື່ (Labels) ຕ້ອງບໍ່ມີຫວ່າງ ຫຼື ຕົວອັກສອນໃຫຍ່."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:13
msgid ""
"In the `Parent Channel` drop down, choose the relevant base channel (for "
"example, `SLE-Product-SLES15-SP1-Pool for x86_64`)."
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:14
msgid "Ensure that you choose the compatible parent channel for your packages."
msgstr "ໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າທ່ານເລືອກຊ່ອງທາງຫຼັກທີ່ເຂົ້າກັນໄດ້ສຳລັບແພັກເກັດຂອງທ່ານ."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:15
msgid ""
"In the `Architecture` drop down, choose the appropriate hardware "
"architecture (for example, `x86_64`)."
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:16
msgid ""
"Provide any additional information in the contact details, channel access "
"control, and GPG fields, as required for your environment."
msgstr "ໃຫ້ຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມໃນສ່ວນລາຍລະອຽດການຕິດຕໍ່, ການຄວບຄຸມການເຂົ້າເຖິງຊ່ອງທາງ, ແລະ ຟີວ GPG ຕາມທີ່ສະພາບແວດລ້ອມຂອງທ່ານຕ້ອງການ."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:17
msgid "Click btn:[Create Channel]."
msgstr "ຄລິກ btn:[Create Channel]."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:18
msgid ""
"Custom channels sometimes require additional security settings.  Many third "
"party vendors secure packages with GPG.  If you want to use GPG-protected "
"packages in your custom channel, you need to trust the GPG key which has "
"been used to sign the metadata.  You can then check the `Has Signed "
"Metadata?` check box to match the package metadata against the trusted GPG "
"keys."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:19
msgid ""
"If remote channels and repositories are signed with GPG keys, you can import "
"and trust these GPG keys.  For example, execute the `spacewalk-repo-sync` "
"from the command line on the {productname} Server:"
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:20
#, no-wrap
msgid "/usr/bin/spacewalk-repo-sync -c <channellabelname> -t yum\n"
msgstr "/usr/bin/spacewalk-repo-sync -c <channellabelname> -t yum\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:21
msgid ""
"This command and procedure is for temporary GPG key synchronization only.  "
"For storing the key permantenly, see this section later on."
msgstr "ຄຳສັ່ງ ແລະ ຂັ້ນຕອນນີ້ແມ່ນສຳລັບການຊິງໂຄໄນຄີ GPG ຊົ່ວຄາວເທົ່ານັ້ນ. ສຳລັບການເກັບຮັກສາຄີແບບຖາວອນ, ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງໃນພາກສ່ວນຕໍ່ໄປ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:22
msgid ""
"The underlying `zypper` call will import the key, if it is available.  The "
"{webui} does not offer this feature."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:23
msgid ""
"This only works when the repository you want to mirror is set up in a "
"special way and provides the \"key\" in the repository next to the "
"signature.  This is the case for all repositories generated by the Open "
"Build Service (OBS).  For other repositories special preparation steps are "
"needed, as described further below."
msgstr "ສິ່ງນີ້ຈະເຮັດວຽກໄດ້ກໍຕໍ່ເມື່ອຄັງເກັບຊອບແວທີ່ທ່ານຕ້ອງການມີເມີ (mirror) ຖືກຕັ້ງຄ່າໄວ້ເປັນພິເສດ ແລະ ມີ \"key\" ຢູ່ໃນຄັງເກັບນັ້ນຄຽງຄູ່ກັບລາຍເຊັນ. ນີ້ແມ່ນກໍລະນີຂອງຄັງເກັບຊອບແວທັງໝົດທີ່ສ້າງໂດຍ Open Build Service (OBS). ສຳລັບຄັງເກັບອື່ນໆ ແມ່ນຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງມີຂັ້ນຕອນການກຽມພ້ອມພິເສດ ຕາມທີ່ຈະອະທິບາຍໄວ້ຂ້າງລຸ່ມ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:24
msgid ""
"By default, the `Enable GPG Check` field is checked when you create a new "
"channel.  If you would like to add custom packages and applications to your "
"channel, make sure you uncheck this field to be able to install unsigned "
"packages.  Disabling the GPG check is a security risk if packages are from "
"an untrusted source."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:25
msgid ""
"You can only add a repository to the {productname} with the {webui} if it is "
"a valid software repository.  Check in advance that needed repository "
"metadata are available.  Tools such as `createrepo` and `reprepro` are "
"useful in this regard.  `mgrpush` can help with pushing a single RPM into a "
"channel without creating a repository."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:26
msgid ""
"For more information on `createrepo_c` see "
"`https://manpages.opensuse.org/Leap-15.6/createrepo_c/`"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:27
msgid ""
"For more information on `reprepro` see "
"`https://manpages.opensuse.org/Leap-15.6/reprepro/`"
msgstr ""

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:28
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Adding a software repository"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການເພີ່ມຄັງເກັບຊອບແວ"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:29
msgid ""
"In the {productname} {webui}, navigate to menu:Software[Manage > "
"Repositories], and click btn:[Create Repository]."
msgstr "ໃນ {productname} {webui}, ໄປທີ່ເມນູ: Software[Manage > Repositories], ແລະ ຄລິກ btn:[Create Repository]."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:30
msgid ""
"On the `Create Repository` page, give your repository a label (for example, "
"`my-tools-sles15sp1-x86_64-repo`)."
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:31
msgid ""
"In the `Repository URL` field, provide the path to the directory that "
"contains the `repodata` file (for example, `file:///opt/mytools/`).  You can "
"use any valid addressing protocol in this field."
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:32
msgid "Uncheck the `Has Signed Metadata?` check box."
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:33
msgid ""
"OPTIONAL: Complete the SSL fields if your repository requires client "
"certificate authentication."
msgstr "ທາງເລືອກ: ຕື່ມຂໍ້ມູນໃນຟີວ SSL ຫາກຄັງເກັບຂອງທ່ານຕ້ອງການການຢືນຢັນຕົວຕົນດ້ວຍໃບຢັ້ງຢືນຂອງລູກຂ່າຍ."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:34
msgid "Click btn:[Create Repository]."
msgstr "ຄລິກ btn:[Create Repository]."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:35
msgid ""
"The above procedure only works if the repository you want to mirror provides "
"the \"key\" in the repository next to the signature.  This is the case for "
"all repositories generated by the OBS, but it is typically not the case for "
"repositories of operating systems that are not offered by the OBS."
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນຂ້າງເທິງຈະເຮັດວຽກໄດ້ກໍຕໍ່ເມື່ອຄັງເກັບທີ່ທ່ານຕ້ອງການມີເມີ ມີ \"ຄີ\" ໃຫ້ໃນຄັງເກັບພ້ອມກັບລາຍເຊັນ. ນີ້ແມ່ນກໍລະນີສຳລັບຄັງເກັບທັງໝົດທີ່ສ້າງໂດຍ OBS, ແຕ່ໂດຍທົ່ວໄປແລ້ວມັນຈະບໍ່ແມ່ນກໍລະນີສຳລັບຄັງເກັບຂອງລະບົບປະຕິບັດການທີ່ບໍ່ໄດ້ສະໜອງໃຫ້ໂດຍ OBS."

#.  Not sure how it is possible to import the key into the RPM DB which is used for syncing.
#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:36
msgid ""
"If the repository you want to use does not have a GPG key you can provide "
"one yourself and import the GPG key into the keyring manually.  If you "
"import the key into the `/var/lib/spacewalk/gpgdir` keyring using the `gpg` "
"command line tool it would be stored permanently.  The key would also "
"persist if the chroot environment would be cleaned."
msgstr ""

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:37
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Creating a software repository with GPG key"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການສ້າງຄັງເກັບຊອບແວດ້ວຍຄີ GPG"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:38
msgid "On the container host, the command to import a key into the keyring, is:"
msgstr "ໃນ container host, ຄຳສັ່ງໃນການນຳເຂົ້າຄີເຂົ້າໃນ keyring ແມ່ນ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:39
#, no-wrap
msgid "mgradm gpg add /path/to/gpg.key\n"
msgstr "mgradm gpg add /path/to/gpg.key\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:40
msgid ""
"For more information, see "
"xref:client-configuration:autoinst-owngpgkey.adoc[]."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ, ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງ xref:client-configuration:autoinst-owngpgkey.adoc[]."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:41
msgid ""
"Add Debian non-flat repositories using `uyuni_suite`, `uyuni_component`, and "
"`uyuni_arch` query parameters."
msgstr ""

#. type: Labeled list
#: en/modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:42
#, no-wrap
msgid "`uyuni_suite`"
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:43
msgid ""
"is mandatory.  In Debian documentation, this is also known as "
"`distribution`.  With this parameter you specify the apt source.  Without "
"this parameter the original approach is used.  If the parameter ends with "
"`/`, the repository is identified as flat."
msgstr ""

#. type: Labeled list
#: en/modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:44
#, no-wrap
msgid "`uyuni_component`"
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:45
msgid ""
"is optional.  This parameter can specify only one component.  It is not "
"possible to list the components.  An apt source entry allows to specify "
"multiple components, but for Uyuni it is not possible.  Instead you must "
"create a separate repository for each component."
msgstr "ແມ່ນທາງເລືອກ. ພາລາມິເຕີນີ້ສາມາດລະບຸໄດ້ພຽງແຕ່ສ່ວນປະກອບ (component) ດຽວເທົ່ານັ້ນ. ມັນບໍ່ສາມາດລາຍຊື່ສ່ວນປະກອບຫຼາຍຢ່າງໄດ້. ລາຍການແຫຼ່ງ apt ອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ລະບຸສ່ວນປະກອບຫຼາຍຢ່າງ, ແຕ່ສຳລັບ Uyuni ແມ່ນເປັນໄປບໍ່ໄດ້. ແທນທີ່ຈະເປັນແນວນັ້ນ ທ່ານຕ້ອງສ້າງຄັງເກັບແຍກຕ່າງຫາກສຳລັບແຕ່ລະສ່ວນປະກອບ."

#. type: Labeled list
#: en/modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:46
#, no-wrap
msgid "`uyuni_arch`"
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:47
msgid ""
"is optional.  If omitted the architecture name is calculated with a SQL "
"query for the channel from the database.  Specify `uyuni_arch` explicitly if "
"it does not match the architecture of the channel (sometimes architecture "
"naming is ambiguous)."
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:48
msgid "Here are some examples:"
msgstr "ນີ້ແມ່ນບາງຕົວຢ່າງ:"

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:49
#, no-wrap
msgid "Debian non-flat repository mapping"
msgstr "ການຈັບຄູ່ຄັງເກັບຊອບແວ Debian ແບບ non-flat"

#. type: Table
#: en/modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:50
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Type             | Source line / URL\n"
"| apt source line  | `deb https://pkg.jenkins.io/debian-stable binary/`\n"
"| URL mapping      | "
"`https://pkg.jenkins.io/debian-stable?uyuni_suite=binary/`\n"
"| {nbsp}           |\n"
"| apt source line  | `deb https://deb.debian.org/debian/dists stable main`\n"
"| URL mapping      | "
"`https://deb.debian.org/debian/dists?uyuni_suite=stable&uyuni_component=main`\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:51
msgid ""
"This following information about the Debian repository definition format is "
"based on https://wiki.debian.org/DebianRepository/Format#Overview."
msgstr "ຂໍ້ມູນຕໍ່ໄປນີ້ກ່ຽວກັບຮູບແບບການກຳນົດຄັງເກັບ Debian ແມ່ນອີງໃສ່ https://wiki.debian.org/DebianRepository/Format#Overview."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:52
msgid "The repository definition format is as follows:"
msgstr "ຮູບແບບການກຳນົດຄັງເກັບແມ່ນດັ່ງນີ້:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:53
#, no-wrap
msgid "deb uri suite [component1] [component2] [...]\n"
msgstr "deb uri suite [component1] [component2] [...]\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:54
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-salt-clients-down-and-dns.adoc:10
msgid "For example:"
msgstr "ຕົວຢ່າງ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:55
#, no-wrap
msgid "deb https://deb.debian.org/debian/dists stable main\n"
msgstr "deb https://deb.debian.org/debian/dists stable main\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:56
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-schema-upgrade-fails.adoc:6
msgid "or"
msgstr "ຫຼື"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:57
#, no-wrap
msgid "deb https://pkg.jenkins.io/debian-stable binary/\n"
msgstr "deb https://pkg.jenkins.io/debian-stable binary/\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:58
msgid ""
"For each pair of `suite` and `component` the spezification defines a "
"distinct URL calculated on the base URL `+ suite + component`."
msgstr ""

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:59
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Assigning the repository to a channel"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການກຳນົດຄັງເກັບຊອບແວໃຫ້ກັບຊ່ອງທາງ"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:60
msgid ""
"Assign your new repository to your custom channel by navigating to "
"menu:Software[Manage > Channels], clicking the name of your newly created "
"custom channel."
msgstr "ກຳນົດຄັງເກັບໃໝ່ຂອງທ່ານໃຫ້ກັບຊ່ອງທາງກຳນົດເອງ ໂດຍໄປທີ່ເມນູ: Software[Manage > Channels], ຄລິກທີ່ຊື່ຂອງຊ່ອງທາງກຳນົດເອງທີ່ທ່ານຫາກໍ່ສ້າງຂຶ້ນ."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:61
msgid ""
"Navigate to the `Repositories` tab, and ensure the repository you want to "
"assign to the channel is checked.  Click btn:[Save Repositories]."
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:62
msgid "By default, the synchronization process starts immediately."
msgstr "ໂດຍເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ, ຂະບວນການຊິງໂຄໄນຈະເລີ່ມຕົ້ນທັນທີ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:63
msgid ""
"For more information about channel synchronization, see "
"xref:administration:custom-channels.adoc#custom-channel-sync[]."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບການຊິງໂຄໄນຊ່ອງທາງ, ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງ xref:administration:custom-channels.adoc#custom-channel-sync[]."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:64
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Adding custom channels to an activation key"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການເພີ່ມຊ່ອງທາງກຳນົດເອງໃຫ້ກັບຄີກະຕຸ້ນ (activation key)"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:65
msgid ""
"In the {productname} {webui}, navigate to menu:Systems[Activation Keys], and "
"select the key you want to add the custom channel to."
msgstr "ໃນ {productname} {webui}, ໄປທີ່ເມນູ: Systems[Activation Keys], ແລະ ເລືອກຄີທີ່ທ່ານຕ້ອງການເພີ່ມຊ່ອງທາງກຳນົດເອງເຂົ້າໄປ."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:66
msgid ""
"On the `Details` tab, in the `Child Channels` listing, select the channel to "
"associate."
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:67
msgid "You can select multiple channels, if you need to."
msgstr "ທ່ານສາມາດເລືອກຫຼາຍຊ່ອງທາງໄດ້ ຫາກທ່ານຕ້ອງການ."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:68
msgid "Click btn:[Update Activation Key]."
msgstr "ກົດ btn:[Update Activation Key]."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:69
#, no-wrap
msgid "Custom channel synchronization"
msgstr "ການຊິງຄ໌ຊ່ອງທາງກຳນົດເອງ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:70
msgid ""
"To avoid missing important updates, {suse} recommends to keep your custom "
"channels up to date with the remote repositories changes."
msgstr "ເພື່ອຫຼີກເວັ້ນການພາດການອັບເດດທີ່ສຳຄັນ, {suse} ແນະນຳໃຫ້ຮັກສາຊ່ອງທາງກຳນົດເອງຂອງທ່ານໃຫ້ເປັນປັດຈຸບັນສະເໝີກັບການປ່ຽນແປງຂອງຄັງເກັບທາງໄກ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:71
msgid ""
"By default, a synchronization will happen automatically for all custom "
"channels you create.  In particular, it will happen:"
msgstr "ໂດຍເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ, ການຊິງໂຄໄນຈະເກີດຂຶ້ນໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດສຳລັບທຸກຊ່ອງທາງກຳນົດເອງທີ່ທ່ານສ້າງ. ໂດຍສະເພາະ, ມັນຈະເກີດຂຶ້ນ:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:72
msgid ""
"after adding a repository to a channel from the UI or by using "
"`spacewalk-common-channels`"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:73
msgid ""
"as part of the daily task `mgr-sync-refresh-default`, which will synchronize "
"all your custom and vendor channels."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:74
msgid "To disable this default behaviour, set in `/etc/rhn/rhn.conf`:"
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:75
#, no-wrap
msgid "java.unify_custom_channel_management = 0\n"
msgstr "java.unify_custom_channel_management = 0\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:76
msgid ""
"With this property turned off, no synchronization is performed automatically "
"and, in order to keep a custom channel up to date, you need to:"
msgstr "ເມື່ອປິດຄຸນສົມບັດນີ້ແລ້ວ, ຈະບໍ່ມີການຊິງໂຄໄນໃດໆເກີດຂຶ້ນໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ ແລະ ເພື່ອຮັກສາຊ່ອງທາງກຳນົດເອງໃຫ້ເປັນປັດຈຸບັນ, ທ່ານຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງ:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:77
msgid ""
"synchronize it manually by navigating to the `Sync` tab and click btn:[Sync "
"Now],"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:78
msgid "set up an automated synchronization schedule from the `Repositories` tab."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:79
msgid ""
"When the process is started, there are several ways to check if a channel "
"has finished synchronizing:"
msgstr "ເມື່ອຂະບວນການເລີ່ມຕົ້ນແລ້ວ, ມີຫຼາຍວິທີໃນການກວດສອບວ່າຊ່ອງທາງການຊິງໂຄໄນສຳເລັດແລ້ວຫຼືບໍ່:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:80
msgid ""
"In the {productname} {webui}, navigate to menu:Admin[Setup Wizard] and "
"select the `Products` tab."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:81
msgid ""
"This dialog displays a completion bar for each product when they are being "
"synchronized."
msgstr "ໄດອາລັອກ (dialog) ນີ້ຈະສະແດງແຖບຄວາມຄືບໜ້າສຳລັບແຕ່ລະຜະລິດຕະພັນໃນຂະນະທີ່ພວກມັນກຳລັງຖືກຊິງໂຄໄນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:82
msgid ""
"In the {productname} {webui}, navigate to menu:Software[Manage > Channels], "
"then click the channel associated to the repository."
msgstr "ໃນ {webui} ຂອງ {productname}, ໄປທີ່ menu:Software[Manage > Channels], ຈາກນັ້ນກົດທີ່ຊ່ອງທາງທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງກັບ repository ນັ້ນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:83
msgid ""
"Navigate to the menu:[Repositories > Sync] tab.  The `Sync Status` is shown "
"next to the repository name."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:84
msgid "Check the synchronization log file at the command prompt:"
msgstr "ກວດສອບໄຟລ໌ລັອກ (log file) ການຊິງໂຄໄນທີ່ command prompt:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:85
#, no-wrap
msgid "tail -f /var/log/rhn/reposync/<channel-label>.log\n"
msgstr "tail -f /var/log/rhn/reposync/<channel-label>.log\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:86
msgid ""
"Each child channel generates its own log during the synchronization "
"progress.  You need to check all the base and child channel log files to be "
"sure that the synchronization is complete."
msgstr "ແຕ່ລະຊ່ອງທາງຍ່ອຍຈະສ້າງລັອກຂອງຕົນເອງໃນລະຫວ່າງຄວາມຄືບໜ້າຂອງການຊິງໂຄໄນ. ທ່ານຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງກວດສອບໄຟລ໌ລັອກຂອງຊ່ອງທາງພື້ນຖານ ແລະ ຊ່ອງທາງຍ່ອຍທັງໝົດເພື່ອໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າການຊິງໂຄໄນສຳເລັດສົມບູນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:87
msgid "The following custom channel synchronization options are available:"
msgstr "ມີຕົວເລືອກການຊິງໂຄໄນຊ່ອງທາງກຳນົດເອງດັ່ງຕໍ່ໄປນີ້:"

#. type: Labeled list
#: en/modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:88
#, no-wrap
msgid "Retain packages in channels which have been removed from the repository"
msgstr "ຮັກສາແພັກເກັດໃນຊ່ອງທາງທີ່ຖືກລຶບອອກຈາກຄັງເກັບແລ້ວ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:89
msgid "This turns off `strict` mode."
msgstr ""

#. type: Labeled list
#: en/modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:90
#, no-wrap
msgid "Do not sync errata"
msgstr "ບໍ່ຕ້ອງຊິງໂຄໄນ errata"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:91
msgid "Do not synchronize patches."
msgstr "ບໍ່ຕ້ອງຊິງໂຄໄນ patches (ແຜ່ນແປ້)."

#. type: Labeled list
#: en/modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:92
#, no-wrap
msgid "Sync only latest packages"
msgstr "ຊິງໂຄໄນສະເພາະແພັກເກັດເວີຊັນລ່າສຸດ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:93
msgid "Synchronize latest package version only."
msgstr "ຊິງໂຄໄນສະເພາະເວີຊັນແພັກເກັດລ່າສຸດເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

#. type: Labeled list
#: en/modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:94
#, no-wrap
msgid "Create kickstartable tree"
msgstr "ສ້າງ kickstartable tree"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:95
msgid ""
"This option prepares a directory tree ready for {kickstart} auto "
"installation."
msgstr "ຕົວເລືອກນີ້ກຽມໂຄງສ້າງໄດເຣັກທໍຣີ (directory tree) ທີ່ພ້ອມສຳລັບການຕິດຕັ້ງແບບອັດຕະໂນມັດ {kickstart}."

#. type: Labeled list
#: en/modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:96
#, no-wrap
msgid "Terminate upon any error"
msgstr "ຢຸດການເຮັດວຽກເມື່ອເກີດຂໍ້ຜິດພາດໃດໆ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:97
msgid "Stop synchronizing if an error occurs."
msgstr "ຢຸດການຊິງໂຄໄນຫາກເກີດຂໍ້ຜິດພາດ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:98
msgid ""
"These options will be saved persistently for each channel.  The btn:[Sync "
"now] button also saves the channel options before performing the "
"synchronization."
msgstr "ຕົວເລືອກເຫຼົ່ານີ້ຈະຖືກບັນທຶກໄວ້ແບບຖາວອນສຳລັບແຕ່ລະຊ່ອງທາງ. ປຸ່ມ btn:[Sync now] ຍັງຈະບັນທຶກຕົວເລືອກຊ່ອງທາງກ່ອນທີ່ຈະດຳເນີນການຊິງໂຄໄນ."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:99
#, no-wrap
msgid "Add packages and patches to custom channels"
msgstr "ເພີ່ມແພັກເກດ ແລະ ແພັດຊ໌ເຂົ້າໃນຊ່ອງທາງກຳນົດເອງ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:100
msgid ""
"When you create a new custom channel without cloning it from an existing "
"channel, it does not contain any packages or patches.  You can add the "
"packages and patches you require using the {productname} {webui}."
msgstr "ເມື່ອທ່ານສ້າງຊ່ອງທາງກຳນົດເອງໃໝ່ໂດຍບໍ່ໄດ້ໂຄລນຈາກຊ່ອງທາງທີ່ມີຢູ່, ມັນຈະບໍ່ມີແພັກເກັດ ຫຼື patches ໃດໆ. ທ່ານສາມາດເພີ່ມແພັກເກັດ ແລະ patches ທີ່ທ່ານຕ້ອງການໄດ້ໂດຍໃຊ້ {productname} {webui}."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:101
msgid ""
"Custom channels can only include packages or patches that are cloned or "
"custom, and they must match the base architecture of the channel.  Patches "
"added to custom channels must apply to a package that exists in the channel."
msgstr "ຊ່ອງທາງກຳນົດເອງສາມາດລວມເອົາໄດ້ສະເພາະແພັກເກັດ ຫຼື patches ທີ່ຖືກໂຄລນ ຫຼື ກຳນົດເອງເທົ່ານັ້ນ, ແລະ ພວກມັນຕ້ອງກົງກັບສະຖາປັດຕະຍະກຳພື້ນຖານຂອງຊ່ອງທາງ. patches ທີ່ເພີ່ມເຂົ້າໃນຊ່ອງທາງກຳນົດເອງຕ້ອງໃຊ້ກັບແພັກເກັດທີ່ມີຢູ່ໃນຊ່ອງທາງນັ້ນ."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:102
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Adding packages to custom channels"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການເພີ່ມແພັກເກດເຂົ້າໃນຊ່ອງທາງກຳນົດເອງ"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:103
msgid ""
"In the {productname} {webui}, navigate to menu:Software[Manage > Channels], "
"and go to the `Packages` tab."
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:104
msgid ""
"OPTIONAL: See all packages currently in the channel by navigating to the "
"`List/Remove` tab."
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:105
msgid "Add new packages to the channel by navigating to the `Add` tab."
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:106
msgid ""
"Select the parent channel to provide packages, and click btn:[View Packages] "
"to populate the list."
msgstr "ເລືອກຊ່ອງທາງຫຼັກທີ່ຈະສະໜອງແພັກເກັດ, ແລະ ຄລິກ btn:[View Packages] ເພື່ອສະແດງລາຍຊື່."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:107
msgid ""
"Check the packages to add to the custom channel, and click btn:[Add "
"Packages]."
msgstr "ໝາຍຕິກເລືອກແພັກເກັດທີ່ຈະເພີ່ມເຂົ້າໃນຊ່ອງທາງກຳນົດເອງ, ແລະ ຄລິກ btn:[Add Packages]."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:108
msgid ""
"When you are satisfied with the selection, click btn:[Confirm Addition] to "
"add the packages to the channel."
msgstr "ເມື່ອທ່ານພໍໃຈກັບການເລືອກແລ້ວ, ໃຫ້ຄລິກ btn:[Confirm Addition] ເພື່ອເພີ່ມແພັກເກັດເຂົ້າໃນຊ່ອງທາງ."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:109
msgid ""
"OPTIONAL: You can compare the packages in the current channel with those in "
"a different channel by navigating to menu:Software[Manage > Channels], and "
"going to the menu:Packages[Compare] tab."
msgstr "ທາງເລືອກ: ທ່ານສາມາດປຽບທຽບແພັກເກັດໃນຊ່ອງທາງປັດຈຸບັນກັບຊ່ອງທາງອື່ນໄດ້ໂດຍການໄປທີ່ເມນູ: Software[Manage > Channels], ແລະ ໄປທີ່ແຖບເມນູ: Packages[Compare]."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:110
msgid ""
"To make the two channels the same, click the btn:[Merge Differences] button, "
"and resolve any conflicts."
msgstr "ເພື່ອເຮັດໃຫ້ສອງຊ່ອງທາງຄືກັນ, ໃຫ້ຄລິກປຸ່ມ btn:[Merge Differences], ແລະ ແກ້ໄຂຂໍ້ຂັດແຍ່ງໃດໆ."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:111
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Adding patches to a custom channel"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການເພີ່ມແພັດຊ໌ເຂົ້າໃນຊ່ອງທາງກຳນົດເອງ"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:112
msgid ""
"In the {productname} {webui}, navigate to menu:Software[Manage > Channels], "
"and go to the `Patches` tab."
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:113
msgid ""
"OPTIONAL: See all patches currently in the channel by navigating to the "
"`List/Remove` tab."
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:114
msgid ""
"Add new patches to the channel by navigating to the `Add` tab, and selecting "
"what kind of patches you want to add."
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:115
msgid ""
"Select the parent channel to provide patches, and click btn:[View Associated "
"Patches] to populate the list."
msgstr "ເລືອກຊ່ອງທາງຫຼັກທີ່ຈະສະໜອງ patches, ແລະ ຄລິກ btn:[View Associated Patches] ເພື່ອສະແດງລາຍຊື່."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:116
msgid "Check the patches to add to the custom channel, and click btn:[Confirm]."
msgstr "ໝາຍຕິກເລືອກ patches ທີ່ຈະເພີ່ມເຂົ້າໃນຊ່ອງທາງກຳນົດເອງ, ແລະ ຄລິກ btn:[Confirm]."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:117
msgid ""
"When you are satisfied with the selection, click btn:[Confirm] to add the "
"patches to the channel."
msgstr "ເມື່ອທ່ານພໍໃຈກັບການເລືອກແລ້ວ, ໃຫ້ຄລິກ btn:[Confirm] ເພື່ອເພີ່ມ patches ເຂົ້າໃນຊ່ອງທາງ."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:118
#, no-wrap
msgid "Manage custom channels"
msgstr "ຈັດການຊ່ອງທາງກຳນົດເອງ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:119
msgid ""
"{productname} administrators and channel administrators can alter or delete "
"any channel."
msgstr "ຜູ້ເບິ່ງແຍງລະບົບ {productname} ແລະ ຜູ້ເບິ່ງແຍງຊ່ອງທາງສາມາດປ່ຽນແປງ ຫຼື ລຶບຊ່ອງທາງໃດກໍໄດ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:120
msgid ""
"To grant other users rights to alter or delete a channel, navigate to "
"menu:Software[Manage > Channels] and select the channel you want to edit.  "
"Navigate to the `Managers` tab, and check the user to grant permissions.  "
"Click btn:[Update] to save the changes."
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:121
msgid ""
"If you delete a channel that has been assigned to a set of clients, it "
"triggers an immediate update of the channel state for any clients associated "
"with the deleted channel.  This is to ensure that the changes are reflected "
"accurately in the repository file."
msgstr "ຫາກທ່ານລຶບຊ່ອງທາງທີ່ຖືກກຳນົດໃຫ້ກັບກຸ່ມລູກຂ່າຍ, ມັນຈະກະຕຸ້ນການອັບເດດສະຖານະຊ່ອງທາງທັນທີສຳລັບລູກຂ່າຍໃດກໍຕາມທີ່ເຊື່ອມໂຍງກັບຊ່ອງທາງທີ່ຖືກລຶບ. ນີ້ແມ່ນເພື່ອໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າການປ່ຽນແປງຖືກສະທ້ອນໃຫ້ເຫັນຢ່າງຖືກຕ້ອງໃນໄຟລ໌ຄັງເກັບ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:122
msgid ""
"You cannot delete {productname} channels with the {webui}.  Only custom "
"channels can be deleted."
msgstr "ທ່ານບໍ່ສາມາດລຶບຊ່ອງທາງຂອງ {productname} ດ້ວຍ {webui} ໄດ້. ມີພຽງແຕ່ຊ່ອງທາງກຳນົດເອງເທົ່ານັ້ນທີ່ສາມາດລຶບໄດ້."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:123
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Deleting custom channels"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການລຶບຊ່ອງທາງກຳນົດເອງ"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:124
msgid ""
"In the {productname} {webui}, navigate to menu:Software[Manage > Channels], "
"and select the channel you want to delete."
msgstr "ໃນ {productname} {webui}, ໄປທີ່ເມນູ: Software[Manage > Channels], ແລະ ເລືອກຊ່ອງທາງທີ່ທ່ານຕ້ອງການລຶບ."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:125
msgid "Click btn:[Delete software channel]."
msgstr "ຄລິກ btn:[Delete software channel]."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:126
msgid ""
"On the `Delete Channel` page, check the details of the channel you are "
"deleting, and check the `Unsubscribe Systems` checkbox to remove the custom "
"channel from any systems that might still be subscribed."
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:127
msgid "Click btn:[Delete Channel]."
msgstr "ຄລິກ btn:[Delete Channel]."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:128
msgid ""
"When channels are deleted, the packages that are part of the deleted channel "
"are not automatically removed.  You are not able to update packages that "
"have had their channel deleted."
msgstr "ເມື່ອຊ່ອງທາງຖືກລຶບ, ແພັກເກັດທີ່ເປັນສ່ວນໜຶ່ງຂອງຊ່ອງທາງທີ່ຖືກລຶບຈະບໍ່ຖືກຖອນອອກໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ. ທ່ານຈະບໍ່ສາມາດອັບເດດແພັກເກັດທີ່ຊ່ອງທາງຂອງພວກມັນຖືກລຶບໄປແລ້ວ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:129
msgid ""
"You can delete packages that are not associated with a channel in the "
"{productname} {webui}.  Navigate to menu:Software[Manage > Packages], check "
"the packages to remove, and click btn:[Delete Packages]."
msgstr "ທ່ານສາມາດລຶບແພັກເກັດທີ່ບໍ່ໄດ້ເຊື່ອມໂຍງກັບຊ່ອງທາງໃດໆໃນ {productname} {webui} ໄດ້. ໄປທີ່ເມນູ: Software[Manage > Packages], ໝາຍຕິກເລືອກແພັກເກັດທີ່ຈະຖອນອອກ, ແລະ ຄລິກ btn:[Delete Packages]."

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/disconnected-setup.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Disconnected Setup"
msgstr "ການຕັ້ງຄ່າແບບຕັດການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ (Disconnected Setup)"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/disconnected-setup.adoc:2
msgid ""
"When it is not possible to connect {productname} to the internet, you can "
"use it within a disconnected environment."
msgstr "ເມື່ອບໍ່ສາມາດເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ {productname} ກັບອິນເຕີເນັດໄດ້, ທ່ານສາມາດໃຊ້ມັນພາຍໃນສະພາບແວດລ້ອມທີ່ຕັດການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ໄດ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/disconnected-setup.adoc:3
msgid ""
"The repository mirroring tool (RMT) is available on {sle}{nbsp}15 and "
"later.  RMT replaces the subscription management tool (SMT), which can be "
"used on older {sle} installations."
msgstr "ເຄື່ອງມື Repository Mirroring Tool (RMT) ມີໃຫ້ໃຊ້ໃນ {sle}{nbsp}15 ແລະ ເວີຊັນຫຼັງຈາກນັ້ນ. RMT ມາແທນທີ່ Subscription Management Tool (SMT), ເຊິ່ງສາມາດໃຊ້ໃນການຕິດຕັ້ງ {sle} ເວີຊັນເກົ່າ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/disconnected-setup.adoc:4
msgid ""
"In a disconnected {productname} setup, RMT or SMT uses an external network "
"to connect to {scclongform}.  All software channels and repositories are "
"synchronized to a removable storage device.  The storage device can then be "
"used to update the disconnected {productname} installation."
msgstr "ໃນການຕັ້ງຄ່າ {productname} ແບບຕັດການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່, RMT ຫຼື SMT ຈະໃຊ້ເຄືອຂ່າຍພາຍນອກເພື່ອເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ກັບ {scclongform}. ທຸກຊ່ອງທາງຊອບແວ ແລະ ຄັງເກັບຈະຖືກຊິງໂຄໄນໄປຍັງອຸປະກອນເກັບຂໍ້ມູນແບບຖອດອອກໄດ້. ຈາກນັ້ນອຸປະກອນເກັບຂໍ້ມູນສາມາດຖືກນຳໃຊ້ເພື່ອອັບເດດການຕິດຕັ້ງ {productname} ທີ່ຕັດການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ໄດ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/disconnected-setup.adoc:5
msgid ""
"This setup allows your {productname} installation to remain in an offline, "
"disconnected environment."
msgstr "ການຕັ້ງຄ່ານີ້ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ການຕິດຕັ້ງ {productname} ຂອງທ່ານຍັງຄົງຢູ່ໃນສະພາບແວດລ້ອມແບບອອບລາຍ ແລະ ຕັດການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ໄດ້."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/disconnected-setup.adoc:6
msgid ""
"Your RMT or SMT instance must be used to manage the {productname} Server "
"directly.  It cannot be used to manage a second RMT or SMT instance, in a "
"cascade."
msgstr "ອິນສະແຕນຊ໌ RMT ຫຼື SMT ຂອງທ່ານຕ້ອງຖືກໃຊ້ເພື່ອຈັດການ {productname} Server ໂດຍກົງ. ມັນບໍ່ສາມາດຖືກໃຊ້ເພື່ອຈັດການອິນສະແຕນຊ໌ RMT ຫຼື SMT ອັນທີສອງໃນຮູບແບບ cascade ໄດ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/disconnected-setup.adoc:7
msgid "For more information on RMT, see {sles-base-os-documentation}/book-rmt.html."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບ RMT, ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງ {sles-base-os-documentation}/book-rmt.html."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/administration/pages/disconnected-setup.adoc:8
#, no-wrap
msgid "Synchronize Channels and Repositories from {scc}"
msgstr "ຊິງໂຄໄນຊ່ອງທາງ ແລະ ຄັງເກັບຈາກ {scc}"

#. type: Title ===
#: en/modules/administration/pages/disconnected-setup.adoc:9
#, no-wrap
msgid "Synchronize RMT"
msgstr "ຊິງໂຄໄນ RMT"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/disconnected-setup.adoc:10
msgid ""
"You can use RMT on {sle} 15 installations to manage clients running {sle} 12 "
"or later."
msgstr "ທ່ານສາມາດໃຊ້ RMT ໃນການຕິດຕັ້ງ {sle} 15 ເພື່ອຈັດການລູກຂ່າຍທີ່ໃຊ້ {sle} 12 ຫຼື ເວີຊັນຫຼັງຈາກນັ້ນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/disconnected-setup.adoc:11
msgid ""
"We recommend you set up a dedicated RMT instance for each {productname} "
"installation."
msgstr "ພວກເຮົາແນະນຳໃຫ້ທ່ານຕັ້ງຄ່າອິນສະແຕນຊ໌ RMT ສະເພາະສຳລັບແຕ່ລະການຕິດຕັ້ງ {productname}."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/administration/pages/disconnected-setup.adoc:12
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Setting up RMT"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການຕັ້ງຄ່າ RMT"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/disconnected-setup.adoc:13
msgid "On the RMT instance, install the RMT package:"
msgstr "ໃນອິນສະແຕນຊ໌ RMT, ໃຫ້ຕິດຕັ້ງແພັກເກັດ RMT:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/disconnected-setup.adoc:14
#, no-wrap
msgid "zypper in rmt-server\n"
msgstr "zypper in rmt-server\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/disconnected-setup.adoc:15
msgid "Configure RMT using {yast}:"
msgstr "ກຳນົດຄ່າ RMT ໂດຍໃຊ້ {yast}:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/disconnected-setup.adoc:16
#, no-wrap
msgid "yast2 rmt\n"
msgstr "yast2 rmt\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/disconnected-setup.adoc:17
msgid "Follow the prompts to complete installation."
msgstr "ປະຕິບັດຕາມຄຳແນະນຳເພື່ອໃຫ້ການຕິດຕັ້ງສຳເລັດສົມບູນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/disconnected-setup.adoc:18
msgid ""
"For more information on setting up RMT, see "
"{sles-base-os-documentation}/book-rmt.html."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບການຕັ້ງຄ່າ RMT, ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງ {sles-base-os-documentation}/book-rmt.html."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/administration/pages/disconnected-setup.adoc:19
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Synchronizing RMT with {scc}"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການຊິງໂຄໄນ RMT ກັບ {scc}"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/disconnected-setup.adoc:20
msgid ""
"On the RMT instance, list all available products and repositories for your "
"organization:"
msgstr "ໃນອິນສະແຕນຊ໌ RMT, ໃຫ້ລາຍຊື່ຜະລິດຕະພັນ ແລະ ຄັງເກັບທີ່ມີທັງໝົດສຳລັບອົງກອນຂອງທ່ານ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/disconnected-setup.adoc:21
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"rmt-cli products list --all\n"
"rmt-cli repos list --all\n"
msgstr ""
"rmt-cli products list --all\n"
"rmt-cli repos list --all\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/disconnected-setup.adoc:22
msgid "Synchronize all available updates for your organization:"
msgstr "ຊິງໂຄໄນການອັບເດດທີ່ມີທັງໝົດສຳລັບອົງກອນຂອງທ່ານ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/disconnected-setup.adoc:23
#, no-wrap
msgid "rmt-cli sync\n"
msgstr "rmt-cli sync\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/disconnected-setup.adoc:24
msgid "You can also configure RMT to synchronize regularly using systemd."
msgstr "ທ່ານຍັງສາມາດກຳນົດຄ່າ RMT ໃຫ້ຊິງໂຄໄນຢ່າງສະໝໍ່າສະເໝີໂດຍໃຊ້ systemd."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/disconnected-setup.adoc:25
msgid "Enable the products you require."
msgstr "ເປີດໃຊ້ຜະລິດຕະພັນທີ່ທ່ານຕ້ອງການ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/disconnected-setup.adoc:26
msgid "For example, to enable SLES 15:"
msgstr "ຕົວຢ່າງ, ເພື່ອເປີດໃຊ້ SLES 15:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/disconnected-setup.adoc:27
#, no-wrap
msgid "rmt-cli product enable sles/15/x86_64\n"
msgstr "rmt-cli product enable sles/15/x86_64\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/disconnected-setup.adoc:28
msgid "Export the synchronized data to your removable storage."
msgstr "ສົ່ງອອກຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ຊິງໂຄໄນແລ້ວໄປຍັງອຸປະກອນເກັບຂໍ້ມູນແບບຖອດອອກໄດ້ຂອງທ່ານ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/disconnected-setup.adoc:29
msgid "In this example, the storage medium is mounted at `/mnt/usb`:"
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/disconnected-setup.adoc:30
#, no-wrap
msgid "rmt-cli export data /mnt/usb\n"
msgstr "rmt-cli export data /mnt/usb\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/disconnected-setup.adoc:31
msgid "Export the enabled repositories to your removable storage:"
msgstr "ສົ່ງອອກຄັງເກັບທີ່ເປີດໃຊ້ແລ້ວໄປຍັງອຸປະກອນເກັບຂໍ້ມູນແບບຖອດອອກໄດ້ຂອງທ່ານ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/disconnected-setup.adoc:32
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"rmt-cli export settings /mnt/usb\n"
"rmt-cli export repos /mnt/usb\n"
msgstr ""
"rmt-cli export settings /mnt/usb\n"
"rmt-cli export repos /mnt/usb\n"

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/disconnected-setup.adoc:33
msgid ""
"Ensure that the external storage is mounted to a directory that is writeable "
"by the RMT user.  You can change RMT user settings in the `cli` section of "
"`/etc/rmt.conf`."
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ===
#: en/modules/administration/pages/disconnected-setup.adoc:34
#, no-wrap
msgid "Synchronize SMT"
msgstr "ຊິງໂຄໄນ SMT"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/disconnected-setup.adoc:35
msgid ""
"SMT is included with {sle} 12, and can be used to manage clients running "
"{sle} 10 or later."
msgstr "SMT ມີມາພ້ອມກັບ {sle} 12, ແລະ ສາມາດໃຊ້ເພື່ອຈັດການລູກຂ່າຍທີ່ໃຊ້ {sle} 10 ຫຼື ເວີຊັນຫຼັງຈາກນັ້ນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/disconnected-setup.adoc:36
msgid ""
"SMT requires you to create a local mirror directory on the SMT instance to "
"synchronize repositories and packages."
msgstr "SMT ຕ້ອງການໃຫ້ທ່ານສ້າງໄດເຣັກທໍຣີເມີເມີ (mirror directory) ພາຍໃນເຄື່ອງໃນອິນສະແຕນຊ໌ SMT ເພື່ອຊິງໂຄໄນຄັງເກັບ ແລະ ແພັກເກັດ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/disconnected-setup.adoc:37
msgid ""
"For more details on installing and configuring SMT, see "
"https://documentation.suse.com/sles/12-SP5/html/SLES-all/book-smt.html."
msgstr "ສຳລັບລາຍລະອຽດເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບການຕິດຕັ້ງ ແລະ ການກຳນົດຄ່າ SMT, ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງ https://documentation.suse.com/sles/12-SP5/html/SLES-all/book-smt.html."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/administration/pages/disconnected-setup.adoc:38
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Synchronizing SMT with {scc}"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການຊິງໂຄໄນ SMT ກັບ {scc}"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/disconnected-setup.adoc:39
msgid "On the SMT instance, create a database replacement file:"
msgstr "ໃນອິນສະແຕນຊ໌ SMT, ໃຫ້ສ້າງໄຟລ໌ທົດແທນຖານຂໍ້ມູນ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/disconnected-setup.adoc:40
#, no-wrap
msgid "smt-sync --createdbreplacementfile /tmp/dbrepl.xml\n"
msgstr "smt-sync --createdbreplacementfile /tmp/dbrepl.xml\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/disconnected-setup.adoc:41
msgid ""
"Export the synchronized data to your removable storage.  In this example, "
"the storage medium is mounted at `/mnt/usb`:"
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/disconnected-setup.adoc:42
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"smt-sync --todir /mnt/usb\n"
"smt-mirror --dbreplfile /tmp/dbrepl.xml --directory /mnt/usb \\\n"
"           --fromlocalsmt -L /var/log/smt/smt-mirror-export.log\n"
"curl https://scc.suse.com/multi-linux-manager/product_tree.json -o "
"/mnt/usb/product_tree.json\n"
msgstr ""
"smt-sync --todir /mnt/usb\n"
"smt-mirror --dbreplfile /tmp/dbrepl.xml --directory /mnt/usb \\\n"
"           --fromlocalsmt -L /var/log/smt/smt-mirror-export.log\n"
"curl https://scc.suse.com/multi-linux-manager/product_tree.json -o /mnt/usb/product_tree.json\n"

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/disconnected-setup.adoc:43
msgid ""
"Ensure that the external storage is mounted to a directory that is writeable "
"by the RMT user.  You can change SMT user settings in `/etc/smt.conf`."
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/administration/pages/disconnected-setup.adoc:44
#, no-wrap
msgid "Mandatory Channels"
msgstr "ຊ່ອງທາງທີ່ບັງຄັບ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/disconnected-setup.adoc:45
msgid ""
"The corresponding {productname} Client Tools Channels are required, for "
"{productname} to be able to synchronize a given channel.  If these channels "
"are not enabled, {productname} may fail to detect that product."
msgstr "ຊ່ອງທາງ {productname} Client Tools ທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງແມ່ນມີຄວາມຈຳເປັນ ເພື່ອໃຫ້ {productname} ສາມາດຊິງໂຄໄນຊ່ອງທາງທີ່ກຳນົດໄດ້. ຫາກຊ່ອງທາງເຫຼົ່ານີ້ບໍ່ຖືກເປີດໃຊ້, {productname} ອາດຈະກວດບໍ່ພົບຜະລິດຕະພັນນັ້ນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/disconnected-setup.adoc:46
msgid "Run the following command to enable these mandatory channels:"
msgstr "ດຳເນີນການຄຳສັ່ງຕໍ່ໄປນີ້ເພື່ອເປີດໃຊ້ຊ່ອງທາງທີ່ບັງຄັບເຫຼົ່ານີ້:"

#. type: Labeled list
#: en/modules/administration/pages/disconnected-setup.adoc:47
#, no-wrap
msgid "SLES 12 and products based on it such as SLES for SAP or SLE HPC"
msgstr "SLES 12 ແລະ ຜະລິດຕະພັນທີ່ອີງໃສ່ມັນ ເຊັ່ນ SLES for SAP ຫຼື SLE HPC"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/disconnected-setup.adoc:48
msgid "RMT: `rmt-cli products enable sle-manager-tools/12/x86_64`"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/disconnected-setup.adoc:49
msgid "SMT: `smt repos -p sle-manager-tools,12,x86_64`"
msgstr ""

#. type: Labeled list
#: en/modules/administration/pages/disconnected-setup.adoc:50
#, no-wrap
msgid "SLES 15 and products based on it such as SLES for SAP or SLE HPC"
msgstr "SLES 15 ແລະ ຜະລິດຕະພັນທີ່ອີງໃສ່ມັນ ເຊັ່ນ SLES for SAP ຫຼື SLE HPC"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/disconnected-setup.adoc:51
msgid "RMT: `rmt-cli products enable sle-manager-tools/15/x86_64`"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/disconnected-setup.adoc:52
msgid "SMT: `smt repos -p sle-manager-tools,15,x86_64`"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/disconnected-setup.adoc:53
msgid "Then mirror the channels, and export."
msgstr "ຈາກນັ້ນເຮັດເມີເມີຊ່ອງທາງ, ແລະ ສົ່ງອອກ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/disconnected-setup.adoc:54
msgid ""
"Other distributions, or architectures, can be enabled.  For more information "
"about enabling product channels or repositories to be mirrored, see the "
"documentation:"
msgstr "ສາມາດເປີດໃຊ້ການແຈກຈ່າຍ ຫຼື ສະຖາປັດຕະຍະກຳອື່ນໆໄດ້. ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບການເປີດໃຊ້ຊ່ອງທາງຜະລິດຕະພັນ ຫຼື ຄັງເກັບທີ່ຈະເຮັດເມີເມີ, ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງເອກະສານ:"

#. type: Labeled list
#: en/modules/administration/pages/disconnected-setup.adoc:55
#, no-wrap
msgid "RMT"
msgstr "RMT"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/disconnected-setup.adoc:56
msgid "{sles-base-os-documentation}/cha-rmt-mirroring.html#sec-rmt-mirroring-enable-disable"
msgstr "{sles-base-os-documentation}/cha-rmt-mirroring.html#sec-rmt-mirroring-enable-disable"

#. type: Labeled list
#: en/modules/administration/pages/disconnected-setup.adoc:57
#, no-wrap
msgid "SMT"
msgstr "SMT"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/disconnected-setup.adoc:58
msgid "https://documentation.suse.com/sles/12-SP5/single-html/SLES-smt/index.html#smt-mirroring-manage-domirror"
msgstr "https://documentation.suse.com/sles/12-SP5/single-html/SLES-smt/index.html#smt-mirroring-manage-domirror"

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/administration/pages/disconnected-setup.adoc:59
#, no-wrap
msgid "Disconnected Server"
msgstr "ເຊີບເວີທີ່ຕັດການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/disconnected-setup.adoc:60
msgid ""
"To set up {productname} as a disconnected server follow the instructions of "
"an air-gapped deployment."
msgstr "ເພື່ອຕັ້ງຄ່າ {productname} ເປັນເຊີບເວີທີ່ຕັດການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ ໃຫ້ປະຕິບັດຕາມຄຳແນະນຳຂອງການນຳໃຊ້ແບບ air-gapped."

#. type: Title ===
#: en/modules/administration/pages/disconnected-setup.adoc:61
#, no-wrap
msgid "Deploy"
msgstr "ການນຳໃຊ້ (Deploy)"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/disconnected-setup.adoc:62
msgid ""
"It is recommended to deploy a disconnected server as a Virtual Machine (VM) "
"using a provided image.  For an air-gapped deployment of {productname} "
"Server, see "
"xref:installation-and-upgrade:container-deployment/mlm/server-air-gapped-deployment-mlm.adoc[]."
msgstr "ແນະນຳໃຫ້ນຳໃຊ້ເຊີບເວີແບບຕັດການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ໃນຮູບແບບ Virtual Machine (VM) ໂດຍໃຊ້ອິເມຈ (image) ທີ່ກຽມໄວ້ໃຫ້. ສຳລັບການນຳໃຊ້ {productname} Server ແບບ air-gapped, ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງ xref:installation-and-upgrade:container-deployment/mlm/server-air-gapped-deployment-mlm.adoc[]."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/disconnected-setup.adoc:63
msgid ""
"Keep in mind to execute the final command with the `--mirror` option and "
"replace `</media/disk>` with your mount point:"
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/disconnected-setup.adoc:64
#, no-wrap
msgid "mgradm install podman --mirror </media/disk>\n"
msgstr "mgradm install podman --mirror </media/disk>\n"

#. type: Title ===
#: en/modules/administration/pages/disconnected-setup.adoc:65
#, no-wrap
msgid "Synchronize"
msgstr "ຊິງໂຄໄນ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/disconnected-setup.adoc:66
msgid ""
"When you have removable media loaded with your {scclongform} data, you can "
"use it to synchronize your disconnected server."
msgstr "ເມື່ອທ່ານມີສື່ເກັບຂໍ້ມູນແບບຖອດອອກໄດ້ທີ່ໂຫຼດຂໍ້ມູນ {scclongform} ຂອງທ່ານແລ້ວ, ທ່ານສາມາດໃຊ້ມັນເພື່ອຊິງໂຄໄນເຊີບເວີທີ່ຕັດການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ຂອງທ່ານໄດ້."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/disconnected-setup.adoc:67
msgid ""
"The removable media that you use for synchronization must always be "
"available at the same mount point.  Do not trigger a synchronization if the "
"storage medium is not mounted.  This results in data corruption."
msgstr "ສື່ເກັບຂໍ້ມູນແບບຖອດອອກໄດ້ທີ່ທ່ານໃຊ້ໃນການຊິງໂຄໄນຕ້ອງມີໃຫ້ໃຊ້ຢູ່ທີ່ຈຸດເມົາດຽວກັນສະເໝີ. ຢ່າເລີ່ມການຊິງໂຄໄນຫາກສື່ເກັບຂໍ້ມູນບໍ່ໄດ້ຖືກເມົາໄວ້. ສິ່ງນີ້ຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ຂໍ້ມູນເສຍຫາຍ."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/administration/pages/disconnected-setup.adoc:68
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Synchronizing a Disconnected Server"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການຊິງໂຄໄນເຊີບເວີທີ່ຕັດການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/disconnected-setup.adoc:69
msgid "Restart the Tomcat service:"
msgstr "ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນການບໍລິການ Tomcat ໃໝ່:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/disconnected-setup.adoc:70
#, no-wrap
msgid "mgrctl exec -ti -- systemctl restart tomcat\n"
msgstr "mgrctl exec -ti -- systemctl restart tomcat\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/disconnected-setup.adoc:71
msgid "Refresh the local data:"
msgstr "ຣີເຟຣຊຂໍ້ມູນພາຍໃນເຄື່ອງ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/disconnected-setup.adoc:72
#, no-wrap
msgid "mgrctl exec -ti -- mgr-sync refresh\n"
msgstr "mgrctl exec -ti -- mgr-sync refresh\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/disconnected-setup.adoc:73
msgid "Perform a synchronization:"
msgstr "ດຳເນີນການຊິງໂຄໄນ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/disconnected-setup.adoc:74
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"mgrctl exec -ti -- mgr-sync list channels\n"
"mgrctl exec -ti -- mgr-sync add channel channel-label\n"
msgstr ""
"mgrctl exec -ti -- mgr-sync list channels\n"
"mgrctl exec -ti -- mgr-sync add channel channel-label\n"

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/disconnected-setup.adoc:75
msgid ""
"Be aware that if `server.susemanager.fromdir` is set, {productname} will not "
"be able to check if {scclongform} credentials are valid or not.  Instead, a "
"warning sign will be displayed and no {scc} online check will be performed."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/disconnected-setup.adoc:76
msgid ""
"An alternative to disconnected setup may be to copy content between servers "
"using Inter-Server Synchronization (ISS).  For more information, see "
"xref:specialized-guides:large-deployments/iss_v2.adoc[Inter-Server "
"Synchronization - Version 2]."
msgstr "ທາງເລືອກອື່ນນອກຈາກການຕັ້ງຄ່າແບບຕັດການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ ຄືການກັອບປີ້ເນື້ອຫາລະຫວ່າງເຊີບເວີໂດຍໃຊ້ Inter-Server Synchronization (ISS). ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ, ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງ xref:specialized-guides:large-deployments/iss_v2.adoc[Inter-Server Synchronization - Version 2]."

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Image Building and Management"
msgstr "ການສ້າງ ແລະ ການຈັດການອິເມຈ"

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:2
#, no-wrap
msgid "Image building overview"
msgstr "ພາບລວມການສ້າງອິເມຈ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:3
msgid ""
"{productname} enables system administrators to build containers and OS "
"Images and push the results to an image store."
msgstr "{productname} ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ຜູ້ເບິ່ງແຍງລະບົບສາມາດສ້າງຄອນເທນເນີ ແລະ OS Images ແລະ ດັນ (push) ຜົນລັດທີ່ໄດ້ໄປຍັງບ່ອນເກັບອິເມຈ."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:4
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Building and pushing images"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການສ້າງ ແລະ ການດັນອິເມຈ"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:5
msgid "Define an image store."
msgstr "ກຳນົດບ່ອນເກັບອິເມຈ."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:6
msgid ""
"Define an image profile and associate it with a source (either a git "
"repository or a directory)."
msgstr "ກຳນົດໂປຣໄຟລ໌ອິເມຈ ແລະ ເຊື່ອມໂຍງມັນກັບແຫຼ່ງຂໍ້ມູນ (ບໍ່ວ່າຈະເປັນ git repository ຫຼື ໄດເຣັກທໍຣີ)."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:7
msgid "Build the image."
msgstr "ສ້າງອິເມຈ."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:8
msgid "Push the image to the image store."
msgstr "ດັນອິເມຈໄປຍັງບ່ອນເກັບອິເມຈ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:9
msgid ""
"{productname} supports these two build types: Dockerfile and the Kiwi build "
"type.  The Kiwi build type is used to build system, virtual, and other "
"images."
msgstr "{productname} ຮອງຮັບປະເພດການສ້າງສອງແບບນີ້: Dockerfile ແລະ Kiwi build. ປະເພດການສ້າງ Kiwi ຖືກໃຊ້ເພື່ອສ້າງອິເມຈຂອງລະບົບ, ລະບົບສະເືອນ (virtual), ແລະ ອິເມຈປະເພດອື່ນໆ."

#.  Needs checking
#.  at later places to be fix accordingly
#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:10
msgid ""
"The image store for the Kiwi build type is pre-defined as a file system "
"directory in the `srv-www` volume."
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:11
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:210
msgid ""
"The image files can be downloaded from "
"`https://MANAGER-HOST/os-images/ORGANIZATION-ID/FILE-NAME`.  The exact "
"location can be determined from the image details page."
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:12
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:211
msgid ""
"The image files can be downloaded from "
"`https://UYUNI-HOST/os-images/ORGANIZATION-ID/FILE-NAME`.  The exact "
"location can be determined from the image details page."
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:13
#, no-wrap
msgid "Container images"
msgstr "ຄອນເທນເນີອິເມຈ (Container images)"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:15
msgid ""
"The containers feature is available for {salt} clients running {sles} 12 or "
"later.  Before you begin, ensure your environment meets these requirements:"
msgstr "ຄຸນສົມບັດຄອນເທນເນີມີໃຫ້ໃຊ້ສຳລັບລູກຂ່າຍ {salt} ທີ່ໃຊ້ {sles} 12 ຫຼື ເວີຊັນຫຼັງຈາກນັ້ນ. ກ່ອນທີ່ທ່ານຈະເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ, ໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າສະພາບແວດລ້ອມຂອງທ່ານມີຄວາມຕ້ອງການດັ່ງນີ້:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:16
msgid ""
"A published git repository containing a Dockerfile and configuration "
"scripts.  The repository can be public or private, and should be hosted on "
"GitHub, GitLab, or BitBucket."
msgstr "git repository ທີ່ຖືກເຜີຍແຜ່ເຊິ່ງປະກອບດ້ວຍ Dockerfile ແລະ ສະຄຣິບການກຳນົດຄ່າ. ຄັງເກັບສາມາດເປັນແບບສາທາລະນະ ຫຼື ສ່ວນຕົວ, ແລະ ຄວນຖືກໂຮສ (host) ໄວ້ໃນ GitHub, GitLab, ຫຼື BitBucket."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:17
msgid "A properly configured image store, such as a Docker registry."
msgstr "ບ່ອນເກັບອິເມຈທີ່ຖືກກຳນົດຄ່າຢ່າງຖືກຕ້ອງ, ເຊັ່ນ Docker registry."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:18
msgid ""
"For more information on containers, see "
"https://documentation.suse.com/container/all/html/Container-guide/."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບຄອນເທນເນີ, ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງ https://documentation.suse.com/container/all/html/Container-guide/."

#. type: Title ===
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:19
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:168
#, no-wrap
msgid "Create a build host"
msgstr "ສ້າງ build host"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:20
msgid ""
"To build images with {productname}, you need to create and configure a build "
"host.  Container build hosts are {salt} clients running {sle} 12 or later.  "
"This section guides you through the initial configuration for a build host."
msgstr "ເພື່ອສ້າງອິເມຈດ້ວຍ {productname}, ທ່ານຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງສ້າງ ແລະ ກຳນົດຄ່າ build host. build host ຂອງຄອນເທນເນີແມ່ນລູກຂ່າຍ {salt} ທີ່ໃຊ້ {sle} 12 ຫຼື ເວີຊັນຫຼັງຈາກນັ້ນ. ພາກນີ້ຈະແນະນຳທ່ານຜ່ານການກຳນົດຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນສຳລັບ build host."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:21
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:171
msgid ""
"The operating system on the build host must match the operating system on "
"the targeted image."
msgstr "ລະບົບປະຕິບັດການໃນ build host ຕ້ອງກົງກັບລະບົບປະຕິບັດການໃນອິເມຈເປົ້າໝາຍ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:22
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:172
msgid ""
"For example, build {sles}{nbsp}15 based images on a build host running "
"{sles}{nbsp}15 (SP2 or later) OS version.  Build {sles}{nbsp}12 based images "
"on a build host running {sles}{nbsp}12 SP5 or {sles}{nbsp}12 SP4 OS version."
msgstr "ຕົວຢ່າງ: ສ້າງອິເມຈທີ່ອີງໃສ່ {sles}{nbsp}15 ໃນ build host ທີ່ໃຊ້ລະບົບປະຕິບັດການ {sles}{nbsp}15 (SP2 ຫຼື ຫຼັງຈາກນັ້ນ). ສ້າງອິເມຈທີ່ອີງໃສ່ {sles}{nbsp}12 ໃນ build host ທີ່ໃຊ້ລະບົບປະຕິບັດການ {sles}{nbsp}12 SP5 ຫຼື {sles}{nbsp}12 SP4."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:23
msgid "Cross-architecture builds are not supported."
msgstr "ບໍ່ຮອງຮັບການສ້າງແບບຂ້າມສະຖາປັດຕະຍະກຳ (Cross-architecture)."

#. 2022-05-12, ke: at least for now, according to feedback, this is unsupported:
#. For example, you must build Raspberry Pi {sles}{nbsp}15 SP3 images on a Raspberry Pi (aarch64 architecture) build host running {sles}{nbsp}15 SP3.
#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:24
msgid ""
"From the {productname} {webui}, perform these steps to configure a build "
"host:"
msgstr "ຈາກ {productname} {webui}, ໃຫ້ປະຕິບັດຕາມຂັ້ນຕອນເຫຼົ່ານີ້ເພື່ອ ກຳນົດຄ່າ build host:"

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:25
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Building a host"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການສ້າງ build host"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:26
msgid ""
"Select a {salt} client to be designated as a build host from the "
"menu:Systems[Systems] overview page."
msgstr "ເລືອກລູກຂ່າຍ {salt} ທີ່ຈະກຳນົດໃຫ້ເປັນ build host ຈາກໜ້າພາບລວມ menu:Systems[Systems]."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:27
msgid ""
"From the `System Details` page of the selected client assign the containers "
"modules.  Navigate to menu:Software[Software Channels] and enable the "
"containers module (for example, `SLE-Module-Containers15-Pool` and "
"`SLE-Module-Containers15-Updates`).  Continue with btn:[Next]."
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:28
msgid "Schedule the ` Software Channel Change`, and click btn:[Confirm]."
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:29
msgid ""
"From the `System Details` tab select menu:Properties[] page, and enable "
"`Container Build Host` from the `Add-on System Types` list.  Confirm by "
"clicking btn:[Update Properties]."
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:30
msgid ""
"Install all required packages by applying `Highstate`.  From the system "
"details tab select menu:States[Highstate], and click btn:[Apply Highstate].  "
"Alternatively, apply `Highstate` from the {productname} Server command line:"
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:31
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:183
#, no-wrap
msgid "salt '$your_client' state.highstate\n"
msgstr "salt '$your_client' state.highstate\n"

#. type: Title ===
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:32
#, no-wrap
msgid "Create an activation key for containers"
msgstr "ສ້າງ activation key ສຳລັບຄອນເທນເນີ"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:33
msgid ""
"The containers built with {productname} use channels associated to the "
"activation key as repositories when building the image.  This section guides "
"you through creating an ad-hoc activation key for this purpose."
msgstr "ຄອນເທນເນີທີ່ສ້າງຂຶ້ນດ້ວຍ {productname} ຈະໃຊ້ຊ່ອງທາງທີ່ເຊື່ອມໂຍງກັບ activation key ເປັນຄັງເກັບ (repositories) ໃນເວລາສ້າງອິເມຈ. ພາກນີ້ຈະແນະນຳທ່ານຜ່ານການສ້າງ activation key ແບບສະເພາະກິດ (ad-hoc) ສຳລັບຈຸດປະສົງນີ້."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:34
msgid ""
"To build a container, you need an activation key that is associated with a "
"channel other than `SUSE Manager Default`."
msgstr "ເພື່ອສ້າງຄອນເທນເນີ, ທ່ານຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງມີ activation key ທີ່ເຊື່ອມໂຍງກັບຊ່ອງທາງອື່ນນອກເໜືອຈາກ `SUSE Manager Default`."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:35
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:201
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Creating an activation key"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການສ້າງ activation key"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:36
msgid "Select menu:Systems[Activation Keys]."
msgstr "ເລືອກເມນູ: Systems[Activation Keys]."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:37
msgid "Click btn:[Create Key]."
msgstr "ຄລິກ btn:[Create Key]."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:38
msgid ""
"Enter a `Description` and a `Key` name.  Use the drop-down menu to select "
"the `Base Channel` to associate with this key."
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:39
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:205
msgid "Confirm with btn:[Create Activation Key]."
msgstr "ຢືນຢັນດ້ວຍ btn:[Create Activation Key]."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:40
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:206
msgid "For more information, see xref:client-configuration:activation-keys.adoc[]."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ, ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງ xref:client-configuration:activation-keys.adoc[]."

#. type: Title ===
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:41
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:207
#, no-wrap
msgid "Create an image store"
msgstr "ສ້າງບ່ອນເກັບອິເມຈ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:42
msgid ""
"All built images are pushed to an image store.  This section contains "
"information about creating an image store.  Image store is generally "
"referenced as a registry."
msgstr "ອິເມຈທີ່ສ້າງຂຶ້ນທັງໝົດຈະຖືກດັນໄປຍັງບ່ອນເກັບອິເມຈ. ພາກນີ້ປະກອບດ້ວຍຂໍ້ມູນກ່ຽວກັບການສ້າງບ່ອນເກັບອິເມຈ. ບ່ອນເກັບອິເມຈໂດຍທົ່ວໄປແລ້ວຈະຖືກເອີ້ນວ່າ registry."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:43
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Creating image store"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການສ້າງບ່ອນເກັບອິເມຈ"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:44
msgid "Select menu:Images[Stores]."
msgstr "ເລືອກເມນູ: Images[Stores]."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:45
msgid "Click `Create` to create a new store."
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:46
msgid "From the `Store Type` select the correct type."
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:47
msgid "Define a name for the image store in the `Label` field."
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:48
msgid ""
"Provide the path to your image registry by filling in the `URI` field, as a "
"fully qualified domain name (FQDN) for the container registry host (whether "
"internal or external)."
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:49
#, no-wrap
msgid "registry.example.com\n"
msgstr "registry.example.com\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:50
msgid ""
"The Registry URI can also be used to specify an image store on a registry "
"that is already in use."
msgstr "Registry URI ຍັງສາມາດຖືກໃຊ້ເພື່ອລະບຸບ່ອນເກັບອິເມຈໃນ registry ທີ່ຖືກໃຊ້ງານຢູ່ແລ້ວ."

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:51
#, no-wrap
msgid "registry.example.com:5000/myregistry/myproject\n"
msgstr "registry.example.com:5000/myregistry/myproject\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:52
msgid "Click btn:[Create] to add the new image store."
msgstr "ຄລິກ btn:[Create] ເພື່ອເພີ່ມບ່ອນເກັບອິເມຈໃໝ່."

#. type: Title ===
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:53
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:212
#, no-wrap
msgid "Create an image profile"
msgstr "ສ້າງໂປຣໄຟລ໌ອິເມຈ"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:54
msgid ""
"All container images are built using an image profile, which contains the "
"building instructions.  This section contains information about creating an "
"image profile with the {productname} {webui}."
msgstr "ທຸກຄອນເທນເນີອິເມຈຖືກສ້າງຂຶ້ນໂດຍໃຊ້ໂປຣໄຟລ໌ອິເມຈ, ເຊິ່ງປະກອບດ້ວຍຄຳແນະນຳໃນການສ້າງ. ພາກນີ້ປະກອບດ້ວຍຂໍ້ມູນກ່ຽວກັບການສ້າງໂປຣໄຟລ໌ອິເມຈດ້ວຍ {productname} {webui}."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:55
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:214
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Creating an image profile"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການສ້າງໂປຣໄຟລ໌ອິເມຈ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:56
msgid ""
"To create an image profile select menu:Images[Profiles] and click "
"btn:[Create]."
msgstr "ເພື່ອສ້າງໂປຣໄຟລ໌ອິເມຈ ໃຫ້ເລືອກເມນູ: Images[Profiles] ແລະ ຄລິກ btn:[Create]."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:57
msgid "Provide a name for the image profile by filling in the `Label` field."
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:58
msgid ""
"If your container image tag is in a format such as `myproject/myimage`, make "
"sure your image store registry URI contains the `/myproject` suffix."
msgstr "ຫາກແທັກອິເມຈຄອນເທນເນີຂອງທ່ານຢູ່ໃນຮູບແບບເຊັ່ນ `myproject/myimage`, ໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າ URI ຂອງ registry ບ່ອນເກັບອິເມຈຂອງທ່ານມີນາມສະກຸນ `/myproject` ຕໍ່ທ້າຍ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:59
msgid "Use `Dockerfile` as the `Image Type`."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:60
msgid ""
"Use the drop-down menu to select your registry from the `Target Image Store` "
"field."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:61
msgid ""
"In the `Path` field, type a GitHub, GitLab, or BitBucket repository URL.  "
"The path can also be a local directory on the build host.  The URL should be "
"`http`, `https`, or a token authentication URL.  For GitHub or GitLab, use "
"one of these formats:"
msgstr ""

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:62
#, no-wrap
msgid "GitHub Path Options"
msgstr "ຕົວເລືອກອ້າງອີງຂອງ GitHub"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:63
msgid "GitHub single user project repository"
msgstr "GitHub ຄັງເກັບໂຄງການຂອງຜູ້ໃຊ້ດ່ຽວ"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:64
#, no-wrap
msgid "https://github.com/USER/project.git#branchname:folder\n"
msgstr "https://github.com/USER/project.git#branchname:folder\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:65
msgid "GitHub organization project repository"
msgstr "GitHub ຄັງເກັບໂຄງການຂອງອົງກອນ"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:66
#, no-wrap
msgid "https://github.com/ORG/project.git#branchname:folder\n"
msgstr "https://github.com/ORG/project.git#branchname:folder\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:67
msgid "GitHub token authentication"
msgstr "ການຢືນຢັນຕົວຕົນດ້ວຍ GitHub token"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:68
msgid ""
"If your git repository is private, modify the profile's URL to include "
"authentication.  Use this URL format to authenticate with a GitHub token:"
msgstr "ຫາກ git repository ຂອງທ່ານເປັນແບບສ່ວນຕົວ, ໃຫ້ແກ້ໄຂ URL ຂອງໂປຣໄຟລ໌ເພື່ອລວມເອົາການຢືນຢັນຕົວຕົນ. ໃຊ້ຮູບແບບ URL ນີ້ເພື່ອຢືນຢັນຕົວຕົນດ້ວຍ GitHub token:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:69
#, no-wrap
msgid "https://USER:<AUTHENTICATION_TOKEN>@github.com/USER/project.git#master:/container/\n"
msgstr "https://USER:<AUTHENTICATION_TOKEN>@github.com/USER/project.git#master:/container/\n"

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:70
#, no-wrap
msgid "GitLab Path Options"
msgstr "ຕົວເລືອກເສັ້ນທາງ GitLab"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:71
msgid "GitLab single user project repository"
msgstr "GitLab ຄັງເກັບໂຄງການຂອງຜູ້ໃຊ້ດ່ຽວ"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:72
#, no-wrap
msgid "https://gitlab.example.com/USER/project.git#master:/container/\n"
msgstr "https://gitlab.example.com/USER/project.git#master:/container/\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:73
msgid "GitLab groups project repository"
msgstr "GitLab ຄັງເກັບໂຄງການຂອງກຸ່ມ"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:74
#, no-wrap
msgid "https://gitlab.example.com/GROUP/project.git#master:/container/\n"
msgstr "https://gitlab.example.com/GROUP/project.git#master:/container/\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:75
msgid "GitLab token authentication"
msgstr "ການຢືນຢັນຕົວຕົນດ້ວຍ GitLab token"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:76
msgid ""
"If your git repository is private and not publicly accessible, you need to "
"modify the profile's git URL to include authentication.  Use this URL format "
"to authenticate with a GitLab token:"
msgstr "ຫາກ git repository ຂອງທ່ານເປັນສ່ວນຕົວ ແລະ ບໍ່ສາມາດເຂົ້າເຖິງໄດ້ແບບສາທາລະນະ, ທ່ານຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງແກ້ໄຂ git URL ຂອງໂປຣໄຟລ໌ເພື່ອລວມເອົາການຢືນຢັນຕົວຕົນ. ໃຊ້ຮູບແບບ URL ນີ້ເພື່ອຢືນຢັນຕົວຕົນດ້ວຍ GitLab token:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:77
#, no-wrap
msgid "https://gitlab-ci-token:<AUTHENTICATION_TOKEN>@gitlab.example.com/USER/project.git#master:/container/\n"
msgstr "https://gitlab-ci-token:<AUTHENTICATION_TOKEN>@gitlab.example.com/USER/project.git#master:/container/\n"

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:78
msgid ""
"If you do not specify a git branch, the `master` branch is used by default.  "
"If a `folder` is not specified, the image sources (Dockerfile sources) are "
"expected to be in the root directory of the GitHub or GitLab checkout."
msgstr "ຫາກທ່ານບໍ່ໄດ້ລະບຸ branch ຂອງ git, branch `master` ຈະຖືກນຳໃຊ້ໂດຍເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ. ຫາກບໍ່ໄດ້ລະບຸ `folder`, ແຫຼ່ງຂໍ້ມູນອິເມຈ (Dockerfile sources) ແມ່ນຄາດວ່າຈະຢູ່ໃນໄດເຣັກທໍຣີຮາກ (root directory) ຂອງການ checkout GitHub ຫຼື GitLab."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:79
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:221
msgid ""
"Select an `Activation Key`.  Activation keys ensure that images using a "
"profile are assigned to the correct channel and packages."
msgstr "ເລືອກ `Activation Key`. Activation keys ຈະຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າອິເມຈທີ່ໃຊ້ໂປຣໄຟລ໌ຈະຖືກກຳນົດໃຫ້ກັບຊ່ອງທາງ ແລະ ແພັກເກັດທີ່ຖືກຕ້ອງ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:80
msgid ""
"When you associate an activation key with an image profile you are ensuring "
"any image using the profile uses the correct software channel and any "
"packages in the channel."
msgstr "ເມື່ອທ່ານເຊື່ອມໂຍງ activation key ກັບໂປຣໄຟລ໌ອິເມຈ, ທ່ານກຳລັງເຮັດໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າອິເມຈໃດໆທີ່ໃຊ້ໂປຣໄຟລ໌ນັ້ນຈະໃຊ້ຊ່ອງທາງຊອບແວທີ່ຖືກຕ້ອງ ແລະ ແພັກເກັດຕ່າງໆໃນຊ່ອງທາງນັ້ນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:81
msgid "Click the btn:[Create] button."
msgstr "ຄລິກປຸ່ມ btn:[Create]."

#. type: Title ====
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:82
#, no-wrap
msgid "Example Dockerfile sources"
msgstr "ຕົວຢ່າງ Dockerfile sources"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:83
msgid ""
"An Image Profile that can be reused is published at "
"https://github.com/SUSE/manager-build-profiles."
msgstr "ໂປຣໄຟລ໌ອິເມຈທີ່ສາມາດນຳມາໃຊ້ໃໝ່ໄດ້ຖືກເຜີຍແຜ່ຢູ່ທີ່ https://github.com/SUSE/manager-build-profiles."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:84
msgid ""
"The `ARG` parameters ensure that the built image is associated with the "
"desired repository served by {productname}.  The `ARG` parameters also allow "
"you to build image versions of {sles} which may differ from the version of "
"{sles} used by the build host itself."
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:85
msgid ""
"For example: The `ARG repo` parameter and the `echo` command pointing to the "
"repository file, creates and then injects the correct path into the "
"repository file for the desired channel version."
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:86
msgid ""
"The repository is determined by the activation key that you assigned to your "
"image profile."
msgstr "ຄັງເກັບຖືກກຳນົດໂດຍ activation key ທີ່ທ່ານໄດ້ມອບໝາຍໃຫ້ກັບໂປຣໄຟລ໌ອິເມຈຂອງທ່ານ."

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:87
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"FROM registry.example.com/sles12sp2\n"
"MAINTAINER Tux Administrator \"tux@example.com\"\n"
msgstr ""
"FROM registry.example.com/sles12sp2\n"
"MAINTAINER Tux Administrator \"tux@example.com\"\n"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:88
#, no-wrap
msgid "### Begin: These lines are required for use with {productname}\n"
msgstr "### Begin: ແຖວເຫຼົ່ານີ້ແມ່ນຈຳເປັນສຳລັບການໃຊ້ງານກັບ {productname}\n"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:89
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"ARG repo\n"
"ARG cert\n"
msgstr ""
"ARG repo\n"
"ARG cert\n"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:90
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"# Add the correct certificate\n"
"RUN echo \"$cert\" > /etc/pki/trust/anchors/RHN-ORG-TRUSTED-SSL-CERT.pem\n"
msgstr ""
"# ເພີ່ມໃບຢັ້ງຢືນທີ່ຖືກຕ້ອງ\n"
"RUN echo \"$cert\" > /etc/pki/trust/anchors/RHN-ORG-TRUSTED-SSL-CERT.pem\n"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:91
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"# Update certificate trust store\n"
"RUN update-ca-certificates\n"
msgstr ""
"# ອັບເດດ certificate trust store\n"
"RUN update-ca-certificates\n"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:92
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"# Add the repository path to the image\n"
"RUN echo \"$repo\" > /etc/zypp/repos.d/susemanager:dockerbuild.repo\n"
msgstr ""
"# ເພີ່ມເສັ້ນທາງຄັງເກັບເຂົ້າໃນອິເມຈ\n"
"RUN echo \"$repo\" > /etc/zypp/repos.d/susemanager:dockerbuild.repo\n"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:93
#, no-wrap
msgid "### End: These lines are required for use with {productname}\n"
msgstr "### End: ແຖວເຫຼົ່ານີ້ແມ່ນຈຳເປັນສຳລັບການໃຊ້ງານກັບ {productname}\n"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:94
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"# Add the package script\n"
"ADD add_packages.sh /root/add_packages.sh\n"
msgstr ""
"# ເພີ່ມສະຄຣິບແພັກເກັດ\n"
"ADD add_packages.sh /root/add_packages.sh\n"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:95
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"# Run the package script\n"
"RUN /root/add_packages.sh\n"
msgstr ""
"# ດຳເນີນການສະຄຣິບແພັກເກັດ\n"
"RUN /root/add_packages.sh\n"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:96
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"# After building remove the repository path from image\n"
"RUN rm -f /etc/zypp/repos.d/susemanager:dockerbuild.repo\n"
msgstr ""
"# ຫຼັງຈາກສ້າງສຳເລັດ ໃຫ້ຖອນເສັ້ນທາງຄັງເກັບອອກຈາກອິເມຈ\n"
"RUN rm -f /etc/zypp/repos.d/susemanager:dockerbuild.repo\n"

#. type: Title ====
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:97
#, no-wrap
msgid "Using custom info key-value pairs as Docker `buildargs`"
msgstr "ການໃຊ້ຄູ່ຄີ-ຄ່າ (key-value pairs) ຂອງຂໍ້ມູນກຳນົດເອງເປັນ Docker `buildargs`"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:98
msgid ""
"You can assign custom info key-value pairs to attach information to the "
"image profiles.  Additionally, these key-value pairs are passed to the "
"Docker build command as `buildargs`."
msgstr "ທ່ານສາມາດກຳນົດຄູ່ຄີ-ຄ່າຂອງຂໍ້ມູນກຳນົດເອງເພື່ອແນບຂໍ້ມູນໃສ່ກັບໂປຣໄຟລ໌ອິເມຈ. ນອກຈາກນັ້ນ, ຄູ່ຄີ-ຄ່າເຫຼົ່ານີ້ຈະຖືກສົ່ງໄປຫາຄຳສັ່ງ Docker build ໃນຖານະ `buildargs`."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:99
msgid ""
"For more information about the available custom info keys and creating "
"additional ones, see xref:reference:systems/custom-system-info.adoc[]."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບຄີຂໍ້ມູນກຳນົດເອງທີ່ມີໃຫ້ໃຊ້ ແລະ ການສ້າງຄີເພີ່ມເຕີມ, ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງ xref:reference:systems/custom-system-info.adoc[]."

#. type: Title ===
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:100
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:248
#, no-wrap
msgid "Build an image"
msgstr "ສ້າງອິເມຈ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:101
msgid ""
"There are two ways to build an image.  The first way is to create it from "
"scratch.  To do that, select menu:Images[Build] from the left navigation "
"bar, or click the build icon in the menu:Images[Profiles] list and follow "
"the procedure."
msgstr "ມີສອງວິທີໃນການສ້າງອິເມຈ. ວິທີທຳອິດຄືການສ້າງຂຶ້ນມາໃໝ່ທັງໝົດ. ເພື່ອເຮັດສິ່ງນັ້ນ, ໃຫ້ເລືອກ menu:Images[Build] ຈາກແຖບເມນູດ້ານຊ້າຍ, ຫຼື ກົດໄອຄອນການສ້າງໃນລາຍການ menu:Images[Profiles] ແລະ ປະຕິບັດຕາມຂັ້ນຕອນ."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:102
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:250
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Building an image"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການສ້າງອິເມຈ"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:103
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:251
msgid "Select menu:Images[Build]."
msgstr "ເລືອກເມນູ: Images[Build]."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:104
msgid ""
"Add a different tag name if you want a version other than the default "
"`latest` (only relevant to containers)."
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:105
msgid "Select `Build Profile` and `Build Host`."
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:106
msgid ""
"Notice the `Profile Summary` to the right of the build fields.  When you "
"have selected a build profile, detailed information about the selected "
"profile is displayed in this area."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:107
msgid "To schedule a build click the btn:[Build] button."
msgstr "ເພື່ອ ກຳນົດເວລາການສ້າງ ໃຫ້ຄລິກປຸ່ມ btn:[Build]."

#. type: Title ===
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:108
#, no-wrap
msgid "Import an image"
msgstr "ນຳເຂົ້າອິເມຈ"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:109
msgid ""
"The second way to get an image is to import and inspect arbitrary images.  "
"To do that, select menu:Images[Image List] from the left navigation bar.  "
"Complete the text boxes of the `Import` dialog.  When it has processed, the "
"imported image is listed on the `Image List` page."
msgstr ""

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:110
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Importing an image"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການນຳເຂົ້າອິເມຈ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:111
msgid ""
"From menu:Images[Image list] click btn:[Import] to open the `Import Image` "
"dialog."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:112
msgid "In the `Import Image` dialog complete these fields:"
msgstr ""

#. type: Labeled list
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:113
#, no-wrap
msgid "Image store"
msgstr "ບ່ອນເກັບອິເມຈ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:114
msgid "The registry from where the image is pulled for inspection."
msgstr "registry ທີ່ອິເມຈຖືກດຶງ (pull) ມາເພື່ອກວດສອບ."

#. type: Labeled list
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:115
#, no-wrap
msgid "Image name"
msgstr "ຊື່ອິເມຈ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:116
msgid "The name of the image in the registry."
msgstr "ຊື່ຂອງອິເມຈໃນ registry."

#. type: Labeled list
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:117
#, no-wrap
msgid "Image version"
msgstr "ເວີຊັນອິເມຈ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:118
msgid "The version of the image in the registry."
msgstr "ເວີຊັນຂອງອິເມຈໃນ registry."

#. type: Labeled list
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:119
#, no-wrap
msgid "Build host"
msgstr "Build host"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:120
msgid "The build host that pulls and inspects the image."
msgstr "build host ທີ່ດຶງ ແລະ ກວດສອບອິເມຈ."

#. type: Labeled list
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:121
#, no-wrap
msgid "Activation key"
msgstr "Activation key"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:122
msgid ""
"The activation key that provides the path to the software channel that the "
"image is inspected with."
msgstr "activation key ທີ່ໃຫ້ເສັ້ນທາງໄປຫາຊ່ອງທາງຊອບແວທີ່ອິເມຈຖືກກວດສອບນຳ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:123
msgid "For confirmation, click btn:[Import]."
msgstr "ເພື່ອຢືນຢັນ, ໃຫ້ຄລິກ btn:[Import]."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:124
msgid ""
"The entry for the image is created in the database, and an `Inspect Image` "
"action on {productname} is scheduled."
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:125
msgid ""
"When it has been processed, you can find the imported image in the `Image "
"List`.  It has a different icon in the `Build` column, to indicate that the "
"image is imported.  The status icon for the imported image can also be seen "
"on the `Overview` tab for the image."
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ====
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:127
#, no-wrap
msgid "General issues"
msgstr "ບັນຫາທົ່ວໄປ"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:128
msgid "These are some known problems when working with images:"
msgstr "ນີ້ແມ່ນບາງບັນຫາທີ່ພົບເລື້ອຍໃນເວລາເຮັດວຽກກັບອິເມຈ:"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:129
msgid ""
"HTTPS certificates to access the registry or the git repositories should be "
"deployed to the client by a custom state file."
msgstr "ໃບຢັ້ງຢືນ HTTPS ເພື່ອເຂົ້າເຖິງ registry ຫຼື git repositories ຄວນຖືກນຳໃຊ້ (deploy) ໄປຍັງລູກຂ່າຍໂດຍໃຊ້ໄຟລ໌ສະຖານະກຳນົດເອງ (custom state file)."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:130
msgid "SSH git access using Docker is currently unsupported."
msgstr "ການເຂົ້າເຖິງ SSH git ໂດຍໃຊ້ Docker ແມ່ນຍັງບໍ່ຮອງຮັບໃນປັດຈຸບັນ."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:131
#, no-wrap
msgid "OS images"
msgstr "OS images"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:132
msgid ""
"OS Images are built by the Kiwi build system.  The output image is "
"customizable and can be PXE, QCOW2, LiveCD, or other types of images."
msgstr "OS Images ຖືກສ້າງຂຶ້ນໂດຍລະບົບການສ້າງ Kiwi. ອິເມຈທີ່ໄດ້ສາມາດກຳນົດເອງໄດ້ ແລະ ສາມາດເປັນ PXE, QCOW2, LiveCD, ຫຼື ອິເມຈປະເພດອື່ນໆ."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:133
msgid ""
"For more information about the Kiwi build system, see the "
"https://osinside.github.io/kiwi/[Kiwi documentation]."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບລະບົບການສ້າງ Kiwi, ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງ [Kiwi documentation] ຢູ່ທີ່ https://osinside.github.io/kiwi/."

#. SLE15 images support is not yet released for MLM4, but is part of MLM4.0.4 as tech preview
#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:135
msgid ""
"The Kiwi image building feature is available for {salt} clients running "
"{sles}{nbsp}15 and {sles}{nbsp}12."
msgstr ""

#. From {sles}{nbsp}15, `kiwi-ng` is used instead of the legacy Kiwi.
#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:136
msgid ""
"Kiwi image configuration files and configuration scripts must be accessible "
"in one of these locations:"
msgstr "ໄຟລ໌ກຳນົດຄ່າ Kiwi ອິເມຈ ແລະ ສະຄຣິບການກຳນົດຄ່າຕ້ອງສາມາດເຂົ້າເຖິງໄດ້ໃນຕຳແໜ່ງໃດໜຶ່ງດັ່ງນີ້:"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:137
msgid "Git repository"
msgstr "Git repository"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:138
msgid "HTTP or HTTPS hosted tar archive"
msgstr "tar archive ທີ່ໂຮສດ້ວຍ HTTP ຫຼື HTTPS"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:139
msgid "Local directory on the build host"
msgstr "ໄດເຣັກທໍຣີພາຍໃນເຄື່ອງໃນ build host"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:140
msgid ""
"For an example of a complete Kiwi repository served by git, see "
"https://github.com/SUSE/manager-build-profiles/tree/master/OSImage."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຕົວຢ່າງຂອງ Kiwi repository ທີ່ສົມບູນເຊິ່ງໃຫ້ບໍລິການໂດຍ git, ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງ https://github.com/SUSE/manager-build-profiles/tree/master/OSImage."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:141
msgid ""
"You need at least 1{nbsp}GB of RAM available for hosts running OS Images "
"built with Kiwi.  Disk space depends on the actual size of the image.  For "
"more information, see the documentation of the underlying system."
msgstr "ທ່ານຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງມີ RAM ຢ່າງໜ້ອຍ 1{nbsp}GB ສຳລັບໂຮສທີ່ໃຊ້ OS Images ທີ່ສ້າງດ້ວຍ Kiwi. ພື້ນທີ່ວ່າງໃນດິດແມ່ນຂຶ້ນກັບຂະໜາດຕົວຈິງຂອງອິເມຈ. ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ, ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງເອກະສານຂອງລະບົບທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງ."

#. type: Title ===
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:142
#, no-wrap
msgid "Accessing Git repositories via an HTTP/HTTPS proxy when building images"
msgstr "ການເຂົ້າເຖິງຄັງເກັບ Git ຜ່ານພຣັອກຊີ HTTP/HTTPS ໃນເວລາບິວດ໌ຮູບພາບ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:143
msgid ""
"When a build host needs to fetch sources from a git repository that is only "
"reachable through an HTTP/HTTPS proxy, you may see git timeouts during the "
"build because the git client invoked by the {salt} state does not always "
"pick up system-wide proxy settings (for example `/etc/sysconfig/proxy` or "
"environment variables)."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:144
msgid ""
"To make git use the proxy for non-interactive builds create `/etc/gitconfig` "
"with an http.proxy entry:"
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:145
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"# /etc/gitconfig\n"
"[http]\n"
"    proxy = http://proxy.example.com:3128\n"
"# or for HTTPS\n"
"[http]\n"
"    proxy = https://proxy.example.com:3128\n"
msgstr ""
"# /etc/gitconfig\n"
"[http]\n"
"    proxy = http://proxy.example.com:3128\n"
"# ຫຼື ສຳລັບ HTTPS\n"
"[http]\n"
"    proxy = https://proxy.example.com:3128\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:146
msgid ""
"If the proxy requires authentication, prefer a credential helper or use a "
"credential store instead of embedding credentials in the URL."
msgstr "ຫາກພຣັອກຊີຕ້ອງການການຢືນຢັນຕົວຕົນ, ຄວນໃຊ້ຕົວຊ່ວຍຈັດການຂໍ້ມູນປະຈຳຕົວ (credential helper) ຫຼື ໃຊ້ບ່ອນເກັບຂໍ້ມູນປະຈຳຕົວ ແທນການຝັງຂໍ້ມູນປະຈຳຕົວໄວ້ໃນ URL."

#. type: Title ====
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:147
#, no-wrap
msgid "Automating with {salt}"
msgstr "ການເຮັດວຽກແບບອັດຕະໂນມັດດ້ວຍ {salt}"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:148
msgid ""
"You can manage `/etc/gitconfig` on build hosts through Configuration "
"Management, the same way as on any other managed system.  Create a {salt} "
"state file and assign it to the build host via a config channel, then apply "
"a highstate from the {productname} UI."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:149
msgid ""
"If you want to source the proxy address from a System Custom Info field, use "
"the `custom_info:` pillar prefix:"
msgstr "ຫາກເຈົ້າຕ້ອງການດຶງທີ່ຢູ່ພຣັອກຊີຈາກຟິວຂໍ້ມູນລະບົບແບບກຳນົດເອງ (System Custom Info), ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ຄຳນຳໜ້າ pillar `custom_info:`:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:150
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"/etc/gitconfig:\n"
"  file.managed:\n"
"    - user: root\n"
"    - group: root\n"
"    - mode: '0644'\n"
"    - contents: |\n"
"        [http]\n"
"            proxy = {{ "
"salt['pillar.get']('custom_info:build_server:git_proxy', "
"'http://proxy.example.com:3128') }}\n"
msgstr ""
"/etc/gitconfig:\n"
"  file.managed:\n"
"    - user: root\n"
"    - group: root\n"
"    - mode: '0644'\n"
"    - contents: |\n"
"        [http]\n"
"            proxy = {{ salt['pillar.get']('custom_info:build_server:git_proxy', 'http://proxy.example.com:3128') }}\n"

#. type: Title ===
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:151
#, no-wrap
msgid "Container-based Kiwi image build support"
msgstr "ການຮອງຮັບການສ້າງອິເມຈ Kiwi ແບບອີງຕາມຄອນເທນເນີ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:152
msgid ""
"{productname} introduces a container-based Kiwi image build system, in "
"addition to the existing legacy Kiwi and KiwiNG tools."
msgstr "{productname} ນຳສະເໜີລະບົບການສ້າງອິເມຈ Kiwi ແບບອີງຕາມຄອນເທນເນີ, ເພີ່ມເຕີມຈາກເຄື່ອງມື legacy Kiwi ແລະ KiwiNG ທີ່ມີຢູ່."

#. type: Title ====
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:153
#, no-wrap
msgid "Configuration and overrides "
msgstr "ການຕັ້ງຄ່າ ແລະ ການປ່ຽນແທນຄ່າ (Overrides) "

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:154
msgid ""
"Administrators can override the default behavior using the following pillar "
"or custom values.  To configure these, navigate to menu:[Systems>Custom "
"System Info] in the {webui} and create the necessary keys."
msgstr "ຜູ້ດູແລລະບົບສາມາດປ່ຽນແທນຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນໄດ້ໂດຍໃຊ້ຄ່າ pillar ຫຼື ຄ່າກຳນົດເອງຕໍ່ໄປນີ້. ເພື່ອຕັ້ງຄ່າເຫຼົ່ານີ້, ໃຫ້ໄປທີ່ menu:[Systems>Custom System Info] ໃນ {webui} ແລະ ສ້າງຄີທີ່ຈຳເປັນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:155
msgid ""
"The build system used depends on the underlying OS or specific pillar "
"values:"
msgstr "ລະບົບການສ້າງທີ່ໃຊ້ແມ່ນຂຶ້ນກັບລະບົບປະຕິບັດການ ຫຼື ຄ່າ pillar ທີ່ລະບຸ:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:156
msgid "for SLE 11 / SLE 12: legacy Kiwi v7"
msgstr "ສຳລັບ SLE 11 / SLE 12: ໃຊ້ legacy Kiwi v7"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:157
msgid "for SLE 15: KiwiNG (v9 and containerized Kiwi 10)"
msgstr "ສຳລັບ SLE 15: ໃຊ້ KiwiNG (v9 ແລະ containerized Kiwi 10)"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:158
msgid ""
"Administrators can override the default behavior using the following pillar "
"or custom values:"
msgstr "ຜູ້ດູແລລະບົບສາມາດປ່ຽນແທນຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນໄດ້ໂດຍໃຊ້ຄ່າ pillar ຫຼື ຄ່າກຳນົດເອງຕໍ່ໄປນີ້:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:159
msgid "`use_kiwi_ng`: force the use of Kiwi 9,"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:160
msgid ""
"`use_kiwi_container`: force the use of containerized Kiwi 10.  To enable "
"this, set the value to `1`."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:161
msgid ""
"`use_bundle_build`: upload additional KIWI bundle build artifacts (like "
"`.install.tar` which contains PXE files, and `.raw.xz`) to the server.  To "
"enable this, set the value to `true`."
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ====
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:162
#, no-wrap
msgid "Version-specific configurations"
msgstr "ການຕັ້ງຄ່າສະເພາະເວີຊັນ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:163
msgid ""
"When using a containerized build host for SUSE Linux Enterprise 15 profiles, "
"specific configurations are required because SLES 15 profiles rely on Kiwi "
"9, while the default container behavior uses Kiwi 10."
msgstr "ເມື່ອໃຊ້ containerized build host ສຳລັບໂປຣໄຟລ໌ SUSE Linux Enterprise 15, ຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງມີການຕັ້ງຄ່າສະເພາະ ເພາະວ່າໂປຣໄຟລ໌ SLES 15 ອີງຕາມ Kiwi 9, ໃນຂະນະທີ່ພຶດຕິກຳຄອນເທນເນີເລີ່ມຕົ້ນໃຊ້ Kiwi 10."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:164
msgid ""
"To ensure the correct version is used for SLES 15 profiles, you must define "
"the `kiwi_image` custom info key with the following value:"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:165
msgid "`Key`: kiwi_image"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:166
msgid "`Value`: `registry.suse.com/bci/kiwi:9`"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:167
msgid ""
"If this key is not set, the system defaults to the latest version (e.g., "
"`registry.suse.com/bci/kiwi:10.2`), which may result in build issues for "
"SLES 15 profiles."
msgstr ""

#.  FIXME, bsc#1245987:
#.  Discussing Container-Based KIWI Image Build Support here?
#.  Perhaps 2.'docker' might be 2, but the container variant might be different?
#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:169
msgid ""
"To build all kinds of images with {productname}, create and configure a "
"build host.  OS Image build hosts are {salt} clients running on "
"{sles}{nbsp}15 (SP2 or later) or {sles}{nbsp}12 (SP4 or later)."
msgstr "ເພື່ອສ້າງອິເມຈທຸກປະເພດດ້ວຍ {productname}, ໃຫ້ສ້າງ ແລະ ກຳນົດຄ່າ build host. build host ຂອງ OS Image ແມ່ນລູກຂ່າຍ {salt} ທີ່ໃຊ້ {sles}{nbsp}15 (SP2 ຫຼື ຫຼັງຈາກນັ້ນ) ຫຼື {sles}{nbsp}12 (SP4 ຫຼື ຫຼັງຈາກນັ້ນ)."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:170
msgid ""
"This procedure guides you through the initial configuration for a build "
"host."
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນນີ້ຈະແນະນຳທ່ານຜ່ານການກຳນົດຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນສຳລັບ build host."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:173
msgid ""
"Cross-architecture builds are not possible.  For example, you must build "
"Raspberry PI {sles}{nbsp}15 SP3 image on a Raspberry PI (aarch64 "
"architecture) build host running {sles}{nbsp}15 SP3."
msgstr "ການສ້າງແບບຂ້າມສະຖາປັດຕະຍະກຳແມ່ນເປັນໄປບໍ່ໄດ້. ຕົວຢ່າງ: ທ່ານຕ້ອງສ້າງອິເມຈ Raspberry PI {sles}{nbsp}15 SP3 ໃນ build host ຂອງ Raspberry PI (ສະຖາປັດຕະຍະກຳ aarch64) ທີ່ໃຊ້ {sles}{nbsp}15 SP3."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:174
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Configure the build host in the {productname} {webui}"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ກຳນົດຄ່າ build host ໃນ {productname} {webui}"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:175
msgid ""
"Select a client to be designated as a build host from the "
"menu:Systems[Overview] page."
msgstr "ເລືອກລູກຂ່າຍທີ່ຈະກຳນົດໃຫ້ເປັນ build host ຈາກໜ້າ menu:Systems[Overview]."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:176
msgid ""
"Navigate to the menu:System Details[Properties] tab, and check the `Add-on "
"System Type` > `OS Image Build Host` box."
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:177
msgid "Confirm with btn:[Update Properties]."
msgstr "ຢືນຢັນດ້ວຍ btn:[Update Properties]."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:178
msgid ""
"Navigate to menu:System Details[Software > Software Channels], and enable "
"the required software channels depending on the build host version."
msgstr "ໄປທີ່ເມນູ: System Details[Software > Software Channels], ແລະ ເປີດໃຊ້ຊ່ອງທາງຊອບແວທີ່ຈຳເປັນ ຂຶ້ນກັບເວີຊັນຂອງ build host."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:179
msgid ""
"{sles}{nbsp}12 build hosts require {productname} Client tools "
"(`SLE-Manager-Tools12-Pool` and `SLE-Manager-Tools12-Updates`)."
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:180
msgid ""
"{sles}{nbsp}15 build hosts require {sles} modules "
"`SLE-Module-DevTools15-SP4-Pool` and `SLE-Module-DevTools15-SP4-Updates`."
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:181
msgid "Schedule and click btn:[Confirm]."
msgstr "ກຳນົດເວລາ ແລະ ຄລິກ btn:[Confirm]."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:182
msgid ""
"Install Kiwi and all required packages by applying `Highstate`.  From the "
"system details page select menu:States[Highstate] and click btn:[Apply "
"Highstate].  Alternatively, apply Highstate from the {productname} Server "
"command line:"
msgstr "ຕິດຕັ້ງ Kiwi ແລະ ແພັກເກັດທີ່ຈຳເປັນທັງໝົດໂດຍການນຳໃຊ້ `Highstate`. ຈາກໜ້າລາຍລະອຽດລະບົບ ເລືອກເມນູ: States[Highstate] ແລະ ຄລິກ btn:[Apply Highstate]. ຫຼືອີກທາງເລືອກໜຶ່ງ, ໃຫ້ນຳໃຊ້ Highstate ຈາກ command line ຂອງ {productname} Server:"

#. type: Title ====
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:184
#, no-wrap
msgid "{productname} web server public certificate RPM"
msgstr "{productname} ໃບຢັ້ງຢືນສາທາລະນະເວັບເຊີບເວີ RPM"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:185
msgid ""
"Build host provisioning copies the {productname} certificate RPM to the "
"build host.  This certificate is used for accessing repositories provided by "
"{productname}."
msgstr "ການຈັດກຽມ build host ຈະຄັດລອກໃບຢັ້ງຢືນ RPM ຂອງ {productname} ໄປຍັງ build host. ໃບຢັ້ງຢືນນີ້ຖືກໃຊ້ເພື່ອເຂົ້າເຖິງຄັງເກັບທີ່ສະໜອງໃຫ້ໂດຍ {productname}."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:186
msgid ""
"The certificate is packaged in RPM by the "
"`mgr-package-rpm-certificate-osimage` package script.  The package script is "
"called automatically during a new {productname} installation."
msgstr "ໃບຢັ້ງຢືນຖືກບັນຈຸໃນ RPM ໂດຍສະຄຣິບແພັກເກັດ `mgr-package-rpm-certificate-osimage`. ສະຄຣິບແພັກເກັດຈະຖືກຮຽກໃຊ້ໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດໃນລະຫວ່າງການຕິດຕັ້ງ {productname} ໃໝ່."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:187
msgid ""
"When you upgrade the `spacewalk-certs-tools` package, the upgrade scenario "
"calls the package script using the default values.  However if the "
"certificate path was changed or unavailable, call the package script "
"manually using `--ca-cert-full-path <path_to_certificate>` after the upgrade "
"procedure has finished."
msgstr "ເມື່ອທ່ານອັບເກຣດແພັກເກັດ `spacewalk-certs-tools`, ຂະບວນການອັບເກຣດຈະຮຽກໃຊ້ສະຄຣິບແພັກເກັດໂດຍໃຊ້ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ. ແນວໃດກໍຕາມ, ຫາກເສັ້ນທາງໃບຢັ້ງຢືນຖືກປ່ຽນແປງ ຫຼື ບໍ່ມີໃຫ້ໃຊ້, ໃຫ້ຮຽກໃຊ້ສະຄຣິບແພັກເກັດດ້ວຍຕົນເອງໂດຍໃຊ້ `--ca-cert-full-path <path_to_certificate>` ຫຼັງຈາກຂັ້ນຕອນການອັບເກຣດສຳເລັດແລ້ວ."

#. type: Title ====
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:188
#, no-wrap
msgid "Package script call example"
msgstr "ຕົວຢ່າງການຮຽກໃຊ້ສະຄຣິບແພັກເກັດ"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:189
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"/usr/sbin/mgr-package-rpm-certificate-osimage --ca-cert-full-path "
"/root/ssl-build/RHN-ORG-TRUSTED-SSL-CERT\n"
msgstr "/usr/sbin/mgr-package-rpm-certificate-osimage --ca-cert-full-path /root/ssl-build/RHN-ORG-TRUSTED-SSL-CERT\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:190
msgid ""
"The RPM package with the certificate is stored in a salt-accessible "
"directory such as:"
msgstr "ແພັກເກັດ RPM ທີ່ມີໃບຢັ້ງຢືນຖືກເກັບໄວ້ໃນໄດເຣັກທໍຣີທີ່ salt ເຂົ້າເຖິງໄດ້ ເຊັ່ນ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:191
#, no-wrap
msgid "/usr/share/susemanager/salt/images/rhn-org-trusted-ssl-cert-osimage-1.0-1.noarch.rpm\n"
msgstr "/usr/share/susemanager/salt/images/rhn-org-trusted-ssl-cert-osimage-1.0-1.noarch.rpm\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:192
msgid ""
"The RPM package with the certificate is provided in the local build host "
"repository:"
msgstr "ແພັກເກັດ RPM ທີ່ມີໃບຢັ້ງຢືນມີໃຫ້ໃນຄັງເກັບ build host ພາຍໃນເຄື່ອງ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:193
#, no-wrap
msgid "/var/lib/Kiwi/repo\n"
msgstr "/var/lib/Kiwi/repo\n"

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:194
msgid ""
"Specify the RPM package with the {productname} SSL certificate in the build "
"source, and make sure your Kiwi configuration contains "
"`rhn-org-trusted-ssl-cert-osimage` as a required package in the `bootstrap` "
"section."
msgstr ""

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:195
#, no-wrap
msgid "config.xml"
msgstr "config.xml"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:196
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"...\n"
"  <packages type=\"bootstrap\">\n"
"    ...\n"
"    <package name=\"rhn-org-trusted-ssl-cert-osimage\" "
"bootinclude=\"true\"/>\n"
"  </packages>\n"
"...\n"
msgstr ""
"...\n"
"  <packages type=\"bootstrap\">\n"
"    ...\n"
"    <package name=\"rhn-org-trusted-ssl-cert-osimage\" bootinclude=\"true\"/>\n"
"  </packages>\n"
"...\n"

#.  FIXME 2024-04-25, ke: continue here compare with container build host
#. type: Title ===
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:197
#, no-wrap
msgid "Create an activation key for OS images"
msgstr "ສ້າງ activation key ສຳລັບ OS images"

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:198
msgid ""
"Create an activation key associated with the channel that your OS Images can "
"use as repositories when building the image."
msgstr "ສ້າງ activation key ທີ່ເຊື່ອມໂຍງກັບຊ່ອງທາງທີ່ OS Images ຂອງທ່ານສາມາດໃຊ້ເປັນຄັງເກັບໄດ້ໃນເວລາສ້າງອິເມຈ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:199
msgid "Activation keys are mandatory for OS Image building."
msgstr "Activation keys ແມ່ນສິ່ງຈຳເປັນສຳລັບການສ້າງ OS Image."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:200
msgid ""
"To build OS Images, you need an activation key that is associated with a "
"channel other than `Default` activation key."
msgstr "ເພື່ອສ້າງ OS Images, ທ່ານຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງມີ activation key ທີ່ເຊື່ອມໂຍງກັບຊ່ອງທາງອື່ນນອກເໜືອຈາກ `Default` activation key."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:202
msgid "In the {webui}, select menu:Systems[Activation Keys]."
msgstr "ໃນ {webui}, ເລືອກເມນູ: Systems[Activation Keys]."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:203
msgid "Click `Create Key`."
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:204
msgid ""
"Enter a `Description`, a `Key` name, and use the drop-down box to select a "
"`Base Channel` to associate with the key."
msgstr ""

#.  For background info about Image Store, see the overview at the beginning of this chapter.
#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:208
msgid ""
"OS Images can require a significant amount of storage space.  By default, "
"the image store is using the `srv-www` volume."
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:209
msgid ""
"Image stores for Kiwi build type, used to build system, virtual, and other "
"images, are not supported yet."
msgstr "ບ່ອນເກັບອິເມຈສຳລັບປະເພດການສ້າງ Kiwi, ທີ່ໃຊ້ເພື່ອສ້າງອິເມຈລະບົບ, ລະບົບສະເືອນ, ແລະ ອິເມຈອື່ນໆ ແມ່ນຍັງບໍ່ຮອງຮັບໃນປັດຈຸບັນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:213
msgid "Manage image profiles using the {webui}."
msgstr "ຈັດການໂປຣໄຟລ໌ອິເມຈໂດຍໃຊ້ {webui}."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:215
msgid ""
"To create an image profile select from menu:Images[Profiles] and click "
"btn:[Create]."
msgstr "ເພື່ອສ້າງໂປຣໄຟລ໌ອິເມຈ ໃຫ້ເລືອກຈາກເມນູ: Images[Profiles] ແລະ ຄລິກ btn:[Create]."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:216
msgid "In the `Label` field, provide a name for the `Image Profile`."
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:217
msgid "Use `Kiwi` as the `Image Type`."
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:218
msgid "Image store is automatically selected."
msgstr "ບ່ອນເກັບອິເມຈຈະຖືກເລືອກໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:219
msgid ""
"Enter a `Config URL` to the directory containing the Kiwi configuration "
"files.  For example, a git URI such as "
"https://github.com/SUSE/manager-build-profiles#master:OSImage/SLE-Micro54.  "
"Other options are a HTTP or HTTPS hosted tar archive or a local directory on "
"the build host.  For more information, see source format options at the end "
"of this section."
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:220
msgid ""
"Enter `Kiwi options` if needed.  If the Kiwi configuration files specify "
"multiple profiles, use `--profile <name>` to select the active one.  For "
"other options, see Kiwi documentation."
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:222
msgid ""
"Associate an activation key with an image profile to ensure the image "
"profile uses the correct software channel, and any packages."
msgstr "ເຊື່ອມໂຍງ activation key ກັບໂປຣໄຟລ໌ອິເມຈເພື່ອໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າໂປຣໄຟລ໌ອິເມຈນັ້ນໃຊ້ຊ່ອງທາງຊອບແວ ແລະ ແພັກເກັດໃດໆທີ່ຖືກຕ້ອງ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:223
msgid "Confirm with the btn:[Create] button."
msgstr "ຢືນຢັນດ້ວຍປຸ່ມ btn:[Create]."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:224
#, no-wrap
msgid "Source Format Options"
msgstr "ຕົວເລືອກຮູບແບບແຫຼ່ງຂໍ້ມູນ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:225
msgid "_git/HTTP(S) URL to the repository_"
msgstr "_git/HTTP(S) URL ໄປຫາຄັງເກັບ (repository)_"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:226
msgid ""
"URL to a public or private git repository containing the sources of the "
"image to be built.  Depending on the layout of the repository the URL can "
"be:"
msgstr "URL ໄປຫາ git repository ແບບສາທາລະນະ ຫຼື ສ່ວນຕົວ ທີ່ປະກອບດ້ວຍແຫຼ່ງຂໍ້ມູນຂອງອິເມຈທີ່ຈະສ້າງ. ຂຶ້ນກັບໂຄງສ້າງຂອງຄັງເກັບ URL ສາມາດເປັນ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:227
#, no-wrap
msgid "https://github.com/SUSE/manager-build-profiles\n"
msgstr "https://github.com/SUSE/manager-build-profiles\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:228
msgid ""
"You can specify a branch after the `#` character in the URL.  In this "
"example, we use the `master` branch:"
msgstr "ທ່ານສາມາດລະບຸ branch ຫຼັງຈາກຕົວອັກສອນ `#` ໃນ URL. ໃນຕົວຢ່າງນີ້, ພວກເຮົາໃຊ້ branch `master`:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:229
#, no-wrap
msgid "https://github.com/SUSE/manager-build-profiles#master\n"
msgstr "https://github.com/SUSE/manager-build-profiles#master\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:230
msgid ""
"You can specify a directory that contains the image sources after the `:` "
"character.  In this example, we use `OSImage/POS_Image-JeOS6`:"
msgstr "ທ່ານສາມາດລະບຸໄດເຣັກທໍຣີທີ່ປະກອບດ້ວຍແຫຼ່ງຂໍ້ມູນອິເມຈຫຼັງຈາກຕົວອັກສອນ `:` . ໃນຕົວຢ່າງນີ້, ພວກເຮົາໃຊ້ `OSImage/POS_Image-JeOS6`:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:231
#, no-wrap
msgid "https://github.com/SUSE/manager-build-profiles#master:OSImage/POS_Image-JeOS6\n"
msgstr "https://github.com/SUSE/manager-build-profiles#master:OSImage/POS_Image-JeOS6\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:232
msgid "_HTTP(S) URL to the tar archive_"
msgstr "_HTTP(S) URL ໄປຫາ tar archive_"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:233
msgid "URL to the tar archive, compressed or uncompressed, hosted on the webserver."
msgstr "URL ໄປຫາ tar archive, ບໍ່ວ່າຈະຖືກບີບອັດ ຫຼື ບໍ່ໄດ້ບີບອັດ, ທີ່ໂຮສຢູ່ເທິງເວັບເຊີບເວີ."

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:234
#, no-wrap
msgid "https://myimagesourceserver.example.org/MyKiwiImage.tar.gz\n"
msgstr "https://myimagesourceserver.example.org/MyKiwiImage.tar.gz\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:235
msgid "_Path to the directory on the build host_"
msgstr "_ເສັ້ນທາງໄປຫາໄດເຣັກທໍຣີໃນ build host_"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:236
msgid ""
"Enter the path to the directory with the Kiwi build system sources.  This "
"directory must be present on the selected build host."
msgstr "ປ້ອນເສັ້ນທາງໄປຫາໄດເຣັກທໍຣີທີ່ມີແຫຼ່ງຂໍ້ມູນລະບົບການສ້າງ Kiwi. ໄດເຣັກທໍຣີນັ້ນຕ້ອງມີຢູ່ໃນ build host ທີ່ເລືອກ."

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:237
#, no-wrap
msgid "/var/lib/Kiwi/MyKiwiImage\n"
msgstr "/var/lib/Kiwi/MyKiwiImage\n"

#. type: Title ====
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:238
#, no-wrap
msgid "Example of Kiwi sources"
msgstr "ຕົວຢ່າງຂອງແຫຼ່ງຂໍ້ມູນ Kiwi"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:239
msgid ""
"Kiwi sources consist at least of `config.xml`.  Usually, `config.sh` and "
"`images.sh` are present as well.  Sources can also contain files to be "
"installed in the final image under the `root` subdirectory."
msgstr "ແຫຼ່ງຂໍ້ມູນ Kiwi ປະກອບມີຢ່າງໜ້ອຍ `config.xml`. ໂດຍປົກກະຕິແລ້ວ, ຈະມີ `config.sh` ແລະ `images.sh` ຢູ່ນຳ. ແຫຼ່ງຂໍ້ມູນຍັງສາມາດບັນຈຸໄຟລ໌ທີ່ຈະຖືກຕິດຕັ້ງໃນອິເມຈ (image) ສຸດທ້າຍພາຍໃຕ້ໄດເຣັກທໍຣີຍ່ອຍ `root`."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:240
msgid ""
"For information about the Kiwi build system, see the "
"https://osinside.github.io/kiwi/[Kiwi documentation]."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນກ່ຽວກັບລະບົບການສ້າງ Kiwi, ເບິ່ງທີ່ https://osinside.github.io/kiwi/[ເອກະສານຂອງ Kiwi]."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:241
msgid ""
"{suse} provides examples of fully functional image sources at the "
"https://github.com/SUSE/manager-build-profiles[SUSE/manager-build-profiles] "
"public GitHub repository."
msgstr "{suse} ໃຫ້ຕົວຢ່າງຂອງແຫຼ່ງຂໍ້ມູນອິເມຈທີ່ເຮັດວຽກໄດ້ຢ່າງສົມບູນຢູ່ທີ່ບ່ອນເກັບຂໍ້ມູນ GitHub ສາທາລະນະ https://github.com/SUSE/manager-build-profiles[SUSE/manager-build-profiles]."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:242
#, no-wrap
msgid "Example of JeOS config.xml"
msgstr "ຕົວຢ່າງຂອງ JeOS config.xml"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:243
#, no-wrap
msgid "<?xml version=\"1.0\" encoding=\"utf-8\"?>\n"
msgstr "<?xml version=\"1.0\" encoding=\"utf-8\"?>\n"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:244
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<image schemaversion=\"6.1\" name=\"POS_Image_JeOS6\">\n"
"    <description type=\"system\">\n"
"        <author>Admin User</author>\n"
"        <contact>noemail@example.com</contact>\n"
"        <specification>SUSE Linux Enterprise 12 SP3 JeOS</specification>\n"
"    </description>\n"
"    <preferences>\n"
"        <version>6.0.0</version>\n"
"        <packagemanager>zypper</packagemanager>\n"
"        <bootsplash-theme>SLE</bootsplash-theme>\n"
"        <bootloader-theme>SLE</bootloader-theme>\n"
msgstr ""
"<image schemaversion=\"6.1\" name=\"POS_Image_JeOS6\">\n"
"    <description type=\"system\">\n"
"        <author>Admin User</author>\n"
"        <contact>noemail@example.com</contact>\n"
"        <specification>SUSE Linux Enterprise 12 SP3 JeOS</specification>\n"
"    </description>\n"
"    <preferences>\n"
"        <version>6.0.0</version>\n"
"        <packagemanager>zypper</packagemanager>\n"
"        <bootsplash-theme>SLE</bootsplash-theme>\n"
"        <bootloader-theme>SLE</bootloader-theme>\n"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:245
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"        <locale>en_US</locale>\n"
"        <keytable>us.map.gz</keytable>\n"
"        <timezone>Europe/Berlin</timezone>\n"
"        <hwclock>utc</hwclock>\n"
msgstr ""
"        <locale>en_US</locale>\n"
"        <keytable>us.map.gz</keytable>\n"
"        <timezone>Europe/Berlin</timezone>\n"
"        <hwclock>utc</hwclock>\n"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:246
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"        <rpm-excludedocs>true</rpm-excludedocs>\n"
"        <type boot=\"saltboot/suse-SLES12\" bootloader=\"grub2\" "
"checkprebuilt=\"true\" compressed=\"false\" filesystem=\"ext3\" "
"fsmountoptions=\"acl\" fsnocheck=\"true\" image=\"pxe\" "
"kernelcmdline=\"quiet\"></type>\n"
"    </preferences>\n"
"    <!--    CUSTOM REPOSITORY\n"
"    <repository type=\"rpm-dir\">\n"
"      <source path=\"this://repo\"/>\n"
"    </repository>\n"
"    -->\n"
"    <packages type=\"image\">\n"
"        <package name=\"patterns-sles-Minimal\"/>\n"
"        <package name=\"aaa_base-extras\"/> <!-- wouldn't be SUSE without "
"that ;-) -->\n"
"        <package name=\"kernel-default\"/>\n"
"        <package name=\"venv-salt-minion\"/>\n"
"        ...\n"
"    </packages>\n"
"    <packages type=\"bootstrap\">\n"
"        ...\n"
"        <package name=\"sles-release\"/>\n"
"        <!-- this certificate package is required to access {productname} "
"repositories\n"
"             and is provided by {productname} automatically -->\n"
"        <package name=\"rhn-org-trusted-ssl-cert-osimage\" "
"bootinclude=\"true\"/>\n"
msgstr ""
"        <rpm-excludedocs>true</rpm-excludedocs>\n"
"        <type boot=\"saltboot/suse-SLES12\" bootloader=\"grub2\" checkprebuilt=\"true\" compressed=\"false\" filesystem=\"ext3\" fsmountoptions=\"acl\" fsnocheck=\"true\" image=\"pxe\" kernelcmdline=\"quiet\"></type>\n"
"    </preferences>\n"
"    <!--    CUSTOM REPOSITORY\n"
"    <repository type=\"rpm-dir\">\n"
"      <source path=\"this://repo\"/>\n"
"    </repository>\n"
"    -->\n"
"    <packages type=\"image\">\n"
"        <package name=\"patterns-sles-Minimal\"/>\n"
"        <package name=\"aaa_base-extras\"/> <!-- ຈະບໍ່ແມ່ນ SUSE ເລີຍຖ້າບໍ່ມີອັນນີ້ ;-) -->\n"
"        <package name=\"kernel-default\"/>\n"
"        <package name=\"venv-salt-minion\"/>\n"
"        ...\n"
"    </packages>\n"
"    <packages type=\"bootstrap\">\n"
"        ...\n"
"        <package name=\"sles-release\"/>\n"
"        <!-- ແພັກເກດໃບຮັບຮອງນີ້ຈຳເປັນສຳລັບການເຂົ້າເຖິງບ່ອນເກັບຂໍ້ມູນຂອງ {productname}\n"
"             ແລະ ຈະຖືກສະໜອງໃຫ້ໂດຍ {productname} ໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ -->\n"
"        <package name=\"rhn-org-trusted-ssl-cert-osimage\" bootinclude=\"true\"/>\n"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:247
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    </packages>\n"
"    <packages type=\"delete\">\n"
"        <package name=\"mtools\"/>\n"
"        <package name=\"initviocons\"/>\n"
"        ...\n"
"    </packages>\n"
"</image>\n"
msgstr ""
"    </packages>\n"
"    <packages type=\"delete\">\n"
"        <package name=\"mtools\"/>\n"
"        <package name=\"initviocons\"/>\n"
"        ...\n"
"    </packages>\n"
"</image>\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:249
msgid ""
"There are two ways to build or get an image using the {webui}.  Either "
"select menu:Images[Build], or click the build icon in the "
"menu:Images[Profiles] list."
msgstr "ມີສອງວິທີໃນການສ້າງ ຫຼື ຮັບອິເມຈໂດຍໃຊ້ {webui}. ໂດຍການເລືອກທີ່ເມນູ: Images[Build], ຫຼື ຄລິກທີ່ໄອຄອນການສ້າງໃນລາຍການເມນູ: Images[Profiles]."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:252
msgid ""
"Add a different tag name if you want a version other than the default "
"`latest` (applies only to containers)."
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:253
msgid "Select the `Image Profile` and a `Build Host`."
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:254
msgid ""
"A `Profile Summary` is displayed to the right of the build fields.  When you "
"have selected a build profile, detailed information about the selected "
"profile is shown here."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:255
msgid "To schedule a build, click the btn:[Build] button."
msgstr "ເພື່ອຕັ້ງເວລາການສ້າງ, ໃຫ້ຄລິກທີ່ປຸ່ມ btn:[Build]."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:256
msgid ""
"The build server cannot run any form of automounter during the image "
"building process.  If applicable, ensure that you do not have your Gnome "
"session running as root.  If an automounter is running, the image build "
"finishes successfully, but the checksum of the image is different and causes "
"a failure."
msgstr "ເຊີເວີການສ້າງບໍ່ສາມາດເປີດໃຊ້ງານລະບົບຕິດຕັ້ງອັດຕະໂນມັດ (automounter) ຮູບແບບໃດໜຶ່ງໃນລະຫວ່າງຂະບວນການສ້າງອິເມຈ. ຖ້າເປັນໄປໄດ້, ໃຫ້ກວດສອບວ່າທ່ານບໍ່ໄດ້ເປີດໃຊ້ງານ Gnome session ໃນຖານະ root. ຫາກມີການເປີດໃຊ້ automounter, ການສ້າງອິເມຈຈະສຳເລັດ ແຕ່ຄ່າ checksum ຂອງອິເມຈຈະແຕກຕ່າງ ແລະ ເຮັດໃຫ້ເກີດຄວາມຜິດພາດ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:257
msgid ""
"After the image is successfully built, the inspection phase begins.  During "
"the inspection phase {susemgr} collects information about the image:"
msgstr "ຫຼັງຈາກສ້າງອິເມຈສຳເລັດແລ້ວ, ຂັ້ນຕອນການກວດສອບຈະເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ. ໃນລະຫວ່າງຂັ້ນຕອນການກວດສອບ {susemgr} ຈະເກັບກຳຂໍ້ມູນກ່ຽວກັບອິເມຈ:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:258
msgid "List of packages installed in the image"
msgstr "ລາຍການແພັກເກດທີ່ຕິດຕັ້ງໃນອິເມຈ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:259
msgid "Checksum of the image"
msgstr "Checksum ຂອງອິເມຈ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:260
msgid "Image type and other image details"
msgstr "ປະເພດຂອງອິເມຈ ແລະ ລາຍລະອຽດອື່ນໆ"

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:261
msgid ""
"If the built image type is `PXE`, a {salt} pillar is also generated.  Image "
"pillars are stored in the database and the {salt} subsystem can access "
"details about the generated image.  Details include where the image files "
"are located and provided, image checksums, information needed for network "
"boot, and more."
msgstr "ຫາກປະເພດອິເມຈທີ່ສ້າງຂຶ້ນແມ່ນ `PXE`, {salt} pillar ກໍຈະຖືກສ້າງຂຶ້ນນຳ. Image pillars ຈະຖືກເກັບໄວ້ໃນຖານຂໍ້ມູນ ແລະ ລະບົບຍ່ອຍຂອງ {salt} ສາມາດເຂົ້າເຖິງລາຍລະອຽດກ່ຽວກັບອິເມຈທີ່ສ້າງຂຶ້ນໄດ້. ລາຍລະອຽດລວມມີບ່ອນທີ່ໄຟລ໌ອິເມຈຖືກເກັບໄວ້, ຄ່າ checksum, ຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ຈຳເປັນສຳລັບການບູດຜ່ານເຄືອຂ່າຍ, ແລະ ອື່ນໆ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:262
msgid "The generated pillar is available to all connected clients."
msgstr "Pillar ທີ່ສ້າງຂຶ້ນຈະສາມາດໃຊ້ງານໄດ້ກັບທຸກ clients ທີ່ເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ຢູ່."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:264
msgid ""
"Building an image requires several dependent steps.  When the build fails, "
"investigating {salt} states results and build log can help identify the "
"source of the failure.  You can carry out these checks when the build fails:"
msgstr "ການສ້າງອິເມຈຕ້ອງໃຊ້ຫຼາຍຂັ້ນຕອນທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງກັນ. ເມື່ອການສ້າງຜິດພາດ, ການກວດສອບຜົນຂອງ {salt} states ແລະ ບັນທຶກການສ້າງ (build log) ສາມາດຊ່ວຍລະບຸສາເຫດຂອງຄວາມຜິດພາດໄດ້. ທ່ານສາມາດດຳເນີນການກວດສອບເຫຼົ່ານີ້ໄດ້ເມື່ອການສ້າງຜິດພາດ:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:265
msgid "The build host can access the build sources"
msgstr "Build host ສາມາດເຂົ້າເຖິງແຫຼ່ງຂໍ້ມູນການສ້າງໄດ້"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:266
msgid ""
"There is enough disk space for the image on both the build host and the "
"{productname} server"
msgstr "ມີພື້ນທີ່ວ່າງໃນດິສກ໌ພຽງພໍສຳລັບອິເມຈ ທັງໃນ build host ແລະ ເຊີເວີ {productname}"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:267
msgid "The activation key has the correct channels associated with it"
msgstr "ລະຫັດການເປີດໃຊ້ງານ (activation key) ມີຊ່ອງທາງ (channels) ທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງຢ່າງຖືກຕ້ອງ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:268
msgid "The build sources used are valid"
msgstr "ແຫຼ່ງຂໍ້ມູນການສ້າງທີ່ໃຊ້ແມ່ນຖືກຕ້ອງ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:269
msgid ""
"The RPM package with the {productname} public certificate is up to date and "
"available at "
"`/usr/share/susemanager/salt/images/rhn-org-trusted-ssl-cert-osimage-1.0-1.noarch.rpm`.  "
"For more on how to refresh a public certificate RPM, see "
"<<at.images.kiwi.buildhost>>."
msgstr "ແພັກເກດ RPM ທີ່ມີໃບຮັບຮອງສາທາລະນະຂອງ {productname} ແມ່ນເປັນເວີຊັນໃໝ່ລ່າສຸດ ແລະ ມີໃຫ້ໃຊ້ງານຢູ່ທີ່ `/usr/share/susemanager/salt/images/rhn-org-trusted-ssl-cert-osimage-1.0-1.noarch.rpm`. ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບວິທີການປັບປຸງໃບຮັບຮອງສາທາລະນະ RPM, ເບິ່ງ <<at.images.kiwi.buildhost>>."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:271
msgid "The section contains some known issues when working with images."
msgstr "ພາກສ່ວນນີ້ປະກອບມີບາງບັນຫາທີ່ພົບເລື້ອຍໃນເວລາເຮັດວຽກກັບອິເມຈ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:272
msgid ""
"HTTPS certificates used to access the HTTP sources or git repositories "
"should be deployed to the client by a custom state file, or configured "
"manually."
msgstr "ໃບຮັບຮອງ HTTPS ທີ່ໃຊ້ໃນການເຂົ້າເຖິງແຫຼ່ງຂໍ້ມູນ HTTP ຫຼື ບ່ອນເກັບຂໍ້ມູນ git ຄວນຖືກຕິດຕັ້ງໄປຍັງ client ໂດຍໃຊ້ໄຟລ໌ custom state, ຫຼື ຕັ້ງຄ່າດ້ວຍຕົນເອງ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:273
msgid "Importing Kiwi-based images is not supported."
msgstr "ບໍ່ຮອງຮັບການນຳເຂົ້າອິເມຈທີ່ອີງຕາມ Kiwi."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:274
#, no-wrap
msgid "List of built images"
msgstr "ລາຍການອິເມຈທີ່ສ້າງແລ້ວ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:275
msgid ""
"To list available built images select menu:Images[Image List].  A list of "
"all images is displayed."
msgstr "ເພື່ອເບິ່ງລາຍການອິເມຈທີ່ມີຢູ່ ໃຫ້ເລືອກເມນູ: Images[Image List]. ລາຍການອິເມຈທັງໝົດຈະຖືກສະແດງອອກມາ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:276
msgid ""
"Displayed data about images includes an image `Name`, its `Version`, "
"`Revision`, and the build `Status`.  You can also see the image update "
"status with a listing of possible patch and package updates that are "
"available for the image."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:277
msgid ""
"For OS Images, the `Name` and `Version` fields originate from Kiwi sources "
"and are updated at the end of successful build.  During building or after "
"failed build these fields show a temporary name based on profile name."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:278
msgid ""
"`Revision` is automatically increased after each successful build. For OS "
"Images, multiple revisions can co-exist in the store."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:279
msgid ""
"For Container Images the store holds only the latest revision.  Information "
"about previous revisions (packages, patches, etc.) are preserved and it is "
"possible to list them with the `Show obsolete` checkbox."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:280
msgid ""
"Clicking the btn:[Details] button on an image provides a detailed view.  The "
"detailed view includes an exact list of relevant patches, list of all "
"packages installed within the image and a build log."
msgstr "ການຄລິກປຸ່ມ btn:[Details] ໃນອິເມຈ ຈະສະແດງລາຍລະອຽດຕ່າງໆ. ເຊິ່ງລວມມີລາຍການແພັດທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງ, ລາຍການແພັກເກດທັງໝົດທີ່ຕິດຕັ້ງໃນອິເມຈ ແລະ ບັນທຶກການສ້າງ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:281
msgid ""
"Clicking the btn:[Delete] button deletes the image from the list.  It also "
"deletes the associated pillar, files from OS Image Store and obsolete "
"revisions."
msgstr "ການຄລິກປຸ່ມ btn:[Delete] ຈະລຶບອິເມຈອອກຈາກລາຍການ. ນອກຈາກນີ້ຍັງລຶບ pillar ທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງ, ໄຟລ໌ຈາກ OS Image Store ແລະ revision ທີ່ເກົ່າແລ້ວ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:282
msgid ""
"The patch and the package list is only available if the inspect state after "
"a build was successful."
msgstr "ລາຍການແພັດ ແລະ ແພັກເກດຈະມີໃຫ້ເບິ່ງກໍຕໍ່ເມື່ອສະຖານະການກວດສອບຫຼັງຈາກການສ້າງສຳເລັດເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/infra-maintenance.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Infrastructure maintenance tasks"
msgstr "ວຽກງານບຳລຸງຮັກສາໂຄງສ້າງພື້ນຖານ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/infra-maintenance.adoc:2
msgid ""
"If you work with scheduled downtime periods, you might find it difficult to "
"remember all the things that you need to do before, during, and after that "
"critical downtime of the {productname} Server.  {productname} Server related "
"systems such as Inter-Server Synchronization Slave Servers or {productname} "
"Proxies are also affected and have to be considered."
msgstr "ຫາກທ່ານເຮັດວຽກກັບຊ່ວງເວລາຢຸດພັກລະບົບ (downtime) ທີ່ໄດ້ວາງແຜນໄວ້, ທ່ານອາດຈະຮູ້ສຶກຍາກໃນການຈື່ທຸກຢ່າງ ທີ່ຕ້ອງເຮັດກ່ອນ, ໃນລະຫວ່າງ ແລະ ຫຼັງຈາກຊ່ວງເວລາ downtime ນັ້ນຂອງເຊີເວີ {productname}. ລະບົບທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງກັບເຊີເວີ {productname} ເຊັ່ນ Inter-Server Synchronization Slave Servers ຫຼື {productname} Proxies ກໍໄດ້ຮັບຜົນກະທົບ ແລະ ຕ້ອງໄດ້ຮັບການພິຈາລະນານຳ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/infra-maintenance.adoc:3
msgid ""
"{suse} recommends you always keep your {productname} infrastructure "
"updated.  That includes servers, proxies, and build hosts.  If you do not "
"keep the {productname} Server updated, you might not be able to update some "
"parts of your environment when you need to."
msgstr "{suse} ແນະນຳໃຫ້ທ່ານອັບເດດໂຄງສ້າງພື້ນຖານ {productname} ໃຫ້ເປັນປັດຈຸບັນສະເໝີ. ເຊິ່ງລວມເຖິງເຊີເວີ, ພຣັອກຊີ (proxies), ແລະ build hosts. ຫາກທ່ານບໍ່ອັບເດດເຊີເວີ {productname}, ທ່ານອາດຈະບໍ່ສາມາດອັບເດດບາງສ່ວນຂອງລະບົບໃນເວລາທີ່ຈຳເປັນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/infra-maintenance.adoc:4
msgid ""
"This section contains a checklist for your downtime period, with links to "
"further information on performing each of the steps."
msgstr "ພາກສ່ວນນີ້ປະກອບມີລາຍການກວດສອບສຳລັບຊ່ວງເວລາ downtime ຂອງທ່ານ, ພ້ອມກັບລິ້ງຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ ໃນການປະຕິບັດແຕ່ລະຂັ້ນຕອນ."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/administration/pages/infra-maintenance.adoc:5
#, no-wrap
msgid "Server"
msgstr "ເຊີເວີ"

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/administration/pages/infra-maintenance.adoc:6
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Server checks"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການກວດສອບເຊີເວີ"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/infra-maintenance.adoc:7
msgid "Apply the latest updates."
msgstr "ນຳໃຊ້ການອັບເດດຫຼ້າສຸດ."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/infra-maintenance.adoc:8
msgid "Upgrade to the latest service pack, if required."
msgstr "ອັບເກຣດເປັນ service pack ຫຼ້າສຸດ, ຫາກຈຳເປັນ."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/infra-maintenance.adoc:9
msgid "Run `podman ps` and check whether all required services are up and running."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/infra-maintenance.adoc:10
msgid "On {sles} {bci-mlm}, you can install updates using a package manager:"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/infra-maintenance.adoc:11
msgid ""
"For information on using {yast}, see "
"{sles-base-os-documentation}/cha-onlineupdate-you.html."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນກ່ຽວກັບການໃຊ້ {yast}, ເບິ່ງ {sles-base-os-documentation}/cha-onlineupdate-you.html."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/infra-maintenance.adoc:12
msgid ""
"For information on using zypper, see "
"{sles-base-os-documentation}/cha-sw-cl.html#sec-zypper."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນກ່ຽວກັບການໃຊ້ zypper, ເບິ່ງ {sles-base-os-documentation}/cha-sw-cl.html#sec-zypper."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/infra-maintenance.adoc:13
msgid ""
"On {sl-micro} {microversion}, you can install updates using the "
"`transactional-update` command.  For information on using "
"`transactional-update`, see "
"https://documentation.suse.com/sle-micro/6.1/html/Micro-transactional-updates/transactional-updates.html."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/infra-maintenance.adoc:14
msgid ""
"By default, several update channels are configured and enabled for the "
"{productname} Server.  New and updated packages become available "
"automatically."
msgstr "ໂດຍຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ, ຫຼາຍຊ່ອງທາງການອັບເດດ (update channels) ຈະຖືກຕັ້ງຄ່າ ແລະ ເປີດໃຊ້ງານໄວ້ສຳລັບ ເຊີເວີ {productname}. ແພັກເກດໃໝ່ ແລະ ແພັກເກດທີ່ອັບເດດແລ້ວຈະມີໃຫ້ໃຊ້ງານໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/infra-maintenance.adoc:15
msgid ""
"To keep {susemgr} up to date, either connect it directly to {scclongform} or "
"use {rmtool} (RMT).  You can use RMT as a local installation source for "
"disconnected environments."
msgstr "ເພື່ອໃຫ້ {susemgr} ເປັນປັດຈຸບັນ, ໃຫ້ເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ໂດຍກົງກັບ {scclongform} ຫຼື ໃຊ້ {rmtool} (RMT). ທ່ານສາມາດໃຊ້ RMT ເປັນແຫຼ່ງຕິດຕັ້ງພາຍໃນສຳລັບສະພາບແວດລ້ອມທີ່ບໍ່ໄດ້ເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ເນັດ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/infra-maintenance.adoc:16
msgid ""
"You can check that the update channels are available on your system with "
"this command:"
msgstr "ທ່ານສາມາດກວດສອບໄດ້ວ່າຊ່ອງທາງການອັບເດດມີໃຫ້ໃຊ້ງານໃນລະບົບຂອງທ່ານ ຫຼື ບໍ່ ດ້ວຍຄຳສັ່ງນີ້:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/infra-maintenance.adoc:17
#, no-wrap
msgid "zypper lr\n"
msgstr "zypper lr\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/infra-maintenance.adoc:18
msgid "The output looks similar to this:"
msgstr "ຜົນທີ່ສະແດງຈະມີລັກສະນະຄ້າຍຄືແບບນີ້:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/infra-maintenance.adoc:19
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Name                                                   | Enabled | GPG Check "
"| Refresh\n"
"-------------------------------------------------------+---------+-----------+--------\n"
"SLE-Module-Basesystem15-SP7-Pool                       | Yes     | (r ) Yes  "
"| No\n"
