#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:133
msgid ""
"Prometheus metrics exporters can be installed and configured on {salt} "
"clients using formulas.  The packages are available from the {productname} "
"client tools channels, and can be enabled and configured directly in the "
"{productname} {webui}."
msgstr "Prometheus metrics exporters ສາມາດຕິດຕັ້ງ ແລະ ຕັ້ງຄ່າໃນໄຄລເອັນ {salt} ໂດຍໃຊ້ formulas. ແພັກເກດເຫຼົ່ານີ້ມີໃຫ້ໃນຊ່ອງທາງເຄື່ອງມືໄຄລເອັນຂອງ {productname}, ແລະ ສາມາດເປີດໃຊ້ ແລະ ຕັ້ງຄ່າໄດ້ໂດຍກົງໃນ {productname} {webui}."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:134
msgid "These exporters can be installed on managed systems:"
msgstr "Exporters ເຫຼົ່ານີ້ສາມາດຕິດຕັ້ງໃນລະບົບທີ່ຖືກຈັດການ:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:139
msgid "Apache exporter: `golang-github-lusitaniae-apache_exporter`."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:140
msgid "See https://github.com/Lusitaniae/apache_exporter."
msgstr "ເບິ່ງທີ່ https://github.com/Lusitaniae/apache_exporter."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:141
msgid ""
"On {sl-micro}, only the Node exporter and the Blackbox exporter are "
"available."
msgstr "ໃນ {sl-micro}, ຈະມີສະເພາະ Node exporter ແລະ Blackbox exporter ເທົ່ານັ້ນທີ່ໃຊ້ງານໄດ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:142
msgid ""
"When you have the exporters installed and configured, you can start using "
"Prometheus to collect metrics from the monitored systems.  If you have "
"configured your monitoring server with the {webui}, metrics collection "
"happens automatically."
msgstr "ເມື່ອທ່ານຕິດຕັ້ງ ແລະ ກຳນົດຄ່າ exporters ແລ້ວ, ທ່ານສາມາດເລີ່ມໃຊ້ Prometheus ເພື່ອເກັບກຳຄ່າວັດແທກຈາກລະບົບທີ່ຖືກກວດສອບ. ຖ້າທ່ານໄດ້ກຳນົດຄ່າເຊີເວີກວດສອບຂອງທ່ານດ້ວຍ {webui}, ການເກັບກຳຄ່າວັດແທກຈະເກີດຂຶ້ນໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:143
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Configuring Prometheus exporters on a client"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການຕັ້ງຄ່າ Prometheus exporters ໃນໄຄລເອັນ"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:144
msgid ""
"In the {productname} {webui}, open the details page of the client to be "
"monitored, and navigate to the menu:Formulas[] tab."
msgstr "ໃນ {webui} ຂອງ {productname}, ເປີດໜ້າລາຍລະອຽດຂອງລູກຂ່າຍທີ່ຕ້ອງການກວດສອບ, ແລະ ໄປທີ່ແທັບ menu:Formulas[]."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:145
msgid "Check the `Enabled` checkbox on the `Prometheus Exporters` formula."
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:147
msgid "Navigate to the menu:Formulas[Prometheus Exporters] tab."
msgstr "ໄປທີ່ແທັບ menu:Formulas[Prometheus Exporters]."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:148
msgid ""
"Select the exporters you want to enable and customize arguments according to "
"your needs."
msgstr "ເລືອກ exporters ທີ່ທ່ານຕ້ອງການເປີດໃຊ້ ແລະ ປັບແຕ່ງອາກິວເມນ (arguments) ຕາມຄວາມຕ້ອງການຂອງທ່ານ."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:149
msgid ""
"The `Address` field accepts either a port number preceded by a colon "
"(`:9100`), or a fully resolvable address (`example:9100`)."
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:151
msgid "Apply the highstate."
msgstr "ນຳໃຊ້ highstate."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:152
msgid "[IMPORTANT]"
msgstr "[ຂໍ້ຄວາມສຳຄັນ]"

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:153
msgid "The following ports need to be enabled and not blocked by the firewall:"
msgstr "ພອດຕໍ່ໄປນີ້ຕ້ອງໄດ້ຮັບການເປີດໃຊ້ງານ ແລະ ບໍ່ຖືກບລັອກໂດຍໄຟວໍ:"

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:154
msgid "on the monitor: 9090/tcp"
msgstr "ໃນເຄື່ອງຕິດຕາມ: 9090/tcp"

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:155
msgid "on the monitored system: 9100/tcp, 9117/tcp, and 9187/tcp"
msgstr "ໃນລະບົບທີ່ຖືກຕິດຕາມ: 9100/tcp, 9117/tcp, ແລະ 9187/tcp"

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:156
msgid ""
"Monitoring formulas can also be configured for System Groups, by applying "
"the same configuration used for individual systems inside the corresponding "
"group."
msgstr "ສູດການກວດສອບຍັງສາມາດກຳນົດຄ່າໃຫ້ກັບກຸ່ມລະບົບ (System Groups) ໄດ້, ໂດຍການນຳໃຊ້ການກຳນົດຄ່າແບບດຽວກັນກັບທີ່ໃຊ້ໃນລະບົບດ່ຽວພາຍໃນກຸ່ມທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງ."

#. type: Title ===
#: en/modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:158
#, no-wrap
msgid "Change Grafana password"
msgstr "ປ່ຽນລະຫັດຜ່ານ Grafana"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:159
msgid ""
"To change the Grafana password follow the steps described in the Grafana "
"documentation:"
msgstr "ເພື່ອປ່ຽນລະຫັດຜ່ານ Grafana ໃຫ້ປະຕິບັດຕາມຂັ້ນຕອນທີ່ອະທິບາຍໄວ້ໃນເອກະສານຂອງ Grafana:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:160
msgid "https://grafana.com/docs/grafana/latest/administration/user-management/user-preferences/#change-your-grafana-password"
msgstr "https://grafana.com/docs/grafana/latest/administration/user-management/user-preferences/#change-your-grafana-password"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:161
msgid ""
"In case you have lost the Grafana administrator password you can reset it as "
"`root` with the following command:"
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:162
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"grafana-cli --configOverrides cfg:default.paths.data=/var/lib/grafana "
"--homepath /usr/share/grafana admin reset-admin-password <new_password>\n"
msgstr "grafana-cli --configOverrides cfg:default.paths.data=/var/lib/grafana --homepath /usr/share/grafana admin reset-admin-password <ລະຫັດຜ່ານໃໝ່>\n"

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:163
#, no-wrap
msgid "Network boundaries"
msgstr "ຂອບເຂດເຄືອຂ່າຍ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:164
msgid ""
"Prometheus fetches metrics using a pull mechanism, so the server must be "
"able to establish TCP connections to monitored clients.  By default, "
"Prometheus uses these ports:"
msgstr "Prometheus ດຶງຄ່າວັດແທກໂດຍໃຊ້ກົນໄກແບບ pull (ດຶງ), ດັ່ງນັ້ນເຊີເວີຕ້ອງສາມາດສ້າງການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ TCP ຫາລູກຂ່າຍທີ່ຖືກກວດສອບໄດ້. ໂດຍມາດຕະຖານແລ້ວ, Prometheus ຈະໃຊ້ພອດເຫຼົ່ານີ້:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:165
msgid "Node exporter: 9100"
msgstr "Node exporter: 9100"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:166
msgid "PostgreSQL exporter: 9187"
msgstr "PostgreSQL exporter: 9187"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:167
msgid "Apache exporter: 9117"
msgstr "Apache exporter: 9117"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:168
msgid ""
"Additionally, if you are running the alert manager on a different host than "
"where you run Prometheus, you also need to open port 9093.  The alert "
"manager is part of Prometheus solution.  It handles alerts sent by client "
"applications such as the Prometheus server instance.  For more information "
"about the alert manager, see "
"https://prometheus.io/docs/alerting/latest/alertmanager/."
msgstr "ນອກຈາກນັ້ນ, ຖ້າທ່ານກຳລັງເປີດໃຊ້ alert manager ໃນໂຮສອື່ນທີ່ບໍ່ແມ່ນບ່ອນດຽວກັບທີ່ Prometheus ເຮັດວຽກຢູ່, ທ່ານຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງເປີດພອດ 9093 ຄືກັນ. alert manager ແມ່ນສ່ວນໜຶ່ງຂອງໂຊລູຊັນ Prometheus. ມັນເຮັດໜ້າທີ່ຈັດການການແຈ້ງເຕືອນທີ່ສົ່ງມາຈາກແອັບພລິເຄຊັນລູກຂ່າຍ ເຊັ່ນ Prometheus server instance. ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບ alert manager, ເບິ່ງໄດ້ທີ່ https://prometheus.io/docs/alerting/latest/alertmanager/."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:169
msgid ""
"For clients installed on cloud instances, you can add the required ports to "
"a security group that has access to the monitoring server."
msgstr "ສຳລັບລູກຂ່າຍທີ່ຕິດຕັ້ງຢູ່ໃນຄລາວ (cloud), ທ່ານສາມາດເພີ່ມພອດທີ່ຈຳເປັນເຂົ້າໃນກຸ່ມຄວາມປອດໄພ (security group) ທີ່ສາມາດເຂົ້າເຖິງເຊີເວີກວດສອບໄດ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:170
msgid ""
"Alternatively, you can deploy a Prometheus instance in the exporters' local "
"network, and configure federation.  This allows the main monitoring server "
"to scrape the time series from the local Prometheus instance.  If you use "
"this method, you only need to open the Prometheus API port, which is 9090."
msgstr "ອີກທາງເລືອກໜຶ່ງ, ທ່ານສາມາດຕິດຕັ້ງ Prometheus instance ໄວ້ໃນເຄືອຂ່າຍພາຍໃນຂອງ exporters, ແລະ ກຳນົດຄ່າ federation. ວິທີນີ້ຈະຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ເຊີເວີກວດສອບຫຼັກສາມາດດຶງຂໍ້ມູນ time series ຈາກ Prometheus instance ພາຍໃນໄດ້. ຖ້າທ່ານໃຊ້ວິທີນີ້, ທ່ານພຽງແຕ່ຕ້ອງເປີດພອດ Prometheus API ເທົ່ານັ້ນ, ເຊິ່ງແມ່ນ 9090."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:171
msgid ""
"For more information on Prometheus federation, see "
"https://prometheus.io/docs/prometheus/latest/federation/."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບ Prometheus federation, ເບິ່ງໄດ້ທີ່ https://prometheus.io/docs/prometheus/latest/federation/."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:172
msgid ""
"You can also proxy requests through the network boundary.  Tools like "
"PushProx deploy a proxy and a client on both sides of the network barrier "
"and allow Prometheus to work across network topologies such as NAT."
msgstr "ທ່ານຍັງສາມາດໃຊ້ພຣັອກຊີ (proxy) ເພື່ອສົ່ງຄຳຮ້ອງຜ່ານຂອບເຂດເຄືອຂ່າຍໄດ້. ເຄື່ອງມືເຊັ່ນ PushProx ຈະຕິດຕັ້ງພຣັອກຊີ ແລະ ລູກຂ່າຍໄວ້ທັງສອງດ້ານຂອງສິ່ງກີດຂວາງເຄືອຂ່າຍ ແລະ ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ Prometheus ເຮັດວຽກຜ່ານຮູບແບບເຄືອຂ່າຍຕ່າງໆ ເຊັ່ນ NAT ໄດ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:173
msgid ""
"For more information on PushProx, see "
"https://github.com/RobustPerception/PushProx."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບ PushProx, ເບິ່ງໄດ້ທີ່ https://github.com/RobustPerception/PushProx."

#. type: Title ===
#: en/modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:174
#, no-wrap
msgid "Reverse proxy setup"
msgstr "ການຕັ້ງຄ່າ Reverse proxy"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:175
msgid ""
"Prometheus fetches metrics using a pull mechanism, so the server must be "
"able to establish TCP connections to each exporter on the monitored "
"clients.  To simplify your firewall configuration, you can use reverse proxy "
"for your exporters to expose all metrics on a single port."
msgstr "Prometheus ດຶງຄ່າວັດແທກໂດຍໃຊ້ກົນໄກແບບ pull, ດັ່ງນັ້ນເຊີເວີຕ້ອງສາມາດສ້າງການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ TCP ຫາແຕ່ລະ exporter ໃນລູກຂ່າຍທີ່ຖືກກວດສອບ. ເພື່ອເຮັດໃຫ້ການກຳນົດຄ່າໄຟວໍ (firewall) ຂອງທ່ານງ່າຍຂຶ້ນ, ທ່ານສາມາດໃຊ້ reverse proxy ສຳລັບ exporters ຂອງທ່ານເພື່ອສະແດງຄ່າວັດແທກທັງໝົດຜ່ານພອດດຽວ."

#.  Probably a diagram here. --LKB 2020-08-11
#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:176
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Installing Prometheus exporters with reverse proxy"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການຕິດຕັ້ງ Prometheus exporters ດ້ວຍ reverse proxy"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:177
msgid ""
"In the {productname} {webui}, open the details page of the system to be "
"monitored, and navigate to the `Formulas` tab."
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:178
msgid ""
"Check the `Prometheus Exporters` checkbox to enable the exporters formula, "
"and click btn:[Save]."
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:179
msgid "Navigate to the `Prometheus Exporters` tab in the top menu."
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:180
msgid ""
"Check the `Enable reverse proxy` option, and enter a valid reverse proxy "
"port number.  For example, `9999`."
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:181
msgid "Ensure that port 9999/tcp is open on the firewall."
msgstr "ກວດສອບໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າພອດ 9999/tcp ຖືກເປີດຢູ່ໃນ firewall."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:182
msgid "Customize the other exporters according to your needs."
msgstr "ປັບແຕ່ງ exporters ອື່ນໆຕາມຄວາມຕ້ອງການຂອງທ່ານ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:187
msgid ""
"Prometheus server and Prometheus node exporter offer a built-in mechanism to "
"secure their endpoints with TLS encryption and authentication.  "
"{productname} {webui} simplifies the configuration of all involved "
"components. The TLS certificates have to be provided and deployed by the "
"user.  {productname} offers enabling the following security model:"
msgstr "Prometheus server ແລະ Prometheus node exporter ມີກົນໄກພາຍໃນຕົວເພື່ອຮັກສາຄວາມປອດໄພຂອງຈຸດປາຍທາງ (endpoints) ດ້ວຍການເຂົ້າລະຫັດ TLS ແລະ ການຢືນຢັນຕົວຕົນ. {webui} ຂອງ {productname} ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ການກຳນົດຄ່າສ່ວນປະກອບທັງໝົດທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງ ເປັນເລື່ອງງ່າຍ. ໃບຢັ້ງຢືນ TLS ຕ້ອງຖືກຈັດຕຽມ ແລະ ຕິດຕັ້ງໂດຍຜູ້ໃຊ້ເອງ. {productname} ຮອງຮັບການເປີດໃຊ້ຮູບແບບຄວາມປອດໄພດັ່ງນີ້:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:188
msgid "Node exporter: TLS encryption and client certificate based authentication"
msgstr "Node exporter: ການເຂົ້າລະຫັດ TLS ແລະ ການຢືນຢັນຕົວຕົນໂດຍໃຊ້ໃບຢັ້ງຢືນລູກຂ່າຍ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:189
msgid "Prometheus: TLS encryption and basic authentication"
msgstr "Prometheus: ການເຂົ້າລະຫັດ TLS ແລະ ການຢືນຢັນຕົວຕົນແບບພື້ນຖານ (basic authentication)"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:190
msgid ""
"For more information about configuring all available options, see "
"xref:specialized-guides:salt/salt-formula-monitoring.adoc[]."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບການກຳນົດຄ່າຕົວເລືອກທີ່ມີທັງໝົດ, ເບິ່ງໄດ້ທີ່ xref:specialized-guides:salt/salt-formula-monitoring.adoc[]."

#. type: Title ===
#: en/modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:191
#, no-wrap
msgid "Generating TLS certificates"
msgstr "ການສ້າງໃບຢັ້ງຢືນ TLS"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:192
msgid ""
"By default, {productname} does not provide any certificates for securing "
"monitoring configuration.  For providing security, you can generate or "
"import custom certificates, self-signed or signed by a third party "
"certificate authority (CA)."
msgstr "ໂດຍມາດຕະຖານ, {productname} ຈະບໍ່ມີໃບຢັ້ງຢືນໃດໆມາໃຫ້ເພື່ອຮັກສາຄວາມປອດໄພຂອງການກຳນົດຄ່າການກວດສອບ. ເພື່ອຄວາມປອດໄພ, ທ່ານສາມາດສ້າງ ຫຼື ນຳເຂົ້າໃບຢັ້ງຢືນແບບກຳນົດເອງ, ເຊິ່ງອາດຈະເປັນແບບເຊັນຊື່ດ້ວຍຕົນເອງ (self-signed) ຫຼື ເຊັນຊື່ໂດຍໜ່ວຍງານອອກໃບຢັ້ງຢືນ (CA) ພາຍນອກ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:193
msgid ""
"This section demonstrates how to generate client/server certificates for "
"Prometheus and Node exporter minions self-signed with {productname} CA."
msgstr "ພາກສ່ວນນີ້ສະແດງວິທີການສ້າງໃບຢັ້ງຢືນ client/server ສຳລັບ Prometheus ແລະ Node exporter minions ທີ່ເຊັນຊື່ດ້ວຍຕົນເອງໂດຍໃຊ້ CA ຂອງ {productname}."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:194
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Creating server/client TLS certificate"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການສ້າງໃບຢັ້ງຢືນ TLS ສຳລັບ server/client"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:195
msgid ""
"At the command prompt of the {productname} container host, as root, run the "
"following commands:"
msgstr "ຢູ່ທີ່ command prompt ຂອງ host ທີ່ລັນ {productname} container, ໃນຖານະ root, ໃຫ້ລັນຄຳສັ່ງດັ່ງນີ້:"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:196
msgid "To generate certificate files, run the following command."
msgstr "ເພື່ອສ້າງໄຟລ໌ໃບຢັ້ງຢືນ, ໃຫ້ລັນຄຳສັ່ງດັ່ງຕໍ່ໄປນີ້."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:197
msgid ""
"Ensure that the `set-cname` parameter is the fully qualified domain name "
"(FQDN) of your {salt} client.  You can use the `set-cname` parameter "
"multiple times if you require multiple aliases:"
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:198
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"mgrctl exec -ti -- mgr-ssl-tool --gen-server --dir=\"/root/ssl-build\" "
"--set-country=\"COUNTRY\" \\\n"
"  --set-state=\"STATE\" --set-city=\"CITY\" --set-org=\"ORGANIZATION\" \\\n"
"  --set-org-unit=\"ORGANIZATION UNIT\" --set-email=\"name@example.com\" \\\n"
"  --set-hostname=\"minion.example.com\" --set-cname=\"minion.example.com\" "
"--no-rpm\n"
msgstr ""
"mgrctl exec -ti -- mgr-ssl-tool --gen-server --dir=\"/root/ssl-build\" --set-country=\"COUNTRY\" \\\n"
"  --set-state=\"STATE\" --set-city=\"CITY\" --set-org=\"ORGANIZATION\" \\\n"
"  --set-org-unit=\"ORGANIZATION UNIT\" --set-email=\"name@example.com\" \\\n"
"  --set-hostname=\"minion.example.com\" --set-cname=\"minion.example.com\" --no-rpm\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:199
msgid "Resulting in:"
msgstr "ຜົນໄດ້ຮັບແມ່ນ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:200
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Generating the web server's SSL private key: "
"/root/ssl-build/minion/server.key\n"
"Generating web server's SSL certificate request: "
"/root/ssl-build/minion/server.csr\n"
"Generating/signing web server's SSL certificate: server.crt\n"
msgstr ""
"Generating the web server's SSL private key: /root/ssl-build/minion/server.key\n"
"Generating web server's SSL certificate request: /root/ssl-build/minion/server.csr\n"
"Generating/signing web server's SSL certificate: server.crt\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:201
msgid ""
"Copy `server.crt` and `server.key` files from the server container to the "
"host:"
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:202
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"mgrctl cp server:/root/ssl-build/minion/server.key server.key\n"
"mgrctl cp server:/root/ssl-build/minion/server.crt server.crt\n"
msgstr ""
"mgrctl cp server:/root/ssl-build/minion/server.key server.key\n"
"mgrctl cp server:/root/ssl-build/minion/server.crt server.crt\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:203
msgid ""
"Copy `server.crt` and `server.key` files from the host to the monitoring "
"client:"
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:204
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"ssh minion.example.com 'mkdir /etc/ssl/mlm-server-certs'\n"
"scp /root/server.* minion.example.com:/etc/ssl/mlm-server-certs\n"
"ssh minion.example.com 'chmod go+r /etc/ssl/mlm-server-certs/server.*; ls "
"-la /etc/ssl/mlm-server-certs'\n"
msgstr ""
"ssh minion.example.com 'mkdir /etc/ssl/mlm-server-certs'\n"
"scp /root/server.* minion.example.com:/etc/ssl/mlm-server-certs\n"
"ssh minion.example.com 'chmod go+r /etc/ssl/mlm-server-certs/server.*; ls -la /etc/ssl/mlm-server-certs'\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:205
msgid ""
"To configure {salt} formulars, enter the directory names specified in the "
"previous steps."
msgstr "ເພື່ອຕັ້ງຄ່າ {salt} formulas, ໃຫ້ປ້ອນຊື່ໄດເຣັກທໍຣີທີ່ລະບຸໄວ້ໃນຂັ້ນຕອນກ່ອນໜ້ານີ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:206
msgid "formular server"
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:207
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Server Certificate /etc/ssl/mlm-server-certs/server.crt\n"
"Server Key /etc/ssl/mlm-server-certs/server.key\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:208
msgid "formular minion"
msgstr "formular minion"

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "System Security with OpenSCAP"
msgstr "ຄວາມປອດໄພຂອງລະບົບດ້ວຍ OpenSCAP"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap.adoc:2
msgid ""
"{productname} uses OpenSCAP to audit clients.  It allows you to schedule and "
"view compliance scans for any client."
msgstr "{productname} ໃຊ້ OpenSCAP ເພື່ອທຳການກວດສອບ (audit) ລູກຂ່າຍ. ມັນຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ທ່ານສາມາດກຳນົດເວລາ ແລະ ເບິ່ງຜົນການສະແກນຄວາມສອດຄ່ອງ (compliance scans) ສຳລັບລູກຂ່າຍໃດໆກໍໄດ້."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap.adoc:3
#, no-wrap
msgid "About SCAP"
msgstr "ກ່ຽວກັບ SCAP"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap.adoc:4
msgid ""
"The Security Content Automation Protocol (SCAP) is a synthesis of "
"interoperable specifications derived from community ideas.  It is a line of "
"specifications maintained by the National Institute of Standards and "
"Technology (NIST) for maintaining system security for enterprise systems."
msgstr "Security Content Automation Protocol (SCAP) ແມ່ນການຮວບຮວມເອົາຂໍ້ກຳນົດທີ່ສາມາດເຮັດວຽກຮ່ວມກັນໄດ້ ເຊິ່ງມາຈາກແນວຄິດຂອງຊຸມຊົນ. ມັນແມ່ນຊຸດຂໍ້ກຳນົດທີ່ດູແລໂດຍສະຖາບັນມາດຕະຖານ ແລະ ເຕັກໂນໂລຊີແຫ່ງຊາດ (NIST) ເພື່ອຮັກສາຄວາມປອດໄພຂອງລະບົບສຳລັບລະບົບລະດັບອົງກອນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap.adoc:5
msgid ""
"SCAP was created to provide a standardized approach to maintaining system "
"security, and the standards that are used continually change to meet the "
"needs of the community and enterprise businesses.  New specifications are "
"governed by NIST's SCAP Release cycle to provide a consistent and repeatable "
"revision work flow.  For more information, see:"
msgstr "SCAP ຖືກສ້າງຂຶ້ນເພື່ອໃຫ້ມີວິທີການມາດຕະຖານໃນການຮັກສາຄວາມປອດໄພຂອງລະບົບ, ແລະ ມາດຕະຖານທີ່ໃຊ້ແມ່ນມີການປ່ຽນແປງຢ່າງຕໍ່ເນື່ອງເພື່ອຕອບສະໜອງຄວາມຕ້ອງການຂອງຊຸມຊົນ ແລະ ທຸລະກິດອົງກອນ. ຂໍ້ກຳນົດໃໝ່ໆແມ່ນຖືກຄວບຄຸມໂດຍຮອບວຽນການປ່ອຍ SCAP ຂອງ NIST ເພື່ອໃຫ້ມີຂັ້ນຕອນການປັບປຸງທີ່ຕໍ່ເນື່ອງ ແລະ ຊັດເຈນ. ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ, ເບິ່ງໄດ້ທີ່:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap.adoc:6
msgid "https://csrc.nist.gov/projects/security-content-automation-protocol"
msgstr "https://csrc.nist.gov/projects/security-content-automation-protocol"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap.adoc:7
msgid "https://www.open-scap.org/features/standards/"
msgstr "https://www.open-scap.org/features/standards/"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap.adoc:8
msgid "https://ncp.nist.gov/repository?scap"
msgstr "https://ncp.nist.gov/repository?scap"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap.adoc:9
msgid ""
"{productname} uses OpenSCAP to implement the SCAP specifications.  OpenSCAP "
"is an auditing tool that utilizes the Extensible Configuration Checklist "
"Description Format (XCCDF).  XCCDF is a standard way of expressing checklist "
"content and defines security checklists.  It also combines with other "
"specifications such as Common Platform Enumeration (CPE), Common "
"Configuration Enumeration (CCE), and Open Vulnerability and Assessment "
"Language (OVAL), to create a SCAP-expressed checklist that can be processed "
"by SCAP-validated products."
msgstr "{productname} ໃຊ້ OpenSCAP ເພື່ອນຳໃຊ້ຂໍ້ກຳນົດຂອງ SCAP. OpenSCAP ແມ່ນເຄື່ອງມືກວດສອບທີ່ໃຊ້ Extensible Configuration Checklist Description Format (XCCDF). XCCDF ແມ່ນວິທີມາດຕະຖານໃນການສະແດງເນື້ອຫາ ແລະ ກຳນົດລາຍການກວດສອບຄວາມປອດໄພ (security checklists). ມັນຍັງຮ່ວມກັບຂໍ້ກຳນົດອື່ນໆ ເຊັ່ນ Common Platform Enumeration (CPE), Common Configuration Enumeration (CCE), ແລະ Open Vulnerability and Assessment Language (OVAL) ເພື່ອສ້າງລາຍການກວດສອບໃນຮູບແບບ SCAP ທີ່ສາມາດປະມວນຜົນໄດ້ໂດຍຜະລິດຕະພັນທີ່ຮອງຮັບ SCAP."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap.adoc:10
msgid ""
"OpenSCAP verifies the presence of patches by using content produced by the "
"{suse} Security Team.  OpenSCAP checks system security configuration "
"settings and examines systems for signs of compromise by using rules based "
"on standards and specifications.  For more information about the {suse} "
"Security Team, see https://www.suse.com/support/security."
msgstr "OpenSCAP ກວດສອບການມີຢູ່ຂອງແພັດຊ໌ (patches) ໂດຍໃຊ້ເນື້ອຫາທີ່ສ້າງຂຶ້ນໂດຍທີມງານຄວາມປອດໄພຂອງ {suse}. OpenSCAP ຈະກວດສອບການຕັ້ງຄ່າຄວາມປອດໄພຂອງລະບົບ ແລະ ກວດເບິ່ງອາການທີ່ລະບົບອາດຈະຖືກແຊກແຊງ ໂດຍໃຊ້ກົດເກນທີ່ອີງຕາມມາດຕະຖານ ແລະ ຂໍ້ກຳນົດ. ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບທີມງານຄວາມປອດໄພຂອງ {suse}, ເບິ່ງໄດ້ທີ່ https://www.suse.com/support/security."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap.adoc:11
#, no-wrap
msgid "Prepare clients for an SCAP scan"
msgstr "ກຽມລູກຂ່າຍສຳລັບການສະແກນ SCAP"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap.adoc:12
msgid "Before you begin, you need to prepare your client systems for SCAP scanning."
msgstr "ກ່ອນທີ່ທ່ານຈະເລີ່ມ, ທ່ານຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງກຽມລະບົບລູກຂ່າຍຂອງທ່ານສຳລັບການສະແກນ SCAP."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap.adoc:13
msgid ""
"OpenSCAP auditing is not available on Salt clients that use the SSH contact "
"method."
msgstr "ການກວດສອບ OpenSCAP ບໍ່ມີໃຫ້ໃຊ້ໃນລູກຂ່າຍ Salt ທີ່ໃຊ້ວິທີການຕິດຕໍ່ແບບ SSH."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap.adoc:14
msgid ""
"Scanning clients can consume a lot of memory and compute power on the client "
"being scanned.  Ensure you have at least 2{nbsp}GB of RAM available on each "
"client to be scanned (especially for {redhat}-based and other modern "
"clients)."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap.adoc:15
msgid ""
"Install the OpenSCAP scanner and the SCAP Security Guide (content) packages "
"on the client before you begin.  Depending on the operating system, these "
"packages are included either on the base operating system, or in the "
"{productname} Client Tools."
msgstr "ຕິດຕັ້ງແພັກເກດ OpenSCAP scanner ແລະ SCAP Security Guide (ເນື້ອຫາ) ໃນລູກຂ່າຍກ່ອນທີ່ທ່ານຈະເລີ່ມ. ຂຶ້ນຢູ່ກັບລະບົບປະຕິບັດການ, ແພັກເກດເຫຼົ່ານີ້ອາດຈະລວມຢູ່ໃນລະບົບປະຕິບັດການພື້ນຖານ ຫຼື ຢູ່ໃນເຄື່ອງມືລູກຂ່າຍຂອງ {productname}."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap.adoc:16
msgid "The table below lists the packages you need:"
msgstr "ຕາຕະລາງລຸ່ມນີ້ສະແດງລາຍຊື່ແພັກເກດທີ່ທ່ານຕ້ອງການ:"

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap.adoc:17
#, no-wrap
msgid "OpenSCAP packages"
msgstr "ແພັກເກດ OpenSCAP"

#. type: Table
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap.adoc:18
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Operating system | Version | Scanner | Content\n"
"| SLES | 12, 15 | `openscap-utils` | `scap-security-guide`\n"
"| openSUSE | Leap 15, Tumbleweed | `openscap-utils` | "
"`scap-security-guide`\n"
"| RHEL / CentOS / Oracle Linux / Rocky Linux / AlmaLinux | 7, 8, 9, 10 | "
"`openscap-utils` | `scap-security-guide-redhat`\n"
"| SUSE Liberty footnote:[SUSE Liberty Linux includes a compatible "
"`scap-security-guide` package. However, the version shipped with the client "
"tools is not compatible, so it should not be used for SCAP content.] | 7, 8, "
"9, 10 | `openscap-utils` | `scap-security-guide`\n"
"| Debian | 13 | `openscap-scanner` | Not officially supported footnote:[This "
"package is community-provided and not officially supported by "
"{suse}. Upstream `ssg-debian` can be used at your own risk.]\n"
"| Ubuntu | 22.04 | `libopenscap8` | `scap-security-guide-ubuntu`\n"
"| Ubuntu | 24.04 | `openscap-scanner` | Not officially supported "
"footnote:[This package is community-provided and not officially supported by "
"{suse}. Upstream `ssg-debderived` can be used at your own risk.]\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap.adoc:19
msgid ""
"For Debian 13 and Ubuntu 24.04, {suse} does not provide custom security "
"guide packages.  To perform scans on these clients, you must install the "
"upstream packages (`ssg-debian` and `ssg-debderived` respectively) from "
"their respective community repositories.  Please note that these upstream "
"guides are not officially supported by {suse}."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap.adoc:20
msgid ""
"RHEL 7 and compatible systems provide a `scap-security-guide` package, which "
"contains outdated contents.  You are advised to use the "
"`scap-security-guide-redhat` package you will find in the {productname} "
"Client Tools."
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap.adoc:21
msgid ""
"{suse} provides the `scap-security-guide` package for different openscap "
"profiles.  In the current version of `scap-security-guide`, {suse} supports "
"the following profiles:"
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap.adoc:22
msgid "DISA STIG profile for {sles} 12 and 15"
msgstr "DISA STIG profile ສຳລັບ {sles} 12 ແລະ 15"

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap.adoc:23
msgid "ANSSI-BP-028 profile for {sles} 12 and 15"
msgstr "ANSSI-BP-028 profile ສຳລັບ {sles} 12 ແລະ 15"

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap.adoc:24
msgid "PCI-DSS profile for {sles} 12 and 15"
msgstr "PCI-DSS profile ສຳລັບ {sles} 12 ແລະ 15"

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap.adoc:25
msgid "HIPAA profile for {sles} 15"
msgstr "HIPAA profile ສຳລັບ {sles} 15"

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap.adoc:26
msgid "Hardening for Public Cloud Image of {sles} for SAP Applications 15"
msgstr "Hardening ສຳລັບ Public Cloud Image ຂອງ {sles} ສຳລັບ SAP Applications 15"

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap.adoc:27
msgid "Public Cloud Hardening for {sle} 15"
msgstr "Public Cloud Hardening ສຳລັບ {sle} 15"

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap.adoc:28
msgid "Standard System Security profile for SLE 12 and 15"
msgstr "Standard System Security profile ສຳລັບ SLE 12 ແລະ 15"

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap.adoc:29
msgid ""
"For Non-{suse} operating systems the included profiles are community "
"supplied.  They are not officially supported by {suse}."
msgstr "ສຳລັບລະບົບປະຕິບັດການທີ່ບໍ່ແມ່ນຂອງ {suse}, ໂປຣໄຟລ໌ທີ່ລວມຢູ່ນັ້ນແມ່ນສະໜອງໂດຍຊຸມຊົນ. ພວກມັນບໍ່ໄດ້ຮັບການສະໜັບສະໜູນຢ່າງເປັນທາງການຈາກ {suse}."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap.adoc:30
#, no-wrap
msgid "OpenSCAP content files"
msgstr "ໄຟລ໌ເນື້ອຫາ OpenSCAP"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap.adoc:31
msgid ""
"OpenSCAP uses SCAP content files to define test rules.  These content files "
"are created based on the XCCDF or OVAL standards.  In addition to the SCAP "
"Security Guide, you can download publicly available content files and "
"customize it to your requirements.  You can install the SCAP Security Guide "
"package for default content file templates.  Alternatively, if you are "
"familiar with XCCDF or OVAL, you can create your own content files."
msgstr "OpenSCAP ໃຊ້ໄຟລ໌ເນື້ອຫາ SCAP ເພື່ອກຳນົດກົດເກນການທົດສອບ. ໄຟລ໌ເນື້ອຫາເຫຼົ່ານີ້ຖືກສ້າງຂຶ້ນໂດຍອີງຕາມ ມາດຕະຖານ XCCDF ຫຼື OVAL. ນອກຈາກ SCAP Security Guide ແລ້ວ, ທ່ານຍັງສາມາດດາວໂຫຼດໄຟລ໌ເນື້ອຫາ ທີ່ມີໃຫ້ສາທາລະນະ ແລະ ປັບແຕ່ງໃຫ້ເຂົ້າກັບຄວາມຕ້ອງການຂອງທ່ານໄດ້. ທ່ານສາມາດຕິດຕັ້ງແພັກເກດ SCAP Security Guide ເພື່ອໃຊ້ແທັມເພລດ (templates) ຂອງໄຟລ໌ເນື້ອຫາມາດຕະຖານ. ຫຼື ຫາກທ່ານຄຸ້ນເຄີຍກັບ XCCDF ຫຼື OVAL, ທ່ານກໍສາມາດສ້າງໄຟລ໌ເນື້ອຫາຂອງຕົວເອງໄດ້."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap.adoc:32
msgid ""
"We recommend you use templates to create your SCAP content files.  If you "
"create and use your own custom content files, you do so at your own risk.  "
"If your system becomes damaged through the use of custom content files, you "
"might not be supported by {suse}."
msgstr "ພວກເຮົາແນະນຳໃຫ້ທ່ານໃຊ້ແທັມເພລດເພື່ອສ້າງໄຟລ໌ເນື້ອຫາ SCAP ຂອງທ່ານ. ຫາກທ່ານສ້າງ ແລະ ໃຊ້ໄຟລ໌ເນື້ອຫາ ແບບກຳນົດເອງ, ທ່ານຕ້ອງຍອມຮັບຄວາມສ່ຽງດ້ວຍຕົນເອງ. ຫາກລະບົບຂອງທ່ານເກີດຄວາມເສຍຫາຍຈາກການໃຊ້ໄຟລ໌ເນື້ອຫາ ແບບກຳນົດເອງ, ທ່ານອາດຈະບໍ່ໄດ້ຮັບການສະໜັບສະໜູນຈາກ {suse}."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap.adoc:33
msgid ""
"When you have created your content files, you need to transfer the file to "
"the client.  You can do this in the same way as you move any other file, "
"using physical storage media, or across a network with Salt (for example, "
"https://docs.saltproject.io/en/latest/ref/cli/salt-cp.html[salt-cp] or the "
"https://docs.saltproject.io/en/latest/ref/file_server/index.html[Salt File "
"Server]), `ftp` or `scp`."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap.adoc:34
msgid ""
"We recommend that you create a package to distribute content files to "
"clients that you are managing with {productname}.  Packages can be signed "
"and verified to ensure their integrity.  For more information, see "
"xref:administration:custom-channels.adoc[]."
msgstr "ພວກເຮົາແນະນຳໃຫ້ທ່ານສ້າງແພັກເກດເພື່ອແຈກຢາຍໄຟລ໌ເນື້ອຫາໃຫ້ກັບລູກຂ່າຍທີ່ທ່ານຈັດການດ້ວຍ {productname}. ແພັກເກດສາມາດຖືກເຊັນຊື່ ແລະ ກວດສອບເພື່ອຢືນຢັນຄວາມຖືກຕ້ອງສົມບູນໄດ້. ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ, ເບິ່ງໄດ້ທີ່ xref:administration:custom-channels.adoc[]."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap.adoc:35
#, no-wrap
msgid "Find OpenSCAP profiles"
msgstr "ຄົ້ນຫາໂປຣໄຟລ໌ OpenSCAP"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap.adoc:36
msgid ""
"Different operating systems make available different OpenSCAP content files "
"and profiles. One content file may contain more than one profile."
msgstr "ລະບົບປະຕິບັດການທີ່ແຕກຕ່າງກັນຈະມີໄຟລ໌ເນື້ອຫາ ແລະ ໂປຣໄຟລ໌ OpenSCAP ທີ່ແຕກຕ່າງກັນ. ໄຟລ໌ເນື້ອຫາໜຶ່ງອາດຈະມີຫຼາຍກວ່າໜຶ່ງໂປຣໄຟລ໌."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap.adoc:37
msgid ""
"On RPM-based operating systems, use this command to determine the location "
"of the available SCAP files:"
msgstr "ໃນລະບົບປະຕິບັດການທີ່ອີງໃສ່ RPM, ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ຄຳສັ່ງນີ້ເພື່ອລະບຸຕຳແໜ່ງຂອງໄຟລ໌ SCAP ທີ່ມີຢູ່:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap.adoc:38
#, no-wrap
msgid "rpm -ql <scap-security-guide-package-name-from-table>\n"
msgstr "rpm -ql <ຊື່ແພັກເກດ-scap-security-guide-ຈາກຕາຕະລາງ>\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap.adoc:39
msgid ""
"On DEB-based operating systems, use this command to determine the location "
"of the available SCAP files:"
msgstr "ໃນລະບົບປະຕິບັດການທີ່ອີງໃສ່ DEB, ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ຄຳສັ່ງນີ້ເພື່ອລະບຸຕຳແໜ່ງຂອງໄຟລ໌ SCAP ທີ່ມີຢູ່:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap.adoc:40
#, no-wrap
msgid "dpkg -L <scap-security-guide-package-name-from-table>\n"
msgstr "dpkg -L <ຊື່ແພັກເກດ-scap-security-guide-ຈາກຕາຕະລາງ>\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap.adoc:41
msgid ""
"When you have identified one SCAP content file that suits your needs, list "
"profiles available on the client:"
msgstr "ເມື່ອທ່ານລະບຸໄຟລ໌ເນື້ອຫາ SCAP ທີ່ເໝາະສົມກັບຄວາມຕ້ອງການຂອງທ່ານໄດ້ແລ້ວ, ໃຫ້ສະແດງລາຍຊື່ໂປຣໄຟລ໌ທີ່ມີຢູ່ໃນລູກຂ່າຍ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap.adoc:42
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"oscap info /usr/share/xml/scap/ssg/content/ssg-sle15-ds.xml\n"
"Document type: Source Data Stream\n"
"Imported: 2021-03-24T18:14:45\n"
