#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/organizations.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Organizations"
msgstr "ອົງກອນ (Organizations)"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/organizations.adoc:2
msgid ""
"Organizations are used to manage user access and permissions within "
"{productname}."
msgstr "ອົງກອນ (Organizations) ຖືກນຳໃຊ້ເພື່ອຈັດການການເຂົ້າເຖິງ ແລະ ສິດທິຂອງຜູ້ໃຊ້ພາຍໃນ {productname}."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/organizations.adoc:3
msgid ""
"For most environments, a single organization is enough.  However, more "
"complicated environments might need several organizations.  You might like "
"to have an organization for each physical location within your business, or "
"for different business functions."
msgstr "ສຳລັບສະພາບແວດລ້ອມສ່ວນໃຫຍ່, ອົງກອນດຽວກໍພຽງພໍແລ້ວ. ເຖິງຢ່າງໃດກໍຕາມ, ໃນລະບົບທີ່ມີຄວາມຊັບຊ້ອນ ອາດຈະຕ້ອງການຫຼາຍອົງກອນ. ທ່ານອາດຈະຢາກມີອົງກອນແຍກຕາມສະຖານທີ່ຕັ້ງຂອງທຸລະກິດ ຫຼື ຕາມແຕ່ລະພາກສ່ວນທຸລະກິດ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/organizations.adoc:4
msgid ""
"When you have created your organizations, you can create and assign users to "
"your organizations.  You can then assign permissions on an organization "
"level, which applies by default to every user assigned to the organization."
msgstr "ເມື່ອທ່ານສ້າງອົງກອນແລ້ວ, ທ່ານສາມາດສ້າງ ແລະ ມອບໝາຍຜູ້ໃຊ້ເຂົ້າໃນອົງກອນຂອງທ່ານ. ຈາກນັ້ນທ່ານສາມາດກຳນົດສິດທິໃນລະດັບອົງກອນ, ເຊິ່ງໂດຍມາດຕະຖານແລ້ວຈະມີຜົນກັບຜູ້ໃຊ້ທຸກຄົນທີ່ສັງກັດໃນອົງກອນນັ້ນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/organizations.adoc:5
msgid ""
"You can also configure authentication methods for your new organization, "
"including PAM and single sign-on.  For more information about "
"authentication, see xref:administration:auth-methods.adoc[]."
msgstr "ທ່ານຍັງສາມາດກຳນົດຄ່າວິທີການຢືນຢັນຕົວຕົນສຳລັບອົງກອນໃໝ່ຂອງທ່ານ, ລວມທັງ PAM ແລະ single sign-on. ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບການຢືນຢັນຕົວຕົນ, ເບິ່ງໄດ້ທີ່ xref:administration:auth-methods.adoc[]."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/administration/pages/organizations.adoc:7
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Creating a New Organization"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການສ້າງອົງກອນໃໝ່"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/organizations.adoc:8
msgid ""
"In the {productname} {webui}, navigate to menu:Admin[Organizations], and "
"click btn:[Create Organization]."
msgstr "ໃນ {webui} ຂອງ {productname}, ໃຫ້ໄປທີ່ menu:Admin[Organizations], ແລະ ຄລິກ btn:[Create Organization]."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/organizations.adoc:9
msgid "In the `Create Organization` dialog, complete these fields:"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/organizations.adoc:10
msgid "In the `Organization Name` field, type a name for your new organization."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/organizations.adoc:11
msgid "The name should be between 3 and 128 characters long."
msgstr "ຊື່ຄວນຈະມີຄວາມຍາວລະຫວ່າງ 3 ຫາ 128 ຕົວອັກສອນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/organizations.adoc:12
msgid ""
"In the `Desired Login` field, type the login name you want to use for the "
"organization's administrator."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/organizations.adoc:13
msgid ""
"This must be a new administrator account, you are not be able to use an "
"existing administrator account to sign in to the new organization, including "
"the one you are currently signed in with."
msgstr "ນີ້ຕ້ອງເປັນບັນຊີຜູ້ດູແລລະບົບໃໝ່, ທ່ານຈະບໍ່ສາມາດໃຊ້ບັນຊີຜູ້ດູແລລະບົບທີ່ມີຢູ່ແລ້ວເພື່ອລັອກອິນເຂົ້າໃນອົງກອນໃໝ່ໄດ້, ລວມທັງບັນຊີທີ່ທ່ານກຳລັງໃຊ້ງານຢູ່ໃນປັດຈຸບັນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/organizations.adoc:14
msgid ""
"In the `Desired Password` field, type a password for the new organization's "
"administrator."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/organizations.adoc:15
msgid ""
"Confirm the password by typing it again in the `Confirm Password` field.  "
"Password strength is indicated by the colored bar beneath the password "
"fields."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/organizations.adoc:16
msgid ""
"In the `Email` field, type an email address for the new organization's "
"administrator."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/organizations.adoc:17
msgid ""
"In the `First Name` field, select a salutation, and type a given name for "
"the new organization's administrator."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/organizations.adoc:18
msgid ""
"In the `Last Name` field, type a surname for the new organization's "
"administrator."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/organizations.adoc:19
msgid "Click btn:[Create Organization]."
msgstr "ຄລິກ btn:[Create Organization]."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/administration/pages/organizations.adoc:20
#, no-wrap
msgid "Manage Organizations"
msgstr "ຈັດການອົງກອນ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/organizations.adoc:21
msgid ""
"In the {productname} {webui}, navigate to menu:Admin[Organizations] to see a "
"list of available organizations.  Click the name of an organization to "
"manage it."
msgstr "ໃນ {webui} ຂອງ {productname}, ໃຫ້ໄປທີ່ menu:Admin[Organizations] ເພື່ອເບິ່ງລາຍຊື່ອົງກອນທີ່ມີຢູ່. ຄລິກໃສ່ຊື່ອົງກອນເພື່ອຈັດການມັນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/organizations.adoc:22
msgid ""
"From the menu:Admin[Organizations] section, you can access tabs to manage "
"users, trusts, configuration, and states for your organization."
msgstr "ຈາກພາກສ່ວນ menu:Admin[Organizations], ທ່ານສາມາດເຂົ້າເຖິງແທັບຕ່າງໆເພື່ອຈັດການຜູ້ໃຊ້, ຄວາມເຊື່ອຖື (trusts), ການກຳນົດຄ່າ (configuration), ແລະ ສະຖານະ (states) ສຳລັບອົງກອນຂອງທ່ານ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/organizations.adoc:23
msgid ""
"Organizations can only be managed by their administrators.  To manage an "
"organization, ensure you are signed in as the correct administrator for the "
"organization you want to change."
msgstr "ອົງກອນສາມາດຖືກຈັດການໄດ້ໂດຍຜູ້ດູແລລະບົບຂອງອົງກອນນັ້ນໆເທົ່ານັ້ນ. ເພື່ອຈັດການອົງກອນ, ໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າທ່ານໄດ້ລັອກອິນດ້ວຍບັນຊີຜູ້ດູແລລະບົບທີ່ຖືກຕ້ອງສຳລັບອົງກອນທີ່ທ່ານຕ້ອງການປ່ຽນແປງ."

#. type: Title ===
#: en/modules/administration/pages/organizations.adoc:24
#, no-wrap
msgid "Organization Users"
msgstr "ຜູ້ໃຊ້ໃນອົງກອນ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/organizations.adoc:25
msgid ""
"Navigate to the `Users` tab to view the list of all users associated with "
"the organization, and their role.  Clicking a username takes you to the "
"`Users` menu to add, change, or delete users."
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ===
#: en/modules/administration/pages/organizations.adoc:26
#, no-wrap
msgid "Trusted Organizations"
msgstr "ອົງກອນທີ່ໄດ້ຮັບຄວາມເຊື່ອຖື"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/organizations.adoc:27
msgid ""
"Navigate to the `Trusts` tab to add or remove trusted organizations.  "
"Establishing trust between organizations allow them to share content between "
"them, and gives you the ability to transfer clients from one organization to "
"another."
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ===
#: en/modules/administration/pages/organizations.adoc:28
#, no-wrap
msgid "Configure Organizations"
msgstr "ກຳນົດຄ່າອົງກອນ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/organizations.adoc:29
msgid ""
"Navigate to the `Configuration` tab to manage the configuration of your "
"organization.  This includes the use of staged contents, and the use of SCAP "
"files."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/organizations.adoc:30
msgid ""
"For more information about content staging, see "
"xref:administration:content-staging.adoc[]."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບ content staging, ເບິ່ງໄດ້ທີ່ xref:administration:content-staging.adoc[]."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/organizations.adoc:31
msgid ""
"For more information about OpenSCAP, see "
"xref:reference:audit/audit-openscap-overview.adoc[]."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບ OpenSCAP, ເບິ່ງໄດ້ທີ່ xref:reference:audit/audit-openscap-overview.adoc[]."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/administration/pages/organizations.adoc:32
#, no-wrap
msgid "Manage States"
msgstr "ຈັດການສະຖານະ (States)"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/organizations.adoc:33
msgid ""
"Navigate to the `States` tab to manage Salt states for all clients in your "
"organization.  States allow you to define global security policies, or add a "
"common admin user to all clients."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/organizations.adoc:34
msgid ""
"For more information about Salt States, see "
"xref:specialized-guides:salt/salt-states-and-pillars.adoc[]."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບ Salt States, ເບິ່ງໄດ້ທີ່ xref:specialized-guides:salt/salt-states-and-pillars.adoc[]."

#. type: Title ===
#: en/modules/administration/pages/organizations.adoc:35
#, no-wrap
msgid "Manage Configuration Channels"
msgstr "ຈັດການຊ່ອງທາງການກຳນົດຄ່າ (Configuration Channels)"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/organizations.adoc:36
msgid ""
"You can select which configuration channels should be applied across your "
"organization.  Configuration channels can be created in the {productname} "
"{webui} by navigating to menu:Configuration[Channels].  Apply configuration "
"channels to your organization using the {productname} {webui}."
msgstr "ທ່ານສາມາດເລືອກວ່າຈະນຳໃຊ້ຊ່ອງທາງການກຳນົດຄ່າໃດແດ່ໃນທົ່ວອົງກອນຂອງທ່ານ. ຊ່ອງທາງການກຳນົດຄ່າສາມາດສ້າງຂຶ້ນໄດ້ໃນ {webui} ຂອງ {productname} ໂດຍໄປທີ່ menu:Configuration[Channels]. ນຳໃຊ້ຊ່ອງທາງການກຳນົດຄ່າໃຫ້ກັບອົງກອນຂອງທ່ານໂດຍໃຊ້ {webui} ຂອງ {productname}."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/administration/pages/organizations.adoc:37
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Applying Configuration Channels to an Organization"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການນຳໃຊ້ຊ່ອງທາງການກຳນົດຄ່າໃຫ້ກັບອົງກອນ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/organizations.adoc:38
msgid ""
"In the {productname} {webui}, navigate to menu:Home[My Organization > "
"Configuration Channels]."
msgstr "ໃນ {webui} ຂອງ {productname}, ໃຫ້ໄປທີ່ menu:Home[My Organization > Configuration Channels]."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/organizations.adoc:39
msgid "Use the search feature to locate a channel by name."
msgstr "ໃຊ້ຄຸນສົມບັດການຄົ້ນຫາເພື່ອລະບຸຊ່ອງທາງ (channel) ດ້ວຍຊື່."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/organizations.adoc:40
msgid "Check the channel to be applied and click btn:[Save Changes]."
msgstr "ໝາຍຕິກເລືອກຊ່ອງທາງທີ່ຈະນຳໃຊ້ ແລະ ຄລິກ btn:[Save Changes]."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/organizations.adoc:41
msgid "This saves to the database, but does not apply the changes to the channel."
msgstr "ນີ້ແມ່ນການບັນທຶກລົງໃນຖານຂໍ້ມູນ, ແຕ່ຍັງບໍ່ທັນໄດ້ນຳໃຊ້ການປ່ຽນແປງກັບຊ່ອງທາງ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/organizations.adoc:42
msgid "Apply the changes by clicking btn:[Apply]."
msgstr "ນຳໃຊ້ການປ່ຽນແປງໂດຍການຄລິກ btn:[Apply]."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/organizations.adoc:43
msgid ""
"This schedules the task to apply the changes to all clients within the "
"organization."
msgstr "ນີ້ຈະເປັນການກຳນົດເວລາວຽກງານເພື່ອການນຳໃຊ້ການປ່ຽນແປງໃຫ້ກັບລູກຂ່າຍທັງໝົດພາຍໃນອົງກອນ."

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/patch-management.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Patch Management"
msgstr "ການຈັດການແພັດຊ໌ (Patch Management)"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/patch-management.adoc:2
msgid "This chapter contains various topics related to patch management."
msgstr "ບົດນີ້ປະກອບດ້ວຍຫົວຂໍ້ຕ່າງໆ ທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງກັບການຈັດການແພັດຊ໌ (patch management)."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/administration/pages/patch-management.adoc:3
#, no-wrap
msgid "Retracted Patches"
msgstr "ແພັດຊ໌ທີ່ຖືກຖອນຄືນ (Retracted Patches)"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/patch-management.adoc:4
msgid ""
"When a new patch gets released by the vendor, it might happen that the patch "
"has undesirable side effects (security, stability) in some scenario that was "
"not identified by testing. When this happens (very rarely), vendors "
"typically release a new patch, which may take hours or days, depending on "
"the internal processes in place by that vendor."
msgstr "ເມື່ອມີແພັດຊ໌ໃໝ່ຖືກປ່ອຍອອກມາໂດຍຜູ້ຜະລິດ (vendor), ມັນອາດຈະເກີດມີຜົນຂ້າງຄຽງທີ່ບໍ່ເພິ່ງປະສົງ (ດ້ານຄວາມປອດໄພ, ຄວາມສະຖຽນ) ໃນບາງກໍລະນີທີ່ບໍ່ໄດ້ຖືກກວດພົບໃນຕອນທົດສອບ. ເມື່ອເຫດການນີ້ເກີດຂຶ້ນ (ເຊິ່ງໜ້ອຍຫຼາຍ), ຜູ້ຜະລິດມັກຈະປ່ອຍແພັດຊ໌ໃໝ່ອອກມາ, ເຊິ່ງອາດຈະໃຊ້ເວລາຫຼາຍຊົ່ວໂມງ ຫຼື ຫຼາຍມື້, ຂຶ້ນຢູ່ກັບຂັ້ນຕອນພາຍໃນຂອງຜູ້ຜະລິດນັ້ນໆ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/patch-management.adoc:5
msgid ""
"SUSE has introduced a new mechanism (2021) called \"retracted patches\" to "
"revoke such patches almost immediately by setting their advisory status to "
"\"retracted\" (instead of \"final\" or \"stable\")."
msgstr "SUSE ໄດ້ນຳສະເໜີກົນໄກໃໝ່ (2021) ທີ່ເອີ້ນວ່າ \"retracted patches\" ເພື່ອຍົກເລີກແພັດຊ໌ດັ່ງກ່າວ ເກືອບຈະທັນທີ ໂດຍການຕັ້ງຄ່າສະຖານະຄຳແນະນຳ (advisory status) ໃຫ້ເປັນ \"retracted\" (ແທນທີ່ຈະເປັນ \"final\" ຫຼື \"stable\")."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/patch-management.adoc:6
msgid ""
"A patch is \"retracted,\" when its advisory status attribute is set to "
"\"retracted.\" A package is \"retracted,\" when it belongs to a "
"\"retracted\" patch."
msgstr "ແພັດຊ໌ຈະຖືກຖືວ່າ \"retracted\" (ຖືກຖອນຄືນ), ເມື່ອຄຸນສົມບັດສະຖານະຄຳແນະນຳຂອງມັນຖືກຕັ້ງເປັນ \"retracted\". ແພັກເກດຈະຖືກຖືວ່າ \"retracted\", ເມື່ອມັນເປັນສ່ວນໜຶ່ງຂອງແພັດຊ໌ທີ່ຖືກຖອນຄືນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/patch-management.adoc:7
msgid ""
"A retracted patch or package cannot be installed on systems with "
"{productname}. The only way to install a retracted package, is to do it "
"manually with `zypper install` and specifying the exact package version.  "
"For example:"
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/patch-management.adoc:8
#, no-wrap
msgid "zypper install vim-8.0.1568-5.14.1\n"
msgstr "zypper install vim-8.0.1568-5.14.1\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/patch-management.adoc:9
msgid ""
"Retracted status of patches and packages is depicted with the "
"icon:times-circle[role=\"red\"] icon in the {webui} of {productname}. For "
"example, see:"
msgstr "ສະຖານະຖືກຖອນຄືນຂອງແພັດຊ໌ ແລະ ແພັກເກດ ຈະສະແດງດ້ວຍໄອຄອນ icon:times-circle[role=\"red\"] ໃນ {webui} ຂອງ {productname}. ຕົວຢ່າງ:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/patch-management.adoc:10
msgid "list of packages in a channel"
msgstr "ລາຍຊື່ແພັກເກດໃນຊ່ອງທາງ (channel)"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/patch-management.adoc:11
msgid "list of patches in a channel"
msgstr "ລາຍຊື່ແພັດຊ໌ໃນຊ່ອງທາງ (channel)"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/patch-management.adoc:12
msgid ""
"When a patch or package, that has been installed on a system, gets "
"retracted, the icon:times-circle[role=\"red\"] icon is also displayed in the "
"installed packages list of that system. {productname} does not provide a way "
"to downgrade such a patch or package."
msgstr "ເມື່ອແພັດຊ໌ ຫຼື ແພັກເກດທີ່ໄດ້ຕິດຕັ້ງໃນລະບົບໄປແລ້ວຖືກຖອນຄືນ, ໄອຄອນ icon:times-circle[role=\"red\"] ຈະສະແດງຢູ່ໃນລາຍຊື່ແພັກເກດທີ່ຕິດຕັ້ງແລ້ວຂອງລະບົບນັ້ນຄືກັນ. {productname} ບໍ່ມີວິທີການ ໃນການດາວເກຣດ (downgrade) ແພັດຊ໌ ຫຼື ແພັກເກດດັ່ງກ່າວ."

#. type: Title ===
#: en/modules/administration/pages/patch-management.adoc:13
#, no-wrap
msgid "Channel Clones"
msgstr "ການໂຄລນຊ່ອງທາງ (Channel Clones)"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/patch-management.adoc:14
msgid ""
"When using cloned channels, you must pay attention to the propagation of the "
"retracted advisory status from the original channels to the clones."
msgstr "ເມື່ອໃຊ້ຊ່ອງທາງທີ່ຖືກໂຄລນ (cloned channels), ທ່ານຕ້ອງເອົາໃຈໃສ່ກ່ຽວກັບການສົ່ງຕໍ່ສະຖານະ ການຖອນຄືນຈາກຊ່ອງທາງຕົ້ນສະບັບໄປຫາຊ່ອງທາງທີ່ໂຄລນມາ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/patch-management.adoc:15
msgid ""
"Upon cloning vendor channels into your organization, channel patches will be "
"cloned as well."
msgstr "ເມື່ອມີການໂຄລນຊ່ອງທາງຂອງຜູ້ຜະລິດເຂົ້າໄປໃນອົງກອນຂອງທ່ານ, ແພັດຊ໌ຂອງຊ່ອງທາງນັ້ນກໍຈະຖືກໂຄລນມາຄືກັນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/patch-management.adoc:16
msgid ""
"When the vendor retracts a patch in a channel and {productname} synchronizes "
"this channel (for example, with the nightly job), the \"retracted\" "
"attribute will not get propagated to the cloned patches and will not be "
"observed by the clients subscribed to cloned channels. To propagate the "
"attribute to your cloned channels use one of the following ways:"
msgstr "ເມື່ອຜູ້ຜະລິດຖອນຄືນແພັດຊ໌ໃນຊ່ອງທາງໜຶ່ງ ແລະ {productname} ຊິງໂຄຣໄນຊ່ອງທາງນັ້ນ (ຕົວຢ່າງ: ຜ່ານວຽກງານ nightly job), ຄຸນສົມບັດ \"retracted\" ຈະບໍ່ຖືກສົ່ງຕໍ່ໄປຫາ ແພັດຊ໌ທີ່ຖືກໂຄລນ ແລະ ລູກຂ່າຍທີ່ຕິດຕາມຊ່ອງທາງໂຄລນຈະບໍ່ເຫັນການປ່ຽນແປງນີ້. ເພື່ອສົ່ງຕໍ່ຄຸນສົມບັດດັ່ງກ່າວໄປຫາຊ່ອງທາງທີ່ໂຄລນຂອງທ່ານ ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ວິທີໃດໜຶ່ງດັ່ງນີ້:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/patch-management.adoc:17
msgid ""
"Patch Sync (menu:Software[Manage > cloned channel > Patches > Sync]). This "
"function allows you to align the attributes of patches in your cloned "
"channel to their originals."
msgstr "Patch Sync (menu:Software[Manage > cloned channel > Patches > Sync]). ຟັງຊັນນີ້ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ທ່ານສາມາດປັບປຸງຄຸນສົມບັດຂອງແພັດຊ໌ໃນຊ່ອງທາງທີ່ໂຄລນຂອງທ່ານ ໃຫ້ກົງກັບຕົ້ນສະບັບ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/patch-management.adoc:18
msgid ""
"Content Lifecycle Management. For more information about cloned channels in "
"the context of Content Lifecycle Management, see "
"xref:client-configuration:channels.adoc[]."
msgstr "Content Lifecycle Management. ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບຊ່ອງທາງທີ່ຖືກໂຄລນ ໃນບໍລິບົດຂອງ Content Lifecycle Management, ເບິ່ງໄດ້ທີ່ xref:client-configuration:channels.adoc[]."

#. type: Title ===
#: en/modules/administration/pages/patch-management.adoc:19
#, no-wrap
msgid "Patch sharing"
msgstr "ການແບ່ງປັນແພັດຊ໌ (Patch sharing)"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/patch-management.adoc:20
msgid ""
"When you create multiple vendor channel clones in your organization, the "
"patches are not cloned multiple times, but are shared between cloned "
"channels. As a consequence, when you synchronize your cloned patch (either "
"using the patch sync function or with Content Lifecycle Management mentioned "
"above), all channels using the cloned patch will observe that change."
msgstr "ເມື່ອທ່ານສ້າງຊ່ອງທາງໂຄລນຂອງຜູ້ຜະລິດຫຼາຍຊ່ອງທາງໃນອົງກອນຂອງທ່ານ, ແພັດຊ໌ຈະບໍ່ໄດ້ຖືກໂຄລນຫຼາຍຄັ້ງ, ແຕ່ຈະຖືກແບ່ງປັນລະຫວ່າງຊ່ອງທາງທີ່ໂຄລນເຫຼົ່ານັ້ນ. ດັ່ງນັ້ນ, ເມື່ອທ່ານຊິງໂຄຣໄນແພັດຊ໌ທີ່ຖືກໂຄລນຂອງທ່ານ (ບໍ່ວ່າຈະໃຊ້ຟັງຊັນ patch sync ຫຼື Content Lifecycle Management ກໍຕາມ), ທຸກໆຊ່ອງທາງທີ່ໃຊ້ແພັດຊ໌ທີ່ຖືກໂຄລນນັ້ນຈະເຫັນການປ່ຽນແປງດັ່ງກ່າວ."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/administration/pages/patch-management.adoc:21
#, no-wrap
msgid "Example:"
msgstr "ຕົວຢ່າງ:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/patch-management.adoc:22
msgid "Consider two Content Lifecycle Management projects `prj1` and `prj2`"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/patch-management.adoc:23
msgid "Both of these projects have 2 environments `dev` and `test`"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/patch-management.adoc:24
msgid "Both of these projects have a vendor channel set as a source channel"
msgstr "ທັງສອງໂຄງການນີ້ມີຊ່ອງທາງຂອງຜູ້ຜະລິດທີ່ຕັ້ງໄວ້ເປັນຊ່ອງທາງຕົ້ນທາງ (source channel)"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/patch-management.adoc:25
msgid ""
"All channels in this scenario (four cloned channels in total) are aligned to "
"the latest state of the vendor channels"
msgstr "ທຸກໆຊ່ອງທາງໃນສະຖານະການນີ້ (ທັງໝົດສີ່ຊ່ອງທາງໂຄລນ) ແມ່ນຖືກປັບໃຫ້ກົງກັບ ສະຖານະຫຼ້າສຸດຂອງຊ່ອງທາງຜູ້ຜະລິດ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/patch-management.adoc:26
msgid ""
"Vendor retracts a patch in the source channel and the nighly job "
"synchronizes it to your {productname}"
msgstr "ຜູ້ຜະລິດຖອນຄືນແພັດຊ໌ໃນຊ່ອງທາງຕົ້ນທາງ ແລະ nightly job ຊິງໂຄຣໄນມັນ ມາຍັງ {productname} ຂອງທ່ານ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/patch-management.adoc:27
msgid ""
"None of the four channels see this change because they are using a patch "
"clone, not the patch directly."
msgstr "ທັງສີ່ຊ່ອງທາງຈະບໍ່ເຫັນການປ່ຽນແປງນີ້ ເພາະພວກມັນໃຊ້ແພັດຊ໌ທີ່ຖືກໂຄລນມາ, ບໍ່ໄດ້ໃຊ້ແພັດຊ໌ໂດຍກົງ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/patch-management.adoc:28
msgid ""
"As soon as you synchronize your patch (either you build any of these two "
"projects, or you use the Patch Sync function on any of the four cloned "
"channels), due to the patch sharing, *ALL* of the cloned channels will see "
"the patch as retracted."
msgstr "ທັນທີທີ່ທ່ານຊິງໂຄຣໄນແພັດຊ໌ຂອງທ່ານ (ບໍ່ວ່າຈະເປັນການບິວ (build) ໂຄງການໃດໜຶ່ງໃນສອງອັນນີ້, ຫຼື ໃຊ້ຟັງຊັນ Patch Sync ໃນຊ່ອງທາງໃດໜຶ່ງໃນສີ່ອັນນັ້ນ), ຍ້ອນການແບ່ງປັນແພັດຊ໌, ຊ່ອງທາງໂຄລນ *ທັງໝົດ* ຈະເຫັນວ່າແພັດຊ໌ນັ້ນຖືກຖອນຄືນ."

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/ptfs.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Using PTFs in {productname}"
msgstr "ການໃຊ້ PTFs ໃນ {productname}"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/ptfs.adoc:2
msgid ""
"SUSE provides temporary fixes for all currently supported solutions shipped "
"directly to its customers.  These PTFs (Program Temporary Fixes) are now "
"available as repositories, which can be synced in {productname}."
msgstr "SUSE ຈັດຫາການແກ້ໄຂຊົ່ວຄາວ (temporary fixes) ສຳລັບທຸກໆໂຊລູຊັນທີ່ໄດ້ຮັບການສະໜັບສະໜູນໃນປັດຈຸບັນ ໃຫ້ກັບລູກຄ້າໂດຍກົງ. PTFs (Program Temporary Fixes) ເຫຼົ່ານີ້ຕອນນີ້ມີໃຫ້ບໍລິການໃນຮູບແບບ ຄັງເກັບ (repositories), ເຊິ່ງສາມາດຊິງໂຄຣໄນໄດ້ໃນ {productname}."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/administration/pages/ptfs.adoc:3
#, no-wrap
msgid "Understanding PTF packages"
msgstr "ຄວາມເຂົ້າໃຈກ່ຽວກັບແພັກເກດ PTF"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/ptfs.adoc:4
msgid ""
"PTF packages are installed via a proxy package and are named `ptf-xxxxxx`, "
"where xxxxxx is a number and part of the name of the package, not its "
"version."
msgstr "ແພັກເກດ PTF ຖືກຕິດຕັ້ງຜ່ານແພັກເກດພຣັອກຊີ ແລະ ຖືກຕັ້ງຊື່ວ່າ `ptf-xxxxxx`, ໂດຍທີ່ xxxxxx ແມ່ນຕົວເລກ ແລະ ເປັນສ່ວນໜຶ່ງຂອງຊື່ແພັກເກດ, ບໍ່ແມ່ນເວີຊັນຂອງມັນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/ptfs.adoc:5
msgid ""
"They will depend on the correct version of the package that is known to "
"include the correction in the software.  This type of package:"
msgstr "ພວກມັນຈະຂຶ້ນຢູ່ກັບເວີຊັນທີ່ຖືກຕ້ອງຂອງແພັກເກດທີ່ມີການແກ້ໄຂຊອບແວແລ້ວ. ແພັກເກດປະເພດນີ້:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/ptfs.adoc:6
msgid ""
"cannot be installed accidentally (i.e. zypper update will never suggest "
"installing them),"
msgstr "ບໍ່ສາມາດຖືກຕິດຕັ້ງໂດຍບັງເອີນ (ເຊັ່ນ: zypper update ຈະບໍ່ແນະນຳໃຫ້ຕິດຕັ້ງພວກມັນເລີຍ),"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/ptfs.adoc:7
msgid ""
"cannot be removed accidentally (i.e. a newer package version will not "
"replace the PTF one, unless the user makes it explicitly on the zypper "
"command line),"
msgstr "ບໍ່ສາມາດຖືກລົບອອກໂດຍບັງເອີນ (ເຊັ່ນ: ແພັກເກດເວີຊັນໃໝ່ກວ່າຈະບໍ່ມາແທນທີ່ PTF, ນອກຈາກວ່າຜູ້ໃຊ້ຈະສັ່ງໂດຍກົງຜ່ານ zypper command line),"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/ptfs.adoc:8
msgid ""
"is only updated when the newer version is known to address the specific "
"issue previously solved by the PTF,"
msgstr "ຈະຖືກອັບເດດກໍຕໍ່ເມື່ອເວີຊັນໃໝ່ກວ່າໄດ້ຮັບການຢືນຢັນວ່າແກ້ໄຂບັນຫາສະເພາະ ທີ່ເຄີຍຖືກແກ້ໄຂໂດຍ PTF ແລ້ວ,"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/ptfs.adoc:9
msgid ""
"updates only packages already installed on the system (i.e. if a software is "
"split into multiple packages, the PTF will replace only those currently "
"installed on the system)."
msgstr "ຈະອັບເດດສະເພາະແພັກເກດທີ່ຖືກຕິດຕັ້ງຢູ່ໃນລະບົບແລ້ວເທົ່ານັ້ນ (ເຊັ່ນ: ຫາກຊອບແວຖືກແຍກອອກເປັນຫຼາຍແພັກເກດ, PTF ຈະປ່ຽນແທນສະເພາະແພັກເກດທີ່ຕິດຕັ້ງຢູ່ໃນລະບົບໃນຕອນນັ້ນ)."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/ptfs.adoc:10
msgid ""
"The correct ID of the package will be provided by SUSE Support during the "
"course of the support case investigation, along with instruction on how to "
"deploy/restart the affected services."
msgstr "ລະຫັດ ID ທີ່ຖືກຕ້ອງຂອງແພັກເກດຈະຖືກສະໜອງໂດຍ SUSE Support ໃນລະຫວ່າງການກວດສອບກໍລະນີ, ພ້ອມກັບຄຳແນະນຳກ່ຽວກັບວິທີການຕິດຕັ້ງ/ເລີ່ມການເຮັດວຽກໃໝ່ຂອງບໍລິການທີ່ໄດ້ຮັບຜົນກະທົບ."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/administration/pages/ptfs.adoc:11
#, no-wrap
msgid "Installing PTF packages"
msgstr "ການຕິດຕັ້ງແພັກເກດ PTF"

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/ptfs.adoc:12
msgid ""
"PTF packages are currently only supported for SLE 12 and SLE 15 based "
"systems.  Other versions or operating systems do not have this feature and "
"the pages are not visible for them."
msgstr "ແພັກເກດ PTF ໃນປັດຈຸບັນຮອງຮັບສະເພາະລະບົບທີ່ອີງໃສ່ SLE 12 ແລະ SLE 15 ເທົ່ານັ້ນ. ເວີຊັນອື່ນ ຫຼື ລະບົບປະຕິບັດການອື່ນຈະບໍ່ມີຄຸນສົມບັດນີ້ ແລະ ໜ້າເວັບຕ່າງໆ ຈະບໍ່ສະແດງໃຫ້ເຫັນ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/ptfs.adoc:13
msgid ""
"Access to PTF channels via {productname} needs to be requested from L3 "
"support."
msgstr "ການເຂົ້າເຖິງຊ່ອງທາງ PTF ຜ່ານ {productname} ຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງໄດ້ຮັບການຮ້ອງຂໍຈາກ L3 support."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/administration/pages/ptfs.adoc:14
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Procedure: Enabling and synchronizing PTF repositories using the command "
"line"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການເປີດໃຊ້ ແລະ ຊິງໂຄຣໄນຄັງເກັບ PTF ໂດຍໃຊ້ command line"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/ptfs.adoc:15
msgid "On the console enter `mgr-sync refresh`."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/ptfs.adoc:16
msgid ""
"Enter `mgr-sync list channel` and look for channels starting with your {scc} "
"account name and `ptfs` in its name.  For example, "
"`a123456-sles-15.3-ptfs-x86_64`."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/ptfs.adoc:17
msgid "Enable the PTF channel with `mgr-sync add channel <label>`."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/ptfs.adoc:18
msgid ""
"This channel is now available and can be added to every system which is "
"using the same base channel."
msgstr "ຊ່ອງທາງນີ້ພ້ອມໃຊ້ງານແລ້ວ ແລະ ສາມາດເພີ່ມເຂົ້າໃນທຸກໆລະບົບ ທີ່ກຳລັງໃຊ້ຊ່ອງທາງພື້ນຖານ (base channel) ດຽວກັນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/ptfs.adoc:19
msgid ""
"PTF packages need to be installed explicitly, since they are not "
"automatically picked up when updating a system.  The SUSE Customer Support "
"will provide the PTF number to fix a specific problem.  With the number the "
"proxy package can be identified in the PTF list.  In {productname} {webui} "
"every system with PTFs available for installation has a page which lists "
"them."
msgstr "ແພັກເກດ PTF ຕ້ອງໄດ້ຮັບການຕິດຕັ້ງໂດຍກົງ, ເພາະພວກມັນຈະບໍ່ຖືກເລືອກໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດໃນຕອນອັບເດດລະບົບ. SUSE Customer Support ຈະໃຫ້ໝາຍເລກ PTF ເພື່ອແກ້ໄຂບັນຫາສະເພາະ. ເມື່ອມີໝາຍເລກດັ່ງກ່າວ ກໍຈະສາມາດລະບຸແພັກເກດພຣັອກຊີໃນລາຍຊື່ PTF ໄດ້. ໃນ {webui} ຂອງ {productname}, ທຸກໆລະບົບທີ່ມີ PTF ພ້ອມໃຫ້ຕິດຕັ້ງຈະມີໜ້າທີ່ສະແດງລາຍຊື່ຂອງພວກມັນ."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/administration/pages/ptfs.adoc:20
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Procedure: Enabling and synchronizing PTF repositories via the {productname} "
"{webui}"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການເປີດໃຊ້ ແລະ ຊິງໂຄຣໄນຄັງເກັບ PTF ຜ່ານ {webui} ຂອງ {productname}"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/ptfs.adoc:21
msgid ""
"In the {productname} {webui}, navigate to menu:Admin[Setup Wizard > "
"Products] and look for the product you want to enable the PTF repository "
"for."
msgstr "ໃນ {webui} ຂອງ {productname}, ໃຫ້ໄປທີ່ menu:Admin[Setup Wizard > Products] ແລະ ຊອກຫາຜະລິດຕະພັນທີ່ທ່ານຕ້ອງການເປີດໃຊ້ຄັງເກັບ PTF."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/ptfs.adoc:22
msgid "Click btn:[Show product's channels] next to the products sync status."
msgstr "ຄລິກ btn:[Show product's channels] ທີ່ຢູ່ຖັດຈາກສະຖານະການຊິງໂຄຣໄນຂອງຜະລິດຕະພັນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/ptfs.adoc:23
msgid ""
"You should see a popup listing mandatory and optional channels for the "
"product."
msgstr "ທ່ານຄວນຈະເຫັນປັອບອັບ (popup) ທີ່ສະແດງລາຍຊື່ຊ່ອງທາງທີ່ບັງຄັບ ແລະ ຊ່ອງທາງເສີມສຳລັບຜະລິດຕະພັນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/ptfs.adoc:24
msgid ""
"In the optional channels list look for channels starting with your {scc} "
"account name and `ptfs` in its name.  For example "
"`a123456-sles-15.3-ptfs-x86_64`."
msgstr "ໃນລາຍຊື່ຊ່ອງທາງເສີມ ໃຫ້ຊອກຫາຊ່ອງທາງທີ່ຂຶ້ນຕົ້ນດ້ວຍຊື່ບັນຊີ {scc} ຂອງທ່ານ ແລະ ມີຄຳວ່າ `ptfs` ຢູ່ໃນຊື່. ຕົວຢ່າງ: `a123456-sles-15.3-ptfs-x86_64`."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/ptfs.adoc:25
msgid ""
"Select the channel using the checkbox next to its name and click "
"btn:[Confirm] to schedule the sync."
msgstr "ເລືອກຊ່ອງທາງໂດຍການໝາຍຕິກໃນຊ່ອງຖັດຈາກຊື່ ແລະ ຄລິກ btn:[Confirm] ເພື່ອກຳນົດເວລາການຊິງໂຄຣໄນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/ptfs.adoc:26
msgid ""
"Note that the product has to be installed to be able to add optional "
"channels to it."
msgstr "ໝາຍເຫດ: ຜະລິດຕະພັນຕ້ອງຖືກຕິດຕັ້ງກ່ອນ ຈຶ່ງຈະສາມາດເພີ່ມຊ່ອງທາງເສີມໃຫ້ກັບມັນໄດ້."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/administration/pages/ptfs.adoc:27
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Installing the PTF packages"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການຕິດຕັ້ງແພັກເກດ PTF"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/ptfs.adoc:28
msgid ""
"In the {productname} {webui}, navigate to menu:Systems[Systems List] and "
"select the client where you want to install a PTF."
msgstr "ໃນ {webui} ຂອງ {productname}, ໃຫ້ໄປທີ່ menu:Systems[Systems List] ແລະ ເລືອກລູກຂ່າຍທີ່ທ່ານຕ້ອງການຕິດຕັ້ງ PTF."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/ptfs.adoc:29
msgid ""
"Navigate to the menu:Systems[Software > Packages > Software Channels] and "
"select the `PTF channel`."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/ptfs.adoc:30
msgid "Click btn:[Next], and `Confirm Software Channel Change` with btn:[Confirm]."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/ptfs.adoc:31
msgid ""
"To check if the channel assignment is finished, navigate to "
"menu:Systems[Events > History] to see the results."
msgstr "ເພື່ອລະບຸວ່າການມອບໝາຍຊ່ອງທາງສຳເລັດແລ້ວຫຼືບໍ່, ໃຫ້ໄປທີ່ menu:Systems[Events > History] ເພື່ອເບິ່ງຜົນລັດ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/ptfs.adoc:32
msgid "Navigate to the menu:Systems[Software > PTFs > Install] sub tab."
msgstr "ໄປທີ່ແທັບຍ່ອຍ menu:Systems[Software > PTFs > Install]."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/ptfs.adoc:33
msgid "Select the PTF package you want to install."
msgstr "ເລືອກແພັກເກດ PTF ທີ່ທ່ານຕ້ອງການຕິດຕັ້ງ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/ptfs.adoc:34
msgid ""
"Click btn:[Install PTF], and `Confirm Program Temporary Fixes (PTFs) "
"Installation` with btn:[Confirm]."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/ptfs.adoc:35
msgid "To see PTF installation results, navigate to menu:Systems[Events > History]."
msgstr "ເພື່ອເບິ່ງຜົນການຕິດຕັ້ງ PTF, ໃຫ້ໄປທີ່ menu:Systems[Events > History]."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/ptfs.adoc:36
msgid ""
"In case a PTF should be installed using the API, the normal "
"`system.schedulePackageInstall` API can be used with the proxy package name."
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/administration/pages/ptfs.adoc:37
#, no-wrap
msgid "After PTF installation"
msgstr "ຫຼັງຈາກການຕິດຕັ້ງ PTF"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/ptfs.adoc:38
msgid ""
"Once a PTF is confirmed to address the reported issue, the updated package "
"will be tracked for inclusion into a future maintenance update before being "
"widely distributed as an regular maintenance update in the update "
"repositories."
msgstr "ເມື່ອ PTF ໄດ້ຮັບການຢືນຢັນວ່າແກ້ໄຂບັນຫາທີ່ລາຍງານໄດ້ແລ້ວ, ແພັກເກດທີ່ອັບເດດແລ້ວຈະຖືກຕິດຕາມ ເພື່ອລວມເຂົ້າໃນການອັບເດດບຳລຸງຮັກສາ (maintenance update) ໃນອະນາຄົດ ກ່ອນທີ່ຈະຖືກແຈກຢາຍ ເປັນການອັບເດດບຳລຸງຮັກສາແບບປົກກະຕິໃນຄັງເກັບການອັບເດດ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/ptfs.adoc:39
msgid ""
"When this regular update with the fix is released, an updated version of the "
"PTF will also be released into the account-specific PTF repository.  The "
"updated PTF will remove the strict dependencies and allow updates to be "
"installed again."
msgstr "ເມື່ອການອັບເດດປົກກະຕິທີ່ມີການແກ້ໄຂບັນຫາຖືກປ່ອຍອອກມາ, PTF ເວີຊັນໃໝ່ກໍຈະຖືກປ່ອຍອອກມາ ໃນຄັງເກັບ PTF ສະເພາະບັນຊີຄືກັນ. PTF ເວີຊັນໃໝ່ນີ້ຈະລົບຂໍ້ກຳນົດ dependencies ທີ່ເຄັ່ງຄັດ ແລະ ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ສາມາດຕິດຕັ້ງການອັບເດດໄດ້ອີກຄັ້ງ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/ptfs.adoc:40
msgid ""
"The replacement of the PTF with the maintenance update which includes the "
"fix happens automatically via a standard package update or patch "
"installation."
msgstr "ການປ່ຽນແທນ PTF ດ້ວຍການອັບເດດບຳລຸງຮັກສາທີ່ມີການແກ້ໄຂບັນຫາແລ້ວ ຈະເກີດຂຶ້ນໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ ຜ່ານການອັບເດດແພັກເກດມາດຕະຖານ ຫຼື ການຕິດຕັ້ງແພັດຊ໌."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/administration/pages/ptfs.adoc:41
#, no-wrap
msgid "Removing the patched version of a package"
msgstr "ການລົບແພັກເກດເວີຊັນທີ່ຖືກແກ້ໄຂ (patched version) ອອກ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/ptfs.adoc:42
msgid ""
"In cases where a PTF needs to be uninstalled and the non-patched version of "
"the packages need to be installed on the system, a simple package remove "
"cannot be used.  The PTF package is not selectable in the standard package "
"list page."
msgstr "ໃນກໍລະນີທີ່ຕ້ອງການຖອນການຕິດຕັ້ງ PTF ແລະ ຕິດຕັ້ງແພັກເກດເວີຊັນທີ່ບໍ່ໄດ້ແກ້ໄຂ (non-patched) ເຂົ້າໃນລະບົບແທນ, ຈະບໍ່ສາມາດໃຊ້ວິທີການລົບແພັກເກດແບບງ່າຍໆໄດ້. ແພັກເກດ PTF ຈະບໍ່ສາມາດເລືອກໄດ້ໃນໜ້າລາຍຊື່ແພັກເກດມາດຕະຖານ."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/administration/pages/ptfs.adoc:43
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Removing the PTF packages"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການລົບແພັກເກດ PTF"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/ptfs.adoc:44
msgid ""
"In the {productname} {webui}, navigate to menu:Systems[Systems List] and "
"select the client you want to remove a PTF from."
msgstr "ໃນ {webui} ຂອງ {productname}, ໃຫ້ໄປທີ່ menu:Systems[Systems List] ແລະ ເລືອກລູກຂ່າຍທີ່ທ່ານຕ້ອງການລົບ PTF ອອກ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/ptfs.adoc:45
msgid "Navigate to the menu:Systems[Software > PTFs > List/Remove] sub tab."
msgstr "ໄປທີ່ແທັບຍ່ອຍ menu:Systems[Software > PTFs > List/Remove]."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/ptfs.adoc:46
msgid "Select the ptf package you want to remove."
msgstr "ເລືອກແພັກເກດ PTF ທີ່ທ່ານຕ້ອງການລົບອອກ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/ptfs.adoc:47
msgid ""
"Click btn:[Remove PTFs], and on the `Confirm Program Temporary Fixes (PTFs) "
"Removal` page click btn:[Confirm]."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/ptfs.adoc:48
msgid "To see the results, navigate to menu:Systems[Events > History]."
msgstr "ເພື່ອເບິ່ງຜົນລັດ, ໃຫ້ໄປທີ່ menu:Systems[Events > History]."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/ptfs.adoc:49
msgid ""
"Removing PTFs requires a special version of `libzypp` and `zypper` to be "
"installed on the client system.  Check `zypper --help` to confirm whether "
"`removeptf` is supported.  The `List/Remove` tab is only visible if this "
"condition is met."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/ptfs.adoc:50
msgid ""
"In case the PTF should be removed using the API, the normal "
"`system.schedulePackageRemove` API can be used with the proxy package name."
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/administration/pages/ptfs.adoc:51
#, no-wrap
msgid "Removing the patched version of a package on the client"
msgstr "ການລົບແພັກເກດເວີຊັນທີ່ຖືກແກ້ໄຂໃນລູກຂ່າຍ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/ptfs.adoc:52
msgid ""
"In case a PTF should be removed directly on the client using the console, it "
"is required to use a special command `zypper removeptf`.  All other ways "
"result either in an error or can lead to unwanted behavior like removing "
"important packages from the system and make the system unusable."
msgstr ""

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/removing-channels.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Removing Channel"
msgstr "ການລົບຊ່ອງທາງ (Channel)"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/removing-channels.adoc:2
msgid ""
"This chapter describes how to manually remove {suse} provided channels from "
"{productname} and clean up end-of-life products, to reclaim space or for "
"other purposes."
msgstr "ບົດນີ້ອະທິບາຍວິທີການລົບຊ່ອງທາງທີ່ {suse} ຈັດຫາໃຫ້ອອກຈາກ {productname} ດ້ວຍຕົນເອງ ແລະ ການທຳຄວາມສະອາດຜະລິດຕະພັນທີ່ໝົດອາຍຸການໃຊ້ງານ (end-of-life) ເພື່ອຄືນພື້ນທີ່ເກັບຂໍ້ມູນ ຫຼື ເພື່ອຈຸດປະສົງອື່ນໆ."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/administration/pages/removing-channels.adoc:3
#, no-wrap
msgid "Prepare to Remove a Channel"
msgstr "ການກຽມຕົວເພື່ອລົບຊ່ອງທາງ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/removing-channels.adoc:4
msgid ""
"Before removing a channel, you must identify the label for the channel to be "
"removed.  It can be done with {webui} or on the command line."
msgstr "ກ່ອນທີ່ຈະລົບຊ່ອງທາງ, ທ່ານຕ້ອງລະບຸເລເບວ (label) ຂອງຊ່ອງທາງທີ່ຈະລົບອອກກ່ອນ. ສາມາດເຮັດໄດ້ຜ່ານ {webui} ຫຼື ຜ່ານ command line."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/removing-channels.adoc:5
msgid ""
"Be careful not to remove channels that systems are currently subscribed to, "
"or that you are planning on subscribing a system to."
msgstr "ໃຫ້ລະມັດລະວັງ ບໍ່ໃຫ້ລົບຊ່ອງທາງທີ່ລະບົບຕ່າງໆ ກຳລັງຕິດຕາມ (subscribed) ຢູ່ໃນປັດຈຸບັນ, ຫຼື ຊ່ອງທາງທີ່ທ່ານມີແຜນຈະໃຫ້ລະບົບຕິດຕາມໃນອະນາຄົດ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/removing-channels.adoc:6
msgid ""
"If there are systems that are currently subscribed to a channel that you "
"want to delete, do not remove the channel until those systems are upgraded "
"or unsubscribed."
msgstr "ຫາກມີລະບົບໃດໜຶ່ງທີ່ກຳລັງຕິດຕາມຊ່ອງທາງທີ່ທ່ານຕ້ອງການລົບ, ຫ້າມລົບຊ່ອງທາງນັ້ນ ຈົນກວ່າລະບົບເຫຼົ່ານັ້ນຈະຖືກອັບເກຣດ ຫຼື ຍົກເລີກການຕິດຕາມແລ້ວ."

#. type: Title ===
#: en/modules/administration/pages/removing-channels.adoc:7
#, no-wrap
msgid "Identify Channel Labels"
msgstr "ການລະບຸເລເບວຂອງຊ່ອງທາງ"

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/administration/pages/removing-channels.adoc:8
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Identifying Channel Labels Using {webui}"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການລະບຸເລເບວຂອງຊ່ອງທາງໂດຍໃຊ້ {webui}"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/removing-channels.adoc:9
#: en/modules/administration/pages/removing-channels.adoc:17
msgid "In the {productname} {webui}, navigate to menu:Software[Channel List > All]."
msgstr "ໃນ {webui} ຂອງ {productname}, ໃຫ້ໄປທີ່ menu:Software[Channel List > All]."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/removing-channels.adoc:10
msgid ""
"This page displays the `Channel Name`.  If you select the link for a channel "
"name, you will see the field for `Channel Label`."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/removing-channels.adoc:11
msgid "Identify the channel, and child channels, to be removed."
msgstr "ລະບຸຊ່ອງທາງຫຼັກ ແລະ ຊ່ອງທາງຍ່ອຍ (child channels) ທີ່ຈະລົບອອກ."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/administration/pages/removing-channels.adoc:12
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Identifying Channel Labels Using the Command Line"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການລະບຸເລເບວຂອງຊ່ອງທາງໂດຍໃຊ້ Command Line"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/removing-channels.adoc:13
msgid ""
"You can get a list of channels by running the following command on the "
"{productname} container host:"
msgstr "ທ່ານສາມາດເບິ່ງລາຍຊື່ຊ່ອງທາງໄດ້ໂດຍການລັນຄຳສັ່ງຕໍ່ໄປນີ້ໃນ {productname} container host:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/removing-channels.adoc:14
#, no-wrap
msgid "mgrctl exec -ti -- spacewalk-remove-channel -l\n"
msgstr "mgrctl exec -ti -- spacewalk-remove-channel -l\n"

#. type: Title ===
#: en/modules/administration/pages/removing-channels.adoc:15
#, no-wrap
msgid "Verify Channel System Subscriptions"
msgstr "ກວດສອບການຕິດຕາມຊ່ອງທາງຂອງລະບົບ"

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/administration/pages/removing-channels.adoc:16
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Verifying Channel System Subscriptions Using {webui}"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການກວດສອບການຕິດຕາມຊ່ອງທາງຂອງລະບົບໂດຍໃຊ້ {webui}"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/removing-channels.adoc:18
msgid "Locate `Systems` column on the right."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/removing-channels.adoc:19
msgid ""
"Check the `Systems` column for the channel, or any child channels, that you "
"want to remove."
msgstr ""

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/administration/pages/removing-channels.adoc:20
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Verifying Channel System Subscriptions Using the Command Line"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການກວດສອບການຕິດຕາມຊ່ອງທາງຂອງລະບົບໂດຍໃຊ້ Command Line"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/removing-channels.adoc:21
msgid "Run the following command on the {productname} container host:"
msgstr "ລັນຄຳສັ່ງຕໍ່ໄປນີ້ໃນ {productname} container host:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/removing-channels.adoc:22
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"mgrctl exec -ti -- 'spacecmd -- softwarechannel_listsystems <Channel "
"Label>'\n"
msgstr "mgrctl exec -ti -- 'spacecmd -- softwarechannel_listsystems <ເລເບວຊ່ອງທາງ>'\n"

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/administration/pages/removing-channels.adoc:23
#, no-wrap
msgid "Remove Channel"
msgstr "ລົບຊ່ອງທາງ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/removing-channels.adoc:24
msgid ""
"A channel, with its metadata, can be removed with command line tools only.  "
"The `spacewalk-remove-channel` command automatically removes the software "
"packages, if they are not referenced anymore by other channels.  Thus it "
"removes the metadata from the database and the files from the storage "
"medium."
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ===
#: en/modules/administration/pages/removing-channels.adoc:25
#, no-wrap
msgid "Remove a Child Channel"
msgstr "ລົບຊ່ອງທາງຍ່ອຍ"

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/administration/pages/removing-channels.adoc:26
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Removing a Child Channel Using the Command Line"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການລົບຊ່ອງທາງຍ່ອຍໂດຍໃຊ້ Command Line"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/removing-channels.adoc:27
msgid ""
"To remove an individual channel run the following command on the "
"{productname} container host:"
msgstr "ເພື່ອລົບຊ່ອງທາງໃດໜຶ່ງ ໃຫ້ລັນຄຳສັ່ງຕໍ່ໄປນີ້ໃນ {productname} container host:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/removing-channels.adoc:28
#, no-wrap
msgid "mgrctl exec -ti -- spacewalk-remove-channel -c channel-label\n"
msgstr "mgrctl exec -ti -- spacewalk-remove-channel -c <ເລເບວຊ່ອງທາງ>\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/removing-channels.adoc:29
msgid ""
"To remove multiple channels at the same time, use `-c` flag for each "
"channel, followed by the `channel-label`.  For example:"
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/removing-channels.adoc:30
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"mgrctl exec -ti -- spacewalk-remove-channel -c channel-label1 -c "
"channel-label2\n"
msgstr "mgrctl exec -ti -- spacewalk-remove-channel -c <ເລເບວຊ່ອງທາງ1> -c <ເລເບວຊ່ອງທາງ2>\n"

#. type: Title ===
#: en/modules/administration/pages/removing-channels.adoc:31
#, no-wrap
msgid "Remove a Parent and All Its Child Channels"
msgstr "ລົບຊ່ອງທາງຫຼັກ ແລະ ຊ່ອງທາງຍ່ອຍທັງໝົດຂອງມັນ"

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/administration/pages/removing-channels.adoc:32
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Removing a Parent and All Its Child Channels"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການລົບຊ່ອງທາງຫຼັກ ແລະ ຊ່ອງທາງຍ່ອຍທັງໝົດຂອງມັນ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/removing-channels.adoc:33
msgid ""
"To remove a parent channel with all of the child channels run "
"`spacewalk-remove-channel` with the `-a` option and replace "
"`parent-channel-label` with a channel label such as "
"`sles12-sp5-pool-x86_64`:"
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/removing-channels.adoc:34
#, no-wrap
msgid "mgrctl exec -ti -- spacewalk-remove-channel -a parent-channel-label\n"
msgstr "mgrctl exec -ti -- spacewalk-remove-channel -a <ເລເບວຊ່ອງທາງຫຼັກ>\n"

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/repo-metadata.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Repository Metadata"
msgstr "ເມຕາດາຕາຂອງຄັງເກັບ (Repository Metadata)"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/repo-metadata.adoc:2
msgid "You require a custom GPG key to be able to sign repository metadata."
msgstr "ທ່ານຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງມີຄີ GPG ແບບກຳນົດເອງ ເພື່ອໃຫ້ສາມາດເຊັນຊື່ເມຕາດາຕາຂອງຄັງເກັບໄດ້."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/administration/pages/repo-metadata.adoc:4
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Generating a custom GPG key"
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/repo-metadata.adoc:5
msgid "As the root user, use the `gpg` command to generate a new key:"
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/repo-metadata.adoc:6
#, no-wrap
msgid "mgrctl exec -it -- gpg --full-generate-key\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/repo-metadata.adoc:7
msgid ""
"At the prompts, select `RSA` as the key type, with a size of 2048 bits, and "
"select an appropriate expiry date for your key."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/repo-metadata.adoc:8
msgid "Check the details for your new key, and type `y` to confirm."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/repo-metadata.adoc:9
msgid ""
"At the prompts, enter a name and email address to be associated with your "
"key."
msgstr "ເມື່ອມີການຖາມ, ໃຫ້ປ້ອນຊື່ ແລະ ທີ່ຢູ່ອີເມວທີ່ຈະຜູກກັບຄີຂອງທ່ານ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/repo-metadata.adoc:10
msgid ""
"You can also add a comment to help you identify the key, if desired.  When "
"you are happy with the user identity, type `O` to confirm."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/repo-metadata.adoc:11
msgid "At the prompt, enter a passphrase to protect your key."
msgstr "ເມື່ອມີການຖາມ, ໃຫ້ປ້ອນລະຫັດຜ່ານ (passphrase) ເພື່ອປົກປ້ອງຄີຂອງທ່ານ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/repo-metadata.adoc:12
msgid "The key should be automatically added to your keyring."
msgstr "ຄີຄວນຈະຖືກເພີ່ມເຂົ້າໃນ keyring ຂອງທ່ານໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/repo-metadata.adoc:13
msgid "You can check by listing the keys in your keyring:"
msgstr "ທ່ານສາມາດກວດສອບໄດ້ໂດຍການສະແດງລາຍຊື່ຄີໃນ keyring ຂອງທ່ານ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/repo-metadata.adoc:14
#, no-wrap
msgid "mgrctl exec -- gpg --list-keys\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/repo-metadata.adoc:15
msgid ""
"Add the password for your keyring to the `/etc/rhn/signing.conf` "
"configuration file, by opening the file in your text editor and adding this "
"line:"
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/repo-metadata.adoc:16
#, no-wrap
msgid "GPGPASS=\"password\"\n"
msgstr "GPGPASS=\"ລະຫັດຜ່ານ\"\n"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/repo-metadata.adoc:17
msgid ""
"For renewing a GPG key, see "
"xref:administration:troubleshooting/tshoot-sync.adoc[]."
msgstr "ສຳລັບການຕໍ່ອາຍຸຄີ GPG, ເບິ່ງໄດ້ທີ່ xref:administration:troubleshooting/tshoot-sync.adoc[]."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/repo-metadata.adoc:18
msgid ""
"You can manage metadata signing on the command line using the "
"`mgr-sign-metadata-ctl` command."
msgstr ""

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/administration/pages/repo-metadata.adoc:19
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Enabling metadata signing"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/repo-metadata.adoc:20
msgid "You need to know the short identifier for the key to use."
msgstr "ທ່ານຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງຮູ້ລະຫັດລະບຸແບບສັ້ນ (short identifier) ສຳລັບຄີທີ່ຈະນຳໃຊ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/repo-metadata.adoc:21
msgid "You can list your available public keys in short format:"
msgstr "ທ່ານສາມາດສະແດງລາຍຊື່ public keys ທີ່ມີຢູ່ຂອງທ່ານໃນຮູບແບບສັ້ນ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/repo-metadata.adoc:22
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"mgrctl exec -- gpg --keyid-format short --list-keys\n"
"...\n"
"pub   rsa4096/3E7BFE0A 2019-04-02 [SC] [expires: 2029-04-01]\n"
"      A43F9EC645ED838ED3014B035CFA51BF3E7BFE0A\n"
"uid         [ultimate] SUSE Manager\n"
"sub   rsa4096/118DE7FF 2019-04-02 [E] [expires: 2029-04-01]\n"
msgstr ""
"mgrctl exec -- gpg --keyid-format short --list-keys\n"
"...\n"
"pub   rsa4096/3E7BFE0A 2019-04-02 [SC] [expires: 2029-04-01]\n"
"      A43F9EC645ED838ED3014B035CFA51BF3E7BFE0A\n"
"uid         [ultimate] SUSE Manager\n"
"sub   rsa4096/118DE7FF 2019-04-02 [E] [expires: 2029-04-01]\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/repo-metadata.adoc:23
msgid "Enable metadata signing with the `mgr-sign-metadata-ctl` command:"
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/repo-metadata.adoc:24
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"mgrctl exec -- mgr-sign-metadata-ctl enable 3E7BFE0A\n"
"OK. Found key 3E7BFE0A in keyring.\n"
"DONE. Set key 3E7BFE0A in /etc/rhn/signing.conf.\n"
"DONE. Enabled metadata signing in /etc/rhn/rhn.conf.\n"
"DONE. Exported key 3E7BFE0A to /srv/susemanager/salt/gpg/mgr-keyring.gpg.\n"
"DONE. Exported key 3E7BFE0A to /var/spacewalk/gpg/<KEY_NAME>.key.\n"
"NOTE. For the changes to become effective run:\n"
"   mgr-sign-metadata-ctl regen-metadata\n"
msgstr ""
"mgrctl exec -- mgr-sign-metadata-ctl enable 3E7BFE0A\n"
"OK. Found key 3E7BFE0A in keyring.\n"
"DONE. Set key 3E7BFE0A in /etc/rhn/signing.conf.\n"
"DONE. Enabled metadata signing in /etc/rhn/rhn.conf.\n"
"DONE. Exported key 3E7BFE0A to /srv/susemanager/salt/gpg/mgr-keyring.gpg.\n"
"DONE. Exported key 3E7BFE0A to /var/spacewalk/gpg/<ຊື່_ຄີ>.key.\n"
"NOTE. ເພື່ອໃຫ້ການປ່ຽນແປງມີຜົນ ໃຫ້ລັນຄຳສັ່ງ:\n"
"   mgr-sign-metadata-ctl regen-metadata\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/repo-metadata.adoc:25
msgid "You can check that your configuration is correct with this command:"
msgstr "ທ່ານສາມາດກວດສອບວ່າການກຳນົດຄ່າຂອງທ່ານຖືກຕ້ອງຫຼືບໍ່ ດ້ວຍຄຳສັ່ງນີ້:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/repo-metadata.adoc:26
#, no-wrap
msgid "mgrctl exec -- mgr-sign-metadata-ctl check-config\n"
msgstr "mgrctl exec -- mgr-sign-metadata-ctl check-config\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/repo-metadata.adoc:27
msgid "Restart the container for the configuration changes to be detected."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/repo-metadata.adoc:29
msgid ""
"Schedule metadata regeneration to replace all metadata with new signed "
"versions."
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/repo-metadata.adoc:30
#, no-wrap
msgid "mgrctl exec -- mgr-sign-metadata-ctl regen-metadata\n"
msgstr "mgrctl exec -- mgr-sign-metadata-ctl regen-metadata\n"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/repo-metadata.adoc:31
msgid ""
"You can also use the `mgr-sign-metadata-ctl` command to perform other "
"tasks.  Use `mgr-sign-metadata-ctl --help` to see the complete list."
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/repo-metadata.adoc:32
msgid ""
"Repository metadata signing is a global option.  When it is enabled, it is "
"enabled on all software channels on the server.  This means that all clients "
"connected to the server need to trust the new GPG key to be able to install "
"or update packages."
msgstr "ການເຊັນຊື່ເມຕາດາຕາຂອງຄັງເກັບ ແມ່ນຕົວເລືອກລະດັບສາກົນ (global option). ເມື່ອຖືກເປີດໃຊ້ແລ້ວ, ມັນຈະມີຜົນກັບທຸກຊ່ອງທາງຊອບແວໃນເຊີເວີ. ນີ້ໝາຍຄວາມວ່າລູກຂ່າຍທຸກໆ ເຄື່ອງທີ່ເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ກັບເຊີເວີ ຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງໄດ້ຮັບການຢືນຢັນຄວາມເຊື່ອຖືໃຫ້ກັບຄີ GPG ໃໝ່ ຈຶ່ງຈະສາມາດຕິດຕັ້ງ ຫຼື ອັບເດດແພັກເກດໄດ້."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/administration/pages/repo-metadata.adoc:33
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Importing GPG keys on clients"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/repo-metadata.adoc:34
msgid "Deploying GPG keys to the clients works with salt states."
msgstr "ການຕິດຕັ້ງຄີ GPG ໄປຍັງລູກຂ່າຍ ແມ່ນເຮັດວຽກຮ່ວມກັບ salt states."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/repo-metadata.adoc:35
msgid "Apply the highstate with the {productname} {webui}."
msgstr "ນຳໃຊ້ highstate ໂດຍໃຊ້ {webui} ຂອງ {productname}."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/repo-metadata.adoc:36
msgid ""
"For more information about troubleshooting GPG keys, see "
"xref:administration:troubleshooting/tshoot-sync.adoc[]."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບການແກ້ໄຂບັນຫາຄີ GPG, ເບິ່ງໄດ້ທີ່ xref:administration:troubleshooting/tshoot-sync.adoc[]."

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/reporting-database.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Reporting Database"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/reporting-database.adoc:2
msgid ""
"{productname} includes a reporting database on every server.  The reporting "
"database is a separate PostgreSQL database that stores a de-normalized, "
"read-optimized snapshot of the most relevant data from the main "
"{productname} database.  External reporting tools can connect directly to "
"this database to query and visualize data."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/reporting-database.adoc:3
msgid ""
"In a hub deployment, the hub aggregates the reporting databases of all "
"connected peripheral servers into a single central reporting database.  For "
"hub-specific setup and aggregation, see "
"xref:specialized-guides:large-deployments/hub-reporting.adoc[]."
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/administration/pages/reporting-database.adoc:4
#, no-wrap
msgid "Setup"
msgstr "ການຕິດຕັ້ງ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/reporting-database.adoc:5
msgid ""
"The reporting database and schema are set up by default using the local "
"PostgreSQL server.  The reporting database is a separate database accessible "
"via the network."
msgstr "ຖານຂໍ້ມູນລາຍງານ ແລະ schema ຈະຖືກຕັ້ງຄ່າເປັນຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນໂດຍໃຊ້ PostgreSQL server ພາຍໃນເຄື່ອງ. ຖານຂໍ້ມູນລາຍງານເປັນຖານຂໍ້ມູນແຍກຕ່າງຫາກທີ່ສາມາດເຂົ້າເຖິງໄດ້ຜ່ານເຄືອຂ່າຍ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/reporting-database.adoc:6
msgid ""
"In a hub deployment, the connection between hub and peripheral servers is "
"established via hub online synchronization.  For more information, see "
"xref:specialized-guides:large-deployments/hub-online-sync.adoc[]."
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ===
#: en/modules/administration/pages/reporting-database.adoc:7
#, no-wrap
msgid "Create a DB User for the Reporting Database"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/reporting-database.adoc:8
msgid ""
"Before connecting an external reporting tool to the database, create a user "
"with read-only permissions.  Use the `uyuni-setup-reportdb-user` command for "
"this:"
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/reporting-database.adoc:9
#, no-wrap
msgid "usage: uyuni-setup-reportdb-user [options]\n"
msgstr "ການໃຊ້ງານ: uyuni-setup-reportdb-user [options]\n"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/reporting-database.adoc:10
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"options:\n"
"  --help\n"
"            show this help message and exit\n"
"  --non-interactive\n"
"            Switches to non-interactive mode\n"
"  --dbuser=DBUSER\n"
"            Report DB User\n"
"  --dbpassword=DBPASSWORD\n"
"            Report DB Password\n"
"  --add\n"
"            Add the new user\n"
"  --delete\n"
"            Delete the user\n"
"  --modify\n"
"            Set a new password\n"
msgstr ""
"options:\n"
"  --help\n"
"            ສະແດງຂໍ້ຄວາມຊ່ວຍເຫຼືອນີ້ແລ້ວອອກ\n"
"  --non-interactive\n"
"            ປ່ຽນເປັນໂໝດແບບບໍ່ມີການໂຕ້ຕອບ\n"
"  --dbuser=DBUSER\n"
"            ຜູ້ໃຊ້ຖານຂໍ້ມູນລາຍງານ\n"
"  --dbpassword=DBPASSWORD\n"
"            ລະຫັດຜ່ານຖານຂໍ້ມູນລາຍງານ\n"
"  --add\n"
"            ເພີ່ມຜູ້ໃຊ້ໃໝ່\n"
"  --delete\n"
"            ລຶບຜູ້ໃຊ້\n"
"  --modify\n"
"            ຕັ້ງລະຫັດຜ່ານໃໝ່\n"

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/administration/pages/reporting-database.adoc:11
#, no-wrap
msgid "Database Schema"
msgstr "Database Schema"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/reporting-database.adoc:12
msgid ""
"The schema exports the most important tables from the main {productname} "
"database as a de-normalized variant containing only data relevant for "
"reporting."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/reporting-database.adoc:13
msgid ""
"Ready-to-use reports are provided as views, aggregating data over multiple "
"tables."
msgstr "ລາຍງານທີ່ພ້ອມໃຊ້ງານຈະຖືກໃຫ້ມາໃນຮູບແບບ views ເຊິ່ງຮວບຮວມຂໍ້ມູນຈາກຫຼາຍຕາຕະລາງ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/reporting-database.adoc:14
msgid ""
"Every table has an extra column (`mgm_id`) specifying the {productname} "
"server which provided the data.  On a single {productname} server this "
"column has the standard value `1`, representing `localhost`.  On the "
"{productname} Hub it is replaced with the real server ID the managed server "
"has in the hub database."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/reporting-database.adoc:15
msgid ""
"Another common additional field is `synced_date`, which represents the time "
"when the data were exported from the main {productname} server database."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/reporting-database.adoc:16
msgid ""
"Navigate to menu:Help[Report Database Schema] to find the schema "
"documentation."
msgstr "ໄປທີ່ເມນູ: Help[Report Database Schema] ເພື່ອເບິ່ງເອກະສານຂອງ schema."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/administration/pages/reporting-database.adoc:17
#, no-wrap
msgid "Data Generation and Update"
msgstr "ການສ້າງ ແລະ ອັບເດດຂໍ້ມູນ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/reporting-database.adoc:18
msgid "{productname} uses two taskomatic jobs to manage reporting data:"
msgstr ""

#. type: Labeled list
#: en/modules/administration/pages/reporting-database.adoc:19
#, no-wrap
msgid "`update-reporting-default`"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/reporting-database.adoc:20
msgid ""
"Generates and updates the local reporting database from the main "
"{productname} database.  Runs by default daily at midnight on every server."
msgstr ""

#. type: Labeled list
#: en/modules/administration/pages/reporting-database.adoc:21
#, no-wrap
msgid "`update-reporting-hub-default`"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/reporting-database.adoc:22
msgid ""
"Fetches reporting data from all registered peripheral servers and aggregates "
"it into the hub reporting database.  This schedule is visible on all "
"servers, but only performs meaningful work on a {productname} Hub.  Runs by "
"default daily at 1:30 AM."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/reporting-database.adoc:23
msgid "All times are in the local timezone of the server."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/reporting-database.adoc:24
msgid ""
"For more information about hub aggregation and schedule alignment across "
"timezones, see "
"xref:specialized-guides:large-deployments/hub-reporting.adoc[]."
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/administration/pages/reporting-database.adoc:25
#, no-wrap
msgid "Tuning"
msgstr "ການປັບແຕ່ງ (Tuning)"

#. type: Title ===
#: en/modules/administration/pages/reporting-database.adoc:26
#, no-wrap
msgid "`report_db_batch_size`"
msgstr "`report_db_batch_size`"

#. type: Table
#: en/modules/administration/pages/reporting-database.adoc:27
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Description          | The maximum number of rows fetched and written from "
"one database to the other in one shot.\n"
"| Tune when            | Out of memory errors or on processing speed "
"problems.\n"
"| Value default        | 2000\n"
"| Value recommendation | 500 - 5000\n"
"| Location             | `/etc/rhn/rhn.conf`\n"
"| Example              | `report_db_batch_size = 4000`\n"
"| After changing       | Monitor memory usage closely before and after the "
"change.\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/administration/pages/reporting-database.adoc:28
#, no-wrap
msgid "Visualizing Reporting Data with Grafana"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/reporting-database.adoc:29
msgid ""
"The {productname} Grafana formula can connect directly to the reporting "
"database and deploy pre-built dashboards for fleet management and compliance "
"reporting."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/reporting-database.adoc:30
msgid "Prerequisites:"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/reporting-database.adoc:31
msgid ""
"A Grafana instance configured using the Monitoring Formula.  See "
"xref:specialized-guides:salt/salt-formula-monitoring.adoc[]."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/reporting-database.adoc:32
msgid ""
"A reporting database user created with `uyuni-setup-reportdb-user` (only "
"required when using external reporting tools, as the Grafana formula "
"automatically creates and configures a dedicated read-only database user).  "
"See <<Create a DB User for the Reporting Database>>."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/reporting-database.adoc:33
msgid "The reporting dashboards provided are:"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/reporting-database.adoc:34
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**Hub Overview** (Hub servers only) — high-level overview of the Hub setup, "
"listing peripheral servers and their fleets.\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/reporting-database.adoc:35
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**Fleet Overview & Security** — fleet composition, security posture, CVE "
"analysis, patch compliance, proxy infrastructure, and virtualization "
"overview.\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/reporting-database.adoc:36
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**Reports & History** — channels, packages, errata, actions, system "
"inventory, user management, system history, and SCAP compliance.\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/reporting-database.adoc:37
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**Executive Overview** — dynamic statistics including system counts and "
"package queries.\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/reporting-database.adoc:38
msgid ""
"For configuration steps, see "
"xref:specialized-guides:salt/salt-formula-monitoring.adoc[]."
msgstr ""

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/reports.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Generate Reports"
msgstr "ສ້າງບົດລາຍງານ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/reports.adoc:2
msgid ""
"{productname} allows the user to produce a variety of reports.  These "
"reports can be helpful for taking inventory of your subscribed systems, "
"users, and organizations.  Using reports is often simpler than gathering "
"information manually from the {productname} {webui}, especially if you have "
"many systems under management."
msgstr "{productname} ອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ຜູ້ໃຊ້ສ້າງບົດລາຍງານທີ່ຫຼາກຫຼາຍ. ບົດລາຍງານເຫຼົ່ານີ້ສາມາດຊ່ວຍໃນການກວດສອບລາຍການລະບົບທີ່ລົງທະບຽນ, ຜູ້ໃຊ້, ແລະ ອົງກອນຂອງທ່ານ. ການໃຊ້ບົດລາຍງານມັກຈະງ່າຍກວ່າການເກັບກຳຂໍ້ມູນດ້ວຍຕົນເອງຈາກ {productname} {webui}, ໂດຍສະເພາະຖ້າທ່ານມີຫຼາຍລະບົບທີ່ຕ້ອງຈັດການ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/reports.adoc:3
msgid ""
"While the command line tool `spacewalk-report` can be used to generate "
"pre-configured reports, with the introduction of the "
"xref:administration:reporting-database.adoc[Reporting Database] it is also "
"possible to generate fully customized reports.  This can be achieved by "
"connecting any reporting tool that supports the SQL language to the "
"reporting database and extract the data directly.  For more information "
"about the data availability and structure, see the reporting database schema "
"documentation."
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/administration/pages/reports.adoc:4
#, no-wrap
msgid "Using `spacewalk-report`"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/reports.adoc:6
msgid ""
"To generate reports, you must have the `spacewalk-reports` package "
"installed.  The `spacewalk-report` command allows you to organize and "
"display reports about content, systems, and user resources across "
"{productname}."
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/reports.adoc:7
msgid ""
"Due to the introduction of the "
"xref:administration:reporting-database.adoc[Reporting Database], "
"`spacewalk-report` now gathers by default the data from the reporting "
"database.  For more information see <<spacewalk-report-reporting-db>>."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/reports.adoc:8
msgid "You can generate reports on:"
msgstr "ທ່ານສາມາດສ້າງບົດລາຍງານກ່ຽວກັບ:"

#. type: Labeled list
#: en/modules/administration/pages/reports.adoc:9
#, no-wrap
msgid "System Inventory"
msgstr "ລາຍການລະບົບ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/reports.adoc:10
msgid "List all the systems registered to {productname}."
msgstr "ລາຍຊື່ລະບົບທັງໝົດທີ່ລົງທະບຽນກັບ {productname}."

#. type: Labeled list
#: en/modules/administration/pages/reports.adoc:11
#, no-wrap
msgid "Patches"
msgstr "ແພັດ (Patches)"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/reports.adoc:12
msgid ""
"  List all the patches relevant to the registered systems.  You can sort "
"patches by severity, as well as the systems that apply to a particular "
"patch."
msgstr "  ລາຍຊື່ແພັດທັງໝົດທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງກັບລະບົບທີ່ລົງທະບຽນ. ທ່ານສາມາດຈັດລຽງແພັດຕາມລະດັບຄວາມຮຸນແຮງ, ລວມທັງລະບົບທີ່ຕ້ອງໃຊ້ແພັດນັ້ນໆ."

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/reports.adoc:13
#: en/modules/administration/pages/users.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Users"
msgstr "ຜູ້ໃຊ້ (Users)"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/reports.adoc:14
msgid ""
"  List all registered users and any systems associated with a particular "
"user."
msgstr "  ລາຍຊື່ຜູ້ໃຊ້ທີ່ລົງທະບຽນທັງໝົດ ແລະ ລະບົບຕ່າງໆທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງກັບຜູ້ໃຊ້ແຕ່ລະຄົນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/reports.adoc:15
msgid ""
"To get the report in CSV format, run this command at the command prompt on "
"the server:"
msgstr "ເພື່ອຮັບບົດລາຍງານໃນຮູບແບບ CSV, ໃຫ້ລັນຄຳສັ່ງນີ້ຢູ່ທີ່ command prompt ເທິງເຊີເວີ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/reports.adoc:16
#, no-wrap
msgid "spacewalk-report <report_name>\n"
msgstr "spacewalk-report <ຊື່ບົດລາຍງານ>\n"

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/administration/pages/reports.adoc:17
#, no-wrap
msgid "`spacewalk-report` and the reporting database"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/reports.adoc:18
msgid ""
"`spacewalk-report` uses by default the new reporting database to extract the "
"data.  This means that the new generated reports will have some differences "
"in the structure and the format of the data.  The differences common to all "
"reports are:"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/reports.adoc:19
msgid ""
"the report data is not changing in real-time, but it's updated only by the "
"execution of a scheduled task;"
msgstr "ຂໍ້ມູນບົດລາຍງານບໍ່ໄດ້ປ່ຽນແປງແບບເວລາຈິງ (real-time), ແຕ່ຈະຖືກອັບເດດຜ່ານການເຮັດວຽກຂອງວຽກທີ່ກຳນົດເວລາໄວ້ເທົ່ານັ້ນ;"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/reports.adoc:20
msgid ""
"data duplication has been removed and columns that were previously "
"considered \"multival\" contain now multiple values separated by `;`. This "
"also means that the command line options `--multival-on-rows` and "
"`--multival-separator` are no longer applicable to the new reports, as their "
"behavior is now the default;"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/reports.adoc:21
msgid ""
"in all reports the new columns `mgm_id` and `synced_date` have been "
"introduced to identify the management server in the hub scenario and the "
"last time the information was updated from the application database;"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/reports.adoc:22
msgid ""
"all boolean values are now represented by the `True`/`False` and not by a "
"`1`/`0` values;"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/reports.adoc:23
msgid ""
"the column `org_id` has been replaced by `organization`, which contains the "
"organization name and not the numerical identifier;"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/reports.adoc:24
msgid ""
"The term \"server\" has been replaced by \"system.\" So, for example, the "
"column `server_id` is now called `system_id`."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/reports.adoc:25
msgid "For report specific changes, see <<report-list>>."
msgstr "ສຳລັບການປ່ຽນແປງສະເພາະຂອງແຕ່ລະບົດລາຍງານ, ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງ <<report-list>>."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/reports.adoc:26
msgid ""
"If this changed behavior causes trouble, the new option `--legacy-report` "
"can be used to fall back to the old report, which is executed against the "
"application database."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/reports.adoc:27
msgid ""
"For more information about the reporting database, see "
"xref:administration:reporting-database.adoc[].  For hub-specific aggregation "
"of data from multiple servers, see "
"xref:specialized-guides:large-deployments/hub-reporting.adoc[]."
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/administration/pages/reports.adoc:28
#, no-wrap
msgid "List of available reports"
msgstr "ລາຍຊື່ບົດລາຍງານທີ່ມີໃຫ້ໃຊ້"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/reports.adoc:29
msgid "This table lists the available reports:"
msgstr "ຕາຕະລາງນີ້ສະແດງລາຍຊື່ບົດລາຍງານທີ່ມີໃຫ້ໃຊ້:"

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/administration/pages/reports.adoc:30
#, no-wrap
msgid "`spacewalk-report` Reports"
msgstr ""

#. type: Table
#: en/modules/administration/pages/reports.adoc:31
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"|Report | Invoked as | Description | Uses reporting database | Specific "
"differences\n"
"| Actions | `actions` | All actions. | Yes | The column `id` is now called "
"`action_id`\n"
"| Activation Keys | `activation-keys` | All activation keys, and the "
"entitlements, channels, configuration channels, system groups, and packages "
"associated with them. | No |\n"
"| Activation Keys: Channels | `activation-keys-channels` | All activation "
"keys and the entities associated with each key. | No |\n"
"| Activation Keys: Configuration | `activation-keys-config` | All activation "
"keys and the configuration channels associated with each key. | No |\n"
"| Activation Keys: Server Groups | `activation-keys-groups` | All activation "
"keys and the system groups associated with each key. | No |\n"
"| Activation Keys: Packages | `activation-keys-packages` | All activation "
"keys and the packages each key can deploy. | No |\n"
"| Channel Packages | `channel-packages` | All packages in a channel. | Yes "
"|\n"
"| Channel Report | `channels` | Detailed report of a given channel. | Yes "
"|\n"
"| Cloned Channel Report | `cloned-channels` | Detailed report of cloned "
"channels. | Yes |\n"
"| Configuration Files | `config-files` | All configuration file revisions "
"for all organizations, including  file contents and file information. | No "
"|\n"
"| Latest Configuration Files | `config-files-latest` | The most recent "
"configuration file revisions for all organizations, including  file contents "
"and file information. | No |\n"
"| Custom Channels | `custom-channels` | Channel metadata for all channels "
"owned by specific organizations. | Yes | The column `id` is now called "
"`channel_id`\n"
"| Custom Info | `custom-info` | Client custom information. | Yes |\n"
"| Patches in Channels | `errata-channels` | All patches in channels. | Yes "
"|\n"
"| Patches Details | `errata-list` | All patches that affect registered "
"clients. | Yes |\n"
"| All patches | `errata-list-all` | All patches. | No |\n"
"| Patches for Clients | `errata-systems` | Applicable patches and any "
"registered clients that are affected. | Yes |\n"
"| Host Guests | `host-guests` | Host and guests mapping. | Yes |\n"
"| Inactive Clients | `inactive-systems` | Inactive clients. | Yes | The "
"mandatory parameter is now called `threshold`.\n"
"| System Inventory | `inventory` | Clients registered to the server, "
"together with hardware and software information. | Yes | The column "
"`osad_status` has been removed.\n"
"| Kickstart Scripts | `kickstart-scripts` | All kickstart scripts, with "
