"to. | Yes |\n"
"| System Groups | `system-groups` | System groups. | Yes |\n"
"| System Hardware | `system-hardware` | System hardware information. | No "
"|\n"
"| Activation Keys for System Groups | `system-groups-keys` | Activation keys "
