#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/reports.adoc:32
msgid ""
"For more information about an individual report, run `spacewalk-report` with "
"the option `--info` or `--list-fields-info` and the report name.  This shows "
"the description and list of possible fields in the report."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/reports.adoc:33
msgid ""
"For further information on program invocation and options, see the "
"`spacewalk-report(8)` man page as well as the `--help` parameter of the "
"`spacewalk-report` command."
msgstr ""

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/role-based-access-control.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Role-Based Access Control (RBAC)"
msgstr "ການຄວບຄຸມການເຂົ້າເຖິງຕາມບົດບາດ (RBAC)"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/role-based-access-control.adoc:2
msgid ""
"Role-Based Access Control (RBAC) is a security method that restricts "
"resources access to authorized users based on their assigned roles. In "
"{productname}, RBAC ensures that users can only perform actions and access "
"resources for which they have explicit authorization, enhancing security and "
"simplifying administration."
msgstr "ການຄວບຄຸມການເຂົ້າເຖິງຕາມບົດບາດ (RBAC) ແມ່ນວິທີການຮັກສາຄວາມປອດໄພທີ່ຈໍາກັດການເຂົ້າເຖິງຊັບພະຍາກອນ ໃຫ້ສະເພາະຜູ້ໃຊ້ທີ່ໄດ້ຮັບອະນຸຍາດໂດຍອີງຕາມບົດບາດທີ່ໄດ້ຮັບມອບໝາຍ. ໃນ {productname}, RBAC ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ໝັ້ນໃຈວ່າຜູ້ໃຊ້ສາມາດດໍາເນີນການ ແລະ ເຂົ້າເຖິງຊັບພະຍາກອນທີ່ພວກເຂົາໄດ້ຮັບອະນຸຍາດໂດຍກົງເທົ່ານັ້ນ, ເຊິ່ງຊ່ວຍເພີ່ມຄວາມປອດໄພ ແລະ ເຮັດໃຫ້ການບໍລິຫານຈັດການງ່າຍຂຶ້ນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/role-based-access-control.adoc:3
msgid "The core principles of RBAC include:"
msgstr "ຫຼັກການພື້ນຖານຂອງ RBAC ລວມມີ:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/role-based-access-control.adoc:4
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"*Principle of Least Privilege:* Granting only the necessary access rights "
"for users to perform their tasks.\n"
msgstr "*ຫຼັກການໃຫ້ສິດທິໜ້ອຍທີ່ສຸດ (Principle of Least Privilege):* ການໃຫ້ສິດທິໃນການເຂົ້າເຖິງເທົ່າທີ່ຈໍາເປັນສໍາລັບຜູ້ໃຊ້ເພື່ອປະຕິບັດວຽກງານຂອງພວກເຂົາ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/role-based-access-control.adoc:5
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"*Granular Control:* Providing fine-grained control over specific "
"functionalities.\n"
msgstr "*ການຄວບຄຸມແບບລະອຽດ (Granular Control):* ການຄວບຄຸມທີ່ລະອຽດໃນແຕ່ລະຟັງຊັນການເຮັດວຽກສະເພາະ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/role-based-access-control.adoc:6
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"*Separation of Duties:* Preventing a single user from having too much "
"control over critical processes.\n"
msgstr "*ການແຍກໜ້າທີ່ (Separation of Duties):* ການປ້ອງກັນບໍ່ໃຫ້ຜູ້ໃຊ້ຄົນດຽວມີອໍານາດຄວບຄຸມຂະບວນການທີ່ສໍາຄັນຫຼາຍເກີນໄປ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/role-based-access-control.adoc:7
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"*Auditability:* Allowing for clear tracking of user actions and "
"permissions.\n"
msgstr "*ການກວດສອບໄດ້ (Auditability):* ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ສາມາດຕິດຕາມການກະທໍາ ແລະ ການອະນຸຍາດຂອງຜູ້ໃຊ້ໄດ້ຢ່າງຊັດເຈນ.\n"

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/administration/pages/role-based-access-control.adoc:8
#, no-wrap
msgid "Key RBAC Concepts"
msgstr "ແນວຄວາມຄິດຫຼັກຂອງ RBAC"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/role-based-access-control.adoc:9
msgid ""
"Understanding the following core concepts is crucial for effective RBAC "
"management:"
msgstr "ການເຂົ້າໃຈແນວຄວາມຄິດຫຼັກຕໍ່ໄປນີ້ແມ່ນສິ່ງສໍາຄັນສໍາລັບການຈັດການ RBAC ທີ່ມີປະສິດທິພາບ:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/role-based-access-control.adoc:10
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"*Role:* A collection of permissions defining a specific set of capabilities "
"within {productname}. Roles are assigned to users, granting the user "
"aggregated permissions.\n"
msgstr "*ບົດບາດ (Role):* ແມ່ນການລວບລວມການອະນຸຍາດຕ່າງໆທີ່ກໍານົດຄວາມສາມາດສະເພາະພາຍໃນ {productname}. ບົດບາດຈະຖືກມອບໝາຍໃຫ້ກັບຜູ້ໃຊ້, ເຮັດໃຫ້ຜູ້ໃຊ້ໄດ້ຮັບສິດທິຕ່າງໆຕາມບົດບາດນັ້ນ.\n"

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/role-based-access-control.adoc:11
msgid "Roles are assigned to users, granting the user aggregated permissions."
msgstr "ບົດບາດຈະຖືກມອບໝາຍໃຫ້ກັບຜູ້ໃຊ້, ເຮັດໃຫ້ຜູ້ໃຊ້ໄດ້ຮັບການອະນຸຍາດລວມຕາມບົດບາດນັ້ນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/role-based-access-control.adoc:12
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"*Permission:* An atomic authorization to perform a specific action, access a "
"specific web page or call a specific API endpoint within {productname}. In "
"{productname}, permissions are represented by namespaces and their access "
"modes.\n"
msgstr "*ການອະນຸຍາດ (Permission):* ແມ່ນການອະນຸຍາດຂັ້ນພື້ນຖານເພື່ອດໍາເນີນການໃດໜຶ່ງ, ການເຂົ້າເຖິງໜ້າເວັບສະເພາະ ຫຼື ການເອີ້ນໃຊ້ API endpoint ໃດໜຶ່ງພາຍໃນ {productname}. ໃນ {productname}, ການອະນຸຍາດຈະຖືກສະແດງໂດຍ namespaces ແລະ ໂໝດການເຂົ້າເຖິງຂອງພວກມັນ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/role-based-access-control.adoc:13
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"*User:* An individual account that interacts with {productname}. Users are "
"assigned one or more roles.\n"
msgstr "*ຜູ້ໃຊ້ (User):* ແມ່ນບັນຊີບຸກຄົນທີ່ໂຕ້ຕອບກັບ {productname}. ຜູ້ໃຊ້ຈະຖືກມອບໝາຍໃຫ້ມີໜຶ່ງ ຫຼື ຫຼາຍບົດບາດ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/role-based-access-control.adoc:14
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"*Namespace:* A granular unit of access control organized in a tree-like "
"structure. Most namespaces have distinct \"View\" or \"Modify\" modes.\n"
msgstr "*ເນມສະເປສ (Namespace):* ແມ່ນຫົວໜ່ວຍການຄວບຄຸມການເຂົ້າເຖິງທີ່ລະອຽດ ເຊິ່ງຈັດລຽງໃນຮູບແບບໂຄງສ້າງຕົ້ນໄມ້. ເນມສະເປສສ່ວນໃຫຍ່ຈະມີໂໝດ \"View\" (ເບິ່ງ) ຫຼື \"Modify\" (ແກ້ໄຂ) ທີ່ແຍກຈາກກັນ.\n"

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/administration/pages/role-based-access-control.adoc:15
#, no-wrap
msgid "User Roles in {productname}"
msgstr "ບົດບາດຜູ້ໃຊ້ໃນ {productname}"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/role-based-access-control.adoc:16
msgid ""
"{productname} provides predefined roles and allows for the definition of "
"additional custom roles, optionally inheriting from a combination of other "
"roles."
msgstr "{productname} ມີບົດບາດທີ່ກໍານົດໄວ້ລ່ວງໜ້າແລ້ວ ແລະ ອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ກໍານົດບົດບາດເພີ່ມເຕີມເອງໄດ້, ໂດຍສາມາດເລືອກສືບທອດສິດທິຈາກການລວມກັນຂອງບົດບາດອື່ນໆ."

#. type: Title ===
#: en/modules/administration/pages/role-based-access-control.adoc:17
#, no-wrap
msgid "Predefined Roles"
msgstr "ບົດບາດທີ່ກໍານົດໄວ້ລ່ວງໜ້າ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/role-based-access-control.adoc:18
msgid ""
"Refer to xref:administration:users.adoc#administrator-roles[] for a complete "
"list of predefined roles and their descriptions."
msgstr "ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງທີ່ xref:administration:users.adoc#administrator-roles[] ສໍາລັບລາຍຊື່ບົດບາດທີ່ກໍານົດໄວ້ລ່ວງໜ້າທັງໝົດ ແລະ ຄໍາອະທິບາຍ."

#. type: Title ===
#: en/modules/administration/pages/role-based-access-control.adoc:19
#, no-wrap
msgid "Defining Additional Roles"
msgstr "ການກໍານົດບົດບາດເພີ່ມເຕີມ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/role-based-access-control.adoc:20
msgid "To define additional roles, you can:"
msgstr "ເພື່ອທໍາການກໍານົດບົດບາດເພີ່ມເຕີມ, ທ່ານສາມາດ:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/role-based-access-control.adoc:21
msgid "Select a number of existing roles to inherit permissions from."
msgstr "ເລືອກບົດບາດທີ່ມີຢູ່ເພື່ອສືບທອດການອະນຸຍາດມາ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/role-based-access-control.adoc:22
msgid "Specify additional namespaces to grant access to."
msgstr "ກໍານົດ namespaces ເພີ່ມເຕີມເພື່ອໃຫ້ສິດການເຂົ້າເຖິງ."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/administration/pages/role-based-access-control.adoc:23
#, no-wrap
msgid "Namespaces for Fine-Grained Access"
msgstr "Namespaces ສໍາລັບການເຂົ້າເຖິງແບບລະອຽດ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/role-based-access-control.adoc:24
msgid ""
"Namespaces provide fine-grained access control, organized in a tree-like "
"structure. For most namespaces, access within a namespace is further "
"granularized by \"View\" and \"Modify\" modes."
msgstr "Namespaces ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ການຄວບຄຸມການເຂົ້າເຖິງມີຄວາມລະອຽດ, ໂດຍຈັດລຽງໃນຮູບແບບໂຄງສ້າງຕົ້ນໄມ້. ສໍາລັບ namespaces ສ່ວນໃຫຍ່, ການເຂົ້າເຖິງພາຍໃນ namespace ຈະຖືກແບ່ງຍ່ອຍອອກເປັນໂໝດ \"View\" ແລະ \"Modify\"."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/administration/pages/role-based-access-control.adoc:25
#, no-wrap
msgid "Example: Image Management namespaces and access modes"
msgstr "ຕົວຢ່າງ: ເນມສະເປສ ແລະ ໂໝດການເຂົ້າເຖິງຂອງການຈັດການ Image"

#. type: Table
#: en/modules/administration/pages/role-based-access-control.adoc:26
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Namespace             | Access Mode   | Description\n"
"| `cm.build`          | Modify        | Build container or Kiwi images\n"
"| `cm.image.import`   | Modify        | Import container images from a "
"registered image store\n"
"| `cm.image.list`     | View          | List all images\n"
"| `cm.image.list`     | Modify        | Delete images\n"
"| `cm.image.overview` | View          | View image details, patches, "
"packages, build log and cluster information\n"
"| `cm.image.overview` | Modify        | Inspect, rebuild, delete images\n"
"| `cm.profile.details`| View          | View details of an image profile\n"
"| `cm.profile.details`| Modify        | Create image profiles, edit profile "
"details\n"
"| `cm.profile.list`   | View          | List all image profiles\n"
"| `cm.profile.list`   | Modify        | Delete image profiles\n"
"| `cm.store.details`  | View          | View details of an image store\n"
"| `cm.store.details`  | Modify        | Create image stores, edit store "
"details\n"
"| `cm.store.list`     | View          | List all image stores\n"
"| `cm.store.list`     | Modify        | Delete image stores\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/role-based-access-control.adoc:27
msgid ""
"A comprehensive list of namespaces and their descriptions can be retrieved "
"by making a call to the `access.listNamespaces` API method.  Refer to "
"{productname} API documentation for detailed information, including request "
"and response formats."
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/administration/pages/role-based-access-control.adoc:28
#, no-wrap
msgid "Managing RBAC"
msgstr "ການຈັດການ RBAC"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/role-based-access-control.adoc:29
msgid ""
"Managing RBAC roles and permissions is possible either through the API or "
"through the {webui}.  To assign roles to users via the {webui}, refer to "
"xref:administration:users.adoc[]."
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ===
#: en/modules/administration/pages/role-based-access-control.adoc:30
#, no-wrap
msgid "Managing RBAC via {webui}"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/role-based-access-control.adoc:31
msgid ""
"In the {webui}, you can manage custom RBAC roles and assign permissions by "
"navigating to menu:Admin[Access Control]. From there, you can click "
"btn:[Create Access Group] to define a new role and configure its "
"permissions."
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/role-based-access-control.adoc:32
msgid ""
"Predefined roles cannot be seen or managed via the {webui}. Only custom "
"roles created within your organization are visible in the menu:Admin[Access "
"Control] section."
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ===
#: en/modules/administration/pages/role-based-access-control.adoc:33
#, no-wrap
msgid "Managing RBAC via API"
msgstr "ການຈັດການ RBAC ຜ່ານ API"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/role-based-access-control.adoc:34
msgid ""
"The {productname} API provides methods for programmaticaly managing roles, "
"permissions and user assignments."
msgstr "{productname} API ມີເມທອດ (methods) ສໍາລັບການຈັດການບົດບາດ, ການອະນຸຍາດ ແລະ ການມອບໝາຍໃຫ້ຜູ້ໃຊ້ຜ່ານການຂຽນໂປຣແກຣມ."

#. type: Title ====
#: en/modules/administration/pages/role-based-access-control.adoc:35
#, no-wrap
msgid "The `access` API"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/role-based-access-control.adoc:36
msgid "These API methods manage roles and their associated access:"
msgstr "API methods ເຫຼົ່ານີ້ໃຊ້ຈັດການບົດບາດ ແລະ ການເຂົ້າເຖິງທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງ:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/role-based-access-control.adoc:37
msgid ""
"`listNamespaces`: Lists available namespaces, access modes and their "
"descriptions in {productname}."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/role-based-access-control.adoc:38
msgid "`listPermissions`: Lists permitted namespaces of a role."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/role-based-access-control.adoc:39
msgid "`listRoles`: Lists existing roles in {productname}."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/role-based-access-control.adoc:40
msgid ""
"`createRole`: Creates a new role, optionally copying permissions from "
"existing roles."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/role-based-access-control.adoc:41
msgid "`deleteRole`: Deletes a role."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/role-based-access-control.adoc:42
msgid "`grantAccess`: Grants access to namespaces."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/role-based-access-control.adoc:43
msgid "`revokeAccess`: Revokes access to namespaces."
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ====
#: en/modules/administration/pages/role-based-access-control.adoc:44
#, no-wrap
msgid "The `user` API"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/role-based-access-control.adoc:45
msgid "These API methods manage user-role assignments:"
msgstr "API methods ເຫຼົ່ານີ້ໃຊ້ຈັດການການມອບໝາຍບົດບາດໃຫ້ກັບຜູ້ໃຊ້:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/role-based-access-control.adoc:46
msgid "`listPermissions`: Lists effective permissions of a user."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/role-based-access-control.adoc:47
msgid "`listRoles`: Lists a user's assigned roles."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/role-based-access-control.adoc:48
msgid "`addRole`: Assigns a role to a user."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/role-based-access-control.adoc:49
msgid "`removeRole`: Removes a role from a user."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/role-based-access-control.adoc:50
msgid ""
"For detailed API documentation, including request and response formats, "
"refer to {productname} API reference."
msgstr "ສໍາລັບເອກະສານ API ທີ່ລະອຽດ, ລວມທັງຮູບແບບ request ແລະ response, ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງທີ່ເອກະສານອ້າງອີງ API ຂອງ {productname}."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/administration/pages/role-based-access-control.adoc:51
#, no-wrap
msgid "RBAC Best Practices"
msgstr "ແນວທາງປະຕິບັດທີ່ດີທີ່ສຸດສໍາລັບ RBAC"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/role-based-access-control.adoc:52
msgid ""
"Adhering to these best practices will help maintain a secure, efficient, and "
"manageable RBAC environment:"
msgstr "ການປະຕິບັດຕາມແນວທາງເຫຼົ່ານີ້ຈະຊ່ວຍຮັກສາສະພາບແວດລ້ອມ RBAC ໃຫ້ມີຄວາມປອດໄພ, ມີປະສິດທິພາບ ແລະ ຈັດການໄດ້ງ່າຍ:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/role-based-access-control.adoc:53
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"*Principle of least privilege:* Always grant users the minimum permissions "
"necessary to perform their duties. Avoid overly broad permissions.\n"
msgstr "*ຫຼັກການໃຫ້ສິດທິໜ້ອຍທີ່ສຸດ:* ໃຫ້ການອະນຸຍາດແກ່ຜູ້ໃຊ້ໃນລະດັບຕໍ່າສຸດທີ່ຈໍາເປັນຕໍ່ການປະຕິບັດໜ້າທີ່ສະເໝີ. ຫຼີກເວັ້ນການໃຫ້ສິດທິທີ່ກວ້າງເກີນໄປ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/role-based-access-control.adoc:54
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"*Regular review:* Periodically review assigned roles and permissions for "
"users to ensure they are still appropriate and comply with current security "
"policies.\n"
msgstr "*ການກວດສອບຢ່າງສະໝໍ່າສະເໝີ:* ກວດສອບບົດບາດ ແລະ ການອະນຸຍາດທີ່ມອບໝາຍໃຫ້ຜູ້ໃຊ້ເປັນໄລຍະ ເພື່ອໃຫ້ໝັ້ນໃຈວ່າຍັງເໝາະສົມ ແລະ ສອດຄ່ອງກັບນະໂຍບາຍຄວາມປອດໄພໃນປະຈຸບັນ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/role-based-access-control.adoc:55
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"*Document roles:* Clearly document the purpose and permissions of each "
"custom role you create.\n"
msgstr "*ການເຮັດເອກະສານບົດບາດ:* ບັນທຶກວັດຖຸປະສົງ ແລະ ການອະນຸຍາດຂອງແຕ່ລະບົດບາດທີ່ທ່ານສ້າງຂຶ້ນເອງໃຫ້ຊັດເຈນ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/role-based-access-control.adoc:56
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"*Separate duties:* Implement roles that enforce separation of duties to "
"prevent a single user from having too much control over critical "
"processes.\n"
msgstr "*ການແຍກໜ້າທີ່:* ນໍາໃຊ້ບົດບາດທີ່ບັງຄັບໃຊ້ການແຍກໜ້າທີ່ ເພື່ອປ້ອງກັນບໍ່ໃຫ້ຜູ້ໃຊ້ຄົນດຽວມີອໍານາດຄວບຄຸມຂະບວນການທີ່ສໍາຄັນຫຼາຍເກີນໄປ.\n"

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/space-management.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Disk Space Management"
msgstr "ການຈັດການເນື້ອທີ່ດິສກ໌"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/space-management.adoc:2
msgid ""
"Running out of disk space can have a severe impact on the {productname} "
"database and file structure which, in some cases, is not recoverable."
msgstr "ການທີ່ເນື້ອທີ່ດິສກ໌ເຕັມສາມາດສົ່ງຜົນກະທົບຮ້າຍແຮງຕໍ່ຖານຂໍ້ມູນ ແລະ ໂຄງສ້າງໄຟລ໌ຂອງ {productname} ເຊິ່ງໃນບາງກໍລະນີອາດຈະບໍ່ສາມາດກູ້ຄືນໄດ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/space-management.adoc:3
msgid ""
"{productname} monitors some directories for free disk space.  You can modify "
"which directories are monitored, and the warnings that are created using "
"environment variables in systemd service override files."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/space-management.adoc:4
msgid ""
"When the available space in one of the monitored directories falls below a "
"warning threshold, a message is sent to the configured email address and a "
"notification is shown at the top of the sign-in page."
msgstr "ເມື່ອເນື້ອທີ່ວ່າງໃນໄດເຣັກທໍຣີທີ່ຕິດຕາມຫຼຸດລົງຕໍ່າກວ່າເກນການແຈ້ງເຕືອນ, ຂໍ້ຄວາມຈະຖືກສົ່ງໄປຫາອີເມລທີ່ຕັ້ງຄ່າໄວ້ ແລະ ຈະມີການແຈ້ງເຕືອນສະແດງຢູ່ດ້ານເທິງຂອງໜ້າເຂົ້າສູ່ລະບົບ."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/administration/pages/space-management.adoc:5
#, no-wrap
msgid "Monitored Directories"
msgstr "ໄດເຣັກທໍຣີທີ່ຖືກຕິດຕາມ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/space-management.adoc:6
msgid "By default, the {productname} Server container monitors these directories:"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/space-management.adoc:7
msgid "`/var/spacewalk`"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/space-management.adoc:8
msgid "`/var/cache`"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/space-management.adoc:9
msgid "`/srv`"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/space-management.adoc:10
msgid ""
"You can change which directories are monitored by setting the "
"`DISKCHECKDIRS` environment variable in the server container systemd "
"service.  You can specify multiple directories by separating them with a "
"space."
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/space-management.adoc:11
msgid ""
"The `DISKCHECKDIRS` environment variable applies only to the server "
"container.  The database container always monitors `/var/lib/pgsql/data` and "
"this cannot be overridden."
msgstr ""

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/administration/pages/space-management.adoc:12
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Configuring Monitored Directories"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/space-management.adoc:13
msgid "Create a systemd override directory for the server service:"
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/space-management.adoc:14
#, no-wrap
msgid "mkdir -p /etc/systemd/system/uyuni-server.service.d/\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/space-management.adoc:15
msgid "Create a configuration file with the custom directories:"
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/space-management.adoc:16
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-diskspace.adoc:30
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"cat > /etc/systemd/system/uyuni-server.service.d/diskcheck.conf << 'EOF'\n"
"[Service]\n"
"Environment=\"DISKCHECKDIRS=/var/spacewalk /var/cache /srv\"\n"
"EOF\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/space-management.adoc:17
#: en/modules/administration/pages/space-management.adoc:29
#: en/modules/administration/pages/space-management.adoc:43
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-diskspace.adoc:31
msgid "Apply the configuration by restarting {productname}:"
msgstr "ນຳໃຊ້ການກຳນົດຄ່າໂດຍການຣີສະຕາດ {productname}:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/space-management.adoc:19
msgid ""
"For more information about container volumes, see "
"xref:installation-and-upgrade:container-management/persistent-container-volumes.adoc[]."
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/administration/pages/space-management.adoc:20
#, no-wrap
msgid "Thresholds"
msgstr "ເກນການແຈ້ງເຕືອນ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/space-management.adoc:21
msgid ""
"By default, {productname} creates a warning when a monitored directory "
"reaches 90% disk usage.  A critical alert is created when a monitored "
"directory reaches 95% disk usage, and the container health check will fail."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/space-management.adoc:22
msgid ""
"You can change these alert thresholds by setting the `DISKCHECKALERT` and "
"`DISKTHRESHOLD` environment variables."
msgstr ""

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/administration/pages/space-management.adoc:23
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Configuring Disk Check Thresholds"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/space-management.adoc:24
msgid "Create systemd override directories:"
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/space-management.adoc:25
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"mkdir -p /etc/systemd/system/uyuni-server.service.d/\n"
"mkdir -p /etc/systemd/system/uyuni-db.service.d/\n"
msgstr ""
"mkdir -p /etc/systemd/system/uyuni-server.service.d/\n"
"mkdir -p /etc/systemd/system/uyuni-db.service.d/\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/space-management.adoc:26
msgid "Create configuration files for both server and database services:"
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/space-management.adoc:27
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"cat > /etc/systemd/system/uyuni-server.service.d/diskcheck.conf << 'EOF'\n"
"[Service]\n"
"Environment=\"DISKCHECKALERT=90\"\n"
"Environment=\"DISKTHRESHOLD=95\"\n"
"EOF\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/space-management.adoc:28
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"cat > /etc/systemd/system/uyuni-db.service.d/diskcheck.conf << 'EOF'\n"
"[Service]\n"
"Environment=\"DISKCHECKALERT=90\"\n"
"Environment=\"DISKTHRESHOLD=95\"\n"
"EOF\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/space-management.adoc:31
msgid ""
"For large deployments with multi-terabyte storage volumes, you may want to "
"use higher thresholds to make more efficient use of disk space.  For "
"example, on a 10{nbsp}TB volume, keeping 5% free means 500{nbsp}GB unused.  "
"For tuning recommendations for large deployments, see "
"xref:specialized-guides:large-deployments/tuning.adoc#diskcheck-thresholds[]."
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/administration/pages/space-management.adoc:32
#, no-wrap
msgid "Database Disk Check"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/space-management.adoc:33
msgid ""
"The database container has its own disk check that monitors only the "
"PostgreSQL data directory (`/var/lib/pgsql/data`).  This directory is always "
"monitored and cannot be changed or overridden with the `DISKCHECKDIRS` "
"environment variable."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/space-management.adoc:34
msgid ""
"The database disk check uses the `DISKCHECKALERT` and `DISKTHRESHOLD` "
"environment variables configured for the `uyuni-db` service."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/space-management.adoc:35
msgid ""
"The database disk check runs as a PostgreSQL function and is invoked during "
"container health checks.  When the threshold is exceeded, the health check "
"will fail and the container will be automatically stopped to prevent data "
"corruption."
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/space-management.adoc:36
msgid ""
"The database container only monitors `/var/lib/pgsql/data`.  You cannot "
"configure additional directories to monitor in the database container using "
"`DISKCHECKDIRS`.  To monitor other directories, use the server container "
"configuration."
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/administration/pages/space-management.adoc:37
#, no-wrap
msgid "Disable Space Checking"
msgstr "ປິດການກວດສອບເນື້ອທີ່"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/space-management.adoc:38
msgid ""
"The space checking tool is enabled by default and runs hourly via a "
"Taskomatic scheduled task.  Notification can be disabled by disabling "
"diskcheck-task-queue-default Taskomatic job.  To effectively disable disk "
"space monitoring, set the threshold values to 99 (percent)."
msgstr ""

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/administration/pages/space-management.adoc:39
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Disabling Disk Space Monitoring"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/space-management.adoc:40
msgid "Edit the systemd override files to set very high thresholds:"
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/space-management.adoc:41
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"cat > /etc/systemd/system/uyuni-server.service.d/diskcheck.conf << 'EOF'\n"
"[Service]\n"
"Environment=\"DISKCHECKALERT=99\"\n"
"Environment=\"DISKTHRESHOLD=99\"\n"
"EOF\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/space-management.adoc:42
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"cat > /etc/systemd/system/uyuni-db.service.d/diskcheck.conf << 'EOF'\n"
"[Service]\n"
"Environment=\"DISKCHECKALERT=99\"\n"
"Environment=\"DISKTHRESHOLD=99\"\n"
"EOF\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/space-management.adoc:45
msgid ""
"Disabling disk space monitoring is not recommended in production "
"environments, as running out of disk space can cause severe and potentially "
"unrecoverable damage to the database."
msgstr ""

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs-hsts.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "HTTP Strict Transport Security"
msgstr "ຄວາມປອດໄພໃນການຮັບສົ່ງຂໍ້ມູນ HTTP ແບບເຂັ້ມງວດ (HSTS)"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs-hsts.adoc:2
msgid ""
"HTTP Strict Transport Security "
"(https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/HTTP/Headers/Strict-Transport-Security[HSTS]) "
"is a policy mechanism that helps to protect websites against "
"man-in-the-middle attacks such as protocol downgrade attacks and cookie "
"hijacking."
msgstr "HTTP Strict Transport Security (HSTS) ແມ່ນກົນໄກນະໂຍບາຍທີ່ຊ່ວຍປົກປ້ອງເວັບໄຊຈາກການໂຈມຕີແບບ man-in-the-middle ເຊັ່ນ ການໂຈມຕີແບບຫຼຸດລະດັບໂປຣໂຕຄໍ (protocol downgrade) ແລະ ການຂະໂມຍຄຸກກີ້ (cookie hijacking)."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs-hsts.adoc:3
msgid ""
"On {productname}, HSTS is enabled by default.  If you need to disable it on "
"the server, follow this procedure:"
msgstr "ໃນ {productname}, HSTS ຖືກເປີດໃຊ້ໂດຍຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ. ຫາກທ່ານຕ້ອງການປິດມັນໃນເຊີເວີ, ໃຫ້ປະຕິບັດຕາມຂັ້ນຕອນດັ່ງນີ້:"

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs-hsts.adoc:4
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Disabling HSTS on the server"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການປິດ HSTS ໃນເຊີເວີ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs-hsts.adoc:5
#: en/modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs-hsts.adoc:11
msgid ""
"On the server container host, as root, execute the following command to "
"create a new configuration file with setting `max-age=0`:"
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs-hsts.adoc:6
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"mgrctl exec -- \\\n"
"  echo 'Header always set Strict-Transport-Security \"max-age=0; "
"includeSubDomains\"' \\\n"
"  > /etc/apache2/conf.d/zz-spacewalk-www-hsts.conf\n"
msgstr ""
"mgrctl exec -- \\\n"
"  echo 'Header always set Strict-Transport-Security \"max-age=0; includeSubDomains\"' \\\n"
"  > /etc/apache2/conf.d/zz-spacewalk-www-hsts.conf\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs-hsts.adoc:7
msgid "Restart Apache with:"
msgstr "ຣີສະຕາດ Apache ດ້ວຍຄຳສັ່ງ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs-hsts.adoc:8
#, no-wrap
msgid "mgrctl exec -- systemctl restart apache2\n"
msgstr "mgrctl exec -- systemctl restart apache2\n"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs-hsts.adoc:9
msgid "If you need to disable it on the proxy, follow this procedure:"
msgstr "ຫາກທ່ານຕ້ອງການປິດມັນໃນພຣັອກຊີ (proxy), ໃຫ້ປະຕິບັດຕາມຂັ້ນຕອນດັ່ງນີ້:"

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs-hsts.adoc:10
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Disabling HSTS on the proxy"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການປິດ HSTS ໃນພຣັອກຊີ"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs-hsts.adoc:12
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"echo 'Header always set Strict-Transport-Security \"max-age=0; "
"includeSubDomains' \\\n"
"  > /etc/uyuni/custom-httpd.conf\n"
msgstr ""
"echo 'Header always set Strict-Transport-Security \"max-age=0; includeSubDomains' \\\n"
"  > /etc/uyuni/custom-httpd.conf\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs-hsts.adoc:13
msgid "Run the command:"
msgstr "ລັນຄໍາສັ່ງ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs-hsts.adoc:14
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"mgrpxy install podman --tuning-httpd /etc/uyuni/custom-httpd.conf "
"config.tar.gz\n"
msgstr "mgrpxy install podman --tuning-httpd /etc/uyuni/custom-httpd.conf config.tar.gz\n"

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs-hsts.adoc:15
msgid ""
"When naming the new config file `<filename>.conf`, make sure it is loaded at "
"the right time.  For example, to override something defined in "
"`spacewalk-www.conf` the new file needs to be alphabetically after this "
"file.  For more information about how Apache loads files, see "
"https://httpd.apache.org/docs."
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs-hsts.adoc:16
msgid ""
"When HSTS is enabled while using the default SSL certificate generated by "
"{productname} or a self-signed certificate, browsers will refuse to connect "
"with HTTPS unless the CA used to sign such certificates is trusted by the "
"browser.  If you are using the SSL certificate generated by {productname}, "
"you can trust it by importing the file located at "
"`http://<SERVER-HOSTNAME>/pub/RHN-ORG-TRUSTED-SSL-CERT` to the browsers of "
"all users."
msgstr "ເມື່ອເປີດໃຊ້ HSTS ໃນຂະນະທີ່ໃຊ້ໃບຢັ້ງຢືນ SSL ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນທີ່ສ້າງໂດຍ {productname} ຫຼື ໃບຢັ້ງຢືນທີ່ເຊັນດ້ວຍຕົນເອງ (self-signed), ບຣາວເຊີຈະປະຕິເສດການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ ຜ່ານ HTTPS ນອກຈາກວ່າ CA ທີ່ໃຊ້ເຊັນໃບຢັ້ງຢືນນັ້ນຈະໄດ້ຮັບຄວາມເຊື່ອຖືຈາກບຣາວເຊີ. ຖ້າທ່ານໃຊ້ໃບຢັ້ງຢືນ SSL ທີ່ສ້າງໂດຍ {productname}, ທ່ານສາມາດເຮັດໃຫ້ມັນໄດ້ຮັບຄວາມເຊື່ອຖືໄດ້ໂດຍການນຳເຂົ້າໄຟລ໌ທີ່ຢູ່ `http://<SERVER-HOSTNAME>/pub/RHN-ORG-TRUSTED-SSL-CERT` ເຂົ້າໃນບຣາວເຊີຂອງຜູ້ໃຊ້ທຸກຄົນ."

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs-imported.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Import SSL Certificates"
msgstr "ນຳເຂົ້າໃບຢັ້ງຢືນ SSL"

#. By default, {productname} uses a self-signed certificate.
#. For additional security, you can import a custom certificate, signed by a third party certificate authority (CA).
#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs-imported.adoc:2
msgid ""
"This section covers how to configure SSL certificate for new {productname} "
"installation, and how to replace existing certificates."
msgstr "ພາກນີ້ຈະເວົ້າເຖິງວິທີການກຳນົດຄ່າໃບຢັ້ງຢືນ SSL ສຳລັບການຕິດຕັ້ງ {productname} ໃໝ່, ແລະ ວິທີປ່ຽນແທນໃບຢັ້ງຢືນທີ່ມີຢູ່."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs-imported.adoc:3
msgid "Before you begin, ensure you have:"
msgstr "ກ່ອນຈະເລີ່ມ, ໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າທ່ານມີ:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs-imported.adoc:4
msgid ""
"A certificate authority (CA) SSL public certificate.  If you are using a CA "
"chain, all intermediate CAs must also be available."
msgstr "ໃບຢັ້ງຢືນສາທາລະນະ (public certificate) ຂອງ SSL ຈາກຕົວແທນອອກໃບຢັ້ງຢືນ (CA). ຖ້າທ່ານໃຊ້ CA chain, ໃບຢັ້ງຢືນ CA ລະດັບກາງ (intermediate CAs) ທັງໝົດກໍຕ້ອງມີພ້ອມຄືກັນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs-imported.adoc:5
msgid "An SSL server private key"
msgstr "SSL server private key"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs-imported.adoc:6
msgid "An SSL server certificate"
msgstr "SSL server certificate"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs-imported.adoc:7
msgid "An SSL database private key"
msgstr "ຄີສ່ວນຕົວ (private key) ຂອງ SSL database"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs-imported.adoc:8
msgid "An SSL database certificate"
msgstr "ໃບຢັ້ງຢືນ (certificate) ຂອງ SSL database"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs-imported.adoc:9
msgid "All files must be in PEM format."
msgstr "ໄຟລ໌ທັງໝົດຕ້ອງຢູ່ໃນຮູບແບບ PEM."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs-imported.adoc:10
msgid ""
"The hostname of the SSL server certificate must match the fully qualified "
"hostname of the machine you deploy them on.  You can set the hostnames in "
"the `X509v3 Subject Alternative Name` section of the certificate.  You can "
"also list multiple hostnames if your environment requires it.  Supported Key "
"types are `RSA` and `EC` (Elliptic Curve)."
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs-imported.adoc:11
msgid ""
"In previous versions the database SSL certificates required `reportdb` and "
"`db` as `Subject Alternative Name`.  This is no longer needed."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs-imported.adoc:12
msgid ""
"Third-party authorities commonly use intermediate CAs to sign requested "
"server certificates.  In this case, all CAs in the chain are required to be "
"available.  The `mgrdadm` commands are taking care of ordering the "
"certificates.  Ideally, the root CA should be in its own file.  The server "
"certificate file should contain the server certificate first, followed by "
"all intermediate CA certificates in order."
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs-imported.adoc:13
#, no-wrap
msgid "Import Certificates for New Installations"
msgstr "ນຳເຂົ້າໃບຢັ້ງຢືນສຳລັບການຕິດຕັ້ງໃໝ່"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs-imported.adoc:14
msgid ""
"By default, {productname} uses a self-signed certificate.  Certificates can "
"be imported with third-party certificates at the installation time."
msgstr "ໂດຍຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ, {productname} ຈະໃຊ້ໃບຢັ້ງຢືນທີ່ເຊັນເອງ. ໃບຢັ້ງຢືນສາມາດນໍາເຂົ້າຈາກພາຍນອກໄດ້ໃນເວລາຕິດຕັ້ງ."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs-imported.adoc:15
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Importing certificates on a new {productname} server"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການນໍາເຂົ້າໃບຢັ້ງຢືນໃນ {productname} server ໃໝ່"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs-imported.adoc:16
msgid ""
"Deploy the {productname} Server according to the instructions in "
"xref:installation-and-upgrade:install-server.adoc[].  Make sure to pass the "
"correct files as parameters to `mgradm install podman`.  The parameters are:"
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs-imported.adoc:17
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"3rd Party SSL Certificate Flags:\n"
"      --ssl-ca-intermediate strings    Intermediate CA certificate path\n"
"      --ssl-ca-root string             Root CA certificate path\n"
"      --ssl-server-cert string         Server certificate path\n"
"      --ssl-server-key string          Server key path\n"
"      --ssl-db-ca-intermediate strings Intermediate CA certificate path for "
"the database if different from the server one\n"
"      --ssl-db-ca-root string          Root CA certificate path for the "
"database if different from the server one\n"
"      --ssl-db-cert string             Database certificate path\n"
"      --ssl-db-key string              Database key path\n"
msgstr ""
"3rd Party SSL Certificate Flags:\n"
"      --ssl-ca-intermediate strings    Path ຂອງໃບຢັ້ງຢືນ Intermediate CA\n"
"      --ssl-ca-root string             Path ຂອງໃບຢັ້ງຢືນ Root CA\n"
"      --ssl-server-cert string         Path ຂອງໃບຢັ້ງຢືນ Server\n"
"      --ssl-server-key string          Path ຂອງຄີ Server\n"
"      --ssl-db-ca-intermediate strings Path ຂອງໃບຢັ້ງຢືນ Intermediate CA ສໍາລັບຖານຂໍ້ມູນ (ຫາກຕ່າງຈາກເຊີເວີ)\n"
"      --ssl-db-ca-root string          Path ຂອງໃບຢັ້ງຢືນ Root CA ສໍາລັບຖານຂໍ້ມູນ (ຫາກຕ່າງຈາກເຊີເວີ)\n"
"      --ssl-db-cert string             Path ຂອງໃບຢັ້ງຢືນ Database\n"
"      --ssl-db-key string              Path ຂອງຄີ Database\n"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs-imported.adoc:18
msgid ""
"Intermediate CAs can either be available in the file which is specified with "
"`--ssl-ca-root`, or specified as extra options with "
"`--ssl-ca-intermediate`.  The `--ssl-ca-intermediate` option can be "
"specified multiple times."
msgstr "Intermediate CAs ສາມາດຢູ່ໃນໄຟລ໌ດຽວກັບທີ່ລະບຸໃນ `--ssl-ca-root`, ຫຼື ລະບຸເປັນຕົວເລືອກເພີ່ມເຕີມດ້ວຍ `--ssl-ca-intermediate`. ຕົວເລືອກ `--ssl-ca-intermediate` ສາມາດລະບຸໄດ້ຫຼາຍຄັ້ງ."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs-imported.adoc:19
#, no-wrap
msgid "Import certificates for new proxy installations"
msgstr "ນໍາເຂົ້າໃບຢັ້ງຢືນສໍາລັບການຕິດຕັ້ງພຣັອກຊີໃໝ່"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs-imported.adoc:20
msgid ""
"The proxy certificates are embedded in the generated configuration.  In "
"order to use a third-party certificate, it needs to be provided during the "
"configuration."
msgstr "ໃບຢັ້ງຢືນຂອງພຣັອກຊີຈະຖືກຝັງຢູ່ໃນຄອນຟິກທີ່ສ້າງຂຶ້ນ. ເພື່ອໃຊ້ໃບຢັ້ງຢືນຈາກພາຍນອກ, ທ່ານຕ້ອງລະບຸມັນໃນລະຫວ່າງການຕັ້ງຄ່າ."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs-imported.adoc:21
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Importing certificates on a new {productname} Proxy"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການນໍາເຂົ້າໃບຢັ້ງຢືນໃນ {productname} Proxy ໃໝ່"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs-imported.adoc:22
msgid ""
"Install the {productname} Proxy according to the instructions in "
"xref:installation-and-upgrade:install-proxy.adoc[]."
msgstr "ຕິດຕັ້ງ {productname} Proxy ຕາມຄໍາແນະນໍາໃນ xref:installation-and-upgrade:install-proxy.adoc[]."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs-imported.adoc:23
msgid "Follow the prompts to complete setup."
msgstr "ປະຕິບັດຕາມຂັ້ນຕອນທີ່ສະແດງເພື່ອສຳເລັດການຕັ້ງຄ່າ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs-imported.adoc:24
msgid ""
"Use the same certificate authority (CA) to sign all certificates for servers "
"and proxies.  Certificates signed with different CAs do not match."
msgstr "ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ CA ອັນດຽວກັນເພື່ອເຊັນໃບຢັ້ງຢືນທັງໝົດສໍາລັບເຊີເວີ ແລະ ພຣັອກຊີ. ໃບຢັ້ງຢືນທີ່ເຊັນດ້ວຍ CA ຕ່າງກັນຈະບໍ່ສາມາດໃຊ້ຮ່ວມກັນໄດ້."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs-imported.adoc:25
#, no-wrap
msgid "Replace certificates"
msgstr "ປ່ຽນໃບຢັ້ງຢືນ"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs-imported.adoc:26
msgid ""
"You can replace active certificates on your {productname} installation with "
"a new certificate.  There are two cases to consider: replacing only the "
"server or database certificate, and replacing the root CA."
msgstr "ທ່ານສາມາດປ່ຽນໃບຢັ້ງຢືນທີ່ໃຊ້ງານຢູ່ດ້ວຍໃບຢັ້ງຢືນໃໝ່. ມີສອງກໍລະນີທີ່ຕ້ອງພິຈາລະນາ: ການປ່ຽນສະເພາະໃບຢັ້ງຢືນເຊີເວີ ຫຼື ຖານຂໍ້ມູນ, ແລະ ການປ່ຽນ root CA."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs-imported.adoc:27
msgid ""
"Replacing the root certificate requires more time and planning to avoid "
"disruption as all the registered proxies and systems will need to have the "
"new CA in their database before switching to it at the server level."
msgstr "ການປ່ຽນໃບຢັ້ງຢືນ root ຕ້ອງໃຊ້ເວລາ ແລະ ການວາງແຜນຫຼາຍຂຶ້ນເພື່ອຫຼີກເວັ້ນການຂັດຈັງຫວະ ເນື່ອງຈາກພຣັອກຊີ ແລະ ລະບົບທີ່ລົງທະບຽນທັງໝົດຈະຕ້ອງມີ CA ໃໝ່ໃນຖານຂໍ້ມູນຂອງພວກເຂົາກ່ອນທີ່ຈະປ່ຽນໃນລະດັບເຊີເວີ."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs-imported.adoc:28
msgid ""
"When using third-party certificates signed by an intermediate CA, the "
"intermediate CA certificates need to be appended to the server or database "
"certificate file."
msgstr "ເມື່ອໃຊ້ໃບຢັ້ງຢືນຈາກພາຍນອກທີ່ເຊັນໂດຍ intermediate CA, ໃບຢັ້ງຢືນ intermediate CA ຈະຕ້ອງຖືກຕື່ມໃສ່ທ້າຍໄຟລ໌ໃບຢັ້ງຢືນເຊີເວີ ຫຼື ຖານຂໍ້ມູນ."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs-imported.adoc:29
msgid ""
"The order is important: first comes the server certificate, then the CAs "
"from the one which signed the certificate to the one signed by the root CA.  "
"The root CA certificate should not be appended to the server certificate "
"file."
msgstr "ລໍາດັບແມ່ນສິ່ງສໍາຄັນ: ເອົາໃບຢັ້ງຢືນເຊີເວີຂຶ້ນກ່ອນ, ຕາມດ້ວຍ CA ຈາກອັນທີ່ເຊັນໃບຢັ້ງຢືນນັ້ນ ໄປຈົນຮອດອັນທີ່ເຊັນໂດຍ root CA. ໃບຢັ້ງຢືນ root CA ບໍ່ຄວນຖືກຕື່ມໃສ່ໃນໄຟລ໌ໃບຢັ້ງຢືນເຊີເວີ."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs-imported.adoc:30
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Replacing all existing certificates"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການປ່ຽນໃບຢັ້ງຢືນທີ່ມີຢູ່ທັງໝົດ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs-imported.adoc:31
msgid ""
"The following considers that you have `root-ca.pem`, `intermediate-ca1.pem`, "
"`intermediate-ca2.pem`, `server.pem` and `server.key` files.  It may be "
"different depending on the number of intermediate CAs in the server "
"certificate signature chain."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs-imported.adoc:32
msgid ""
"Combine the intermediate CAs and server certificates.  The order matters, "
"the server must be first and the intermediate CAs in order.  Do not add the "
"root CA last into the chain as it will be passed separately to `uyuni-ca` "
"and `uyuni-db-ca` secrets.  If there is no intermediate CA, then you can use "
"the `server.pem` instead of the combined file in the next steps."
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs-imported.adoc:33
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"cat server.pem intermediate-ca1.pem intermediate-ca2.pem "
">combined-server.pem\n"
msgstr "cat server.pem intermediate-ca1.pem intermediate-ca2.pem >combined-server.pem\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs-imported.adoc:34
msgid ""
"On the {productname} container host, at the command prompt, recreate podman "
"certificate secrets passing the files paths:"
msgstr "ໃນ {productname} container host, ໃຫ້ສ້າງ podman certificate secrets ໃໝ່ໂດຍລະບຸ path ຂອງໄຟລ໌:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs-imported.adoc:35
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"podman secret create --replace uyuni-ca $path_to_ca_certificate\n"
"podman secret create --replace uyuni-cert "
"$path_to_combined_server_certificate\n"
"podman secret create --replace uyuni-key $path_to_server_key\n"
msgstr ""
"podman secret create --replace uyuni-ca $path_to_ca_certificate\n"
"podman secret create --replace uyuni-cert $path_to_combined_server_certificate\n"
"podman secret create --replace uyuni-key $path_to_server_key\n"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs-imported.adoc:36
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"podman secret create --replace uyuni-db-ca "
"$path_to_database_ca_certificate\n"
"podman secret create --replace uyuni-db-cert "
"$path_to_combined_database_certificate\n"
"podman secret create --replace uyuni-db-key $path_to_database_key\n"
msgstr ""
"podman secret create --replace uyuni-db-ca $path_to_database_ca_certificate\n"
"podman secret create --replace uyuni-db-cert $path_to_combined_database_certificate\n"
"podman secret create --replace uyuni-db-key $path_to_database_key\n"

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs-imported.adoc:37
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Restarting the server"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການຣີສະຕາດເຊີເວີ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs-imported.adoc:38
msgid "On the container host, restart the server to pick up the changes:"
msgstr "ທີ່ container host, ໃຫ້ຣີສະຕາດເຊີເວີເພື່ອໃຫ້ການປ່ຽນແປງມີຜົນ:"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs-imported.adoc:40
msgid ""
"If you are using a proxy, you need to generate a server certificate RPM for "
"each proxy, using their hostnames and cnames.  Generate a new configuration "
"tarball and deploy it."
msgstr "ຖ້າທ່ານກຳລັງໃຊ້ພຣັອກຊີ, ທ່ານຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງສ້າງ RPM ໃບຢັ້ງຢືນເຊີເວີສຳລັບແຕ່ລະພຣັອກຊີ ໂດຍໃຊ້ຊື່ໂຮສ ແລະ cnames ຂອງພວກມັນ. ສ້າງ configuration tarball ໃໝ່ແລ້ວນຳໄປຕິດຕັ້ງ."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs-imported.adoc:41
msgid ""
"For more information, see "
"xref:installation-and-upgrade:container-deployment/mlm/proxy-deployment-mlm.adoc#_generate_proxy_configuration[]."
msgstr "ສໍາລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ, ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງ xref:installation-and-upgrade:container-deployment/mlm/proxy-deployment-mlm.adoc#_generate_proxy_configuration[]."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs-imported.adoc:42
msgid ""
"For more information, see "
"xref:installation-and-upgrade:container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-deployment-uyuni.adoc#proxy-setup-containers-generate-config[].  "
"proxy-deployment-uyuni.adoc"
msgstr "ສໍາລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ, ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງ xref:installation-and-upgrade:container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-deployment-uyuni.adoc#proxy-setup-containers-generate-config[]."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs-imported.adoc:43
msgid ""
"If the Root CA was changed, it needs to get deployed to all the clients "
"connected to {productname}.  This is ideally done in advance to minimize the "
"disruption."
msgstr "ຫາກ Root CA ຖືກປ່ຽນ, ມັນຈະຕ້ອງຖືກຕິດຕັ້ງໃຫ້ກັບ client ທັງໝົດທີ່ເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ກັບ {productname}. ຄວນເຮັດສິ່ງນີ້ລ່ວງໜ້າເພື່ອຫຼຸດຜ່ອນການຂັດຈັງຫວະ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs-imported.adoc:44
msgid ""
"If the CA certificate was updated, a RPM file with Kiwi certificate needs to "
"be repackaged."
msgstr "ຫາກໃບຢັ້ງຢືນ CA ຖືກອັບເດດ, ໄຟລ໌ RPM ທີ່ມີໃບຢັ້ງຢືນ Kiwi ຈະຕ້ອງຖືກ repackage ໃໝ່."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs-imported.adoc:45
msgid "On the {productname} Server container host, execute following command:"
msgstr "ໃນ {productname} Server container host, ໃຫ້ລັນຄໍາສັ່ງຕໍ່ໄປນີ້:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs-imported.adoc:46
#, no-wrap
msgid "mgrctl exec mgr-package-rpm-certificate-osimage\n"
msgstr "mgrctl exec mgr-package-rpm-certificate-osimage\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs-imported.adoc:47
msgid ""
"After that, apply highstate on the Image Build hosts to deploy the new "
"certificates for Kiwi to use."
msgstr "ຫຼັງຈາກນັ້ນ, ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ highstate ກັບ Image Build hosts ເພື່ອຕິດຕັ້ງໃບຢັ້ງຢືນໃໝ່ໃຫ້ Kiwi ໃຊ້."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs-imported.adoc:48
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Deploying the root CA on clients"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການຕິດຕັ້ງ root CA ໃຫ້ກັບ clients"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs-imported.adoc:49
msgid "In the {productname} {webui}, navigate to menu:Systems[Overview]."
msgstr "ໃນ {productname} {webui}, ໃຫ້ໄປທີ່ເມນູ menu:Systems[Overview]."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs-imported.adoc:50
msgid "Check all your clients to add them to the system set manager."
msgstr "ເລືອກໄຄເອັນທັງໝົດຂອງທ່ານເພື່ອເພີ່ມພວກມັນເຂົ້າໃນ system set manager."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs-imported.adoc:51
msgid "Navigate to menu:Systems[System Set Manager > Overview]."
msgstr "ໄປທີ່ເມນູ menu:Systems[System Set Manager > Overview]."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs-imported.adoc:52
msgid "In the `States` field, click btn:[Apply] to apply the system states."
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs-imported.adoc:53
msgid ""
"In the `Highstate` page, click btn:[Apply Highstate] to propagate the "
"changes to the clients."
msgstr ""

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs-selfsigned.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Self-Signed SSL Certificates"
msgstr "ໃບຢັ້ງຢືນ SSL ທີ່ເຊັນດ້ວຍຕົນເອງ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs-selfsigned.adoc:2
msgid ""
"By default, {productname} uses a self-signed certificate.  In this case, the "
"certificate is created and signed by {productname}.  This method does not "
"use an independent certificate authority to guarantee that the details of "
"the certificate are correct.  Third-party CAs perform checks to ensure that "
"the information contained in the certificate is correct."
msgstr "ໂດຍຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ, {productname} ໃຊ້ໃບຢັ້ງຢືນທີ່ເຊັນດ້ວຍຕົນເອງ. ໃນກໍລະນີນີ້, ໃບຢັ້ງຢືນຈະຖືກສ້າງ ແລະ ເເຊັນໂດຍ {productname} ເອງ. ວິທີນີ້ບໍ່ໄດ້ໃຊ້ຕົວແທນອອກໃບຢັ້ງຢືນອິດສະຫຼະເພື່ອຮັບປະກັນວ່າລາຍລະອຽດຂອງໃບຢັ້ງຢືນນັ້ນຖືກຕ້ອງ. ແຕ່ CA ພາຍນອກຈະມີການກວດສອບເພື່ອໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າຂໍ້ມູນໃນໃບຢັ້ງຢືນນັ້ນຖືກຕ້ອງ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs-selfsigned.adoc:3
msgid ""
"For more information on third-party CAs, see "
"xref:administration:ssl-certs-imported.adoc[]."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບ CA ພາຍນອກ, ເບິ່ງ xref:administration:ssl-certs-imported.adoc[]."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs-selfsigned.adoc:4
msgid ""
"For more information on replacing certificates, see "
"xref:administration:ssl-certs-imported.adoc#ssl-certs-import-replace[]."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບການປ່ຽນແທນໃບຢັ້ງຢືນ, ເບິ່ງ xref:administration:ssl-certs-imported.adoc#ssl-certs-import-replace[]."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs-selfsigned.adoc:5
msgid ""
"This section covers how to create or re-create your self-signed certificates "
"on new or existing installation."
msgstr "ພາກນີ້ຈະເວົ້າເຖິງວິທີການສ້າງ ຫຼື ສ້າງໃໝ່ໃບຢັ້ງຢືນທີ່ເຊັນດ້ວຍຕົນເອງຂອງທ່ານ ໃນການຕິດຕັ້ງໃໝ່ ຫຼື ທີ່ມີຢູ່ແລ້ວ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs-selfsigned.adoc:6
msgid ""
"The hostname of the SSL keys and certificates must match the fully qualified "
"hostname of the machine you deploy them on."
msgstr "ຊື່ໂຮສຂອງ SSL keys ແລະ ໃບຢັ້ງຢືນຕ້ອງກົງກັບຊື່ໂຮສເຕັມຂອງເຄື່ອງທີ່ທ່ານຕິດຕັ້ງ."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs-selfsigned.adoc:7
#, no-wrap
msgid "Re-Create Existing Server Certificates"
msgstr "ສ້າງໃໝ່ໃບຢັ້ງຢືນເຊີເວີທີ່ມີຢູ່"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs-selfsigned.adoc:8
msgid ""
"If your existing certificates have expired or stopped working for any "
"reason, you can generate a new server certificate from the existing CA."
msgstr "ຖ້າໃບຢັ້ງຢືນທີ່ມີຢູ່ຂອງທ່ານໝົດອາຍຸ ຫຼື ຢຸດເຮັດວຽກດ້ວຍເຫດຜົນໃດກໍຕາມ, ທ່ານສາມາດສ້າງໃບຢັ້ງຢືນເຊີເວີໃໝ່ຈາກ CA ທີ່ມີຢູ່ໄດ້."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs-selfsigned.adoc:9
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Re-Creating an Existing Server Certificate"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການສ້າງໃໝ່ໃບຢັ້ງຢືນເຊີເວີທີ່ມີຢູ່"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs-selfsigned.adoc:10
msgid ""
"On the {productname} container host, at the command prompt, regenerate the "
"server certificate:"
msgstr "ທີ່ {productname} container host, ຢູ່ທີ່ command prompt, ໃຫ້ສ້າງໃບຢັ້ງຢືນເຊີເວີໃໝ່:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs-selfsigned.adoc:11
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"mgrctl exec -ti -- 'rhn-ssl-tool --gen-server --dir=\"/root/ssl-build\" "
"--set-country=\"COUNTRY\" \\\n"
"--set-state=\"STATE\" --set-city=\"CITY\" --set-org=\"ORGANIZATION\" \\\n"
"--set-org-unit=\"ORGANIZATION UNIT\" --set-email=\"name@example.com\" \\\n"
"--set-hostname=\"susemanager.example.com\" --set-cname=\"example.com\"'\n"
msgstr ""
"mgrctl exec -ti -- 'rhn-ssl-tool --gen-server --dir=\"/root/ssl-build\" --set-country=\"COUNTRY\" \\\n"
"--set-state=\"STATE\" --set-city=\"CITY\" --set-org=\"ORGANIZATION\" \\\n"
"--set-org-unit=\"ORGANIZATION UNIT\" --set-email=\"name@example.com\" \\\n"
"--set-hostname=\"susemanager.example.com\" --set-cname=\"example.com\"'\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs-selfsigned.adoc:12
#: en/modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs-selfsigned.adoc:24
msgid ""
"Ensure that the `set-cname` parameter is the fully qualified domain name of "
"your {productname} Server.  You can use the `set-cname` parameter multiple "
"times if you require multiple aliases."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs-selfsigned.adoc:13
msgid ""
"The private key and the server certificate can be found inside the server "
"container in the directory `/root/ssl-build/susemanager/` as `server.key` "
"and `server.crt`.  The name of the last directory depends on the hostname "
"used with `--set-hostname` option."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs-selfsigned.adoc:14
msgid ""
"Deploy or import the new certificate and key by updating container's host "
"podman secrets.  For more information about importing the just generated "
"certificate, see "
"xref:administration:ssl-certs-imported.adoc#ssl-certs-import-replace[]."
msgstr "ຕິດຕັ້ງ ຫຼື ນໍາເຂົ້າໃບຢັ້ງຢືນ ແລະ ຄີໃໝ່ໂດຍການອັບເດດ podman secrets ຂອງ container host. ສໍາລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບການນໍາເຂົ້າໃບຢັ້ງຢືນທີ່ຫາກໍສ້າງໃໝ່, ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງ xref:administration:ssl-certs-imported.adoc#ssl-certs-import-replace[]."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs-selfsigned.adoc:15
#, no-wrap
msgid "Create a new CA and Server Certificates"
msgstr "ສ້າງ CA ໃໝ່ ແລະ ໃບຢັ້ງຢືນເຊີເວີ"

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs-selfsigned.adoc:16
msgid ""
"Be careful when you need to replace the Root CA.  It is possible to break "
"the trust chain between the server and clients.  If that happens, you need "
"an administrative user to log in to every client and deploy the CA directly."
msgstr "ໃຫ້ລະມັດລະວັງເມື່ອຕ້ອງການປ່ຽນແທນ Root CA. ມັນອາດຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ສາຍໃຍຄວາມເຊື່ອຖື (trust chain) ລະຫວ່າງເຊີເວີ ແລະ ໄຄເອັນຂາດລົງ. ຖ້າເກີດເຫດການນັ້ນ, ທ່ານຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງໃຊ້ສິດຜູ້ດູແລລະບົບເພື່ອລັອກອິນເຂົ້າໃນທຸກໄຄເອັນ ແລະ ຕິດຕັ້ງ CA ໂດຍກົງ."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs-selfsigned.adoc:17
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Creating New Certificates"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການສ້າງໃບຢັ້ງຢືນໃໝ່"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs-selfsigned.adoc:18
msgid ""
"On the {productname} container host, at the command prompt, move the old "
"certificate directory to a new location:"
msgstr "ທີ່ {productname} container host, ຢູ່ທີ່ command prompt, ໃຫ້ຍ້າຍໄດເຣັກທໍຣີໃບຢັ້ງຢືນເກົ່າໄປທີ່ບ່ອນໃໝ່:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs-selfsigned.adoc:19
#, no-wrap
msgid "mgrctl exec -- mv /root/ssl-build /root/old-ssl-build\n"
msgstr "mgrctl exec -- mv /root/ssl-build /root/old-ssl-build\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs-selfsigned.adoc:20
msgid "Generate a new CA certificate:"
msgstr "ສ້າງໃບຢັ້ງຢືນ CA ໃໝ່:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs-selfsigned.adoc:21
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"mgrctl exec -ti -- 'rhn-ssl-tool --gen-ca --dir=\"/root/ssl-build\" "
"--set-country=\"COUNTRY\" \\\n"
"--set-state=\"STATE\" --set-city=\"CITY\" --set-org=\"ORGANIZATION\" \\\n"
"--set-org-unit=\"ORGANIZATION UNIT\" --set-common-name=\"SUSE Manager CA "
"Certificate\" \\\n"
"--set-email=\"name@example.com\"'\n"
msgstr ""
"mgrctl exec -ti -- 'rhn-ssl-tool --gen-ca --dir=\"/root/ssl-build\" --set-country=\"COUNTRY\" \\\n"
"--set-state=\"STATE\" --set-city=\"CITY\" --set-org=\"ORGANIZATION\" \\\n"
"--set-org-unit=\"ORGANIZATION UNIT\" --set-common-name=\"SUSE Manager CA Certificate\" \\\n"
"--set-email=\"name@example.com\"'\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs-selfsigned.adoc:22
msgid "Generate a new server certificate:"
msgstr "ສ້າງໃບຢັ້ງຢືນເຊີເວີໃໝ່:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs-selfsigned.adoc:23
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"mgrctl exec -ti -- 'rhn-ssl-tool --gen-server --dir=\"/root/ssl-build\" "
"--set-country=\"COUNTRY\" \\\n"
"--set-state=\"STATE\" --set-city=\"CITY\" --set-org=\"ORGANIZATION\" \\\n"
"--set-org-unit=\"ORGANIZATION UNIT\" --set-email=\"name@example.com\" \\\n"
"--set-hostname=\"susemanager.example.top\" --set-cname=\"example.com\"'\n"
msgstr ""
"mgrctl exec -ti -- 'rhn-ssl-tool --gen-server --dir=\"/root/ssl-build\" --set-country=\"COUNTRY\" \\\n"
"--set-state=\"STATE\" --set-city=\"CITY\" --set-org=\"ORGANIZATION\" \\\n"
"--set-org-unit=\"ORGANIZATION UNIT\" --set-email=\"name@example.com\" \\\n"
"--set-hostname=\"susemanager.example.top\" --set-cname=\"example.com\"'\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs-selfsigned.adoc:25
msgid ""
"You need to generate a server certificate also for each proxy, using their "
"hostnames and cnames."
msgstr "ທ່ານຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງສ້າງໃບຢັ້ງຢືນເຊີເວີສຳລັບແຕ່ລະພຣັອກຊີຄືກັນ ໂດຍໃຊ້ຊື່ໂຮສ ແລະ cnames ຂອງພວກມັນ."

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "SSL Certificates"
msgstr "ໃບຢັ້ງຢືນ SSL"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs.adoc:2
msgid ""
"{productname} uses SSL certificates to ensure that clients are registered to "
"the correct server."
msgstr "{productname} ໃຊ້ໃບຢັ້ງຢືນ SSL ເພື່ອໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າໄຄເອັນໄດ້ລົງທະບຽນກັບເຊີເວີທີ່ຖືກຕ້ອງ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs.adoc:3
msgid ""
"Every client that uses SSL to register to the {productname} Server checks "
"that it is connecting to the right server by validating against a server "
"certificate.  This process is called an SSL handshake."
msgstr "ທຸກໄຄເອັນທີ່ໃຊ້ SSL ເພື່ອລົງທະບຽນກັບ {productname} Server ຈະກວດສອບວ່າມັນກຳລັງເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ກັບເຊີເວີທີ່ຖືກຕ້ອງ ໂດຍການກວດສອບຄວາມຖືກຕ້ອງກັບໃບຢັ້ງຢືນເຊີເວີ. ຂະບວນການນີ້ເອີ້ນວ່າ SSL handshake."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs.adoc:4
msgid ""
"During the SSL handshake, the client checks that the hostname in the server "
"certificate matches what it expects.  The client also needs to check if the "
"server certificate is trusted."
msgstr "ໃນລະຫວ່າງ SSL handshake, ໄຄເອັນຈະກວດສອບວ່າຊື່ໂຮສໃນໃບຢັ້ງຢືນເຊີເວີກົງກັບສິ່ງທີ່ມັນຄາດໄວ້ຫຼືບໍ່. ໄຄເອັນຍັງຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງກວດສອບວ່າໃບຢັ້ງຢືນເຊີເວີນັ້ນໄດ້ຮັບຄວາມເຊື່ອຖືຫຼືບໍ່."

#. Every {productname} Server that uses SSL requires an SSL server certificate.
#. Provide the path to the server certificate using the `SERVER_CERT` environment variable during setup, or with the `--from-server-cert` option of the `rhn-ssl-tool` command.
#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs.adoc:5
msgid ""
"Certificate authorities (CAs) are certificates that are used to sign other "
"certificates.  All certificates must be signed by a certificate authority "
"(CA) in order for them to be considered valid, and for clients to be able to "
"successfully match against them."
msgstr "ຕົວແທນອອກໃບຢັ້ງຢືນ (CAs) ແມ່ນໃບຢັ້ງຢືນທີ່ໃຊ້ເພື່ອເຊັນໃບຢັ້ງຢືນອື່ນໆ. ໃບຢັ້ງຢືນທັງໝົດຕ້ອງໄດ້ຮັບການເຊັນໂດຍ CA ເພື່ອໃຫ້ຖືວ່າຖືກຕ້ອງ ແລະ ເພື່ອໃຫ້ໄຄເອັນສາມາດກວດສອບຄວາມຖືກຕ້ອງກັບພວກມັນໄດ້."

#. When an organization signs its own certificate, the certificate is considered self-signed.
#. A self-signed certificate is straight-forward to set up, and does not cost any money, but they are considered less secure.
#. If you are using a self-signed certificate, you have a root CA that is signed with itself.
#. When you look at the details of a root CA, you can see that the subject has the same value as the issuer.
#. Provide the path to your root CA certificate using the `CA_CERT` environment variable during setup, or with the `--ca-cert` option of the `rhn-ssl-tool` command.
#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs.adoc:6
msgid ""
"In order for SSL authentication to work correctly, the client must trust the "
"root CA.  This means that the root CA must be installed on every client."
msgstr "ເພື່ອໃຫ້ການຢືນຢັນຕົວຕົນ SSL ເຮັດວຽກໄດ້ຢ່າງຖືກຕ້ອງ, ໄຄເອັນຕ້ອງເຊື່ອຖື root CA. ນີ້ໝາຍຄວາມວ່າ root CA ຕ້ອງຖືກຕິດຕັ້ງຢູ່ໃນທຸກໄຄເອັນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs.adoc:7
msgid ""
"The default method of SSL authentication is for {productname} to use "
"self-signed certificates.  In this case, {productname} has generated all the "
"certificates, and the root CA has signed the server certificate directly."
msgstr "ວິທີການຢືນຢັນຕົວຕົນ SSL ແບບເລີ່ມຕົ້ນແມ່ນ {productname} ຈະໃຊ້ໃບຢັ້ງຢືນທີ່ເຊັນດ້ວຍຕົນເອງ. ໃນກໍລະນີນີ້, {productname} ໄດ້ສ້າງໃບຢັ້ງຢືນທັງໝົດ ແລະ root CA ໄດ້ເຊັນໃບຢັ້ງຢືນເຊີເວີໂດຍກົງ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs.adoc:8
msgid ""
"An alternative method is to use an intermediate CA.  In this case, the root "
"CA signs the intermediate CA.  The intermediate CA can then sign any number "
"of other intermediate CAs, and the final one signs the server certificate.  "
"This is referred to as a chained certificate."
msgstr "ອີກວິທີໜຶ່ງແມ່ນການໃຊ້ intermediate CA. ໃນກໍລະນີນີ້, root CA ຈະເຊັນ intermediate CA. ຈາກນັ້ນ intermediate CA ສາມາດເຊັນ intermediate CAs ອື່ນໆໄດ້ບໍ່ຈຳກັດ, ແລະ ອັນສຸດທ້າຍຈະເຊັນໃບຢັ້ງຢືນເຊີເວີ. ສິ່ງນີ້ເອີ້ນວ່າ chained certificate."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs.adoc:9
msgid ""
"If you are using intermediate CAs in a chained certificate, the root CA is "
"installed on the client, and the server certificate is installed on the "
"server.  During the SSL handshake, clients must be able to verify the entire "
"chain of intermediate certificates between the root CA and the server "
"certificate, so they must be able to access all the intermediate "
"certificates."
msgstr "ຖ້າທ່ານໃຊ້ intermediate CAs ໃນ chained certificate, root CA ຈະຖືກຕິດຕັ້ງໃນໄຄເອັນ, ແລະ ໃບຢັ້ງຢືນເຊີເວີຈະຖືກຕິດຕັ້ງໃນເຊີເວີ. ໃນລະຫວ່າງ SSL handshake, ໄຄເອັນຕ້ອງສາມາດກວດສອບທັງໝົດ chain ຂອງໃບຢັ້ງຢືນລະດັບກາງລະຫວ່າງ root CA ແລະ ໃບຢັ້ງຢືນເຊີເວີ, ດັ່ງນັ້ນພວກມັນຕ້ອງສາມາດເຂົ້າເຖິງ intermediate certificates ທັງໝົດໄດ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs.adoc:10
msgid ""
"There are two main ways of achieving this.  In older versions of "
"{productname}, by default, all the intermediate CAs are installed on the "
"client.  However, you could also configure your services on the server to "
"provide them to the client.  In this case, during the SSL handshake, the "
"server presents the server certificate as well as all the intermediate CAs.  "
"This mechanism is used now as the default configuration."
msgstr "ມີສອງວິທີຫຼັກໃນການເຮັດສິ່ງນີ້. ໃນ {productname} ເວີຊັນເກົ່າ, ໂດຍຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ, intermediate CAs ທັງໝົດຈະຖືກຕິດຕັ້ງໃນໄຄເອັນ. ແນວໃດກໍຕາມ, ທ່ານຍັງສາມາດກຳນົດຄ່າບໍລິການຂອງທ່ານໃນເຊີເວີເພື່ອສົ່ງພວກມັນໃຫ້ໄຄເອັນໄດ້. ໃນກໍລະນີນີ້, ໃນລະຫວ່າງ SSL handshake, ເຊີເວີຈະສະແດງທັງໃບຢັ້ງຢືນເຊີເວີ ແລະ intermediate CAs ທັງໝົດ. ກົນໄກນີ້ຖືກໃຊ້ເປັນຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນໃນປັດຈຸບັນ."

#. Whichever method you choose, you must ensure that the `CA_CERT` environment variable points to the root CA, and all intermediate CAs.
#. It should not contain the server certificate.
#. The server certificate must be defined at the `SERVER_CERT` environment variable.
#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs.adoc:11
msgid ""
"By default, {productname} uses a self-signed certificate without "
"intermediate CAs.  For additional security, you can arrange a third party CA "
"to sign your certificates.  Third party CAs perform checks to ensure that "
"the information contained in the certificate is correct.  They usually "
"charge an annual fee for this service.  Using a third party CA makes "
"certificates harder to spoof, and provides additional protection for your "
"installation.  If you have certificates signed by a third party CA, you can "
"import them to your {productname} installation."
msgstr "ໂດຍຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ, {productname} ໃຊ້ໃບຢັ້ງຢືນທີ່ເຊັນດ້ວຍຕົນເອງໂດຍບໍ່ມີ intermediate CAs. ເພື່ອຄວາມປອດໄພທີ່ເພີ່ມຂຶ້ນ, ທ່ານສາມາດໃຫ້ CA ພາຍນອກເຊັນໃບຢັ້ງຢືນຂອງທ່ານໄດ້. CA ພາຍນອກຈະກວດສອບເພື່ອໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າຂໍ້ມູນໃນໃບຢັ້ງຢືນຖືກຕ້ອງ. ພວກເຂົາມັກຈະຄິດຄ່າບໍລິການເປັນລາຍປີ. ການໃຊ້ CA ພາຍນອກເຮັດໃຫ້ໃບຢັ້ງຢືນຖືກປອມແປງໄດ້ຍາກ ແລະ ຊ່ວຍປົກປ້ອງການຕິດຕັ້ງຂອງທ່ານໄດ້ດີຂຶ້ນ. ຖ້າທ່ານມີໃບຢັ້ງຢືນທີ່ເຊັນໂດຍ CA ພາຍນອກ, ທ່ານສາມາດນຳເຂົ້າພວກມັນມາຍັງ {productname} ຂອງທ່ານໄດ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs.adoc:12
msgid "This manual describe the use of SSL certificates in two steps:"
msgstr "ຄູ່ມືນີ້ອະທິບາຍການນຳໃຊ້ໃບຢັ້ງຢືນ SSL ໃນສອງຂັ້ນຕອນ:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs.adoc:13
msgid "How to create a self-signed certificate with {productname} tools"
msgstr "ວິທີການສ້າງໃບຢັ້ງຢືນທີ່ເຊັນດ້ວຍຕົນເອງດ້ວຍເຄື່ອງມື {productname}"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs.adoc:14
msgid "How to deploy a certificate on {productname} Server or Proxy"
msgstr "ວິທີການຕິດຕັ້ງໃບຢັ້ງຢືນໃນ {productname} Server ຫຼື Proxy"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs.adoc:15
msgid ""
"In case the certificates are provided by a third party instance like an own "
"or external PKI, step 1 can be skipped."
msgstr "ໃນກໍລະນີທີ່ໃບຢັ້ງຢືນຖືກຈັດຫາໃຫ້ໂດຍໜ່ວຍງານພາຍນອກ ເຊັ່ນ PKI ຂອງຕົນເອງ ຫຼື ພາຍນອກ, ຂັ້ນຕອນທີ 1 ສາມາດຂ້າມໄດ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs.adoc:16
msgid ""
"For more information about creating self-signed certificates, see "
"xref:administration:ssl-certs-selfsigned.adoc[]."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບການສ້າງໃບຢັ້ງຢືນທີ່ເຊັນດ້ວຍຕົນເອງ, ເບິ່ງ xref:administration:ssl-certs-selfsigned.adoc[]."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs.adoc:17
msgid ""
"For more information about importing certificates, see "
"xref:administration:ssl-certs-imported.adoc[]."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບການນຳເຂົ້າໃບຢັ້ງຢືນ, ເບິ່ງ xref:administration:ssl-certs-imported.adoc[]."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs.adoc:18
#, no-wrap
msgid "Providing SSL Certificates to the {productname} Containers"
msgstr "ການຈັດຫາໃບຢັ້ງຢືນ SSL ໃຫ້ກັບ {productname} Containers"

