#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/subscription-matching.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Subscription Matching"
msgstr "ການຈັບຄູ່ການສະໝັກໃຊ້ (Subscription Matching)"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/subscription-matching.adoc:2
msgid ""
"Your {suse} products require subscriptions, which are managed by the "
"{scclongform} ({scc}).  {productname} runs a nightly report checking the "
"subscription status of all your registered clients against your {scc} "
"account.  The report gives you information about which clients consume which "
"subscriptions, how many subscriptions you have remaining and available to "
"use, and which clients do not have a current subscription."
msgstr "ຜະລິດຕະພັນ {suse} ຂອງທ່ານຕ້ອງການການສະໝັກໃຊ້ (subscriptions) ເຊິ່ງຖືກຈັດການໂດຍ {scclongform} ({scc}). {productname} ຈະລັນບົດລາຍງານທຸກໆຄືນເພື່ອທຽບສະຖານະການສະໝັກໃຊ້ຂອງໄຄເອັນທັງໝົດທີ່ລົງທະບຽນກັບບັນຊີ {scc} ຂອງທ່ານ. ບົດລາຍງານຈະໃຫ້ຂໍ້ມູນວ່າໄຄເອັນໃດໃຊ້ການສະໝັກໃຊ້ອັນໃດ, ທ່ານເຫຼືອການສະໝັກໃຊ້ຈຳນວນເທົ່າໃດທີ່ສາມາດໃຊ້ໄດ້, ແລະ ໄຄເອັນໃດທີ່ຍັງບໍ່ມີການສະໝັກໃຊ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/subscription-matching.adoc:3
msgid "Navigate to menu:Audit[Subscription Matching] to see the report."
msgstr "ໄປທີ່ເມນູ menu:Audit[Subscription Matching] ເພື່ອເບິ່ງບົດລາຍງານ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/subscription-matching.adoc:4
msgid ""
"The `Subscriptions Report` tab gives information about current and expiring "
"subscriptions."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/subscription-matching.adoc:5
msgid ""
"The `Unmatched Products Report` tab gives a list of clients that do not have "
"a current subscription.  This includes clients that could not be matched, or "
"that are not currently registered with {productname}.  The report includes "
"product names and the number of systems that remain unmatched."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/subscription-matching.adoc:6
msgid ""
"The `Pins` tab allows you to associate individual clients to the relevant "
"subscription.  This is especially useful if the subscription manager is not "
"automatically associating clients to subscriptions successfully."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/subscription-matching.adoc:7
msgid ""
"The `Messages` tab shows all the messages generated by subscription matcher "
"during the matching process.  They provide information to help understand "
"the results and to improve the matching."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/subscription-matching.adoc:8
msgid ""
"You can also download the reports in .csv format, or access them from that "
"command prompt in the `/var/lib/spacewalk/subscription-matcher/` directory."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/subscription-matching.adoc:9
msgid ""
"By default, the subscription matcher runs daily, at midnight.  To change "
"this, navigate to menu:Admin[Task Schedules] and click "
"`gatherer-matcher-default`.  Change the schedule as required, and click "
"btn:[Update Schedule]."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/subscription-matching.adoc:10
msgid ""
"Because the report can only match current clients with current "
"subscriptions, you might find that the matches change over time.  The same "
"client does not always match the same subscription.  This can be due to new "
"clients being registered or unregistered, or because of the addition or "
"expiration of subscriptions."
msgstr "ເນື່ອງຈາກບົດລາຍງານສາມາດຈັບຄູ່ໄຄເອັນໃນປັດຈຸບັນກັບການສະໝັກໃຊ້ໃນປັດຈຸບັນເທົ່ານັ້ນ, ທ່ານອາດຈະພົບວ່າການຈັບຄູ່ມີການປ່ຽນແປງຕາມເວລາ. ໄຄເອັນດຽວກັນອາດຈະບໍ່ໄດ້ຈັບຄູ່ກັບການສະໝັກໃຊ້ອັນເດີມສະເໝີໄປ. ສິ່ງນີ້ອາດເກີດຈາກການລົງທະບຽນໄຄເອັນໃໝ່, ການຍົກເລີກການລົງທະບຽນ, ຫຼື ການເພີ່ມ ແລະ ການໝົດອາຍຸຂອງການສະໝັກໃຊ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/subscription-matching.adoc:11
msgid ""
"The subscription matcher automatically attempts to reduce the number of "
"unmatched products, limited by the terms and conditions of the subscriptions "
"in your account.  However, if you have incomplete hardware information, "
"unknown virtual machine host assignments, or clients running in unknown "
"public clouds, the matcher might show that you do not have enough "
"subscriptions available.  Always ensure you have complete data about your "
"clients included in {productname}, to help ensure accuracy."
msgstr "Subscription matcher ຈະພະຍາຍາມຫຼຸດຈຳນວນຜະລິດຕະພັນທີ່ຍັງບໍ່ໄດ້ຈັບຄູ່ໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ ພາຍໃຕ້ຂໍ້ກຳນົດ ແລະ ເງື່ອນໄຂຂອງການສະໝັກໃຊ້ໃນບັນຊີຂອງທ່ານ. ແນວໃດກໍຕາມ, ຖ້າທ່ານມີຂໍ້ມູນຮາດແວບໍ່ຄົບຖ້ວນ, ບໍ່ໄດ້ກຳນົດ virtual machine host ທີ່ຊັດເຈນ, ຫຼື ມີໄຄເອັນທີ່ເຮັດວຽກຢູ່ເທິງ public cloud ທີ່ບໍ່ຮູ້ຈັກ, matcher ອາດຈະສະແດງວ່າທ່ານມີການສະໝັກໃຊ້ບໍ່ພຽງພໍ. ໃຫ້ກວດສອບສະເໝີວ່າທ່ານມີຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ຄົບຖ້ວນກ່ຽວກັບໄຄເອັນໃນ {productname} ເພື່ອຄວາມຖືກຕ້ອງ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/subscription-matching.adoc:12
msgid ""
"The subscription matcher does not always match clients and subscriptions "
"accurately.  It is not intended to be a replacement for auditing."
msgstr "Subscription matcher ອາດຈະບໍ່ຈັບຄູ່ໄຄເອັນ ແລະ ການສະໝັກໃຊ້ໄດ້ຢ່າງຖືກຕ້ອງ 100%. ມັນບໍ່ໄດ້ຖືກອອກແບບມາເພື່ອໃຊ້ແທນການກວດສອບ (auditing)."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/administration/pages/subscription-matching.adoc:13
#, no-wrap
msgid "Pin Clients to Subscriptions"
msgstr "ການປັກໝຸດໄຄເອັນເຂົ້າກັບການສະໝັກໃຊ້"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/subscription-matching.adoc:14
msgid ""
"If the subscription matcher is not automatically matching a particular "
"client with the correct subscription, you can manually pin them.  When you "
"have created a pin, the subscription matcher favors matching a specific "
"subscription with a given system or group of systems."
msgstr "ຖ້າ subscription matcher ບໍ່ສາມາດຈັບຄູ່ໄຄເອັນສະເພາະອັນໃດໜຶ່ງກັບການສະໝັກໃຊ້ທີ່ຖືກຕ້ອງໄດ້, ທ່ານສາມາດປັກໝຸດພວກມັນດ້ວຍຕົນເອງ. ເມື່ອທ່ານສ້າງການປັກໝຸດແລ້ວ, subscription matcher ຈະໃຫ້ບຸລິມະສິດໃນການຈັບຄູ່ການສະໝັກໃຊ້ທີ່ລະບຸກັບລະບົບ ຫຼື ກຸ່ມລະບົບນັ້ນໆ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/subscription-matching.adoc:15
msgid ""
"However, the matcher does not always respect a pin.  It depends on the "
"subscription being available, and whether or not the subscription can be "
"applied to the client.  Additionally, pins are ignored if they result in a "
"match that violates the terms and conditions of the subscription, or if the "
"matcher detects a more accurate match if the pin is ignored."
msgstr "ແນວໃດກໍຕາມ, matcher ອາດຈະບໍ່ເຮັດຕາມການປັກໝຸດສະເໝີໄປ. ມັນຂຶ້ນກັບວ່າການສະໝັກໃຊ້ນັ້ນຍັງວ່າງຢູ່ບໍ່ ແລະ ສາມາດໃຊ້ກັບໄຄເອັນນັ້ນໄດ້ຫຼືບໍ່. ນອກຈາກນັ້ນ, ການປັກໝຸດຈະຖືກລະເລີຍຖ້າມັນເຮັດໃຫ້ເກີດການຈັບຄູ່ທີ່ລະເມີດຂໍ້ກຳນົດ ແລະ ເງື່ອນໄຂ, ຫຼື ຖ້າ matcher ພົບການຈັບຄູ່ທີ່ຖືກຕ້ອງກວ່າຫາກລະເລີຍການປັກໝຸດນັ້ນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/subscription-matching.adoc:16
msgid "To add a new pin, click btn:[Add a Pin], and select the client to pin."
msgstr "ເພື່ອເພີ່ມການປັກໝຸດໃໝ່, ໃຫ້ຄລິກ btn:[Add a Pin], ແລ້ວເລືອກໄຄເອັນທີ່ຕ້ອງການປັກໝຸດ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/subscription-matching.adoc:17
msgid ""
"We do not recommend using pinning regularly, or for a large number of "
"clients.  The subscription matcher tool is generally accurate enough for "
"most installations."
msgstr "ພວກເຮົາບໍ່ແນະນຳໃຫ້ໃຊ້ການປັກໝຸດເປັນປະຈຳ ຫຼື ໃຊ້ກັບໄຄເອັນຈຳນວນຫຼາຍ. ໂດຍທົ່ວໄປແລ້ວເຄື່ອງມື subscription matcher ແມ່ນມີຄວາມຖືກຕ້ອງພຽງພໍສຳລັບການຕິດຕັ້ງສ່ວນໃຫຍ່."

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/support.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Support"
msgstr "ການສະໜັບສະໜູນ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/support.adoc:2
msgid ""
"When you manage systems in {productname} where you are entitled for support "
"from {suse}, you can get the support data like `supportconfig` or "
"`sosreport`.  You will get the data from the managed client and upload it "
"directly to SUSE Global Technical Support."
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/administration/pages/support.adoc:3
#, no-wrap
msgid "Create a service request number"
msgstr "ສ້າງໝາຍເລກຄໍາຮ້ອງຂໍການບໍລິການ (Service Request)"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/support.adoc:4
msgid ""
"Before handing over the support data to Global Technical Support, you need "
"to generate a service request number first."
msgstr "ກ່ອນທີ່ຈະສົ່ງຂໍ້ມູນການສະໜັບສະໜູນໃຫ້ກັບ Global Technical Support, ທ່ານຈໍາເປັນຕ້ອງສ້າງໝາຍເລກຄໍາຮ້ອງຂໍການບໍລິການກ່ອນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/support.adoc:5
msgid ""
"To create a service request, go to https://scc.suse.com/support/requests and "
"follow the instructions on the screen.  Write down the service request "
"number."
msgstr "ເພື່ອສ້າງຄໍາຮ້ອງຂໍການບໍລິການ, ໃຫ້ໄປທີ່ https://scc.suse.com/support/requests ແລະ ປະຕິບັດຕາມຄໍາແນະນໍາໃນໜ້າຈໍ. ຈົດໝາຍເລກຄໍາຮ້ອງຂໍການບໍລິການໄວ້."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/support.adoc:6
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Privacy statement**\n"
msgstr "**ຖະແຫຼງການຄວາມເປັນສ່ວນຕົວ**\n"

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/support.adoc:7
msgid ""
"{suse} treats system reports as confidential data.  For details about the "
"{suse} privacy commitment, see "
"https://www.suse.com/company/policies/privacy/."
msgstr "{suse} ຖືວ່າລາຍງານລະບົບເປັນຂໍ້ມູນລັບ. ສໍາລັບລາຍລະອຽດກ່ຽວກັບຄໍາໝັ້ນສັນຍາຄວາມເປັນສ່ວນຕົວຂອງ {suse}, ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງ https://www.suse.com/company/policies/privacy/."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/administration/pages/support.adoc:8
#, no-wrap
msgid "Collect and upload support data from {productname} to {suse}"
msgstr "ເກັບກໍາ ແລະ ອັບໂຫຼດຂໍ້ມູນການສະໜັບສະໜູນຈາກ {productname} ໄປທີ່ {suse}"

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/administration/pages/support.adoc:9
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Procedure: Collecting support data and uploading with the {productname} "
"{webui}"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການເກັບກໍາຂໍ້ມູນການສະໜັບສະໜູນ ແລະ ອັບໂຫຼດດ້ວຍ {productname} {webui}"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/support.adoc:10
msgid ""
"In the {productname} {webui}, navigate to menu:Systems[System List > All] "
"and select the client which support data should be added to the case."
msgstr "ໃນ {productname} {webui}, ໃຫ້ໄປທີ່ເມນູ: Systems[System List > All] ແລະ ເລືອກ client ທີ່ຕ້ອງການເກັບຂໍ້ມູນການສະໜັບສະໜູນເພື່ອເພີ່ມເຂົ້າໃນເຄສ (case)."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/support.adoc:11
msgid "Then navigate to the `Details` tab and select the `Support` sub-tab."
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/support.adoc:12
msgid ""
"In the field `Support Case Number` enter the service request number created "
"above."
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/support.adoc:13
msgid ""
"In the field `Upload Region` select option `EU` or `US` depending on the "
"server where you want to upload your data."
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/support.adoc:14
msgid ""
"In the field `Command-line Arguments` you can enter options for tool which "
"is used to collect the data from the target system.  Which tool will be used "
"can be found in the tip below this field."
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/support.adoc:15
msgid "In the field `Earliest` select the time of running this action."
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/support.adoc:16
msgid ""
"Click button btn:[Schedule].  The action is scheduled and will be executed "
"defined time. It will collect the data from the client and upload it "
"directly to the upload server."
msgstr "ຄລິກປຸ່ມ [Schedule]. ການດໍາເນີນການຈະຖືກຕັ້ງຕາຕະລາງ ແລະ ຈະຖືກເຮັດວຽກໃນເວລາທີ່ກໍານົດ. ມັນຈະເກັບກໍາຂໍ້ມູນຈາກ client ແລະ ອັບໂຫຼດໂດຍກົງໄປທີ່ເຊີເວີອັບໂຫຼດ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/support.adoc:17
msgid "Supported Products where support data can be collected:"
msgstr "ຜະລິດຕະພັນທີ່ຮອງຮັບການເກັບກໍາຂໍ້ມູນການສະໜັບສະໜູນ:"

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/support.adoc:18
msgid "{productname} Proxy"
msgstr "{productname} Proxy"

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/support.adoc:19
msgid ""
"{productname} Server when it is registered as Peripheral Server in a Hub "
"Scenario"
msgstr "{productname} Server ເມື່ອຖືກລົງທະບຽນເປັນ Peripheral Server ໃນຮູບແບບ Hub Scenario"

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/support.adoc:20
msgid "all {sles} and {opensuse} clients"
msgstr "client {sles} ແລະ {opensuse} ທັງໝົດ"

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/support.adoc:21
msgid "SUSE Liberty and compatible clients"
msgstr "SUSE Liberty ແລະ client ທີ່ເຂົ້າກັນໄດ້"

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/support.adoc:22
msgid "Ubuntu clients"
msgstr "client Ubuntu"

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/support.adoc:23
msgid "Debian clients"
msgstr "client Debian"

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/support.adoc:24
msgid ""
"To upload the support data from the main {productname} Server please still "
"use `mgradm support config` from the container host."
msgstr ""

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/task-schedules.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Task Schedules"
msgstr "ກຳນົດເວລາວຽກ (Task Schedules)"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/task-schedules.adoc:2
msgid "All predefined task bunches are listed under menu:Admin[Task Schedules]."
msgstr "ກຸ່ມວຽກທີ່ກຳນົດໄວ້ລ່ວງໜ້າທັງໝົດຈະສະແດງຢູ່ໃນເມນູ menu:Admin[Task Schedules]."

#. type: Target for macro image
#: en/modules/administration/pages/task-schedules.adoc:3
#, no-wrap
msgid "admin_task_schedules.png"
msgstr "admin_task_schedules.png"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/task-schedules.adoc:4
msgid ""
"Click menu:{productname} Schedules[Schedule name] to open the menu:Schedule "
"Name[Basic Schedule Details].  You can disable it or change its frequency."
msgstr "ຄລິກທີ່ menu:{productname} Schedules[ຊື່ກຳນົດເວລາ] ເພື່ອເປີດ menu:Schedule Name[ລາຍລະອຽດກຳນົດເວລາພື້ນຖານ]. ທ່ານສາມາດປິດການໃຊ້ງານ ຫຼື ປ່ຽນຄວາມຖີ່ຂອງມັນໄດ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/task-schedules.adoc:5
msgid "Click btn:[Edit Schedule] to update the schedule with your settings."
msgstr "ຄລິກ btn:[Edit Schedule] ເພື່ອອັບເດດກຳນົດເວລາດ້ວຍການຕັ້ງຄ່າຂອງທ່ານ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/task-schedules.adoc:6
msgid ""
"Click btn:[Disable Schedule] in the upper right-hand corner to disable a "
"schedule."
msgstr "ຄລິກ btn:[Disable Schedule] ຢູ່ແຈຂວາເທິງເພື່ອປິດການໃຊ້ງານກຳນົດເວລາ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/task-schedules.adoc:7
msgid ""
"Only disable a schedule if you are absolutely certain this is necessary as "
"they are essential for {productname} to work properly."
msgstr "ໃຫ້ປິດການໃຊ້ງານກຳນົດເວລາກໍຕໍ່ເມື່ອທ່ານໝັ້ນໃຈແທ້ໆວ່າມັນຈຳເປັນ ເພາະວຽກເຫຼົ່ານີ້ສຳຄັນຫຼາຍຕໍ່ການເຮັດວຽກທີ່ຖືກຕ້ອງຂອງ {productname}."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/task-schedules.adoc:8
msgid ""
"When a task is disabled, it is still shown in the list.  When you click "
"menu:{productname} Schedules[Schedule name] you can activate the job again "
"by clicking btn:[Activate Schedule]."
msgstr "ເມື່ອວຽກຖືກປິດໃຊ້ງານ, ມັນຈະຍັງຄົງສະແດງຢູ່ໃນລາຍຊື່. ເມື່ອທ່ານຄລິກ menu:{productname} Schedules[ຊື່ກຳນົດເວລາ] ທ່ານສາມາດເປີດໃຊ້ງານວຽກນັ້ນຄືນໃໝ່ໄດ້ໂດຍການຄລິກ btn:[Activate Schedule]."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/task-schedules.adoc:9
msgid ""
"If you click a bunch name, a list of runs of that bunch type and their "
"status is displayed."
msgstr "ຖ້າທ່ານຄລິກທີ່ຊື່ກຸ່ມວຽກ (bunch name), ລາຍຊື່ການເຮັດວຽກຂອງກຸ່ມນັ້ນ ແລະ ສະຖານະຂອງພວກມັນຈະຖືກສະແດງອອກມາ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/task-schedules.adoc:10
msgid ""
"Clicking the start time links takes you back to the menu:Schedule Name[Basic "
"Schedule Details]."
msgstr "ການຄລິກທີ່ລິ້ງເວລາເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຈະພາທ່ານກັບໄປທີ່ menu:Schedule Name[ລາຍລະອຽດກຳນົດເວລາພື້ນຖານ]."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/administration/pages/task-schedules.adoc:11
#, no-wrap
msgid "Predefined task bunches"
msgstr "ກຸ່ມວຽກທີ່ກຳນົດໄວ້ລ່ວງໜ້າ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/task-schedules.adoc:12
msgid ""
"The following predefined task bunches are scheduled by default and can be "
"configured:"
msgstr "ກຸ່ມວຽກທີ່ກຳນົດໄວ້ລ່ວງໜ້າຕໍ່ໄປນີ້ຖືກກຳນົດເວລາໄວ້ໂດຍຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ ແລະ ສາມາດຕັ້ງຄ່າໄດ້:"

#. type: Labeled list
#: en/modules/administration/pages/task-schedules.adoc:13
#, no-wrap
msgid "menu:auto-errata-default[]"
msgstr "menu:auto-errata-default[]"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/task-schedules.adoc:14
msgid "Schedules auto errata updates as necessary."
msgstr "ກຳນົດເວລາການອັບເດດ errata ອັດຕະໂນມັດຕາມຄວາມຈຳເປັນ."

#. type: Labeled list
#: en/modules/administration/pages/task-schedules.adoc:15
#, no-wrap
msgid "menu:channel-repodata-default[]"
msgstr "menu:channel-repodata-default[]"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/task-schedules.adoc:16
msgid "(Re)generates repository metadata files."
msgstr "ສ້າງ (ໃໝ່) ໄຟລ໌ metadata ຂອງຄັງເກັບ (repository)."

#. type: Labeled list
#: en/modules/administration/pages/task-schedules.adoc:17
#, no-wrap
msgid "menu:cleanup-data-default[]"
msgstr "menu:cleanup-data-default[]"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/task-schedules.adoc:18
msgid ""
"Cleans up stale package change log and monitoring time series data from the "
"database."
msgstr "ລ້າງຂໍ້ມູນປະຫວັດການປ່ຽນແປງແພັກເກດທີ່ເກົ່າແລ້ວ ແລະ ຂໍ້ມູນ monitoring time series ອອກຈາກຖານຂໍ້ມູນ."

#. type: Labeled list
#: en/modules/administration/pages/task-schedules.adoc:19
#, no-wrap
msgid "menu:clear-taskologs-default[]"
msgstr "menu:clear-taskologs-default[]"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/task-schedules.adoc:20
msgid ""
"Clears task engine (taskomatic) history data older than a specified number "
"of days, depending on the job type, from the database."
msgstr "ລ້າງຂໍ້ມູນປະຫວັດຂອງ task engine (taskomatic) ທີ່ເກົ່າກວ່າຈຳນວນມື້ທີ່ລະບຸອອກຈາກຖານຂໍ້ມູນ, ເຊິ່ງຂຶ້ນກັບປະເພດຂອງວຽກ."

#. type: Labeled list
#: en/modules/administration/pages/task-schedules.adoc:21
#, no-wrap
msgid "menu:cobbler-sync-default[]"
msgstr "menu:cobbler-sync-default[]"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/task-schedules.adoc:22
msgid ""
"Synchronizes distribution and profile data from {productname} to {cobbler}.  "
"For more information about autoinstallation powered by {cobbler}, see "
"xref:client-configuration:autoinst-intro.adoc[]."
msgstr "ຊິງໂຄຣໄນຂໍ້ມູນການແຈກຢາຍ (distribution) ແລະ ໂປຣໄຟລ໌ຈາກ {productname} ໄປຍັງ {cobbler}. ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບ autoinstallation ທີ່ຂັບເຄື່ອນດ້ວຍ {cobbler}, ເບິ່ງ xref:client-configuration:autoinst-intro.adoc[]."

#. type: Labeled list
#: en/modules/administration/pages/task-schedules.adoc:23
#, no-wrap
msgid "menu:compare-configs-default[]"
msgstr "menu:compare-configs-default[]"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/task-schedules.adoc:24
msgid ""
"Compares configuration files as stored in configuration channels with the "
"files stored on all configuration-enabled servers.  To review comparisons, "
"click menu:Systems[] tab and select the system of interest.  Go to "
"menu:Configuration[Compare Files].  For more information, see "
"xref:reference:systems/system-details/sd-configuration.adoc#sd-config-compare-files[]."
msgstr "ປຽບທຽບໄຟລ໌ການກຳນົດຄ່າທີ່ເກັບໄວ້ໃນຊ່ອງທາງການກຳນົດຄ່າກັບໄຟລ໌ທີ່ເກັບໄວ້ໃນເຊີເວີທັງໝົດທີ່ເປີດໃຊ້ການກຳນົດຄ່າ. ເພື່ອເບິ່ງການປຽບທຽບ, ໃຫ້ຄລິກແທັບ menu:Systems[] ແລ້ວເລືອກລະບົບທີ່ຕ້ອງການ. ໄປທີ່ menu:Configuration[Compare Files]. ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ, ເບິ່ງ xref:reference:systems/system-details/sd-configuration.adoc#sd-config-compare-files[]."

#. type: Labeled list
#: en/modules/administration/pages/task-schedules.adoc:25
#, no-wrap
msgid "menu:cve-server-channels-default[]"
msgstr "menu:cve-server-channels-default[]"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/task-schedules.adoc:26
msgid ""
"Updates internal pre-computed CVE data that is used to display results on "
"the menu:Audit[CVE Audit] page.  Search results in the menu:Audit[CVE Audit] "
"page are updated to the last run of this schedule.  For more information, "
"see xref:reference:audit/audit-cve-audit.adoc[]."
msgstr "ອັບເດດຂໍ້ມູນ CVE ພາຍໃນທີ່ຖືກຄຳນວນໄວ້ລ່ວງໜ້າ ເພື່ອໃຊ້ສະແດງຜົນໃນໜ້າ menu:Audit[CVE Audit]. ຜົນການຄົ້ນຫາໃນໜ້າ menu:Audit[CVE Audit] ຈະຖືກອັບເດດຕາມການລັນຫຼ້າສຸດຂອງກຳນົດເວລານີ້. ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ, ເບິ່ງ xref:reference:audit/audit-cve-audit.adoc[]."

#. type: Labeled list
#: en/modules/administration/pages/task-schedules.adoc:27
#, no-wrap
msgid "menu:daily-status-default[]"
msgstr "menu:daily-status-default[]"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/task-schedules.adoc:28
msgid ""
"Sends daily report e-mails to relevant addresses.  For more information "
"about configuring notifications for specific users, see "
"xref:reference:users/user-details.adoc[]."
msgstr "ສົ່ງອີເມລບົດລາຍງານປະຈຳວັນໄປຫາທີ່ຢູ່ວາງໄວ້. ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບການຕັ້ງຄ່າການແຈ້ງເຕືອນສຳລັບຜູ້ໃຊ້ສະເພາະ, ເບິ່ງ xref:reference:users/user-details.adoc[]."

#. type: Labeled list
#: en/modules/administration/pages/task-schedules.adoc:29
#, no-wrap
msgid "menu:errata-advisory-map-sync-default[]"
msgstr "ເມນູ: errata-advisory-map-sync-default[]"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/task-schedules.adoc:30
msgid ""
"Updates internal {suse} patch vendor advisory database tables.  If "
"available, the original advisory provided by {suse} is shown in the section "
"Vendor Advisory of each patch detail."
msgstr "ອັບເດດຕາຕະລາງຖານຂໍ້ມູນ patch vendor advisory ພາຍໃນຂອງ {suse}."

#. type: Labeled list
#: en/modules/administration/pages/task-schedules.adoc:31
#, no-wrap
msgid "menu:errata-cache-default[]"
msgstr "menu:errata-cache-default[]"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/task-schedules.adoc:32
msgid ""
"Updates internal patch cache database tables, which are used to look up "
"packages that need updates for each server.  Also, this sends notification "
"emails to users that might be interested in certain patches.  For more "
"information about patches, see xref:reference:patches/patches-menu.adoc[]."
msgstr "ອັບເດດຕາຕະລາງຖານຂໍ້ມູນ patch cache ພາຍໃນ ເຊິ່ງໃຊ້ເພື່ອຄົ້ນຫາແພັກເກດທີ່ຕ້ອງອັບເດດສຳລັບແຕ່ລະເຊີເວີ. ນອກຈາກນັ້ນ, ຍັງສົ່ງອີເມລແຈ້ງເຕືອນໄປຫາຜູ້ໃຊ້ທີ່ອາດຈະສົນໃຈໃນແພັດບາງອັນ. ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບແພັດ, ເບິ່ງ xref:reference:patches/patches-menu.adoc[]."

#. type: Labeled list
#: en/modules/administration/pages/task-schedules.adoc:33
#, no-wrap
msgid "menu:errata-queue-default[]"
msgstr "menu:errata-queue-default[]"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/task-schedules.adoc:34
msgid ""
"Queues automatic updates (patches) for servers that are configured to "
"receive them."
msgstr "ຈັດຄິວການອັບເດດອັດຕະໂນມັດ (ແພັດ) ສຳລັບເຊີເວີທີ່ຖືກຕັ້ງຄ່າໃຫ້ຮັບພວກມັນ."

#. type: Labeled list
#: en/modules/administration/pages/task-schedules.adoc:35
#, no-wrap
msgid "menu:gatherer-matcher-default[]"
msgstr "menu:gatherer-matcher-default[]"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/task-schedules.adoc:36
msgid ""
"Gather virtual host data by running Virtual Host Gatherer configured in "
"Virtual Host Managers.  After updated data are available, the Subscription "
"Matcher job is run."
msgstr "ເກັບກຳຂໍ້ມູນ virtual host ໂດຍການລັນ Virtual Host Gatherer ທີ່ຕັ້ງຄ່າໄວ້ໃນ Virtual Host Managers. ຫຼັງຈາກມີຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ອັບເດດແລ້ວ, ວຽກ Subscription Matcher ຈະຖືກລັນຕໍ່."

#. type: Labeled list
#: en/modules/administration/pages/task-schedules.adoc:37
#, no-wrap
msgid "menu:kickstart-cleanup-default[]"
msgstr "menu:kickstart-cleanup-default[]"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/task-schedules.adoc:38
msgid "Cleans up stale {kickstart} session data."
msgstr "ລ້າງຂໍ້ມູນເຊດຊັນ (session) ຂອງ {kickstart} ທີ່ເກົ່າແລ້ວ."

#. type: Labeled list
#: en/modules/administration/pages/task-schedules.adoc:39
#, no-wrap
msgid "menu:kickstartfile-sync-default[]"
msgstr "menu:kickstartfile-sync-default[]"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/task-schedules.adoc:40
msgid ""
"Generates {cobbler} files corresponding to {kickstart} profiles created by "
"the configuration wizard."
msgstr "ສ້າງໄຟລ໌ {cobbler} ທີ່ກົງກັບໂປຣໄຟລ໌ {kickstart} ທີ່ສ້າງໂດຍ configuration wizard."

#. type: Labeled list
#: en/modules/administration/pages/task-schedules.adoc:41
#, no-wrap
msgid "menu:mgr-forward-registration-default[]"
msgstr "menu:mgr-forward-registration-default[]"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/task-schedules.adoc:42
msgid ""
"Synchronizes client registration data with {scclongform}.  By default, new, "
"changed, or deleted client data are forwarded.  To disable synchronization "
"set in `/etc/rhn/rhn.conf`, run:"
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/task-schedules.adoc:43
#, no-wrap
msgid "server.susemanager.forward_registration = 0\n"
msgstr "server.susemanager.forward_registration = 0\n"

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/task-schedules.adoc:44
msgid ""
"Disabling data synchronizing with {scc} will lead to reduced visibility of "
"your managed clients between RMT, SMT, {productname} and {scc}-directly "
"registered clients."
msgstr "ການປິດການຊິງໂຄຣໄນຊ໌ຂໍ້ມູນກັບ {scc} ຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ການເບິ່ງເຫັນ client ທີ່ຖືກຈັດການຫຼຸດລົງ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/task-schedules.adoc:45
msgid "By synchronizing data, you ensure a uniform view of all registered clients."
msgstr "ໂດຍການຊິງໂຄຣໄນຊ໌ຂໍ້ມູນ, ທ່ານຈະໝັ້ນໃຈໄດ້ວ່າຂໍ້ມູນຂອງ client ທັງໝົດທີ່ລົງທະບຽນແມ່ນກົງກັນ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/task-schedules.adoc:46
msgid ""
"https://suselinux.fra1.qualtrics.com/jfe/form/SV_0ooNnrY0rYuQScS[Help us "
"improve our services by sharing your reason for opting out]"
msgstr "https://suselinux.fra1.qualtrics.com/jfe/form/SV_0ooNnrY0rYuQScS[ຊ່ວຍພວກເຮົາປັບປຸງການບໍລິການໂດຍການແບ່ງປັນເຫດຜົນຂອງທ່ານໃນການຍົກເລີກ]"

#. type: Labeled list
#: en/modules/administration/pages/task-schedules.adoc:47
#, no-wrap
msgid "menu:mgr-sync-refresh-default[]"
msgstr "menu:mgr-sync-refresh-default[]"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/task-schedules.adoc:48
msgid ""
"Synchronizes with {scclongform} (`mgr-sync-refresh`).  By default, all "
"custom channels are also synchronized as part of this task.  For more "
"information about custom channel synchronization, see "
"xref:administration:custom-channels.adoc#_custom_channel_synchronization[]."
msgstr ""

#. type: Labeled list
#: en/modules/administration/pages/task-schedules.adoc:49
#, no-wrap
msgid "menu:minion-action-chain-cleanup-default[]"
msgstr "ເມນູ: minion-action-chain-cleanup-default[]"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/task-schedules.adoc:50
msgid "Cleans up outdated action chain data."
msgstr "ລຶບຂໍ້ມູນ action chain ທີ່ໝົດອາຍຸ."

#. type: Labeled list
#: en/modules/administration/pages/task-schedules.adoc:51
#, no-wrap
msgid "menu:minion-action-cleanup-default[]"
msgstr "menu:minion-action-cleanup-default[]"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/task-schedules.adoc:52
msgid ""
"Deletes stale client action data from the file system.  First it tries to "
"complete any possibly unfinished actions by looking up the corresponding "
"results stored in the {salt} job cache.  An unfinished action can occur if "
"the server has missed the results of the action.  For successfully completed "
"actions it removes artifacts such as executed script files."
msgstr "ລົບຂໍ້ມູນການດຳເນີນການຂອງໄຄເອັນທີ່ເກົ່າແລ້ວອອກຈາກລະບົບໄຟລ໌. ທຳອິດມັນຈະພະຍາຍາມເຮັດໃຫ້ການດຳເນີນການໃດໆທີ່ຍັງບໍ່ສຳເລັດໃຫ້ສຳເລັດ ໂດຍການກວດສອບຜົນໄດ້ຮັບໃນ {salt} job cache. ການດຳເນີນການທີ່ບໍ່ສຳເລັດອາດເກີດຈາກເຊີເວີພາດຜົນໄດ້ຮັບຂອງການດຳເນີນການນັ້ນ. ສຳລັບການດຳເນີນການທີ່ສຳເລັດແລ້ວ, ມັນຈະລົບໄຟລ໌ທີ່ບໍ່ຈຳເປັນອອກ ເຊັ່ນ ໄຟລ໌ສະຄຣິບທີ່ຖືກລັນໄປແລ້ວ."

#. type: Labeled list
#: en/modules/administration/pages/task-schedules.adoc:53
#, no-wrap
msgid "menu:minion-checkin-default[]"
msgstr "menu:minion-checkin-default[]"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/task-schedules.adoc:54
msgid "Performs a regular check-in on clients."
msgstr "ເຮັດການ check-in ຕາມປົກກະຕິໃນໄຄເອັນ."

#. type: Labeled list
#: en/modules/administration/pages/task-schedules.adoc:55
#, no-wrap
msgid "menu:notifications-cleanup-default[]"
msgstr "menu:notifications-cleanup-default[]"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/task-schedules.adoc:56
msgid "Cleans up expired notification messages."
msgstr "ລ້າງຂໍ້ຄວາມການແຈ້ງເຕືອນທີ່ໝົດອາຍຸແລ້ວ."

#. type: Labeled list
#: en/modules/administration/pages/task-schedules.adoc:57
#, no-wrap
msgid "menu:oval-data-sync-default[]"
msgstr "menu:oval-data-sync-default[]"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/task-schedules.adoc:58
msgid "Generate OVAL data required to increase the accuracy of CVE audit queries."
msgstr "ສ້າງຂໍ້ມູນ OVAL ທີ່ຈຳເປັນເພື່ອເພີ່ມຄວາມຖືກຕ້ອງຂອງການສອບຖາມ CVE audit."

#. type: Labeled list
#: en/modules/administration/pages/task-schedules.adoc:59
#, no-wrap
msgid "menu:package-cleanup-default[]"
msgstr "menu:package-cleanup-default[]"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/task-schedules.adoc:60
msgid "Deletes stale package files from the file system."
msgstr "ລົບໄຟລ໌ແພັກເກດທີ່ເກົ່າແລ້ວອອກຈາກລະບົບໄຟລ໌."

#. type: Labeled list
#: en/modules/administration/pages/task-schedules.adoc:61
#, no-wrap
msgid "menu:reboot-action-cleanup-default[]"
msgstr "menu:reboot-action-cleanup-default[]"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/task-schedules.adoc:62
msgid ""
"Any reboot actions pending for more than six hours are marked as failed and "
"associated data is cleaned up from the database.  For more information on "
"scheduling reboot actions, see "
"xref:reference:systems/system-details/sd-provisioning.adoc#sd-power-management[]."
msgstr "ການດຳເນີນການຣີບູດ (reboot) ໃດໆທີ່ຄ້າງຢູ່ເກີນ 6 ຊົ່ວໂມງ ຈະຖືກໝາຍວ່າຫຼົ້ມເຫຼວ ແລະ ຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງຈະຖືກລ້າງອອກຈາກຖານຂໍ້ມູນ. ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບການກຳນົດເວລາຣີບູດ, ເບິ່ງ xref:reference:systems/system-details/sd-provisioning.adoc#sd-power-management[]."

#. type: Labeled list
#: en/modules/administration/pages/task-schedules.adoc:63
#, no-wrap
msgid "menu:session-cleanup-default[]"
msgstr "menu:session-cleanup-default[]"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/task-schedules.adoc:64
msgid ""
"Cleans up stale Web interface sessions, typically data that is temporarily "
"stored when a user logs in and then closes the browser before logging out."
msgstr "ລ້າງເຊດຊັນ Web interface ທີ່ເກົ່າແລ້ວ, ເຊິ່ງມັກຈະເປັນຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ຖືກເກັບໄວ້ຊົ່ວຄາວເມື່ອຜູ້ໃຊ້ລັອກອິນແລ້ວປິດບຣາວເຊີໂດຍບໍ່ໄດ້ລັອກເອົາ."

#. type: Labeled list
#: en/modules/administration/pages/task-schedules.adoc:65
#, no-wrap
msgid "menu:ssh-service-default[]"
msgstr "menu:ssh-service-default[]"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/task-schedules.adoc:66
msgid ""
"Prompts clients to check in with {productname} via SSH if they are "
"configured with a `SSH Push` contact method.  Also resume action chains "
"after a reboot."
msgstr "ກະຕຸ້ນໃຫ້ໄຄເອັນ check-in ກັບ {productname} ຜ່ານ SSH ຖ້າພວກມັນຖືກຕັ້ງຄ່າດ້ວຍວິທີການຕິດຕໍ່ແບບ `SSH Push`. ນອກຈາກນີ້ຍັງຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ການດຳເນີນການແບບຕ່ອງໂສ້ (action chains) ເຮັດວຽກຕໍ່ໄດ້ຫຼັງຈາກຣີບູດ."

#. type: Labeled list
#: en/modules/administration/pages/task-schedules.adoc:67
#, no-wrap
msgid "menu:system-overview-update-queue-default[]"
msgstr "menu:system-overview-update-queue-default[]"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/task-schedules.adoc:68
msgid "Update the systems overview data."
msgstr "ອັບເດດຂໍ້ມູນພາບລວມຂອງລະບົບ."

#. type: Labeled list
#: en/modules/administration/pages/task-schedules.adoc:69
#, no-wrap
msgid "menu:system-profile-refresh-default[]"
msgstr "menu:system-profile-refresh-default[]"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/task-schedules.adoc:70
msgid ""
"Runs a hardware refresh on all systems.  This happens only monthly and can "
"increase load on the {productname} Server.  The job uses "
"xref:specialized-guides:salt/salt-rate-limiting.adoc[Salt Rate Limiting].  "
"For tuning the batch size, see "
"xref:specialized-guides:large-deployments/tuning.adoc#java-salt-batch-size[]."
msgstr "ລັນການຣີເຟຣຊຮາດແວໃນທຸກລະບົບ. ສິ່ງນີ້ຈະເກີດຂຶ້ນພຽງເດືອນລະຄັ້ງ ແລະ ອາດເພີ່ມພາລະໃຫ້ກັບ {productname} Server. ວຽກນີ້ໃຊ້ xref:specialized-guides:salt/salt-rate-limiting.adoc[Salt Rate Limiting]. ສຳລັບການປັບແຕ່ງຂະໜາດ batch, ເບິ່ງ xref:specialized-guides:large-deployments/tuning.adoc#java-salt-batch-size[]."

#. type: Labeled list
#: en/modules/administration/pages/task-schedules.adoc:71
#, no-wrap
msgid "menu:token-cleanup-default[]"
msgstr "menu:token-cleanup-default[]"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/task-schedules.adoc:72
msgid ""
"Deletes expired repository tokens that are used by {salt} clients to "
"download packages and metadata."
msgstr "ລົບ repository tokens ທີ່ໝົດອາຍຸ ເຊິ່ງໃຊ້ໂດຍ {salt} clients ເພື່ອດາວໂຫຼດແພັກເກດ ແລະ metadata."

#. type: Labeled list
#: en/modules/administration/pages/task-schedules.adoc:73
#, no-wrap
msgid "menu:update-payg-default[]"
msgstr "menu:update-payg-default[]"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/task-schedules.adoc:74
msgid "Collects authentication data from configured {payg} cloud instances."
msgstr "ເກັບກຳຂໍ້ມູນການຢືນຢັນຕົວຕົນຈາກ {payg} cloud instances ທີ່ຕັ້ງຄ່າໄວ້."

#. type: Labeled list
#: en/modules/administration/pages/task-schedules.adoc:75
#, no-wrap
msgid "menu:update-reporting-default[]"
msgstr "menu:update-reporting-default[]"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/task-schedules.adoc:76
msgid "Updates the local Reporting Database."
msgstr "ອັບເດດຖານຂໍ້ມູນການລາຍງານພາຍໃນເຄື່ອງ (Local Reporting Database)."

#. type: Labeled list
#: en/modules/administration/pages/task-schedules.adoc:77
#, no-wrap
msgid "menu:update-reporting-hub-default[]"
msgstr "menu:update-reporting-hub-default[]"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/task-schedules.adoc:78
msgid ""
"Collects all reporting data from peripheral {productname} Server and update "
"the Hub Reporting Database."
msgstr "ເກັບກຳຂໍ້ມູນການລາຍງານທັງໝົດຈາກ {productname} Server ທີ່ຢູ່ອ້ອມຂ້າງ ແລະ ອັບເດດຖານຂໍ້ມູນ Hub Reporting."

#. type: Labeled list
#: en/modules/administration/pages/task-schedules.adoc:79
#, no-wrap
msgid "menu:update-system-overview-default[]"
msgstr "menu:update-system-overview-default[]"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/task-schedules.adoc:80
msgid "Regularly ensure the systems overview data are up to date."
msgstr "ກວດສອບໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າຂໍ້ມູນພາບລວມຂອງລະບົບເປັນປັດຈຸບັນຢູ່ສະເໝີ."

#. type: Labeled list
#: en/modules/administration/pages/task-schedules.adoc:81
#, no-wrap
msgid "menu:uuid-cleanup-default[]"
msgstr "menu:uuid-cleanup-default[]"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/task-schedules.adoc:82
msgid "Cleans up outdated UUID records."
msgstr "ລ້າງຂໍ້ມູນ UUID ທີ່ເກົ່າແລ້ວ."

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/third-party-channels.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Third-party Channels"
msgstr "ຊ່ອງທາງພາຍນອກ (Third-party Channels)"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/third-party-channels.adoc:2
msgid ""
"{productname} includes the ability to synchronize the content of optional "
"third-party repositories with some of the products that can be managed by "
"it."
msgstr "{productname} ມີຄວາມສາມາດໃນການຊິງໂຄຣໄນເນື້ອຫາຂອງຄັງເກັບ (repositories) ພາຍນອກທີ່ເປັນທາງເລືອກ ເຂົ້າກັບບາງຜະລິດຕະພັນທີ່ສາມາດຈັດການໄດ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/third-party-channels.adoc:3
msgid ""
"Some third-party GPG keys are included by default in the {productname} "
"database, and some are not.  For third-party keys that are not included, the "
"relevant keys need to be imported when choosing to synchronize such "
"third-party repositories."
msgstr "ຄີ GPG ຂອງພາຍນອກບາງອັນມີມາໃຫ້ແລ້ວໂດຍຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນໃນຖານຂໍ້ມູນ {productname}, ແຕ່ບາງອັນກໍບໍ່ມີ. ສຳລັບຄີພາຍນອກທີ່ບໍ່ມີ, ທ່ານຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງນຳເຂົ້າຄີທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງເມື່ອເລືອກຊິງໂຄຣໄນຄັງເກັບພາຍນອກນັ້ນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/third-party-channels.adoc:4
msgid ""
"To import a GPG key, use the following command syntax, executing the command "
"on the {productname} host server:"
msgstr "ເພື່ອນຳເຂົ້າຄີ GPG, ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ຮູບແບບຄຳສັ່ງຕໍ່ໄປນີ້ ໂດຍລັນຄຳສັ່ງຢູ່ທີ່ {productname} host server:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/third-party-channels.adoc:5
#, no-wrap
msgid "mgradm gpg add <path-to-gpg-key-file-or-URL>\n"
msgstr "mgradm gpg add <ເສັ້ນທາງຫາໄຟລ໌ຄີ-GPG-ຫຼື-URL>\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/third-party-channels.adoc:6
msgid "Example: Adding a GPG key from a file:"
msgstr "ຕົວຢ່າງ: ການເພີ່ມຄີ GPG ຈາກໄຟລ໌:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/third-party-channels.adoc:7
#, no-wrap
msgid "mgradm gpg add repomd.xml.key\n"
msgstr "mgradm gpg add repomd.xml.key\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/third-party-channels.adoc:8
msgid "Example: Adding a GPG key from a remote repository using a URL:"
msgstr "ຕົວຢ່າງ: ການເພີ່ມຄີ GPG ຈາກຄັງເກັບທາງໄກໂດຍໃຊ້ URL:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/third-party-channels.adoc:9
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"mgradm gpg add "
"https://<3rd-party-domain>/path/to/repository/repodata/repomd.xml.key\n"
msgstr "mgradm gpg add https://<3rd-party-domain>/path/to/repository/repodata/repomd.xml.key\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/third-party-channels.adoc:10
msgid ""
"To list the keys currently held in the {productname} GPG database, run the "
"following command:"
msgstr "ເພື່ອເບິ່ງລາຍຊື່ຄີທີ່ມີຢູ່ໃນຖານຂໍ້ມູນ GPG ຂອງ {productname}, ໃຫ້ລັນຄຳສັ່ງຕໍ່ໄປນີ້:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/third-party-channels.adoc:11
#, no-wrap
msgid "mgrctl exec -ti -- gpg --homedir /var/lib/spacewalk/gpgdir --list-keys\n"
msgstr "mgrctl exec -ti -- gpg --homedir /var/lib/spacewalk/gpgdir --list-keys\n"

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/third-party-channels.adoc:12
msgid ""
"When installing a package on the client, you may also need to trust the GPG "
"key on the client itself.  This requires that the GPG key is also available "
"there."
msgstr "ເມື່ອຕິດຕັ້ງແພັກເກດໃນໄຄເອັນ, ທ່ານອາດຈະຕ້ອງເຮັດໃຫ້ຄີ GPG ນັ້ນໄດ້ຮັບຄວາມເຊື່ອຖືໃນໂຕໄຄເອັນເອງນຳ. ເຊິ່ງໝາຍຄວາມວ່າຄີ GPG ຕ້ອງມີຢູ່ທີ່ນັ້ນຄືກັນ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/third-party-channels.adoc:13
msgid "For more information, see: xref:client-configuration:gpg-keys.adoc[]."
msgstr "ສໍາລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ, ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງ: xref:client-configuration:gpg-keys.adoc[]."

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-autoinstallation.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Troubleshooting Autoinstallation"
msgstr "ການແກ້ໄຂບັນຫາ Autoinstallation"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-autoinstallation.adoc:2
msgid ""
"If you use the plain {salt} (salt-minion) implementation for communication, "
"you on your own must make sure that all the needed software (software "
"packages) is properly available in configured client channels.  It is not "
"recommended to use this implementation together with {productname}."
msgstr "ຖ້າທ່ານໃຊ້ {salt} (salt-minion) ແບບທຳມະດາໃນການສື່ສານ, ທ່ານຕ້ອງກວດສອບດ້ວຍຕົນເອງວ່າຊອບແວທີ່ຈຳເປັນທັງໝົດ ມີພ້ອມຢູ່ໃນຊ່ອງທາງໄຄເອັນທີ່ຕັ້ງຄ່າໄວ້. ບໍ່ແນະນຳໃຫ້ໃຊ້ວິທີນີ້ຮ່ວມກັບ {productname}."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-autoinstallation.adoc:3
msgid ""
"With the default {salt} bundle (venv-salt-minion) implementation you only "
"need a client tools channel as a child channel that is compatible with your "
"client base channel.  All required packages will be part of the {salt} "
"bundle."
msgstr "ດ້ວຍການໃຊ້ {salt} bundle (venv-salt-minion) ແບບເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ, ທ່ານພຽງແຕ່ຕ້ອງການຊ່ອງທາງເຄື່ອງມືໄຄເອັນ (client tools channel) ທີ່ເປັນຊ່ອງທາງລູກ (child channel) ເຊິ່ງເຂົ້າກັນໄດ້ກັບຊ່ອງທາງຫຼັກ (base channel) ຂອງໄຄເອັນທ່ານ. ແພັກເກດທີ່ຈຳເປັນທັງໝົດຈະລວມຢູ່ໃນ {salt} bundle ແລ້ວ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-autoinstallation.adoc:4
msgid ""
"Check that the client tools software channel related to the base channel in "
"your autoinstallation profile is available to your organization and your "
"user."
msgstr "ກວດສອບວ່າຊ່ອງທາງຊອບແວເຄື່ອງມືໄຄເອັນທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງກັບຊ່ອງທາງຫຼັກໃນໂປຣໄຟລ໌ autoinstallation ຂອງທ່ານ ນັ້ນພ້ອມໃຊ້ງານສຳລັບອົງກອນ ແລະ ຜູ້ໃຊ້ຂອງທ່ານຫຼືບໍ່."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-autoinstallation.adoc:5
msgid ""
"Check that the tools channel is available to your {productname} as a child "
"channel."
msgstr "ກວດສອບວ່າຊ່ອງທາງເຄື່ອງມື (tools channel) ມີໃຫ້ໃຊ້ໃນ {productname} ຂອງທ່ານໃນຖານະຊ່ອງທາງລູກ (child channel)."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-autoinstallation.adoc:6
msgid ""
"Only if using the plain {salt} (salt-minion) implementation, also check that "
"the required packages and any dependencies are available in the associated "
"channels."
msgstr "ສະເພາະໃນກໍລະນີທີ່ໃຊ້ {salt} (salt-minion) ແບບທຳມະດາເທົ່ານັ້ນ, ໃຫ້ກວດສອບຄືກັນວ່າແພັກເກດທີ່ຈຳເປັນ ແລະ dependency ຕ່າງໆ ມີພ້ອມຢູ່ໃນຊ່ອງທາງທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງ."

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-bootstrap-repo-for-eol-products.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Troubleshooting Bootstrap Repository for End-of-Life Products"
msgstr "ການແກ້ໄຂບັນຫາ Bootstrap Repository ສຳລັບຜະລິດຕະພັນທີ່ໝົດອາຍຸ (End-of-Life)"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-bootstrap-repo-for-eol-products.adoc:2
msgid ""
"When supported products are synchronized, bootstrap repositories are "
"automatically created and regenerated on the {productname} Server.  When a "
"product reaches end-of-life and becomes unsupported, bootstrap repositories "
"must be created manually if you want to continue using the product."
msgstr "ເມື່ອຜະລິດຕະພັນທີ່ຍັງໄດ້ຮັບການສະໜັບສະໜູນຖືກຊິງໂຄຣໄນ, bootstrap repositories ຈະຖືກສ້າງ ແລະ ສ້າງໃໝ່ໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດໃນ {productname} Server. ແຕ່ເມື່ອຜະລິດຕະພັນໝົດອາຍຸ (end-of-life) ແລະ ບໍ່ໄດ້ຮັບການສະໜັບສະໜູນອີກຕໍ່ໄປ, ທ່ານຕ້ອງສ້າງ bootstrap repositories ດ້ວຍຕົນເອງ ຫາກທ່ານຕ້ອງການໃຊ້ຜະລິດຕະພັນນັ້ນຕໍ່."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-bootstrap-repo-for-eol-products.adoc:3
msgid ""
"For more information about bootstrap repositories, see "
"xref:client-configuration:bootstrap-repository.adoc[]."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບ bootstrap repositories, ເບິ່ງ xref:client-configuration:bootstrap-repository.adoc[]."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-bootstrap-repo-for-eol-products.adoc:4
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Creating Bootstrap Repositories for End-Of-Life Products"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການສ້າງ Bootstrap Repositories ສຳລັບຜະລິດຕະພັນທີ່ໝົດອາຍຸ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-bootstrap-repo-for-eol-products.adoc:5
msgid ""
"At the command prompt of the {productname} container host, as root, enter "
"the server container:"
msgstr "ທີ່ command prompt ຂອງ {productname} container host, ໃນຖານະ root, ໃຫ້ເຂົ້າສູ່ server container:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-bootstrap-repo-for-eol-products.adoc:8
msgid ""
"List the available unsupported bootstrap repositories with the `--force` "
"option, for example:"
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-bootstrap-repo-for-eol-products.adoc:9
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"mgr-create-bootstrap-repo --list --force\n"
"1. SLE-12-SP2-x86_64\n"
"2. SLE-12-SP3-x86_64\n"
msgstr ""
"mgr-create-bootstrap-repo --list --force\n"
"1. SLE-12-SP2-x86_64\n"
"2. SLE-12-SP3-x86_64\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-bootstrap-repo-for-eol-products.adoc:10
msgid ""
"Create the bootstrap repository by using the appropriate repository name as "
"the product label:"
msgstr "ສ້າງ bootstrap repository ໂດຍໃຊ້ຊື່ຄັງເກັບທີ່ເໝາະສົມເປັນປ້າຍຊື່ຜະລິດຕະພັນ (product label):"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-bootstrap-repo-for-eol-products.adoc:11
#, no-wrap
msgid "mgr-create-bootstrap-repo --create SLE-12-SP2-x86_64 --force\n"
msgstr "mgr-create-bootstrap-repo --create SLE-12-SP2-x86_64 --force\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-bootstrap-repo-for-eol-products.adoc:12
msgid ""
"If you do not want to create bootstrap repositories manually, you can check "
"whether LTSS is available for the product and bootstrap repository you need."
msgstr "ຖ້າທ່ານບໍ່ຕ້ອງການສ້າງ bootstrap repositories ດ້ວຍຕົນເອງ, ທ່ານສາມາດກວດສອບໄດ້ວ່າ LTSS ມີໃຫ້ໃຊ້ສຳລັບຜະລິດຕະພັນ ແລະ bootstrap repository ທີ່ທ່ານຕ້ອງການຫຼືບໍ່."

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-cloned-salt-clients.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Troubleshooting Clients Cloned Salt Clients"
msgstr "ການແກ້ໄຂບັນຫາໄຄເອັນ Salt ທີ່ຖືກໂຄລນ (Cloned Clients)"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-cloned-salt-clients.adoc:2
msgid ""
"If you have used your hypervisor clone utility, and attempted to register "
"the cloned Salt client, you might get this error:"
msgstr "ຖ້າທ່ານໃຊ້ເຄື່ອງມືໂຄລນຂອງ hypervisor ແລະ ພະຍາຍາມລົງທະບຽນໄຄເອັນ Salt ທີ່ຖືກໂຄລນມາ, ທ່ານອາດຈະພົບຂໍ້ຜິດພາດນີ້:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-cloned-salt-clients.adoc:3
#, no-wrap
msgid "We're sorry, but the system could not be found.\n"
msgstr "ຂໍອະໄພ, ບໍ່ພົບລະບົບດັ່ງກ່າວ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-cloned-salt-clients.adoc:4
msgid ""
"This is caused by the new, cloned, system having the same machine ID as an "
"existing, registered, system.  You can adjust this manually to correct the "
"error and register the cloned system successfully."
msgstr "ສິ່ງນີ້ເກີດຈາກລະບົບໃໝ່ທີ່ຖືກໂຄລນມາມີ machine ID ດຽວກັນກັບລະບົບທີ່ມີຢູ່ແລ້ວ ແລະ ລົງທະບຽນໄວ້ແລ້ວ. ທ່ານສາມາດປັບແຕ່ງສິ່ງນີ້ດ້ວຍຕົນເອງເພື່ອແກ້ໄຂຂໍ້ຜິດພາດ ແລະ ລົງທະບຽນລະບົບທີ່ໂຄລນມາໃຫ້ສຳເລັດ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-cloned-salt-clients.adoc:5
msgid ""
"For more information and instructions, see "
"xref:administration:troubleshooting/tshoot-registerclones.adoc[]."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ ແລະ ຄຳແນະນຳ, ເບິ່ງ xref:administration:troubleshooting/tshoot-registerclones.adoc[]."

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-container-full-disk.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Troubleshooting Container with Full Disk Event"
msgstr "ການແກ້ໄຂບັນຫາ Container ເມື່ອດິສກ໌ເຕັມ"

#
#
#
#. PUT THIS COMMENT AT THE TOP OF TROUBLESHOOTING SECTIONS
#. Troubleshooting format:
#. One sentence each:
#. Cause: What created the problem?
#. Consequence: What does the user see when this happens?
#. Fix: What can the user do to fix this problem?
#. Result: What happens after the user has completed the fix?
#. If more detailed instructions are required, put them in a "Resolving" procedure:
#. .Procedure: Resolving Widget Wobbles
#. . First step
#. . Another step
#. . Last step
#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-container-full-disk.adoc:2
msgid ""
"In case a dedicated disk mounted as a persistent storage medium of a "
"container runs out of storage space, an emergency action is needed."
msgstr "ໃນກໍລະນີທີ່ດິສກ໌ທີ່ແຍກໄວ້ເຊິ່ງເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ (mounted) ເປັນບ່ອນເກັບຂໍ້ມູນຖາວອນ (persistent storage) ຂອງ container ເຕັມ, ຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງມີການດຳເນີນການສຸກເສີນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-container-full-disk.adoc:3
msgid ""
"Proceed as follows to solve the problem with resizing the storage medium.  "
"Run all listed commands as `root` on the container host."
msgstr ""

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-container-full-disk.adoc:4
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Resize Storage Medium"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການປັບຂະໜາດບ່ອນເກັບຂໍ້ມູນ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-container-full-disk.adoc:5
msgid ""
"Increase the disk size.  Actions to take depend on the installation "
"scenario."
msgstr "ເພີ່ມຂະໜາດດິສກ໌. ວິທີການແມ່ນຂຶ້ນກັບຮູບແບບການຕິດຕັ້ງຂອງທ່ານ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-container-full-disk.adoc:6
msgid ""
"If the disk is partitioned (for example, there is a `/dev/vdb1` for disk "
"`/dev/vdb`), run the following commands:"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-container-full-disk.adoc:7
msgid "Run the following commands:"
msgstr "ລັນຄຳສັ່ງຕໍ່ໄປນີ້:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-container-full-disk.adoc:8
msgid "`parted /dev/vdb`"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-container-full-disk.adoc:9
msgid "`(parted)` `print`"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-container-full-disk.adoc:10
msgid ""
"`(parted)` `resizepart NUMBER 100%` where `NUMBER` is the partition number "
"shown by `print` command (for example, `1` if `/dev/vdb1`)"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-container-full-disk.adoc:11
msgid "`(parted)` `quit`"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-container-full-disk.adoc:12
msgid "Resize the filesystem.  For example, for an XFS filesystem, run the command:"
msgstr "ປັບຂະໜາດລະບົບໄຟລ໌ (filesystem). ຕົວຢ່າງ, ສຳລັບລະບົບໄຟລ໌ XFS, ໃຫ້ລັນຄຳສັ່ງ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-container-full-disk.adoc:13
#, no-wrap
msgid "xfs_growfs /dev/vdb1\n"
msgstr "xfs_growfs /dev/vdb1\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-container-full-disk.adoc:14
msgid ""
"After completing the procedure, an XFS filesystem should be using all space "
"available on the disk."
msgstr "ຫຼັງຈາກສຳເລັດຂັ້ນຕອນ, ລະບົບໄຟລ໌ XFS ຄວນຈະໃຊ້ເນື້ອທີ່ທັງໝົດທີ່ມີຢູ່ໃນດິສກ໌."

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-corruptrepo.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Troubleshooting Corrupt Repositories"
msgstr "ການແກ້ໄຂບັນຫາຄັງເກັບ (Repositories) ເສຍຫາຍ"

#
#
#
#. PUT THIS COMMENT AT THE TOP OF TROUBLESHOOTING SECTIONS
#. Troubleshooting format:
#. One sentence each:
#. Cause: What created the problem?
#. Consequence: What does the user see when this happens?
#. Fix: What can the user do to fix this problem?
#. Result: What happens after the user has completed the fix?
#. If more detailed instructions are required, put them in a "Resolving" procedure:
#. .Procedure: Resolving Widget Wobbles
#. . First step
#. . Another step
#. . Last step
#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-corruptrepo.adoc:2
msgid ""
"The information in the repository metadata files can become corrupt or out "
"of date.  This can create problems with updating clients.  You can fix this "
"by removing the files and regenerating it.  With an new repository data "
"file, updates should operate as expected."
msgstr "ຂໍ້ມູນໃນໄຟລ໌ metadata ຂອງຄັງເກັບອາດຈະເສຍຫາຍ ຫຼື ຫຼ້າສະໄໝ. ສິ່ງນີ້ສາມາດເຮັດໃຫ້ເກີດບັນຫາໃນການອັບເດດໄຄເອັນ. ທ່ານສາມາດແກ້ໄຂໄດ້ໂດຍການລົບໄຟລ໌ເຫຼົ່ານັ້ນອອກ ແລະ ສ້າງພວກມັນໃໝ່. ເມື່ອມີໄຟລ໌ຂໍ້ມູນຄັງເກັບໃໝ່, ການອັບເດດຄວນຈະເຮັດວຽກໄດ້ຕາມປົກກະຕິ."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-corruptrepo.adoc:3
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Resolving Corrupt Repository Data"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການແກ້ໄຂຂໍ້ມູນຄັງເກັບທີ່ເສຍຫາຍ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-corruptrepo.adoc:4
msgid "Remove all files from `/var/cache/rhn/repodata/<channel-label>`."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-corruptrepo.adoc:5
msgid ""
"If you do not know the channel label, you can find it in the {productname} "
"{webui}, by navigating to menu:Software[Channels > Channel Label]."
msgstr "ຖ້າທ່ານບໍ່ຮູ້ channel label, ທ່ານສາມາດເບິ່ງໄດ້ໃນ {productname} {webui} ໂດຍໄປທີ່ເມນູ menu:Software[Channels > Channel Label]."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-corruptrepo.adoc:6
msgid ""
"On the container host, from the command line, execute the following command "
"to regenerate the file in the container:"
msgstr "ຢູ່ທີ່ container host, ຜ່ານຄອມມານລາຍ, ໃຫ້ລັນຄຳສັ່ງຕໍ່ໄປນີ້ເພື່ອສ້າງໄຟລ໌ໃໝ່ພາຍໃນ container:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-corruptrepo.adoc:7
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"mgrctl exec -ti -- spacecmd softwarechannel_regenerateyumcache "
"<channel-label>\n"
msgstr "mgrctl exec -ti -- spacecmd softwarechannel_regenerateyumcache <channel-label>\n"

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-custom-channel.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Troubleshooting Custom Channel with Conflicting Packages"
msgstr "ການແກ້ໄຂບັນຫາຊ່ອງທາງກຳນົດເອງທີ່ມີແພັກເກດຂັດແຍ່ງກັນ"

#
#
#
#. PUT THIS COMMENT AT THE TOP OF TROUBLESHOOTING SECTIONS
#. Troubleshooting format:
#. One sentence each:
#. Cause: What created the problem?
#. Consequence: What does the user see when this happens?
#. Fix: What can the user do to fix this problem?
#. Result: What happens after the user has completed the fix?
#. If more detailed instructions are required, put them in a "Resolving" procedure:
#. .Procedure: Resolving Widget Wobbles
#. . First step
#. . Another step
#. . Last step
#. Cause: Conflicting packages in custom channel
#. Consequence: Creating bootstrap repo can fail
#. Fix: Separate trees from each other
#. Result: Clean and functional boostrap repo will be created
#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-custom-channel.adoc:2
msgid ""
"When setting up a custom channel with conflicting packages features such as "
"creating a bootstrap repository can result in undefined behavior and make "
"registering clients fail."
msgstr "ເມື່ອຕັ້ງຄ່າຊ່ອງທາງກຳນົດເອງ (custom channel) ທີ່ມີແພັກເກດທີ່ຂັດແຍ່ງກັນ, ຄຸນສົມບັດຕ່າງໆ ເຊັ່ນ ການສ້າງ bootstrap repository ອາດສົ່ງຜົນໃຫ້ການເຮັດວຽກຜິດປົກກະຕິ ແລະ ເຮັດໃຫ້ການລົງທະບຽນໄຄເອັນຫຼົ້ມເຫຼວ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-custom-channel.adoc:3
msgid ""
"For example, conflicting packages with higher version numbers could be "
"included into the bootstrap repository.  Such packages (for example, "
"`python3-zmq` or `zeromq`) may corrupt the creation of the bootstrap "
"repository or cause issues during bootstrap of the client."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-custom-channel.adoc:4
msgid ""
"When the custom channel (for example, an EPEL channel) is added below the "
"parent vendor channel, issues with conflicting packages cannot be solved "
"directly.  The way how to solve this is to separate the custom channel from "
"the vendor channel.  The custom channel needs to be created in a separate "
"tree.  In case that the custom channel needs to be delivered as a child, "
"such environment can be created using Content Lifecycle Management (CLM).  "
"Sources in a CLM project can be added there from different trees.  Using "
"such an approach, the custom channel stays below the parent within the built "
"environment.  However, the vendor channel tree stays without the custom "
"channel and the bootstrap repository.  Then registering clients works "
"correctly."
msgstr "ເມື່ອຊ່ອງທາງທີ່ກຳນົດເອງ (ຕົວຢ່າງ: ຊ່ອງທາງ EPEL) ຖືກເພີ່ມໄວ້ກ້ອງຊ່ອງທາງຜູ້ຜະລິດຫຼັກ (parent vendor channel), ບັນຫາເລື່ອງແພັກເກດຂັດແຍ້ງກັນຈະບໍ່ສາມາດແກ້ໄຂໄດ້ໂດຍກົງ. ວິທີແກ້ໄຂແມ່ນການແຍກຊ່ອງທາງທີ່ກຳນົດເອງອອກຈາກຊ່ອງທາງຜູ້ຜະລິດ. ຊ່ອງທາງທີ່ກຳນົດເອງຕ້ອງຖືກສ້າງຂຶ້ນໃນໂຄງສ້າງຕົ້ນໄມ້ (tree) ທີ່ແຍກຕ່າງຫາກ. ໃນກໍລະນີທີ່ຊ່ອງທາງທີ່ກຳນົດເອງຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງຖືກສົ່ງມອບເປັນຊ່ອງທາງຍ່ອຍ, ສະພາບແວດລ້ອມດັ່ງກ່າວສາມາດສ້າງຂຶ້ນໄດ້ໂດຍໃຊ້ Content Lifecycle Management (CLM). ແຫຼ່ງຂໍ້ມູນໃນໂປຣເຈັກ CLM ສາມາດເພີ່ມເຂົ້າໄປຈາກຕົ້ນໄມ້ທີ່ແຕກຕ່າງກັນໄດ້. ການໃຊ້ວິທີນີ້ຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ຊ່ອງທາງທີ່ກຳນົດເອງຍັງຄົງຢູ່ກ້ອງຊ່ອງທາງຫຼັກພາຍໃນສະພາບແວດລ້ອມທີ່ສ້າງຂຶ້ນ. ແນວໃດກໍຕາມ, ຕົ້ນໄມ້ຊ່ອງທາງຜູ້ຜະລິດຈະຍັງຄົງຢູ່ໂດຍບໍ່ມີຊ່ອງທາງທີ່ກຳນົດເອງ ແລະ ຄັງເກັບ bootstrap. ຈາກນັ້ນການລົງທະບຽນລູກຂ່າຍຈະເຮັດວຽກໄດ້ຢ່າງຖືກຕ້ອງ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-custom-channel.adoc:5
msgid ""
"When the custom channel with the conflicting packages (salt, zeromq, and so "
"on) is created as a child channel, following steps can help to avoid the "
"issue:"
msgstr "ເມື່ອສ້າງຊ່ອງທາງກຳນົດເອງທີ່ມີແພັກເກດທີ່ຂັດແຍ່ງກັນ (salt, zeromq, ແລະ ອື່ນໆ) ເປັນຊ່ອງທາງລູກ, ຂັ້ນຕອນຕໍ່ໄປນີ້ສາມາດຊ່ວຍຫຼີກລ່ຽງບັນຫາໄດ້:"

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-custom-channel.adoc:6
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Avoiding Conflicting Packages in Custom Channels"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການຫຼີກລ່ຽງແພັກເກດທີ່ຂັດແຍ້ງກັນໃນຊ່ອງທາງທີ່ກຳນົດເອງ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-custom-channel.adoc:7
msgid ""
"Remove the custom channel as a child channel from parent channel.  For more "
"information, see "
"xref:administration:custom-channels.adoc#_manage_custom_channels[]."
msgstr "ລຶບຊ່ອງທາງທີ່ກຳນົດເອງອອກຈາກການເປັນຊ່ອງທາງລູກຂອງຊ່ອງທາງຫຼັກ. ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ, ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງທີ່ xref:administration:custom-channels.adoc#_manage_custom_channels[]."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-custom-channel.adoc:8
msgid ""
"Create the custom channel in a separate tree.  For more information, see "
"xref:administration:custom-channels.adoc#_creating_custom_channels_and_repositories[]."
msgstr "ສ້າງຊ່ອງທາງທີ່ກຳນົດເອງໃນໂຄງສ້າງແຍກຕ່າງຫາກ. ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ, ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງທີ່ xref:administration:custom-channels.adoc#_creating_custom_channels_and_repositories[]."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-custom-channel.adoc:9
msgid ""
"To get the custom channel as a child channel within Content Lifecycle "
"Management (CLM):"
msgstr "ເພື່ອໃຫ້ໄດ້ຊ່ອງທາງທີ່ກຳນົດເອງເປັນຊ່ອງທາງລູກພາຍໃນການຈັດການວົງຈອນຊີວິດເນື້ອຫາ (CLM):"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-custom-channel.adoc:10
msgid ""
"In the {productname} {webui}, navigate to menu:Content Lifecycle[], and "
"click btn:[Create Project].  Enter `Name` and `Label`."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-custom-channel.adoc:11
msgid ""
"Attach Source to the project.  Use the needed vendor channels and the custom "
"channel.  (sharing example using CentOS8)"
msgstr "ແນບແຫຼ່ງຂໍ້ມູນ (Source) ໃສ່ໂຄງການ. ນຳໃຊ້ຊ່ອງທາງຂອງຜູ້ຜະລິດ (vendor channels) ທີ່ຈຳເປັນ ແລະ ຊ່ອງທາງທີ່ກຳນົດເອງ. (ຕົວຢ່າງການແບ່ງປັນໂດຍໃຊ້ CentOS8)"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-custom-channel.adoc:12
msgid "Add environment into the Project.  For example, use CentOS8."
msgstr "ເພີ່ມສະພາບແວດລ້ອມ (Environment) ເຂົ້າໃນໂຄງການ. ຕົວຢ່າງ: ນຳໃຊ້ CentOS8."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-custom-channel.adoc:13
msgid ""
"To build the environment click the btn:[Build] button.  This creates an "
"environment with vendor and custom channels that can be associated with an "
"activation key and used to bootstrap the client."
msgstr "ເພື່ອບິວ (build) ສະພາບແວດລ້ອມ ໃຫ້ຄລິກປຸ່ມ btn:[Build]. ນີ້ຈະສ້າງສະພາບແວດລ້ອມທີ່ມີທັງຊ່ອງທາງຂອງຜູ້ຜະລິດ ແລະ ຊ່ອງທາງທີ່ກຳນົດເອງ ເຊິ່ງສາມາດເຊື່ອມໂຍງກັບລະຫັດການເປີດໃຊ້ງານ (activation key) ແລະ ນຳໃຊ້ເພື່ອບູດສະແຕຣັບ (bootstrap) ເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-custom-channel.adoc:14
msgid ""
"Important note: In the CLM project, it is recommend to add a filter, which "
"excludes the problematic or conflicting packages.  Otherwise the conflicting "
"packages with higher version numbers would be installed during the update of "
"the client.  For more information about filtering, see "
"xref:administration:content-lifecycle-examples.adoc#exclude-higher-kernel-version[]."
msgstr "ໝາຍເຫດສຳຄັນ: ໃນໂຄງການ CLM, ແນະນຳໃຫ້ເພີ່ມຕົວຕອງ (filter), ເຊິ່ງຈະແຍກແພັກເກດທີ່ມີບັນຫາ ຫຼື ຂັດແຍ້ງກັນອອກ. ຖ້າບໍ່ດັ່ງນັ້ນ, ແພັກເກດທີ່ຂັດແຍ້ງກັນທີ່ມີລຸ້ນສູງກວ່າຈະຖືກຕິດຕັ້ງໃນລະຫວ່າງການອັບເດດເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍ. ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບການຕອງ, ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງທີ່ xref:administration:content-lifecycle-examples.adoc#exclude-higher-kernel-version[]."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-custom-channel.adoc:15
msgid ""
"To get the latest patches into the CLM environment (with vendor and custom "
"channel), click the btn:[Build] button in the project.  This is needed to "
"re-built the environment."
msgstr "ເພື່ອໃຫ້ໄດ້ແພັດ (patches) ຫຼ້າສຸດເຂົ້າໃນສະພາບແວດລ້ອມ CLM (ທີ່ມີທັງຊ່ອງທາງຂອງຜູ້ຜະລິດ ແລະ ຊ່ອງທາງທີ່ກຳນົດເອງ), ໃຫ້ຄລິກປຸ່ມ btn:[Build] ໃນໂຄງການ. ນີ້ແມ່ນຈຳເປັນເພື່ອສ້າງ (re-built) ສະພາບແວດລ້ອມໃໝ່."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-custom-channel.adoc:16
msgid ""
"For more information about CLM, see "
"xref:administration:content-lifecycle.adoc[]."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບ CLM, ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງທີ່ xref:administration:content-lifecycle.adoc[]."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-custom-channel.adoc:17
msgid ""
"Using the Extra Packages for Enterprise Linux (EPEL) directly on {rhel} "
"clients (or compatible: {sll}, {centos}, {oracle}, etc.) will install the "
"{salt} packages from EPEL, which miss some features available in the "
"{productname}-provided {salt} packages.  This is especially important "
"because it will result in a bootstrap repository containing the non-SUSE "
"{salt} packages.  Therefore, this is an unsupported scenario."
msgstr "ການນຳໃຊ້ Extra Packages for Enterprise Linux (EPEL) ໂດຍກົງໃນເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍ {rhel} (ຫຼື ລຸ້ນທີ່ເຂົ້າກັນໄດ້: {sll}, {centos}, {oracle}, ແລະອື່ນໆ) ຈະເປັນການຕິດຕັ້ງແພັກເກດ {salt} ຈາກ EPEL, ເຊິ່ງຂາດບາງຟີເຈີທີ່ມີຢູ່ໃນແພັກເກດ {salt} ທີ່ສະໜອງໃຫ້ໂດຍ {productname}. ນີ້ແມ່ນສິ່ງສຳຄັນຫຼາຍ ເພາະວ່າມັນຈະສົ່ງຜົນໃຫ້ຄັງເກັບບູດສະແຕຣັບມີແພັກເກດ {salt} ທີ່ບໍ່ແມ່ນຂອງ SUSE. ດັ່ງນັ້ນ, ນີ້ຈຶ່ງເປັນຮູບແບບການນຳໃຊ້ທີ່ບໍ່ໄດ້ຮັບການສະໜັບສະໜູນ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-custom-channel.adoc:18
msgid ""
"If you need to enable the EPEL repository, make sure you filter out the "
"{salt} packages from EPEL in advance (for example, by removing the {salt} "
"packages in menu:Software[Manage > Channels > EPEL > Packages]."
msgstr "ຖ້າຫາກທ່ານຕ້ອງການເປີດໃຊ້ງານຄັງເກັບ EPEL, ໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າໄດ້ຕອງແພັກເກດ {salt} ອອກຈາກ EPEL ກ່ອນລ່ວງໜ້າ (ຕົວຢ່າງ: ໂດຍການລຶບແພັກເກດ {salt} ໃນ menu:Software[Manage > Channels > EPEL > Packages]."

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-delclients.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Troubleshooting Registering Deleted Clients"
msgstr "ການແກ້ໄຂບັນຫາການລົງທະບຽນເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍທີ່ຖືກລຶບໄປແລ້ວ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-delclients.adoc:3
msgid ""
"Sometimes a new registration of a deleted (unregistered) client might not be "
"possible.  To solve this issue, some Salt cache files should be deleted on "
"the {productname} Server (Salt master) before trying to re-register again:"
msgstr "ບາງຄັ້ງ ການລົງທະບຽນໃໝ່ຂອງເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍທີ່ຖືກລຶບ (ຍົກເລີກການລົງທະບຽນ) ອາດຈະເຮັດບໍ່ໄດ້. ເພື່ອແກ້ໄຂບັນຫານີ້, ຄວນລຶບໄຟລ໌ແຄຊ໌ (cache) ບາງຢ່າງຂອງ Salt ໃນເຊີເວີ {productname} (Salt master) ກ່ອນທີ່ຈະພະຍາຍາມລົງທະບຽນໃໝ່ອີກຄັ້ງ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-delclients.adoc:4
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"rm /var/cache/salt/master/thin/version\n"
"rm /var/cache/salt/master/thin/thin.tgz\n"
msgstr ""
"rm /var/cache/salt/master/thin/version\n"
"rm /var/cache/salt/master/thin/thin.tgz\n"

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-disabling-fqdns-grain.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Troubleshooting Disabling the FQDNS grain"
msgstr "ການແກ້ໄຂບັນຫາການປິດໃຊ້ງານ FQDNS grain"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-disabling-fqdns-grain.adoc:2
msgid ""
"The FQDNS grain returns the list of all the fully qualified DNS services in "
"the system.  Collecting this information is usually a fast process, but if "
"the DNS settings have been misconfigured, it could take a much longer time.  "
"In some cases, the client could become unresponsive, or crash."
msgstr "FQDNS grain ຈະສົ່ງຄືນລາຍຊື່ບໍລິການ DNS ທີ່ຄົບຖ້ວນ (fully qualified) ທັງໝົດໃນລະບົບ. ການເກັບກຳຂໍ້ມູນນີ້ໂດຍປົກກະຕິແລ້ວແມ່ນຂະບວນການທີ່ໄວ, ແຕ່ຖ້າຫາກການຕັ້ງຄ່າ DNS ຜິດພາດ, ມັນອາດຈະໃຊ້ເວລາດົນກວ່າປົກກະຕິ. ໃນບາງກໍລະນີ, ເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍອາດຈະບໍ່ຕອບສະໜອງ ຫຼື ຄ້າງ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-disabling-fqdns-grain.adoc:3
msgid ""
"To prevent this problem, you can disable the FQDNS grain with a Salt flag.  "
"If you disable the grain, you can use a network module to provide FQDNS "
"services, without the risk of the client becoming unresponsive."
msgstr "ເພື່ອປ້ອງກັນບັນຫານີ້, ທ່ານສາມາດປິດໃຊ້ງານ FQDNS grain ດ້ວຍ Salt flag. ຖ້າທ່ານປິດໃຊ້ງານ grain ນີ້, ທ່ານສາມາດໃຊ້ໂມດູນເຄືອຂ່າຍເພື່ອໃຫ້ບໍລິການ FQDNS ໄດ້ ໂດຍບໍ່ມີຄວາມສ່ຽງທີ່ເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍຈະບໍ່ຕອບສະໜອງ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-disabling-fqdns-grain.adoc:4
msgid ""
"This only applies to older Salt clients.  If you registered your Salt client "
"recently, the FQDNS grain is disabled by default."
msgstr "ນີ້ໃຊ້ໄດ້ກັບເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍ Salt ລຸ້ນເກົ່າເທົ່ານັ້ນ. ຖ້າທ່ານໄດ້ລົງທະບຽນເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍ Salt ຂອງທ່່ານເມື່ອບໍ່ດົນມານີ້, FQDNS grain ຈະຖືກປິດໃຊ້ງານໄວ້ເປັນຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-disabling-fqdns-grain.adoc:5
msgid ""
"On the {productname} Server, at the command prompt, use this command to "
"disable the FQDNS grain:"
msgstr "ຢູ່ໃນເຊີເວີ {productname}, ທີ່ໜ້າຕ່າງຄຳສັ່ງ (command prompt), ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ຄຳສັ່ງນີ້ເພື່ອປິດໃຊ້ງານ FQDNS grain:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-disabling-fqdns-grain.adoc:6
#, no-wrap
msgid "salt '*' state.sls util.mgr_disable_fqdns_grain\n"
msgstr "salt '*' state.sls util.mgr_disable_fqdns_grain\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-disabling-fqdns-grain.adoc:7
msgid ""
"This command restarts each client and generate Salt events that the server "
"needs to process.  If you have a large number of clients, you can execute "
"the command in batch mode instead:"
msgstr "ຄຳສັ່ງນີ້ຈະເລີ່ມການເຮັດວຽກຂອງແຕ່ລະເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍໃໝ່ ແລະ ສ້າງເຫດການ Salt ທີ່ເຊີເວີຕ້ອງໄດ້ປະມວນຜົນ. ຖ້າທ່ານມີເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍເປັນຈຳນວນຫຼາຍ, ທ່ານສາມາດໃຊ້ຄຳສັ່ງໃນຮູບແບບແບັດຊ໌ (batch mode) ແທນໄດ້:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-disabling-fqdns-grain.adoc:8
#, no-wrap
msgid "salt --batch-size 50 '*' state.sls util.mgr_disable_fqdns_grain\n"
msgstr "salt --batch-size 50 '*' state.sls util.mgr_disable_fqdns_grain\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-disabling-fqdns-grain.adoc:9
msgid ""
"Wait for the batch command to finish executing.  Do not interrupt the "
"process with kbd:[Ctrl+C]."
msgstr "ລໍຖ້າໃຫ້ຄຳສັ່ງແບບແບັດຊ໌ເຮັດວຽກໃຫ້ສຳເລັດ. ຫ້າມຂັດຈັງຫວະຂະບວນການດ້ວຍການກົດ kbd:[Ctrl+C]."

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-diskspace.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Troubleshooting Disk Space"
msgstr "ການແກ້ໄຂບັນຫາພື້ນທີ່ດິສກ໌"

#
#
#
#. PUT THIS COMMENT AT THE TOP OF TROUBLESHOOTING SECTIONS
#. Troubleshooting format:
#. One sentence each:
#. Cause: What created the problem?
#. Consequence: What does the user see when this happens?
#. Fix: What can the user do to fix this problem?
#. Result: What happens after the user has completed the fix?
#. If more detailed instructions are required, put them in a "Resolving" procedure:
#. .Procedure: Resolving Widget Wobbles
#. . First step
#. . Another step
#. . Last step
#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-diskspace.adoc:2
msgid ""
"Running out of disk space can have a severe impact on the {productname} "
"database and file structure which, in most cases, is not recoverable.  "
"{productname} monitors free space in specific directories, and has "
"configurable alerts.  For more on space management, see "
"xref:administration:space-management.adoc[]."
msgstr "ການທີ່ພື້ນທີ່ດິສກ໌ໝົດສາມາດສົ່ງຜົນກະທົບຮ້າຍແຮງຕໍ່ຖານຂໍ້ມູນ ແລະ ໂຄງສ້າງໄຟລ໌ຂອງ {productname} ເຊິ່ງໃນກໍລະນີສ່ວນໃຫຍ່ແມ່ນບໍ່ສາມາດກູ້ຄືນໄດ້. {productname} ຈະກວດສອບພື້ນທີ່ວ່າງໃນໄດເຣັກທໍຣີສະເພາະ ແລະ ມີການແຈ້ງເຕືອນທີ່ສາມາດຕັ້ງຄ່າໄດ້. ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບການຈັດການພື້ນທີ່, ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງທີ່ xref:administration:space-management.adoc[]."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-diskspace.adoc:3
msgid ""
"Generally, container volumes share space with the host filesystem.  When the "
"`btrfs` filesystem becomes full, it can prevent you from deleting files.  To "
"resolve this, you can add a small amount of storage temporarily to the "
"filesystem using the `btrfs device add` command.  This will allow you to "
"delete files to gain space for further filesystem maintenance.  When done "
"with the maintenance, you can remove the temporary storage with `btrfs "
"device delete`.  For more information about this topic, see "
"https://www.suse.com/support/kb/doc/?id=000018779."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-diskspace.adoc:4
msgid "You can recover disk space by removing unused software channels."
msgstr "ທ່ານສາມາດກູ້ຄືນພື້ນທີ່ດິສກ໌ໄດ້ໂດຍການລຶບຊ່ອງທາງຊອບແວທີ່ບໍ່ໄດ້ໃຊ້ງານອອກ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-diskspace.adoc:5
msgid ""
"For instructions on how to delete vendor channels, see "
"xref:administration:channel-management.adoc[]."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຄຳແນະນຳກ່ຽວກັບວິທີການລຶບຊ່ອງທາງຂອງຜູ້ຜະລິດ, ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງທີ່ xref:administration:channel-management.adoc[]."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-diskspace.adoc:6
msgid ""
"For instructions on how to delete custom channels, see "
"xref:administration:custom-channels.adoc[]."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຄຳແນະນຳກ່ຽວກັບວິທີການລຶບຊ່ອງທາງທີ່ກຳນົດເອງ, ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງທີ່ xref:administration:custom-channels.adoc[]."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-diskspace.adoc:7
msgid ""
"You can also check how often your custom channels are synchronized.  For "
"instructions on how deal with custom channel synchronization, see "
"xref:administration:custom-channels.adoc#_custom_channel_synchronization[]."
msgstr "ທ່ານຍັງສາມາດກວດສອບໄດ້ວ່າຊ່ອງທາງທີ່ກຳນົດເອງຂອງທ່ານຖືກຊິງຄ໌ (synchronized) ດົນປານໃດຕໍ່ຄັ້ງ. ສຳລັບຄຳແນະນຳກ່ຽວກັບວິທີການຈັດການການຊິງຄ໌ຊ່ອງທາງທີ່ກຳນົດເອງ, ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງທີ່ xref:administration:custom-channels.adoc#_custom_channel_synchronization[]."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-diskspace.adoc:8
msgid ""
"You can also recover disk space by cleaning up unused activation keys, "
"content lifecycle projects, and client registrations.  You can also remove "
"redundant database entries:"
msgstr "ທ່ານຍັງສາມາດກູ້ຄືນພື້ນທີ່ດິສກ໌ໄດ້ໂດຍການອະນາໄມລະຫັດການເປີດໃຊ້ງານທີ່ບໍ່ໄດ້ໃຊ້, ໂຄງການວົງຈອນຊີວິດເນື້ອຫາ ແລະ ການລົງທະບຽນເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍ. ທ່ານຍັງສາມາດລຶບຂໍ້ມູນໃນຖານຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ຊ້ຳຊ້ອນອອກໄດ້:"

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-diskspace.adoc:9
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Resolving Redundant Database Entries"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການແກ້ໄຂຂໍ້ມູນຖານຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ຊ້ຳຊ້ອນ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-diskspace.adoc:10
msgid ""
"Use the `spacewalk-data-fsck` command to list any redundant database "
"entries."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-diskspace.adoc:11
msgid "Use the `spacewalk-data-fsck --remove` command to delete them."
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-diskspace.adoc:12
#, no-wrap
msgid "Disk Check Warnings for Missing Directories"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-diskspace.adoc:13
msgid ""
"After migrating to containerized deployments from 5.0 or when using custom "
"disk check configurations, you might see warnings for directories that no "
"longer exist.  This commonly occurs when the `DISKCHECKDIRS` environment "
"variable references `/var/lib/pgsql` or its subdirectories."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-diskspace.adoc:14
msgid ""
"In containerized deployments, the PostgreSQL database runs in its own "
"container, and the `/var/lib/pgsql` directory no longer exists in the server "
"container.  The database files are stored in a separate database container "
"volume."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-diskspace.adoc:15
msgid "If you see warnings like these in the logs or notifications:"
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-diskspace.adoc:16
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"DISKCHECK: Directory /var/lib/pgsql does not exist\n"
"DISKCHECK: Directory /var/lib/pgsql/data does not exist\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-diskspace.adoc:17
msgid ""
"This indicates that the disk check configuration includes directories that "
"are no longer valid in containerized deployments."
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ===
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-diskspace.adoc:18
#, no-wrap
msgid "Cause"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-diskspace.adoc:19
msgid ""
"Prior to containerization, customers could configure custom directories to "
"monitor by setting the `spacecheck_dirs` parameter in `/etc/rhn/rhn.conf`.  "
"A common configuration included `/var/lib/pgsql` to monitor database disk "
"space."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-diskspace.adoc:20
msgid "In containerized deployments:"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-diskspace.adoc:21
msgid ""
"The `spacecheck_dirs` parameter in `/etc/rhn/rhn.conf` is still read, but is "
"overridden by the `DISKCHECKDIRS` environment variable if set"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-diskspace.adoc:22
msgid ""
"If `DISKCHECKDIRS` is not set, the system falls back to `spacecheck_dirs` "
"from the configuration file"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-diskspace.adoc:23
msgid ""
"The database runs in a separate container and has its own dedicated disk "
"check"
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ===
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-diskspace.adoc:24
#, no-wrap
msgid "Fix"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-diskspace.adoc:25
msgid ""
"Remove the obsolete directory references from the `DISKCHECKDIRS` "
"environment variable."
msgstr ""

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-diskspace.adoc:26
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Removing Obsolete Directory References"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-diskspace.adoc:27
msgid ""
"Check if you have a systemd override file with custom directory "
"configuration:"
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-diskspace.adoc:28
#, no-wrap
msgid "cat /etc/systemd/system/uyuni-server.service.d/diskcheck.conf\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-diskspace.adoc:29
msgid ""
"If the file contains `/var/lib/pgsql` or other non-existent directories, "
"update it to use only valid directories:"
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ===
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-diskspace.adoc:33
#, no-wrap
msgid "Result"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-diskspace.adoc:34
msgid ""
"The disk check warnings for missing directories will no longer appear.  The "
"server container will only monitor the directories that exist within the "
"container."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-diskspace.adoc:35
msgid ""
"The database container has its own separate disk check that monitors the "
"PostgreSQL data directory (`/var/lib/pgsql/data`) within the database "
"container.  This check is automatically configured and does not require "
"manual intervention."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-diskspace.adoc:36
msgid ""
"For more information about disk space management in containerized "
"deployments, see xref:administration:space-management.adoc[]."
msgstr ""

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-firewalls.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Troubleshooting Firewalls"
msgstr "ການແກ້ໄຂບັນຫາໄຟວໍ"

#
#
#
#
#
#
#
#
#. PUT THIS COMMENT AT THE TOP OF TROUBLESHOOTING SECTIONS
#. Troubleshooting format:
#. One sentence each:
#. Cause: What created the problem?
#. Consequence: What does the user see when this happens?
#. Fix: What can the user do to fix this problem?
#. Result: What happens after the user has completed the fix?
#. If more detailed instructions are required, put them in a "Resolving" procedure:
#. .Procedure: Resolving Widget Wobbles
#. . First step
#. . Another step
#. . Last step
#. Cause: User firewall is set to block outgoing traffic by dropping the packet request. During sync with {scc}, mlm waits for an answer on each URL until it times out, eventually causing the entire refresh of the product list to timeout. Applies only to third party (non-SUSE) products, as sync with {scc} needs to access locations other than {scc} to verify if the if the download location is valid.
#. Consequence: The sync to {scc} fails, and the third party products are not shown in the product list.
#. Fix: Configure the firewall to reject requests from mlm instead of drop (preferred), or configure a firewall on the server (if no ability to change firewall settings)
#. Result: Sync to {scc} is either able to reach the URLs required, or rejects the request so that the request fails rather than times out.
#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-firewalls.adoc:2
msgid ""
"If you are using a firewall that blocks outgoing traffic, it can either "
"`REJECT` or `DROP` network requests.  If it is set to `DROP` then you might "
"find that synchronizing with the {scclongform} times out."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-firewalls.adoc:3
msgid ""
"This occurs because the synchronization process needs to access third-party "
"repositories that provide packages for non-{suse} clients, and not just the "
"{scclongform}.  When the {productname} Server attempts to reach these "
"repositories to check that they are valid, the firewall drops the requests, "
"and the synchronization continues to wait for the response until it times "
"out."
msgstr "ສິ່ງນີ້ເກີດຂຶ້ນຍ້ອນວ່າຂະບວນການຊິງຄ໌ຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງເຂົ້າເຖິງຄັງເກັບຂອງບຸກຄົນທີສາມທີ່ສະໜອງແພັກເກດໃຫ້ກັບເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍທີ່ບໍ່ແມ່ນ {suse}, ແລະ ບໍ່ແມ່ນພຽງແຕ່ {scclongform} ເທົ່ານັ້ນ. ເມື່ອເຊີເວີ {productname} ພະຍາຍາມເຂົ້າເຖິງຄັງເກັບເຫຼົ່ານີ້ເພື່ອຢັ້ງຢືນຄວາມຖືກຕ້ອງ, ໄຟວໍຈະຕັດການຮ້ອງຂໍ (drops the requests), ແລະ ການຊິງຄ໌ຈະລໍຖ້າການຕອບສະໜອງຕໍ່ໄປຈົນກວ່າຈະໝົດເວລາ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-firewalls.adoc:4
msgid ""
"If this occurs, the synchronization takes a long time before it fails, and "
"your non-{suse} products are not shown in the product list."
msgstr "ຖ້າສິ່ງນີ້ເກີດຂຶ້ນ, ການຊິງຄ໌ຈະໃຊ້ເວລາດົນຫຼາຍກ່ອນທີ່ຈະລົ້ມເຫຼວ, ແລະ ຜະລິດຕະພັນທີ່ບໍ່ແມ່ນ {suse} ຂອງທ່ານຈະບໍ່ສະແດງຢູ່ໃນລາຍຊື່ຜະລິດຕະພັນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-firewalls.adoc:5
msgid "You can fix this problem in several different ways."
msgstr "ທ່ານສາມາດແກ້ໄຂບັນຫານີ້ໄດ້ໃນຫຼາຍວິທີທີ່ແຕກຕ່າງກັນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-firewalls.adoc:6
msgid ""
"The simplest method is to configure your firewall to allow access to the "
"URLs required by non-{suse} repositories.  This allows the synchronization "
"process to reach the URLs and complete successfully."
msgstr "ວິທີທີ່ງ່າຍທີ່ສຸດແມ່ນການຕັ້ງຄ່າໄຟວໍຂອງທ່ານໃຫ້ອະນຸຍາດການເຂົ້າເຖິງ URL ທີ່ຄັງເກັບທີ່ບໍ່ແມ່ນ {suse} ຕ້ອງການ. ສິ່ງນີ້ຈະຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ຂະບວນການຊິງຄ໌ສາມາດເຂົ້າເຖິງ URL ໄດ້ ແລະ ສຳເລັດການເຮັດວຽກ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-firewalls.adoc:7
msgid ""
"If allowing external traffic is not possible, configure your firewall to "
"`REJECT` requests from {productname} instead of `DROP`.  This rejects "
"requests to third-party URLs, so that the synchronization fails early rather "
"than times out, and the products are not shown in the list."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-firewalls.adoc:8
msgid ""
"If you do not have configuration access to the firewall, you can consider "
"setting up a separate firewall on the {productname} Server instead."
msgstr "ຖ້າທ່ານບໍ່ມີສິດໃນການເຂົ້າເຖິງການຕັ້ງຄ່າໄຟວໍ, ທ່ານສາມາດພິຈາລະນາການຕັ້ງຄ່າໄຟວໍແຍກຕ່າງຫາກຢູ່ໃນເຊີເວີ {productname} ແທນ."

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-highsynctimesoverwan.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Troubleshooting high sync times between {productname} Server and Proxy over "
"WAN connections"
msgstr "ການແກ້ໄຂບັນຫາການໃຊ້ເວລາຊິງຄ໌ດົນລະຫວ່າງເຊີເວີ {productname} ແລະ ພຣັອກຊີ (Proxy) ຜ່ານການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ WAN"

#
#
#
#
#. PUT THIS COMMENT AT THE TOP OF TROUBLESHOOTING SECTIONS
#. Troubleshooting format:
#. One sentence each:
#. Cause: What created the problem?
#. Consequence: What does the user see when this happens?
#. Fix: What can the user do to fix this problem?
#. Result: What happens after the user has completed the fix?
#. If more detailed instructions are required, put them in a "Resolving" procedure.
#. .Procedure: Resolving Widget Wobbles
#. . First step
#. . Another step
#. . Last step
#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-highsynctimesoverwan.adoc:2
msgid ""
"Depending on what changes are executed in the WebUI or via an API call to "
"distribution or system settings, `cobbler sync` command may be required to "
"transfer files from {productname} Server to {productname} Proxy systems.  To "
"accomplish this, {cobbler} uses a list of proxies specified in "
"`/etc/cobbler/settings`."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-highsynctimesoverwan.adoc:3
msgid ""
"Due to its design, `cobbler sync` is not able to sync only the changed or "
"recently added files."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-highsynctimesoverwan.adoc:4
msgid ""
"Instead, executing `cobbler sync` triggers a full sync of the "
"`/srv/tftpboot` directory to all specified proxies configured in "
"`/etc/cobbler/settings`.  It is also influenced by the latency of the WAN "
"connection between the involved systems."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-highsynctimesoverwan.adoc:5
msgid ""
"The process of syncing may take a considerable amount of time to finish "
"according to the logs in `/var/log/cobbler/`."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-highsynctimesoverwan.adoc:6
msgid "For example, it started at:"
msgstr "ຕົວຢ່າງ: ມັນເລີ່ມຕົ້ນເມື່ອ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-highsynctimesoverwan.adoc:7
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Thu Jun  3 14:47:35 2021 - DEBUG | running python triggers from "
"/var/lib/cobbler/triggers/task/sync/pre/*\n"
"Thu Jun  3 14:47:35 2021 - DEBUG | running shell triggers from "
"/var/lib/cobbler/triggers/task/sync/pre/*\n"
msgstr ""
"Thu Jun  3 14:47:35 2021 - DEBUG | running python triggers from /var/lib/cobbler/triggers/task/sync/pre/*\n"
"Thu Jun  3 14:47:35 2021 - DEBUG | running shell triggers from /var/lib/cobbler/triggers/task/sync/pre/*\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-highsynctimesoverwan.adoc:8
msgid "and ended at:"
msgstr "ແລະ ສິ້ນສຸດເມື່ອ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-highsynctimesoverwan.adoc:9
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Thu Jun  3 15:18:49 2021 - DEBUG | running shell triggers from "
"/var/lib/cobbler/triggers/task/sync/post/*\n"
"Thu Jun  3 15:18:49 2021 - DEBUG | shell triggers finished successfully\n"
msgstr ""
"Thu Jun  3 15:18:49 2021 - DEBUG | running shell triggers from /var/lib/cobbler/triggers/task/sync/post/*\n"
"Thu Jun  3 15:18:49 2021 - DEBUG | shell triggers finished successfully\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-highsynctimesoverwan.adoc:10
msgid ""
"The transfer amount was roughly 1.8 GB.  The transfer took almost 30 "
"minutes."
msgstr "ປະລິມານການໂອນຂໍ້ມູນແມ່ນປະມານ 1.8 GB. ການໂອນຂໍ້ມູນໃຊ້ເວລາເກືອບ 30 ນາທີ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-highsynctimesoverwan.adoc:11
msgid ""
"By comparison, copying a single big file of the same size as `/srv/tftboot` "
"completes within several minutes."
msgstr ""

#. == Resolution and analysis
#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-highsynctimesoverwan.adoc:12
msgid ""
"Switching to an `rsync`-based approach to copy files between {productname} "
"Server and Proxy may help to reduce the transfer and wait times."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-highsynctimesoverwan.adoc:13
msgid ""
"A script to accomplish this task is available for download at "
"https://suse.my.salesforce.com/sfc/p/1i000000gLOd/a/1i000000ll5B/B2AmvIJN2_JsAyjTQzCVP_x5ioVgd0bYN9X9NpMugS8."
msgstr "ສະຄຣິບເພື່ອປະຕິບັດໜ້າທີ່ນີ້ແມ່ນມີໃຫ້ດາວໂຫຼດທີ່ https://suse.my.salesforce.com/sfc/p/1i000000gLOd/a/1i000000ll5B/B2AmvIJN2_JsAyjTQzCVP_x5ioVgd0bYN9X9NpMugS8."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-highsynctimesoverwan.adoc:14
msgid ""
"The script does not accept command line options.  Before running the script, "
"you need to manually edit it and set correctly `MLMHOSTNAME`, `MLMIP` and "
"`MLMPROXY1` variables for it to work correctly."
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-highsynctimesoverwan.adoc:15
msgid ""
"There is no support available for individual adjustments of the script.  The "
"script and the comments inside aim to provide an overview of the process and "
"steps to be taken into consideration.  If further help is required, contact "
"SUSE Consulting."
msgstr "ບໍ່ມີການສະໜັບສະໜູນສຳລັບການປັບແຕ່ງສະຄຣິບເປັນລາຍບຸກຄົນ. ສະຄຣິບ ແລະ ຄຳອະທິບາຍ (comments) ຂ້າງໃນມີຈຸດປະສົງເພື່ອໃຫ້ເຫັນພາບລວມຂອງຂະບວນການ ແລະ ຂັ້ນຕອນທີ່ຄວນພິຈາລະນາ. ຖ້າຫາກຕ້ອງການຄວາມຊ່ວຍເຫຼືອເພີ່ມເຕີມ, ໃຫ້ຕິດຕໍ່ SUSE Consulting."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-highsynctimesoverwan.adoc:16
msgid ""
"The proposed approach using the script is beneficial in the following "
"environment:"
msgstr "ວິທີການທີ່ນຳສະເໜີໂດຍການໃຊ້ສະຄຣິບນີ້ແມ່ນມີປະໂຫຍດໃນສະພາບແວດລ້ອມຕໍ່ໄປນີ້:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-highsynctimesoverwan.adoc:17
msgid "{productname} Proxy systems are connected via a WAN connection;"
msgstr "ລະບົບພຣັອກຊີ {productname} ທີ່ເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ຜ່ານ WAN;"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-highsynctimesoverwan.adoc:18
msgid ""
"`/srv/tftboot` contains a high number of files for distributions and client "
"PXE boot files, in total several thousand files;"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-highsynctimesoverwan.adoc:19
msgid ""
"Any proxy in `/etc/cobbler/settings` has been disabled, otherwise "
"{productname} will continue to sync content to the proxies."
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-highsynctimesoverwan.adoc:20
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"#proxies:\n"
"# - \"MLMproxy.MLMproxy.test\"\n"
"# - \"MLMproxy2.MLMproxy.test\"\n"
msgstr ""
"#proxies:\n"
"# - \"MLMproxy.MLMproxy.test\"\n"
"# - \"MLMproxy2.MLMproxy.test\"\n"

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-highsynctimesoverwan.adoc:21
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Analyzing New Sync Speed"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການວິເຄາະຄວາມໄວໃນການຊິງຄ໌ໃໝ່"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-highsynctimesoverwan.adoc:22
msgid ""
"Take a dump of the TCP traffic between {productname} and the involved "
"systems."
msgstr "ດຶງຂໍ້ມູນ (dump) ທຣາຟຟິກ TCP ລະຫວ່າງ {productname} ແລະ ລະບົບທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-highsynctimesoverwan.adoc:23
msgid "On {productname} Server:"
msgstr "ຢູ່ທີ່ເຊີເວີ {productname}:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-highsynctimesoverwan.adoc:24
#, no-wrap
msgid "tcpdump -i ethX -s 200 host <ip-address-of-susemanagerproxy> and not ssh\n"
msgstr "tcpdump -i ethX -s 200 host <ip-address-of-susemanagerproxy> and not ssh\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-highsynctimesoverwan.adoc:25
msgid "On {productname} Proxy:"
msgstr "ຢູ່ທີ່ພຣັອກຊີ {productname}:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-highsynctimesoverwan.adoc:26
#, no-wrap
msgid "tcpdump -i ethX -s 200 host <ip-address-of-susemanager> and not ssh\n"
msgstr "tcpdump -i ethX -s 200 host <ip-address-of-susemanager> and not ssh\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-highsynctimesoverwan.adoc:27
msgid ""
"This will only capture a package size of 200 which is sufficient to run an "
"analysis."
msgstr "ສິ່ງນີ້ຈະຈັບຂໍ້ມູນສະເພາະແພັກເກດທີ່ມີຂະໜາດ 200 ເຊິ່ງພຽງພໍສຳລັບການວິເຄາະ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-highsynctimesoverwan.adoc:28
msgid ""
"Adjust ethX to the respective network interface {productname} uses to "
"communicate with the proxy."
msgstr "ປັບ ethX ໃຫ້ເປັນອິນເຕີເຟດເຄືອຂ່າຍທີ່ {productname} ໃຊ້ໃນການສື່ສານກັບພຣັອກຊີ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-highsynctimesoverwan.adoc:29
msgid ""
"At last, ssh communication will not be captured to reduce the number of "
"packages even further."
msgstr "ສຸດທ້າຍ, ການສື່ສານຜ່ານ ssh ຈະບໍ່ຖືກຈັບຂໍ້ມູນ ເພື່ອຫຼຸດຜ່ອນຈຳນວນແພັກເກດລົງຕື່ມອີກ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-highsynctimesoverwan.adoc:30
msgid "Start a `cobbler sync`."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-highsynctimesoverwan.adoc:31
msgid ""
"To force a sync, delete the {cobbler} json cache file first and then issue "
"`cobbler sync`:"
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-highsynctimesoverwan.adoc:32
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"rm /var/lib/cobbler/pxe_cache.json\n"
"cobbler sync\n"
msgstr ""
"rm /var/lib/cobbler/pxe_cache.json\n"
"cobbler sync\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-highsynctimesoverwan.adoc:33
msgid "When {command]`cobbler sync` is finished, stop the TCPdumps."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-highsynctimesoverwan.adoc:34
msgid ""
"Open the TCPdumps using Wireshark, go to `Statistics > Conversations` and "
"wait for the dump to be analyzed."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-highsynctimesoverwan.adoc:35
msgid ""
"Switch to the TCP tab.  The number shown on this tab gives the total number "
"of conversations captured between {productname} Server and {productname} "
"Proxy."
msgstr "ປ່ຽນໄປທີ່ແທັບ TCP. ຕົວເລກທີ່ສະແດງໃນແທັບນີ້ຄືຈຳນວນການສົນທະນາທັງໝົດທີ່ຈັບໄດ້ລະຫວ່າງເຊີເວີ {productname} ແລະ ພຣັອກຊີ {productname}."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-highsynctimesoverwan.adoc:36
msgid "Look for the column `Duration`."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-highsynctimesoverwan.adoc:37
msgid ""
"Start by sorting in ascending order to find out the minimal amount of time "
"it took to transfer a file."
msgstr "ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນໂດຍການລຽງລຳດັບຈາກໜ້ອຍໄປຫາຫຼາຍ ເພື່ອຊອກຫາເວລາທີ່ໜ້ອຍທີ່ສຸດທີ່ໃຊ້ໃນການໂອນໄຟລ໌."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-highsynctimesoverwan.adoc:38
msgid ""
"Continue by sorting in descending order to find out the maximum values for "
"the big files, for example kernel and initrd transfers."
msgstr "ຕໍ່ໄປໂດຍການລຽງລຳດັບຈາກຫຼາຍໄປຫາໜ້ອຍ ເພື່ອຊອກຫາຄ່າສູງສຸດສຳລັບໄຟລ໌ຂະໜາດໃຫຍ່, ຕົວຢ່າງ: ການໂອນ kernel ແລະ initrd."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-highsynctimesoverwan.adoc:39
msgid "Ignore ports 4505 and 4506 as these are used for Salt communication."
msgstr "ໃຫ້ຂ້າມພອດ 4505 ແລະ 4506 ເພາະພອດເຫຼົ່ານີ້ຖືກໃຊ້ສຳລັບການສື່ສານ Salt."

#. === Conclusion 
#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-highsynctimesoverwan.adoc:40
msgid ""
"Analysis of the TCPdumps showed the transfer of small files with a size of "
"approx. 1800 bytes from {productname} Server to Proxy took around 0.3 "
"seconds."
msgstr "ການວິເຄາະ TCPdumps ສະແດງໃຫ້ເຫັນວ່າການໂອນໄຟລ໌ຂະໜາດນ້ອຍທີ່ມີຂະໜາດປະມານ 1800 ໄບຕ໌ ຈາກເຊີເວີ {productname} ໄປຫາພຣັອກຊີ ໃຊ້ເວລາປະມານ 0.3 ວິນາທີ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-highsynctimesoverwan.adoc:41
msgid ""
"While there were not many big files, the high number of smaller files "
"resulted high number of established connections as new TCP connection is "
"created for every single transferred file."
msgstr "ເຖິງແມ່ນວ່າຈະບໍ່ມີໄຟລ໌ຂະໜາດໃຫຍ່ຫຼາຍ, ແຕ່ຈຳນວນໄຟລ໌ຂະໜາດນ້ອຍທີ່ຫຼວງຫຼາຍເຮັດໃຫ້ມີການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ຈຳນວນຫຼາຍ ເພາະມີການສ້າງການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ TCP ໃໝ່ສຳລັບທຸກໆໄຟລ໌ທີ່ຖືກໂອນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-highsynctimesoverwan.adoc:42
msgid ""
"Therefore, knowing the minimal amount of transfer time and a number of "
"connections needed (approx. 5000 in the example), gives an approximate "
"estimated time for the overall transfer time: 5000 * 0.3 / 60 = 25 minutes."
msgstr "ດັ່ງນັ້ນ, ເມື່ອຮູ້ເວລາການໂອນທີ່ໜ້ອຍທີ່ສຸດ ແລະ ຈຳນວນການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ທີ່ຈຳເປັນ (ປະມານ 5000 ໃນຕົວຢ່າງ), ຈະຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ປະມານເວລາການໂອນທັງໝົດໄດ້ຄື: 5000 * 0.3 / 60 = 25 ນາທີ."

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-hostname-rename.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Troubleshooting Renaming {productname} Server"
msgstr "ການແກ້ໄຂບັນຫາການປ່ຽນຊື່ເຊີເວີ {productname}"

#
#
#
#
#. PUT THIS COMMENT AT THE TOP OF TROUBLESHOOTING SECTIONS
#. Troubleshooting format:
#. One sentence each:
#. Cause: What created the problem?
#. Consequence: What does the user see when this happens?
#. Fix: What can the user do to fix this problem?
#. Result: What happens after the user has completed the fix?
#. If more detailed instructions are required, put them in a "Resolving" procedure:
#. .Procedure: Resolving Widget Wobbles
#. . First step
#. . Another step
#. . Last step
#. Showing my working. --LKB 2020-06-22
#. Cause: Renaming the hostname
#. Consequence: Changes not picked up by db, clients and proxies
#. Fix: Use the `spacewalk-hostname-rename` script to update the settings in the PostgreSQL database and the internal structures of {productname}.
#. Result: Renaming is successfully propagated
#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-hostname-rename.adoc:2
msgid ""
"If you change the hostname of the {productname} Server locally, your "
"{productname} installation ceases to work properly.  This is because the "
"changes have not been made in the database, which prevents the changes from "
"propagating out your clients and any proxies."
msgstr "ຖ້າທ່ານປ່ຽນຊື່ໂຮສ (hostname) ຂອງເຊີເວີ {productname} ຢູ່ໃນເຄື່ອງໂດຍກົງ, ການຕິດຕັ້ງ {productname} ຂອງທ່ານຈະເຮັດວຽກບໍ່ປົກກະຕິ. ນີ້ແມ່ນຍ້ອນວ່າການປ່ຽນແປງບໍ່ໄດ້ຖືກເຮັດໃນຖານຂໍ້ມູນ, ເຊິ່ງເຮັດໃຫ້ການປ່ຽນແປງບໍ່ສົ່ງຜົນໄປຫາເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍ ແລະ ພຣັອກຊີ."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-hostname-rename.adoc:3
#, no-wrap
msgid "Rename server"
msgstr "ປ່ຽນຊື່ເຊີເວີ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-hostname-rename.adoc:4
msgid ""
"If you need to change the hostname of the {productname} Server, you can do "
"so using the `mgradm server rename` command.  This command updates the "
"settings in the {postgresql} database and the internal structures of "
"{productname}."
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ===
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-hostname-rename.adoc:5
#, no-wrap
msgid "Server configuration"
msgstr "ການຕັ້ງຄ່າເຊີເວີ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-hostname-rename.adoc:6
msgid ""
"The command takes no mandatory parameter, but can take the new hostname if "
"it is not the one from the container host."
msgstr "ຄຳສັ່ງນີ້ບໍ່ມີພາຣາມີເຕີທີ່ບັງຄັບ, ແຕ່ສາມາດລະບຸ hostname ໃໝ່ໄດ້ ຫາກມັນບໍ່ແມ່ນຊື່ດຽວກັນກັບ container host."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-hostname-rename.adoc:7
msgid ""
"In case any SSL certificate needs to be generated to match the new hostname, "
"the SSL CA password needs to be provided.  This is safely achieved using a "
"configuration file"
msgstr "ໃນກໍລະນີທີ່ຕ້ອງສ້າງ SSL certificate ໃໝ່ເພື່ອໃຫ້ກົງກັບ hostname ໃໝ່, ຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງລະບຸລະຫັດຜ່ານ SSL CA. ສິ່ງນີ້ສາມາດເຮັດໄດ້ຢ່າງປອດໄພໂດຍການໃຊ້ໄຟລ໌ການຕັ້ງຄ່າ."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-hostname-rename.adoc:8
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Prepare the configuration file for the SSL CA password"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການກຽມໄຟລ໌ການຕັ້ງຄ່າສຳລັບລະຫັດຜ່ານ SSL CA"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-hostname-rename.adoc:9
msgid "Write a `config.yaml` file with content like the following:"
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-hostname-rename.adoc:10
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"ssl:\n"
"  password: \"<CA PASSWORD>\"\n"
msgstr ""
"ssl:\n"
"  password: \"<CA PASSWORD>\"\n"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-hostname-rename.adoc:11
msgid "This file will be used in the next procedure."
msgstr "ໄຟລ໌ນີ້ຈະຖືກນຳໃຊ້ໃນຂັ້ນຕອນຕໍ່ໄປ."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-hostname-rename.adoc:12
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Renaming {productname} Server"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການປ່ຽນຊື່ເຊີເວີ {productname}"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-hostname-rename.adoc:13
msgid ""
"Change the network settings of the server on the system level locally and "
"remotely at the DNS server."
msgstr "ປ່ຽນການຕັ້ງຄ່າເຄືອຂ່າຍຂອງເຊີເວີໃນລະດັບລະບົບທັງຢູ່ໃນເຄື່ອງ ແລະ ຢູ່ທີ່ເຊີເວີ DNS."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-hostname-rename.adoc:14
msgid ""
"You also need to provide configuration settings for reverse name "
"resolution.  Changing network settings is done in the same way as with "
"renaming any other system."
msgstr "ທ່ານຍັງຕ້ອງຕັ້ງຄ່າສຳລັບການແປງຊື່ແບບຍ້ອນກັບ (reverse name resolution). ການປ່ຽນການຕັ້ງຄ່າເຄືອຂ່າຍແມ່ນເຮັດແບບດຽວກັນກັບການປ່ຽນຊື່ລະບົບອື່ນໆ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-hostname-rename.adoc:15
msgid ""
"Reboot the {productname} Server to use the new network configuration and to "
"ensure the hostname has changed."
msgstr "ເລີ່ມລະບົບເຊີເວີ {productname} ໃໝ່ເພື່ອໃຊ້ການຕັ້ງຄ່າເຄືອຂ່າຍໃໝ່ ແລະ ເພື່ອໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າຊື່ໂຮສໄດ້ປ່ຽນແປງແລ້ວ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-hostname-rename.adoc:16
msgid ""
"On the container host, from the command line, execute the following "
"command. Add `-c config.yaml` if you created the file to store the SSL CA "
"password:"
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-hostname-rename.adoc:17
#, no-wrap
msgid "mgradm server rename\n"
msgstr "mgradm server rename\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-hostname-rename.adoc:18
msgid "If the new hostname is not resolvable, the command fails."
msgstr "ຫາກ hostname ໃໝ່ບໍ່ສາມາດຄົ້ນຫາຊື່ໄດ້ (resolvable), ຄຳສັ່ງຈະລົ້ມເຫຼວ."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-hostname-rename.adoc:19
msgid ""
"The renaming procedure also takes place during the restart of the server "
"container.  The logs can be found by running this command:"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນການປ່ຽນຊື່ຍັງຈະເກີດຂຶ້ນໃນລະຫວ່າງການ restart ເຊີເວີຄອນເທນເນີ. ທ່ານສາມາດເບິ່ງລັອກໄດ້ໂດຍການລັນຄຳສັ່ງນີ້:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-hostname-rename.adoc:20
#, no-wrap
msgid "mgrctl exec -ti -- journalctl -u uyuni-update-config\n"
msgstr "mgrctl exec -ti -- journalctl -u uyuni-update-config\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-hostname-rename.adoc:21
msgid ""
"Be aware that this command triggers a refresh of the pillar data for all "
"{salt} clients when restarting the server container: the time it takes to "
"run depends on the number of registered clients."
msgstr "ໃຫ້ລະວັງວ່າຄຳສັ່ງນີ້ຈະກະຕຸ້ນການຣີເຟຣຊຂໍ້ມູນ pillar ສຳລັບໄຄລເອັນ {salt} ທັງໝົດເມື່ອ restart ເຊີເວີຄອນເທນເນີ: ເວລາທີ່ໃຊ້ຈະຂຶ້ນຢູ່ກັບຈຳນວນໄຄລເອັນທີ່ລົງທະບຽນ."

#. type: Title ===
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-hostname-rename.adoc:22
#, no-wrap
msgid "Directly managed clients reconfiguration"
msgstr "ການຕັ້ງຄ່າໃໝ່ສຳລັບໄຄລເອັນທີ່ຈັດການໂດຍກົງ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-hostname-rename.adoc:23
#, no-wrap
msgid "*Skip this procedure if clients are managed via a {productname} proxy.*\n"
msgstr "*ຂ້າມຂັ້ນຕອນນີ້ຖ້າເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍຖືກຈັດການຜ່ານພຣັອກຊີຂອງ {productname}.*\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-hostname-rename.adoc:24
msgid ""
"With the following procedure, reconfigure directly managed clients to make "
"them aware of the new hostname and IP address."
msgstr "ດ້ວຍຂັ້ນຕອນຕໍ່ໄປນີ້, ໃຫ້ຕັ້ງຄ່າເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍທີ່ຈັດການໂດຍກົງໃໝ່ ເພື່ອໃຫ້ພວກມັນຮັບຮູ້ຊື່ໂຮສ ແລະ ທີ່ຢູ່ IP ໃໝ່."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-hostname-rename.adoc:25
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Reconfiguring directly managed clients"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການຕັ້ງຄ່າໃໝ່ສຳລັບໄຄລເອັນທີ່ຈັດການໂດຍກົງ"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-hostname-rename.adoc:26
msgid ""
"On the every client, in the {salt} client configuration file, specify the "
"name of the new {salt} master ({productname} Server).  The filename is "
"`/etc/venv-salt-minion/minion.d/susemanager.conf` or, if you do not use the "
"{salt} bundle, `/etc/salt-minion/minion.d/susemanager.conf`:"
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-hostname-rename.adoc:27
#, no-wrap
msgid "master: <new_hostname>\n"
msgstr "master: <new_hostname>\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-hostname-rename.adoc:28
msgid "On every client, restart {salt} service.  Either run:"
msgstr "ໃນທຸກເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍ, ໃຫ້ເລີ່ມການເຮັດວຽກຂອງບໍລິການ {salt} ໃໝ່. ໂດຍເປີດໃຊ້:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-hostname-rename.adoc:30
msgid "Or, if you do not use the {salt} bundle, run:"
msgstr "ຫຼື ຖ້າທ່ານບໍ່ໄດ້ໃຊ້ {salt} bundle, ໃຫ້ເປີດໃຊ້:"

#. type: Title ===
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-hostname-rename.adoc:32
#, no-wrap
msgid "Client connection with applying high state"
msgstr "ການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ໄຄລເອັນດ້ວຍການໃຊ້ high state"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-hostname-rename.adoc:33
msgid ""
"Finally, to fully propagate the hostname to the {salt} client configuration, "
"apply the high state.  Applying the high state will update the hostname in "
"the repository URLs."
msgstr "ສຸດທ້າຍ, ເພື່ອສົ່ງຊື່ໂຮສໄປຫາການຕັ້ງຄ່າເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍ {salt} ຢ່າງສົມບູນ, ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ high state. ການໃຊ້ high state ຈະອັບເດດຊື່ໂຮສໃນ URL ຂອງຄັງເກັບ."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-hostname-rename.adoc:34
#, no-wrap
msgid "Reconfigure proxy"
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຄ່າພຣັອກຊີໃໝ່"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-hostname-rename.adoc:35
msgid ""
"Every proxy must be reconfigured.  The new server certificate and key must "
"be copied to the proxy.  For more information, see "
"xref:installation-and-upgrade:install-proxy.adoc[]."
msgstr "ທຸກໆພຣັອກຊີຕ້ອງໄດ້ຮັບການຕັ້ງຄ່າໃໝ່. ໃບຢັ້ງຢືນເຊີເວີ ແລະ ຄີໃໝ່ຕ້ອງຖືກກັອບປີ້ໄປຫາພຣັອກຊີ. ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ, ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງທີ່ xref:installation-and-upgrade:install-proxy.adoc[]."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-hostname-rename.adoc:36
msgid ""
"If you use PXE boot through a proxy, you must check the configuration "
"settings of the proxy.  If you use PXE boot through non-containerized "
"{productname} Proxy 4.3, `tftpsync` needs to be reconfigured."
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-hostname-rename.adoc:37
msgid "On the container host, execute:"
msgstr "ຢູ່ໃນໂຮສຂອງຄອນເທນເນີ, ໃຫ້ເປີດໃຊ້:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-hostname-rename.adoc:38
#, no-wrap
msgid "mgrctl exec -ti -- configure-tftpsync.sh\n"
msgstr "mgrctl exec -ti -- configure-tftpsync.sh\n"

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-inactiveclients.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Troubleshooting Inactive clients"
msgstr "ການແກ້ໄຂບັນຫາເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍທີ່ບໍ່ເຄື່ອນໄຫວ"

#
#
#
#. PUT THIS COMMENT AT THE TOP OF TROUBLESHOOTING SECTIONS
#. Troubleshooting format:
#. One sentence each:
#. Cause: What created the problem?
#. Consequence: What does the user see when this happens?
#. Fix: What can the user do to fix this problem?
#. Result: What happens after the user has completed the fix?
#. If more detailed instructions are required, put them in a "Resolving" procedure:
#. .Procedure: Resolving Widget Wobbles
#. . First step
#. . Another step
#. . Last step
#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-inactiveclients.adoc:2
msgid ""
"A Taskomatic job periodically pings clients to ensure they are connected.  "
"Clients are considered inactive if they have not responded to a Taskomatic "
"check in for 24 hours or more.  To see a list of inactive clients in the "
"{webui}, navigate to menu:Systems[System List > Inactive]."
msgstr "ວຽກຂອງ Taskomatic ຈະປິງ (ping) ໄປຫາເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍເປັນໄລຍະເພື່ອໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າພວກມັນຍັງເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ຢູ່. ເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍຈະຖືກຖືວ່າບໍ່ເຄື່ອນໄຫວ ຖ້າພວກມັນບໍ່ຕອບສະໜອງຕໍ່ການກວດສອບຂອງ Taskomatic ເປັນເວລາ 24 ຊົ່ວໂມງ ຫຼື ຫຼາຍກວ່ານັ້ນ. ເພື່ອເບິ່ງລາຍຊື່ເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍທີ່ບໍ່ເຄື່ອນໄຫວໃນ {webui}, ໃຫ້ໄປທີ່ menu:Systems[System List > Inactive]."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-inactiveclients.adoc:3
msgid "Clients can become inactive for a number of reasons:"
msgstr "ເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍສາມາດກາຍເປັນບໍ່ເຄື່ອນໄຫວໄດ້ຍ້ອນຫຼາຍສາເຫດ:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-inactiveclients.adoc:4
msgid "The client is not entitled to any {productname} service."
msgstr "ເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍບໍ່ມີສິດນຳໃຊ້ບໍລິການໃດໆຂອງ {productname}."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-inactiveclients.adoc:5
msgid "The client is behind a firewall that does not allow HTTPS connections."
msgstr "ເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍຢູ່ເບື້ອງຫຼັງໄຟວໍທີ່ບໍ່ອະນຸຍາດການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ HTTPS."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-inactiveclients.adoc:6
msgid "The client is behind a proxy that is misconfigured."
msgstr "ເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍຢູ່ເບື້ອງຫຼັງພຣັອກຊີທີ່ຕັ້ງຄ່າຜິດພາດ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-inactiveclients.adoc:7
msgid ""
"The client is communicating with a different {productname} Server, or the "
"connection has been misconfigured."
msgstr "ເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍກຳລັງສື່ສານກັບເຊີເວີ {productname} ອື່ນ, ຫຼື ການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ຖືກຕັ້ງຄ່າຜິດ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-inactiveclients.adoc:8
msgid ""
"The client is not in a network that can communicate with the {productname} "
"Server."
msgstr "ເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍບໍ່ໄດ້ຢູ່ໃນເຄືອຂ່າຍທີ່ສາມາດສື່ສານກັບເຊີເວີ {productname} ໄດ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-inactiveclients.adoc:9
msgid ""
"A firewall is blocking traffic between the client and the {productname} "
"Server."
msgstr "ໄຟວໍກຳລັງບລັອກທຣາຟຟິກລະຫວ່າງເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍ ແລະ ເຊີເວີ {productname}."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-inactiveclients.adoc:10
msgid "Taskomatic is misconfigured."
msgstr "Taskomatic ຖືກຕັ້ງຄ່າຜິດພາດ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-inactiveclients.adoc:11
msgid ""
"For more information about client connections to the server, see "
"xref:client-configuration:contact-methods-intro.adoc[]."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍຫາເຊີເວີ, ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງທີ່ xref:client-configuration:contact-methods-intro.adoc[]."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-inactiveclients.adoc:12
msgid ""
"For more information about configuring ports, see "
"xref:installation-and-upgrade:network-requirements.adoc#ports[]."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບການຕັ້ງຄ່າພອດ, ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງທີ່ xref:installation-and-upgrade:network-requirements.adoc#ports[]."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-inactiveclients.adoc:13
msgid ""
"For more information about troubleshooting firewalls, see "
"xref:administration:troubleshooting/tshoot-firewalls.adoc[]."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບການແກ້ໄຂບັນຫາໄຟວໍ, ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງທີ່ xref:administration:troubleshooting/tshoot-firewalls.adoc[]."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-intro.adoc:2
msgid ""
"This section contains some common problems you might encounter with "
"{productname}, and solutions to resolving them."
msgstr "ພາກສ່ວນນີ້ປະກອບດ້ວຍບັນຫາທົ່ວໄປບາງຢ່າງທີ່ທ່ານອາດຈະພົບໃນ {productname}, ແລະ ວິທີການແກ້ໄຂ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-intro.adoc:3
msgid "Troubleshooting topics specific to Public Cloud are covered separately."
msgstr "ຫົວຂໍ້ການແກ້ໄຂບັນຫາສະເພາະສຳລັບ Public Cloud ແມ່ນໄດ້ຖືກແຍກໄວ້ຕ່າງຫາກ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-intro.adoc:4
msgid ""
"For Public Cloud troubleshooting, see "
"xref:specialized-guides:public-cloud-guide/troubleshooting/tshoot-public-cloud-intro.adoc[]."
msgstr "ສຳລັບການແກ້ໄຂບັນຫາ Public Cloud, ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງທີ່ xref:specialized-guides:public-cloud-guide/troubleshooting/tshoot-public-cloud-intro.adoc[]."

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-iss.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Troubleshooting Inter-Server Synchronization"
msgstr "ການແກ້ໄຂບັນຫາການຊິງຄ໌ລະຫວ່າງເຊີເວີ (ISS)"

#
#
#
#. PUT THIS COMMENT AT THE TOP OF TROUBLESHOOTING SECTIONS
#. Troubleshooting format:
#. One sentence each:
#. Cause: What created the problem?
#. Consequence: What does the user see when this happens?
#. Fix: What can the user do to fix this problem?
#. Result: What happens after the user has completed the fix?
#. If more detailed instructions are required, put them in a "Resolving" procedure:
#. .Procedure: Resolving Widget Wobbles
#. . First step
#. . Another step
#. . Last step
#. Cause: Caches on the ISS slave and master can contain old or out-of-date entries.
#. Consequence: Synchronizing fails, with `ERROR: Encountered IntegrityError`.
#. Fix: Delete the cache on the slave and the master
#. Result: Synchronization completes successfully.
#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-iss.adoc:2
msgid ""
"Inter-server synchronization uses caches to manage the ISS Master and "
"Slaves.  These caches can be prone to bugs that create invalid entries.  In "
"this case, bugs can show up even after updating to a version that resolves "
"the bug, because the cache is still using invalid entries.  If you upgrade "
"to a new version of ISS, but are still experiencing problems, clear all the "
"caches to ensure you no longer have old entries creating a problem."
msgstr "ການຊິງຄ໌ລະຫວ່າງເຊີເວີ (ISS) ໃຊ້ແຄຊ໌ (caches) ເພື່ອຈັດການ ISS Master ແລະ Slaves. ແຄຊ໌ເຫຼົ່ານີ້ອາດຈະເກີດບັກ (bugs) ທີ່ສ້າງຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ບໍ່ຖືກຕ້ອງ. ໃນກໍລະນີນີ, ບັກອາດຈະສະແດງໃຫ້ເຫັນເຖິງແມ່ນວ່າຈະອັບເດດເປັນລຸ້ນທີ່ແກ້ໄຂບັກແລ້ວກໍຕາມ, ເພາະວ່າແຄຊ໌ຍັງຄົງໃຊ້ຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ບໍ່ຖືກຕ້ອງຢູ່. ຖ້າທ່ານອັບເກຣດ ISS ເປັນລຸ້ນໃໝ່ ແຕ່ຍັງພົບບັນຫາຢູ່, ໃຫ້ລ້າງແຄຊ໌ທັງໝົດເພື່ອໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າຈະບໍ່ມີຂໍ້ມູນເກົ່າທີ່ກໍ່ໃຫ້ເກີດບັນຫາ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-iss.adoc:3
msgid ""
"Cache errors can lead to synchronization failing with a variety of errors, "
"but the error message will usually report something like this:"
msgstr "ຂໍ້ຜິດພາດຂອງແຄຊ໌ສາມາດເຮັດໃຫ້ການຊິງຄ໌ລົ້ມເຫຼວດ້ວຍຂໍ້ຜິດພາດຫຼາຍຮູບແບບ, ແຕ່ຂໍ້ຄວາມສະແດງຂໍ້ຜິດພາດໂດຍປົກກະຕິແລ້ວຈະລາຍງານປະມານນີ້:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-iss.adoc:4
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"consider removing satellite-sync cache at /var/cache/rhn/satsync/* and "
"re-run satellite-sync with same options.\n"
msgstr "consider removing satellite-sync cache at /var/cache/rhn/satsync/* and re-run satellite-sync with same options.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-iss.adoc:5
msgid ""
"You can resolve this by deleting the cache on the ISS Master and the ISS "
"Slave, so that synchronization completes successfully."
msgstr "ທ່ານສາມາດແກ້ໄຂບັນຫານີ້ໄດ້ໂດຍການລຶບແຄຊ໌ໃນ ISS Master ແລະ ISS Slave, ເພື່ອໃຫ້ການຊິງຄ໌ສຳເລັດ."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-iss.adoc:7
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Resolving ISS Caching Errors"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການແກ້ໄຂຂໍ້ຜິດພາດຂອງ ISS Caching"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-iss.adoc:8
msgid ""
"On the ISS Master, at the command prompt, as root, delete the cache file for "
"the Master:"
msgstr "ໃນ ISS Master, ທີ່ໜ້າຕ່າງຄຳສັ່ງ, ໃນຖານະ root, ໃຫ້ລຶບໄຟລ໌ແຄຊ໌ສຳລັບ Master:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-iss.adoc:9
#, no-wrap
msgid "rm -rf /var/cache/rhn/xml-*\n"
msgstr "rm -rf /var/cache/rhn/xml-*\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-iss.adoc:10
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-iss.adoc:14
msgid "Restart the service:"
msgstr "ເລີ່ມການເຮັດວຽກຂອງບໍລິການໃໝ່:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-iss.adoc:11
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-iss.adoc:15
#, no-wrap
msgid "rcapache2 restart\n"
msgstr "rcapache2 restart\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-iss.adoc:12
msgid ""
"On the ISS Master, at the command prompt, as root, delete the cache file for "
"the Slave:"
msgstr "ໃນ ISS Master, ທີ່ໜ້າຕ່າງຄຳສັ່ງ, ໃນຖານະ root, ໃຫ້ລຶບໄຟລ໌ແຄຊ໌ສຳລັບ Slave:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-iss.adoc:13
#, no-wrap
msgid "rm -rf /var/cache/rhn/satsync/*\n"
msgstr "rm -rf /var/cache/rhn/satsync/*\n"

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-localcert.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Troubleshooting Local Issuer Certificates"
msgstr "ການແກ້ໄຂບັນຫາໃບຢັ້ງຢືນຜູ້ອອກໃຫ້ໃນທ້ອງຖິ່ນ (Local Issuer Certificates)"

#
#
#
#. PUT THIS COMMENT AT THE TOP OF TROUBLESHOOTING SECTIONS
#. Troubleshooting format:
#. One sentence each:
#. Cause: What created the problem?
#. Consequence: What does the user see when this happens?
#. Fix: What can the user do to fix this problem?
#. Result: What happens after the user has completed the fix?
#. If more detailed instructions are required, put them in a "Resolving" procedure:
#. .Procedure: Resolving Widget Wobbles
#. . First step
#. . Another step
#. . Last step
#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-localcert.adoc:2
msgid ""
"Some older bootstrap scripts create a link to the local certificate in the "
"wrong place.  This results in zypper returning an `Unrecognized error` about "
"the local issuer certificate.  You can ensure that the link to the local "
"issuer certificate has been created correctly by checking the "
"`/etc/ssl/certs/` directory.  If you come across this problem, you should "
"consider updating your bootstrap scripts to ensure that zypper operates as "
"expected."
msgstr ""

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-logintimeout.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Troubleshooting Login Timeouts"
msgstr "ການແກ້ໄຂບັນຫາການໝົດເວລາການເຂົ້າສູ່ລະບົບ"

#
#
#
#. PUT THIS COMMENT AT THE TOP OF TROUBLESHOOTING SECTIONS
#. Troubleshooting format:
#. One sentence each:
#. Cause: What created the problem?
#. Consequence: What does the user see when this happens?
#. Fix: What can the user do to fix this problem?
#. Result: What happens after the user has completed the fix?
#. If more detailed instructions are required, put them in a "Resolving" procedure:
#. .Procedure: Resolving Widget Wobbles
#. . First step
#. . Another step
#. . Last step
#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-logintimeout.adoc:2
msgid ""
"By default, the {productname} {webui} requires users to log in again after "
"30{nbsp}minutes.  Depending on your environment, you might want to adjust "
"the login timeout value."
msgstr "ຕາມຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ, {webui} ຂອງ {productname} ກຳນົດໃຫ້ຜູ້ໃຊ້ເຂົ້າສູ່ລະບົບໃໝ່ຫຼັງຈາກ 30{nbsp}ນາທີ. ອີງຕາມສະພາບແວດລ້ອມຂອງທ່ານ, ທ່ານອາດຈະຕ້ອງການປັບປ່ຽນຄ່າການໝົດເວລາການເຂົ້າສູ່ລະບົບນີ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-logintimeout.adoc:3
msgid ""
"To adjust the value, you need to make the change in both `rhn.conf` and "
"`web.xml`.  Ensure you set the value in seconds in `/etc/rhn/rhn.conf`, and "
"in minutes in `web.xml`.  The two values must equal the same amount of time."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-logintimeout.adoc:4
msgid ""
"For example, to change the timeout value to one hour, set the value in "
"`rhn.conf` to 3600 seconds, and the value in `web.xml` to 60 minutes."
msgstr ""

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-logintimeout.adoc:5
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Adjusting the {webui} Login Timeout Value"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການປັບຄ່າການໝົດເວລາການເຂົ້າສູ່ລະບົບຂອງ {webui}"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-logintimeout.adoc:6
msgid "On the container host, open a command line inside the server container:"
msgstr "ຢູ່ໃນໂຮສຂອງຄອນເທນເນີ, ໃຫ້ເປີດໜ້າຕ່າງຄຳສັ່ງພາຍໃນຄອນເທນເນີຂອງເຊີເວີ:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-logintimeout.adoc:8
msgid ""
"Open `/etc/rhn/rhn.conf` and add or edit this line to include the new "
"timeout value in seconds:"
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-logintimeout.adoc:9
#, no-wrap
msgid "web.session_database_lifetime = <Timeout_Value_in_Seconds>\n"
msgstr "web.session_database_lifetime = <Timeout_Value_in_Seconds>\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-logintimeout.adoc:10
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-logintimeout.adoc:13
msgid "Save and close the file."
msgstr "ບັນທຶກ ແລະ ປິດໄຟລ໌."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-logintimeout.adoc:11
msgid ""
"Open `/etc/tomcat/web.xml` and add or edit this line to include the new "
"timeout value in minutes:"
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-logintimeout.adoc:12
#, no-wrap
msgid "<session-timeout>Timeout_Value_in_Minutes</session-timeout>\n"
msgstr "<session-timeout>Timeout_Value_in_Minutes</session-timeout>\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-logintimeout.adoc:14
msgid "On the container host, restart the server to enforce the new configuration:"
msgstr "ໃນຄອນເທນເນີໂຮສ໌, ໃຫ້ຣີສະຕາດເຊີເວີເພື່ອໃຫ້ການຕັ້ງຄ່າໃໝ່ມີຜົນ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-logintimeout.adoc:15
#, no-wrap
msgid "systemctl restart uyuni-server.service\n"
msgstr "systemctl restart uyuni-server.service\n"

