#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-mass-duplication-machine_id.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Mass Machine_id Duplication"
msgstr "ການຊ້ຳຊ້ອນຂອງ Machine ID ຈຳນວນຫຼາຍ"

#
#
#
#. PUT THIS COMMENT AT THE TOP OF TROUBLESHOOTING SECTIONS
#. Troubleshooting format:
#. One sentence each:
#. Cause: What created the problem?
#. Consequence: What does the user see when this happens?
#. Fix: What can the user do to fix this problem?
#. Result: What happens after the user has completed the fix?
#. If more detailed instructions are required, put them in a "Resolving" procedure:
#. .Procedure: Resolving Widget Wobbles
#. . First step
#. . Another step
#. . Last step
#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-mass-duplication-machine_id.adoc:2
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-registerclones.adoc:2
msgid ""
"If you are using {productname} to manage virtual machines, you might find it "
"useful to create clones of your VMs.  A clone is a VM that uses a primary "
"disk that is an exact copy of an existing disk."
msgstr "ຖ້າທ່ານກຳລັງໃຊ້ {productname} ເພື່ອຈັດການເຄື່ອງສະເໝືອນ (VMs), ທ່ານອາດຈະພົບວ່າມັນມີປະໂຫຍດໃນການສ້າງໂຄນ (clones) ຂອງ VMs ຂອງທ່ານ. ໂຄນແມ່ນ VM ທີ່ໃຊ້ດິສກ໌ຫຼັກທີ່ເປັນການກັອບປີ້ທີ່ຄືກັນທຸກປະການຈາກດິສກ໌ທີ່ມີຢູ່ແລ້ວ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-mass-duplication-machine_id.adoc:3
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-registerclones.adoc:3
msgid ""
"While cloning VMs can save you a lot of time, the duplicated identifying "
"information on the disk can sometimes cause problems."
msgstr "ເຖິງແມ່ນວ່າການໂຄນ VMs ຈະຊ່ວຍປະຢັດເວລາໄດ້ຫຼາຍ, ແຕ່ຂໍ້ມູນອ້າງອີງທີ່ຊ້ຳກັນໃນດິສກ໌ບາງຄັ້ງອາດຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ເກີດບັນຫາ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-mass-duplication-machine_id.adoc:4
msgid ""
"If you try to register two machine where one is the clone of the other, you "
"probably want {productname} to register them as two separate clients.  "
"However, if the machine ID in both the original client and the clone is the "
"same, {productname} registers both clients as one system, and the data is "
"overwritten one the second machine is registered."
msgstr "ຖ້າທ່ານພະຍາຍາມລົງທະບຽນສອງເຄື່ອງທີ່ເຄື່ອງໜຶ່ງເປັນໂຄນຂອງອີກເຄື່ອງໜຶ່ງ, ທ່ານອາດຈະຕ້ອງການໃຫ້ {productname} ລົງທະບຽນພວກມັນເປັນເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍແຍກກັນສອງເຄື່ອງ. ແນວໃດກໍຕາມ, ຖ້າ Machine ID ທັງໃນເຄື່ອງຕົ້ນສະບັບ ແລະ ເຄື່ອງໂຄນຄືກັນ, {productname} ຈະລົງທະບຽນທັງສອງເຄື່ອງເປັນລະບົບດຽວ, ແລະ ຂໍ້ມູນຈະຖືກຂຽນທັບເມື່ອເຄື່ອງທີສອງຖືກລົງທະບຽນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-mass-duplication-machine_id.adoc:5
msgid ""
"This can be resolved by changing the machine ID of the clone, so that "
"{productname} recognizes them as two different clients.  For more "
"information and instructions on how to change machine ID, see "
"xref:administration:troubleshooting/tshoot-registerclones.adoc[]."
msgstr "ບັນຫານີ້ສາມາດແກ້ໄຂໄດ້ໂດຍການປ່ຽນ Machine ID ຂອງເຄື່ອງໂຄນ, ເພື່ອໃຫ້ {productname} ຮັບຮູ້ວ່າເປັນເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍທີ່ແຕກຕ່າງກັນສອງເຄື່ອງ. ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ ແລະ ຄຳແນະນຳກ່ຽວກັບວິທີການປ່ຽນ Machine ID, ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງທີ່ xref:administration:troubleshooting/tshoot-registerclones.adoc[]."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-mass-duplication-machine_id.adoc:6
msgid ""
"However, in some situations, it is neither feasible nor practical to change "
"the machine ID on all systems, as this could disrupt other applications that "
"depend on the existing machine IDs. In those cases, a option is available "
"where a fake machine ID is generated to be used in the context of "
"{productname}."
msgstr "ແນວໃດກໍຕາມ, ໃນບາງສະຖານະການ, ມັນອາດຈະບໍ່ສະດວກ ຫຼື ເຮັດບໍ່ໄດ້ທີ່ຈະປ່ຽນ Machine ID ໃນທຸກລະບົບ ເພາະອາດຈະໄປລົບກວນແອັບພລິເຄຊັນອື່ນໆທີ່ຕ້ອງໃຊ້ Machine ID ເດີມ. ໃນກໍລະນີເຫຼົ່ານັ້ນ, ມີຕົວເລືອກໃນການສ້າງ Machine ID ປອມເພື່ອໃຊ້ສະເພາະໃນບໍລິບົດຂອງ {productname}."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-mass-duplication-machine_id.adoc:7
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Generating machine ID for {productname} at registration time"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການສ້າງ Machine ID ສຳລັບ {productname} ໃນເວລາລົງທະບຽນ"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-mass-duplication-machine_id.adoc:8
msgid ""
"Create a Bootstrap script (skip this step if you already have it)  For more "
"information, see xref:client-configuration:registration-bootstrap.adoc[]."
msgstr "ສ້າງສະຄຣິບ Bootstrap (ຂ້າມຂັ້ນຕອນນີ້ຖ້າທ່ານມີຢູ່ແລ້ວ). ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ, ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງທີ່ xref:client-configuration:registration-bootstrap.adoc[]."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-mass-duplication-machine_id.adoc:9
msgid "Open the file and change the parameter:"
msgstr "ເປີດໄຟລ໌ແລ້ວປ່ຽນພາຣາມິເຕີ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-mass-duplication-machine_id.adoc:10
#, no-wrap
msgid "GENERATE_OWN_MACHINEID=1\n"
msgstr "GENERATE_OWN_MACHINEID=1\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-mass-duplication-machine_id.adoc:11
msgid "Start using your bootstrap strict, and machine ID will not collide anymore."
msgstr "ເລີ່ມໃຊ້ສະຄຣິບ bootstrap ຂອງທ່ານ, ແລ້ວ Machine ID ຈະບໍ່ຊ້ຳກັນອີກ."

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-mounting-tmp-with-noexec.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Troubleshooting Mounting /tmp with noexec"
msgstr "ການແກ້ໄຂບັນຫາການເມົາທ໌ (Mounting) /tmp ດ້ວຍ noexec"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-mounting-tmp-with-noexec.adoc:2
msgid ""
"Salt runs remote commands from `/tmp` on the client's file system.  "
"Therefore you must not mount `/tmp` with the `noexec` option.  The other way "
"to solve this issue is to override temporary directory path with the "
"`TMPDIR` environment variable specified for the Salt service to make it "
"pointing to the directory with no `noexec` option set.  It is recommended to "
"use systemd drop-in configuration file "
"`/etc/systemd/system/venv-salt-minion.service.d/10-TMPDIR.conf` if Salt "
"Bundle is used, or "
"`/etc/systemd/system/salt-minion.service.d/10-TMPDIR.conf` if `salt-minion` "
"is used on the client.  The example of the drop-in configuration file "
"content:"
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-mounting-tmp-with-noexec.adoc:3
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"[Service]\n"
"Environment=TMPDIR=/var/tmp\n"
msgstr ""
"[Service]\n"
"Environment=TMPDIR=/var/tmp\n"

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-mounting-vartmp-with-noexec.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Troubleshooting Mounting /var/tmp with noexec"
msgstr "ການແກ້ໄຂບັນຫາການເມົາທ໌ /var/tmp ດ້ວຍ noexec"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-mounting-vartmp-with-noexec.adoc:2
msgid ""
"Salt SSH is using `/var/tmp` to deploy Salt Bundle to and execute Salt "
"commands on the client with the bundled Python.  Therefore you must not "
"mount `/var/tmp` with the `noexec` option.  It is not possible to bootstrap "
"the clients, which have `/var/tmp` mounted with `noexec` option, with the "
"{webui} because the bootstrap process is using Salt SSH to reach a client."
msgstr ""

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-not-enough-disk-space.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Troubleshooting Not Enough Disk Space"
msgstr "ການແກ້ໄຂບັນຫາພື້ນທີ່ດິສກ໌ບໍ່ພຽງພໍ"

#
#
#
#
#
#. PUT THIS COMMENT AT THE TOP OF TROUBLESHOOTING SECTIONS
#. Troubleshooting format:
#. One sentence each:
#. Cause: What created the problem?
#. Consequence: What does the user see when this happens?
#. Fix: What can the user do to fix this problem?
