#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-oes-repos-enablement.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Troubleshooting OES repositories enablement"
msgstr "ການແກ້ໄຂບັນຫາການເປີດໃຊ້ຄັງເກັບ OES"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-oes-repos-enablement.adoc:2
msgid ""
"To enable Open Enterprise Server (OES) on {productname} Server, follow the "
"procedure described."
msgstr "ເພື່ອເປີດໃຊ້ Open Enterprise Server (OES) ໃນເຊີເວີ {productname}, ໃຫ້ປະຕິບັດຕາມຂັ້ນຕອນທີ່ໄດ້ອະທິບາຍໄວ້."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-oes-repos-enablement.adoc:3
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Enabling OES repositories"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການເປີດໃຊ້ຄັງເກັບ OES"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-oes-repos-enablement.adoc:4
msgid "Ensure you have mirror credentials from Microfocus with access to OES."
msgstr "ໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າທ່ານມີຂໍ້ມູນປະຈຳຕົວ (credentials) ຈາກ Microfocus ທີ່ມີສິດເຂົ້າເຖິງ OES."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-oes-repos-enablement.adoc:5
msgid "Log in to {productname} Server."
msgstr "ເຂົ້າສູ່ລະບົບເຊີເວີ {productname}."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-oes-repos-enablement.adoc:6
msgid "Go to `Admin > Setup Wizard > Organization Credentials`."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-oes-repos-enablement.adoc:7
msgid "Make sure you already have SUSE credentials for {productname}."
msgstr "ໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າທ່ານມີຂໍ້ມູນປະຈຳຕົວ SUSE ສຳລັບ {productname} ຢູ່ແລ້ວ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-oes-repos-enablement.adoc:8
msgid "Select option for adding new and type in Microfocus credentials."
msgstr "ເລືອກຕົວເລືອກສຳລັບການເພີ່ມໃໝ່ ແລະ ປ້ອນຂໍ້ມູນປະຈຳຕົວ Microfocus."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-oes-repos-enablement.adoc:9
msgid ""
"Go to `Admin > Setup Wizard > Organization Credentials` and wait for the "
"refresh operation to complete."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-oes-repos-enablement.adoc:10
msgid ""
"OES should be visible on the refreshed product list.  You can now enable it "
"like any other products."
msgstr "OES ຄວນຈະສະແດງໃຫ້ເຫັນໃນລາຍຊື່ຜະລິດຕະພັນທີ່ຣີເຟຣຊແລ້ວ. ຕອນນີ້ທ່ານສາມາດເປີດໃຊ້ງານມັນໄດ້ຄືກັບຜະລິດຕະພັນອື່ນໆ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-oes-repos-enablement.adoc:11
msgid ""
"For more information about OES, see "
"https://www.microfocus.com/documentation/open-enterprise-server/."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບ OES, ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງທີ່ https://www.microfocus.com/documentation/open-enterprise-server/."

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-packages.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Troubleshooting Package Inconsistencies"
msgstr "ການແກ້ໄຂບັນຫາຄວາມບໍ່ສອດຄ່ອງຂອງແພັກເກດ"

#
#
#
#. PUT THIS COMMENT AT THE TOP OF TROUBLESHOOTING SECTIONS
#. Troubleshooting format:
#. One sentence each:
#. Cause: What created the problem?
#. Consequence: What does the user see when this happens?
#. Fix: What can the user do to fix this problem?
#. Result: What happens after the user has completed the fix?
#. If more detailed instructions are required, put them in a "Resolving" procedure:
#. .Procedure: Resolving Widget Wobbles
#. . First step
#. . Another step
#. . Last step
#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-packages.adoc:2
msgid ""
"When packages on a client are locked, {productname} Server may not be able "
"to correctly determine the set of applicable patches.  When this occurs, "
"package updates are available in the {webui}, but do not appear on the "
"client, and attempts to update the client fail.  Check package locks and "
"exclude lists to determine if packages are locked or excluded on the client."
msgstr "ເມື່ອແພັກເກດໃນເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍຖືກລັອກໄວ້, ເຊີເວີ {productname} ອາດຈະບໍ່ສາມາດກຳນົດຊຸດຂອງແພັດ (patches) ທີ່ເໝາະສົມໄດ້ຢ່າງຖືກຕ້ອງ. ເມື່ອສິ່ງນີ້ເກີດຂຶ້ນ, ການອັບເດດແພັກເກດຈະສະແດງໃຫ້ເຫັນໃນ {webui}, ແຕ່ຈະບໍ່ປາກົດຢູ່ໃນເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍ, ແລະ ຄວາມພະຍາຍາມໃນການອັບເດດເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍຈະລົ້ມເຫຼວ. ໃຫ້ກວດສອບການລັອກແພັກເກດ ແລະ ລາຍຊື່ການຍົກເວັ້ນ (exclude lists) ເພື່ອເບິ່ງວ່າແພັກເກດຖືກລັອກ ຫຼື ຖືກຍົກເວັ້ນຢູ່ໃນເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍຫຼືບໍ່."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-packages.adoc:3
msgid ""
"On the client, check package locks and exclude lists to determine if "
"packages are locked or excluded:"
msgstr "ໃນເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍ, ໃຫ້ກວດສອບການລັອກແພັກເກດ ແລະ ລາຍຊື່ການຍົກເວັ້ນ ເພື່ອເບິ່ງວ່າແພັກເກດຖືກລັອກ ຫຼື ຖືກຍົກເວັ້ນ:"

#.  SUSE Liberty Linux not available at Uyuni for now
#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-packages.adoc:4
msgid ""
"On an Expanded Support Platform, check `/etc/yum.conf` and search for "
"`exclude=`."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-packages.adoc:5
msgid "On {sle} and {opensuse}, use the `zypper locks` command."
msgstr ""

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-passing-grains-to-start-event.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Troubleshooting Passing Grains to a Start Event"
msgstr "ການແກ້ໄຂບັນຫາການສົ່ງ Grains ໄປຫາ Start Event"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-passing-grains-to-start-event.adoc:2
msgid ""
"Every time a Salt client starts, it passes the `machine_id` grain to "
"{productname}. {productname} uses this grain to determine if the client is "
"registered.  This process requires a synchronous Salt call. Synchronous Salt "
"calls block other processes, so if you have a lot of clients start at the "
"same time, the process could create significant delays."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-passing-grains-to-start-event.adoc:3
msgid ""
"To overcome this problem, a new feature has been introduced in Salt to avoid "
"making a separate synchronous Salt call."
msgstr "ເພື່ອແກ້ໄຂບັນຫານີ້, ຟີເຈີໃໝ່ໄດ້ຖືກນຳສະເໜີໃນ Salt ເພື່ອຫຼີກລ່ຽງການເອີ້ນໃຊ້ Salt ແບບຊິງໂຄຣນັດແຍກຕ່າງຫາກ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-passing-grains-to-start-event.adoc:4
msgid ""
"To use this feature, you can add a configuration parameter to the client "
"configuration, on clients that support it."
msgstr "ເພື່ອໃຊ້ຟີເຈີນີ້, ທ່ານສາມາດເພີ່ມພາຣາມິເຕີການຕັ້ງຄ່າເຂົ້າໃນການຕັ້ງຄ່າເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍ, ສຳລັບເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍທີ່ຮອງຮັບ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-passing-grains-to-start-event.adoc:5
msgid ""
"To make this process easier, you can use the `mgr_start_event_grains.sls` "
"helper Salt state."
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-passing-grains-to-start-event.adoc:6
msgid ""
"This only applies to already registered clients.  If you registered your "
"Salt client recently, this config parameter is added by default."
msgstr "ສິ່ງນີ້ໃຊ້ໄດ້ກັບເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍທີ່ລົງທະບຽນແລ້ວເທົ່ານັ້ນ. ຖ້າທ່ານໄດ້ລົງທະບຽນເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍ Salt ຂອງທ່ານເມື່ອບໍ່ດົນມານີ້, ພາຣາມິເຕີການຕັ້ງຄ່ານີ້ຈະຖືກເພີ່ມໄວ້ເປັນຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-passing-grains-to-start-event.adoc:7
msgid ""
"On the {productname} Server, at the command prompt, use this command to "
"enable the `start_event_grains` configuration helper:"
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-passing-grains-to-start-event.adoc:8
#, no-wrap
msgid "salt '*' state.sls util.mgr_start_event_grains\n"
msgstr "salt '*' state.sls util.mgr_start_event_grains\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-passing-grains-to-start-event.adoc:9
msgid ""
"This command adds the required configuration into the client's configuration "
"file, and applies it when the client is restarted.  If you have a large "
"number of clients, you can execute the command in batch mode instead:"
msgstr "ຄຳສັ່ງນີ້ຈະເພີ່ມການຕັ້ງຄ່າທີ່ຈຳເປັນເຂົ້າໃນໄຟລ໌ຕັ້ງຄ່າຂອງເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍ, ແລະ ຈະມີຜົນເມື່ອເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍຖືກເລີ່ມໃໝ່. ຖ້າທ່ານມີເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍຈຳນວນຫຼາຍ, ທ່ານສາມາດໃຊ້ຄຳສັ່ງໃນຮູບແບບແບັດຊ໌ແທນໄດ້:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-passing-grains-to-start-event.adoc:10
#, no-wrap
msgid "salt --batch-size 50 '*' state.sls mgr_start_event_grains\n"
msgstr "salt --batch-size 50 '*' state.sls mgr_start_event_grains\n"

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-proxy-connections-and-fqdns.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Troubleshooting Proxy Connections and FQDN"
msgstr "ການແກ້ໄຂບັນຫາການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ພຣັອກຊີ ແລະ FQDN"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-proxy-connections-and-fqdns.adoc:2
msgid ""
"Sometimes clients connected through a proxy appear in the {webui}, but do "
"not show that they are connected through a proxy.  This can occur if you are "
"not using the fully qualified domain name (FQDN) to connect, and the proxy "
"is not known to {productname}."
msgstr "ບາງຄັ້ງເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍທີ່ເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ຜ່ານພຣັອກຊີຈະປາກົດໃນ {webui}, ແຕ່ບໍ່ສະແດງໃຫ້ເຫັນວ່າພວກມັນເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ຜ່ານພຣັອກຊີ. ສິ່ງນີ້ສາມາດເກີດຂຶ້ນໄດ້ຖ້າທ່ານບໍ່ໄດ້ໃຊ້ຊື່ໂດເມນທີ່ຄົບຖ້ວນ (FQDN) ໃນການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່, ແລະ ພຣັອກຊີບໍ່ເປັນທີ່ຮູ້ຈັກສຳລັບ {productname}."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-proxy-connections-and-fqdns.adoc:3
msgid ""
"To correct this behavior, specify additional FQDNs as grains in the client "
"configuration file on the proxy:"
msgstr "ເພື່ອແກ້ໄຂບັນຫານີ້, ໃຫ້ລະບຸ FQDN ເພີ່ມເຕີມເປັນ grains ໃນໄຟລ໌ຕັ້ງຄ່າເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍຢູ່ທີ່ພຣັອກຊີ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-proxy-connections-and-fqdns.adoc:4
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"grains:\n"
"  susemanager:\n"
"    custom_fqdns:\n"
"      - name.one\n"
"      - name.two\n"
msgstr ""
"grains:\n"
"  susemanager:\n"
"    custom_fqdns:\n"
"      - name.one\n"
"      - name.two\n"

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-reg-from-webui-fails-no-errors.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Troubleshooting Registration from {webui} fails and does not show any errors"
msgstr "ການແກ້ໄຂບັນຫາການລົງທະບຽນຈາກ {webui} ລົ້ມເຫຼວ ແລະ ບໍ່ສະແດງຂໍ້ຜິດພາດໃດໆ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-reg-from-webui-fails-no-errors.adoc:2
msgid ""
"For the initial registration from the {webui}, all Salt clients are using "
"Salt SSH."
msgstr "ສຳລັບການລົງທະບຽນຄັ້ງທຳອິດຈາກ {webui}, ເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍ Salt ທັງໝົດຈະໃຊ້ Salt SSH."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-reg-from-webui-fails-no-errors.adoc:3
msgid ""
"Because of its nature, Salt SSH clients do not report errors back to the "
"server."
msgstr "ເນື່ອງຈາກທຳມະຊາດຂອງມັນ, ເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍ Salt SSH ຈະບໍ່ລາຍງານຂໍ້ຜິດພາດກັບຄືນໄປຫາເຊີເວີ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-reg-from-webui-fails-no-errors.adoc:4
msgid ""
"However, the Salt SSH clients store a log locally at `/var/log/salt-ssh.log` "
"that can be inspected for errors."
msgstr ""

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-registerclones.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Troubleshooting Registering Cloned Clients"
msgstr "ການແກ້ໄຂບັນຫາການລົງທະບຽນເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍທີ່ຖືກໂຄນ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-registerclones.adoc:4
msgid ""
"If you have a client that is already registered, you create a clone of that "
"client, and then try and register the clone, you probably want {productname} "
"to register them as two separate clients.  However, if the machine ID in "
"both the original client and the clone is the same, {productname} registers "
"both clients as one system, and the existing client data is overwritten with "
"that of the clone."
msgstr "ຖ້າທ່ານມີເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍທີ່ລົງທະບຽນແລ້ວ, ທ່ານສ້າງໂຄນຂອງເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍນັ້ນ, ແລ້ວພະຍາຍາມລົງທະບຽນເຄື່ອງໂຄນ, ທ່ານອາດຈະຕ້ອງການໃຫ້ {productname} ລົງທະບຽນພວກມັນເປັນເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍແຍກກັນສອງເຄື່ອງ. ແນວໃດກໍຕາມ, ຖ້າ Machine ID ທັງໃນເຄື່ອງຕົ້ນສະບັບ ແລະ ເຄື່ອງໂຄນຄືກັນ, {productname} ຈະລົງທະບຽນທັງສອງເຄື່ອງເປັນລະບົບດຽວ, ແລະ ຂໍ້ມູນເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍເດີມຈະຖືກຂຽນທັບດ້ວຍຂໍ້ມູນຂອງເຄື່ອງໂຄນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-registerclones.adoc:5
msgid ""
"This can be resolved by changing the machine ID of the clone, so that "
"{productname} recognizes them as two different clients."
msgstr "ບັນຫານີ້ສາມາດແກ້ໄຂໄດ້ໂດຍການປ່ຽນ Machine ID ຂອງເຄື່ອງໂຄນ, ເພື່ອໃຫ້ {productname} ຮັບຮູ້ວ່າເປັນເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍທີ່ແຕກຕ່າງກັນສອງເຄື່ອງ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-registerclones.adoc:6
msgid ""
"Each step of this procedure is performed on the cloned client.  This "
"procedure does not manipulate the original client, which remains registered "
"to {productname}."
msgstr "ແຕ່ລະຂັ້ນຕອນຂອງຂະບວນການນີ້ແມ່ນເຮັດໃນເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍທີ່ຖືກໂຄນ. ຂະບວນການນີ້ຈະບໍ່ໄປປ່ຽນແປງເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍຕົ້ນສະບັບ, ເຊິ່ງຍັງຄົງລົງທະບຽນກັບ {productname} ຢູ່."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-registerclones.adoc:7
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Resolving Duplicate Machine IDs in Cloned Salt Clients"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການແກ້ໄຂ Machine ID ທີ່ຊ້ຳກັນໃນເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍ Salt ທີ່ຖືກໂຄນ"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-registerclones.adoc:8
#, no-wrap
msgid "*Initial System Configuration*\n"
msgstr "*ການຕັ້ງຄ່າລະບົບເບື້ອງຕົ້ນ*\n"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-registerclones.adoc:9
msgid "On the cloned machine, change the hostname and IP addresses."
msgstr "ໃນເຄື່ອງທີ່ຖືກໂຄນ, ໃຫ້ປ່ຽນຊື່ໂຮສ ແລະ ທີ່ຢູ່ IP."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-registerclones.adoc:10
msgid ""
"Make sure `/etc/hosts` contains the changes you made and the correct host "
"entries."
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-registerclones.adoc:11
#, no-wrap
msgid "*Resolving Duplicate Machine IDs*\n"
msgstr "*ການແກ້ໄຂ Machine ID ທີ່ຊ້ຳກັນ*\n"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-registerclones.adoc:12
msgid "_For distributions that support systemd:_"
msgstr "_ສຳລັບລະບົບທີ່ຮອງຮັບ systemd:_"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-registerclones.adoc:13
msgid ""
"If your machines have the same machine ID, as root, delete the files on each "
"duplicated client and re-create it:"
msgstr "ຖ້າເຄື່ອງຂອງທ່ານມີ Machine ID ດຽວກັນ, ໃນຖານະ root, ໃຫ້ລຶບໄຟລ໌ໃນແຕ່ລະເຄື່ອງທີ່ຊ້ຳກັນ ແລະ ສ້າງມັນໃໝ່:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-registerclones.adoc:14
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"rm /etc/machine-id\n"
"rm /var/lib/dbus/machine-id\n"
"rm /var/lib/zypp/AnonymousUniqueId\n"
"dbus-uuidgen --ensure\n"
"systemd-machine-id-setup\n"
msgstr ""
"rm /etc/machine-id\n"
"rm /var/lib/dbus/machine-id\n"
"rm /var/lib/zypp/AnonymousUniqueId\n"
"dbus-uuidgen --ensure\n"
"systemd-machine-id-setup\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-registerclones.adoc:15
msgid ""
"If the cloned machine also has a folder in `/var/log/journal/` it needs to "
"be renamed accordingly to the new machine ID. If names do not match, "
"`journalctl` could not retrieve any log and `podman logs` would not show "
"anything."
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-registerclones.adoc:16
#, no-wrap
msgid "mv /var/log/journal/* /var/log/journal/$(cat /etc/machine-id)\n"
msgstr "mv /var/log/journal/* /var/log/journal/$(cat /etc/machine-id)\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-registerclones.adoc:17
msgid "_For distributions that do not support systemd:_"
msgstr "_ສຳລັບລະບົບທີ່ບໍ່ຮອງຮັບ systemd:_"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-registerclones.adoc:18
msgid "As root, generate a machine ID from dbus:"
msgstr "ໃນຖານະ root, ໃຫ້ສ້າງ Machine ID ຈາກ dbus:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-registerclones.adoc:19
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"rm /var/lib/dbus/machine-id\n"
"rm /var/lib/zypp/AnonymousUniqueId\n"
"dbus-uuidgen --ensure\n"
msgstr ""
"rm /var/lib/dbus/machine-id\n"
"rm /var/lib/zypp/AnonymousUniqueId\n"
"dbus-uuidgen --ensure\n"

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-registerclones.adoc:20
msgid ""
"If you are cloning a {rhel} 8.10 server that will later be liberated to "
"{sll}, you must perform extra steps to fix the kernel configuration files."
msgstr "ຖ້າທ່ານກຳລັງໂຄນເຊີເວີ {rhel} 8.10 ທີ່ຈະຖືກປ່ຽນ (liberated) ເປັນ {sll} ໃນພາຍຫຼັງ, ທ່ານຕ້ອງປະຕິບັດຂັ້ນຕອນເພີ່ມເຕີມເພື່ອແກ້ໄຂໄຟລ໌ຕັ້ງຄ່າ kernel."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-registerclones.adoc:21
msgid ""
"{rhel} uses the machine ID to generate kernel entries in "
"`/boot/loader/entries`.  Not performing these steps will result in a mix of "
"old and new kernel entries after the liberation, as {sll} kernels will "
"create new entries instead of replacing the old ones."
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-registerclones.adoc:22
msgid "After changing the machine ID and before liberating, run:"
msgstr "ຫຼັງຈາກປ່ຽນ machine ID ແລະ ກ່ອນທີ່ຈະປ່ຽນລະບົບ, ໃຫ້ເປີດໃຊ້:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-registerclones.adoc:23
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"sudo rm -rf /boot/loader/entries/\n"
"sudo for ver in $(rpm -q kernel --qf '%{VERSION}-%{RELEASE}.%{ARCH}\\n'); do "
"echo \"Reinstalling kernel $ver...\"; sudo kernel-install add $ver "
"/lib/modules/$ver; done\n"
"sudo grub2-mkconfig -o /boot/efi/EFI/redhat/grub.cfg\n"
msgstr ""
"sudo rm -rf /boot/loader/entries/\n"
"sudo for ver in $(rpm -q kernel --qf '%{VERSION}-%{RELEASE}.%{ARCH}\\n'); do echo \"Reinstalling kernel $ver...\"; sudo kernel-install add $ver /lib/modules/$ver; done\n"
"sudo grub2-mkconfig -o /boot/efi/EFI/redhat/grub.cfg\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-registerclones.adoc:24
msgid ""
"For more information and example on liberating {rhel} 8.10 server, see "
"xref:common-workflows:workflow-liberate-rhel-with-secureboot.adoc[]."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ ແລະ ຕົວຢ່າງກ່ຽວກັບການປ່ຽນລະບົບເຊີເວີ {rhel} 8.10, ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງທີ່ xref:common-workflows:workflow-liberate-rhel-with-secureboot.adoc[]."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-registerclones.adoc:25
#, no-wrap
msgid "*Reconfiguring {salt} Clients*\n"
msgstr "*ການຕັ້ງຄ່າເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍ {salt} ໃໝ່*\n"

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-registerclones.adoc:26
msgid ""
"If your clients still have the same Salt client ID, delete the `minion_id` "
"file on each client (FQDN is used when it is regenerated on client restart)."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-registerclones.adoc:27
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-registerclones.adoc:32
msgid "For Salt Minion clients:"
msgstr "ສຳລັບໄຄລເອັນ Salt Minion:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-registerclones.adoc:28
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"rm /etc/salt/minion_id\n"
"rm -rf /etc/salt/pki\n"
msgstr ""
"rm /etc/salt/minion_id\n"
"rm -rf /etc/salt/pki\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-registerclones.adoc:29
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-registerclones.adoc:34
msgid "For Salt Bundle clients:"
msgstr "ສຳລັບເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍ Salt Bundle:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-registerclones.adoc:30
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"rm /etc/venv-salt-minion/minion_id\n"
"rm -rf /etc/venv-salt-minion/pki\n"
msgstr ""
"rm /etc/venv-salt-minion/minion_id\n"
"rm -rf /etc/venv-salt-minion/pki\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-registerclones.adoc:31
msgid ""
"Delete accepted keys from the onboarding page and the system profile from "
"{productname}, and restart the client with."
msgstr "ລຶບ keys ທີ່ຖືກຕອບຮັບແລ້ວອອກຈາກໜ້າ onboarding ແລະ ລຶບ system profile ອອກຈາກ {productname}, ຈາກນັ້ນໃຫ້ restart ໄຄລເອັນດ້ວຍ."

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-registerclones.adoc:33
#, no-wrap
msgid "service salt-minion restart\n"
msgstr "service salt-minion restart\n"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-registerclones.adoc:35
#, no-wrap
msgid "service venv-salt-minion restart\n"
msgstr "service venv-salt-minion restart\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-registerclones.adoc:36
msgid ""
"Re-register the clients.  Each client now has a different `/etc/machine-id` "
"and should be correctly displayed on the `System Overview` page."
msgstr ""

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-remote-root-on-micro.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Remote root login on {sl-micro}"
msgstr "ການເຂົ້າສູ່ລະບົບ root ທາງໄກໃນ {sl-micro}"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-remote-root-on-micro.adoc:2
msgid ""
"For enhanced security, new installations of {sl-micro} 6.1 and later do not "
"allow password-based remote root login anymore, which also affects server "
"and proxy container hosts running on {sl-micro} and managed {sl-micro} "
"clients.  Also, {sle-micro} 5.5 clients with password-based remote root "
"login which will when be migrated to 6.1/6.2 will suddenly lose this access "
"and must be newly configured.  For more information, see SL Micro Release "
"Notes 6.1 "
"(https://www.suse.com/releasenotes/x86_64/SL-Micro/6.1/index.html#jsc-SMO-405)."
msgstr "ເພື່ອຄວາມປອດໄພທີ່ເພີ່ມຂຶ້ນ, ການຕິດຕັ້ງ {sl-micro} 6.1 ແລະ ເວີຊັນໃໝ່ກວ່າ ຈະບໍ່ອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ ເຂົ້າສູ່ລະບົບ root ຈາກທາງໄກດ້ວຍລະຫັດຜ່ານອີກຕໍ່ໄປ, ເຊິ່ງສົ່ງຜົນກະທົບຕໍ່ server host ແລະ proxy container host ທີ່ລັນໃນ {sl-micro} ລວມເຖິງໄຄລເອັນ {sl-micro} ທີ່ຖືກຈັດການ. ນອກຈາກນັ້ນ, ໄຄລເອັນ {sle-micro} 5.5 ທີ່ໃຊ້ການເຂົ້າສູ່ລະບົບ root ຈາກທາງໄກດ້ວຍລະຫັດຜ່ານ ເມື່ອມີການຍ້າຍ (migrate) ໄປຫາ 6.1/6.2 ຈະສູນເສຍສິດການເຂົ້າເຖິງນີ້ ແລະ ຕ້ອງໄດ້ຮັບການຕັ້ງຄ່າໃໝ່. ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ, ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງ SL Micro Release Notes 6.1 (https://www.suse.com/releasenotes/x86_64/SL-Micro/6.1/index.html#jsc-SMO-405)."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-remote-root-on-micro.adoc:3
msgid ""
"While deploying components of {productname} such as a {productname} Proxy, "
"password-based remote root login is required by default.  You can enable "
"password-based remote root login with the following steps."
msgstr "ໃນຂະນະທີ່ຕິດຕັ້ງອົງປະກອບຂອງ {productname} ເຊັ່ນ {productname} Proxy, ໂດຍປົກກະຕິແລ້ວແມ່ນຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງ ໃຊ້ການເຂົ້າສູ່ລະບົບ root ຈາກທາງໄກດ້ວຍລະຫັດຜ່ານ. ທ່ານສາມາດເປີດໃຊ້ງານມັນໄດ້ດ້ວຍຂັ້ນຕອນຕໍ່ໄປນີ້."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-remote-root-on-micro.adoc:4
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Enabling SSH root login with a password on {sl-micro}"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການເປີດໃຊ້ SSH root login ດ້ວຍລະຫັດຜ່ານໃນ {sl-micro}"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-remote-root-on-micro.adoc:5
msgid ""
"You can enable SSH root login in two different ways.  Either of them will "
"work; choose the one that best fits your setup."
msgstr "ທ່ານສາມາດເປີດໃຊ້ SSH root login ໄດ້ສອງວິທີ. ວິທີໃດກໍໄດ້ແມ່ນໃຊ້ໄດ້ຜົນ; ໃຫ້ເລືອກວິທີທີ່ເໝາະສົມກັບການຕັ້ງຄ່າຂອງທ່ານ."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-remote-root-on-micro.adoc:6
#, no-wrap
msgid "Option A: Use the preconfigured package"
msgstr "ຕົວເລືອກ A: ໃຊ້ແພັກເກັດທີ່ຕັ້ງຄ່າໄວ້ລ່ວງໜ້າ"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-remote-root-on-micro.adoc:7
msgid ""
"Install the package `openssh-server-config-rootlogin` from the UI/API on the "
"client."
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-remote-root-on-micro.adoc:8
msgid ""
"Reboot the container host to activate the new configuration either from UI "
"or from terminal"
msgstr "ຣີບູດ (Reboot) container host ເພື່ອໃຫ້ການຕັ້ງຄ່າໃໝ່ມີຜົນ ບໍ່ວ່າຈະຜ່ານ UI ຫຼື ຜ່ານ terminal"

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-remote-root-on-micro.adoc:9
#, no-wrap
msgid "Option B: Edit the SSH configuration manually"
msgstr "ຕົວເລືອກ B: ແກ້ໄຂການຕັ້ງຄ່າ SSH ດ້ວຍຕົນເອງ"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-remote-root-on-micro.adoc:10
msgid ""
"Add a drop-in config `/etc/ssh/sshd_config.d/permit_root.conf` file, with "
"the following content:"
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-remote-root-on-micro.adoc:11
#, no-wrap
msgid "PermitRootLogin yes\n"
msgstr "PermitRootLogin yes\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-remote-root-on-micro.adoc:12
msgid "Reload the SSH server configuration"
msgstr "Reload ການຕັ້ງຄ່າ SSH ເຊີເວີ"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-remote-root-on-micro.adoc:13
#, no-wrap
msgid "systemctl reload sshd\n"
msgstr "systemctl reload sshd\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-remote-root-on-micro.adoc:14
msgid ""
"If connected using SSH, before disconnecting from the server, validate the "
"SSH server is working correctly by opening a new SSH connection."
msgstr "ຫາກເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ດ້ວຍ SSH ຢູ່, ກ່ອນທີ່ຈະຕັດການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ຈາກເຊີເວີ, ໃຫ້ກວດສອບວ່າ SSH ເຊີເວີ ເຮັດວຽກໄດ້ຢ່າງຖືກຕ້ອງໂດຍການເປີດການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ SSH ໃໝ່ອີກອັນໜຶ່ງ."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-remote-root-on-micro.adoc:15
msgid ""
"For more information about `transactional-update`, see "
"https://documentation.suse.com/sle-micro/6.1/html/Micro-transactional-updates/."
msgstr ""

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-resizingBtrfs.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Resizing BTRFS"
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-resizingBtrfs.adoc:2
#, no-wrap
msgid "Resizing a BTRFS LVM partition on {sles}"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-resizingBtrfs.adoc:3
msgid ""
"When managing a {sles} installation, the BTRFS root file system can become "
"full due to files, caches, or snapshots.  Because removing snapshots "
"manually is not recommended, the best approach is to resize the partition."
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-resizingBtrfs.adoc:4
msgid ""
"To resize a BTRFS partition, the partition must remain mounted during this "
"procedure."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-resizingBtrfs.adoc:5
msgid ""
"The following steps illustrate how to resize a BTRFS LVM partition by adding "
"a new disk (for example, `/dev/sdb`) to the volume group."
msgstr ""

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-resizingBtrfs.adoc:6
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Resizing a BTRFS LVM Partition*"
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-resizingBtrfs.adoc:7
msgid ""
"Check the disk information to identify the root file system device and the "
"new disk using the `lsblk` command:"
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-resizingBtrfs.adoc:8
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-resizingBtrfs.adoc:20
#, no-wrap
msgid "lsblk\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-resizingBtrfs.adoc:9
msgid "Create a physical volume on the newly added disk:"
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-resizingBtrfs.adoc:10
#, no-wrap
msgid "pvcreate /dev/sdb\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-resizingBtrfs.adoc:11
msgid "Scan for the current volume group that the root file system is using:"
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-resizingBtrfs.adoc:12
#, no-wrap
msgid "vgscan\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-resizingBtrfs.adoc:13
msgid "Extend the volume group with the newly created physical volume:"
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-resizingBtrfs.adoc:14
#, no-wrap
msgid "vgextend system /dev/sdb\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-resizingBtrfs.adoc:15
msgid "Extend the logical volume using the extended volume group:"
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-resizingBtrfs.adoc:16
#, no-wrap
msgid "lvextend -l +100%FREE /dev/system/root\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-resizingBtrfs.adoc:17
msgid "Resize the BTRFS root file system:"
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-resizingBtrfs.adoc:18
#, no-wrap
msgid "btrfs filesystem resize max /\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-resizingBtrfs.adoc:19
msgid ""
"Check the result to verify that the system's root file system has been "
"successfully resized to the new capacity:"
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-resizingBtrfs.adoc:21
#, no-wrap
msgid "Resizing a BTRFS root volume on {sl-micro}"
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-resizingBtrfs.adoc:22
msgid ""
"When managing a {sle-micro} 5.5 or {sl-micro} 6 installation, the BTRFS root "
"volume may run out of disk space and require resizing."
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-resizingBtrfs.adoc:23
msgid ""
"Attempting to resize the root volume using the standard command `btrfs fi "
"resize max /` will result in the following error:"
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-resizingBtrfs.adoc:24
#, no-wrap
msgid "ERROR: unable to resize '/': Read-only file system\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-resizingBtrfs.adoc:25
msgid ""
"This occurs because the root volume is mounted read-only on {sle-micro} "
"systems.  To successfully complete the operation online, you must target the "
"`/.snapshots` mount point instead, which is mounted read-write."
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-resizingBtrfs.adoc:26
msgid "Changes to the partition table can cause damage to the system."
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-resizingBtrfs.adoc:27
msgid ""
"Always make sure to have a complete backup before making changes to the "
"partition table."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-resizingBtrfs.adoc:28
msgid ""
"The following procedure illustrates how to resize a single disk where the "
"root partition is the last partition on the device (for example, "
"`/dev/sda3`).  If your layout contains further partitions, the operation may "
"become more complex and you may need to reach out to {scclongform} for "
"support."
msgstr ""

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-resizingBtrfs.adoc:29
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Resizing the BTRFS root volume"
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-resizingBtrfs.adoc:30
msgid ""
"Resize the existing disk to the new size using the appropriate hypervisor or "
"storage tools for your environment."
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-resizingBtrfs.adoc:31
msgid ""
"Rescan the device to be resized.  For example, to rescan `/dev/sda`, run the "
"following command as root:"
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-resizingBtrfs.adoc:32
#, no-wrap
msgid "echo 1 > /sys/block/sda/device/rescan\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-resizingBtrfs.adoc:33
msgid ""
"Resize the root partition using the comamnd `growpart`.  In this example, we "
"resize partition 3 on `/dev/sda`:"
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-resizingBtrfs.adoc:34
#, no-wrap
msgid "growpart /dev/sda 3\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-resizingBtrfs.adoc:35
msgid ""
"Resize the BTRFS filesystem.  Be sure to use `/.snapshots` instead of `/` to "
"avoid the read-only error:"
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-resizingBtrfs.adoc:36
#, no-wrap
msgid "btrfs fi resize max /.snapshots\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-resizingBtrfs.adoc:37
msgid ""
"Check the filesystem to verify that the new size has been applied "
"successfully:"
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-resizingBtrfs.adoc:38
#, no-wrap
msgid "btrfs fi show /\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-rh-cdn-channel-and-multiple-certs.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Troubleshooting Red Hat CDN Channel and Multiple Certificates"
msgstr "ການແກ້ໄຂບັນຫາຊ່ອງທາງ Red Hat CDN ແລະ ໃບຢັ້ງຢືນຫຼາຍໃບ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-rh-cdn-channel-and-multiple-certs.adoc:2
msgid ""
"The {redhat} content delivery network (CDN) channels sometimes provide "
"multiple certificates, but the {productname} {webui} can only import a "
"single certificate.  If CDN presents a certificate that is different to the "
"one the {productname} {webui} knows about, validation fails and permission "
"to access the repository is denied, even though the certificate is "
"accurate.  The error message received is:"
msgstr "ຊ່ອງທາງເຄືອຂ່າຍການສົ່ງເນື້ອຫາ (CDN) ຂອງ {redhat} ບາງຄັ້ງໃຫ້ໃບຢັ້ງຢືນຫຼາຍໃບ, ແຕ່ {webui} ຂອງ {productname} ສາມາດນຳເຂົ້າໄດ້ພຽງໃບຢັ້ງຢືນດຽວເທົ່ານັ້ນ. ຖ້າ CDN ສົ່ງໃບຢັ້ງຢືນທີ່ແຕກຕ່າງຈາກໃບຢັ້ງຢືນທີ່ {webui} ຂອງ {productname} ຮູ້ຈັກ, ການຢັ້ງຢືນຈະລົ້ມເຫຼວ ແລະ ການເຂົ້າເຖິງຄັງເກັບຈະຖືກປະຕິເສດ, ເຖິງແມ່ນວ່າໃບຢັ້ງຢືນນັ້ນຈະຖືກຕ້ອງກໍຕາມ. ຂໍ້ຄວາມສະແດງຂໍ້ຜິດພາດທີ່ໄດ້ຮັບຄື:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-rh-cdn-channel-and-multiple-certs.adoc:3
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"[error]\n"
"Repository '<repo_name>' is invalid.\n"
"<repo.pem> Valid metadata not found at specified URL\n"
"History:\n"
" - [|] Error trying to read from '<repo.pem>'\n"
" - Permission to access '<repo.pem>' denied.\n"
"Please check if the URIs defined for this repository are pointing to a valid "
"repository.\n"
"Skipping repository '<repo_nam' because of the above error.\n"
"Could not refresh the repositories because of errors.\n"
"HH:MM:SS RepoMDError: Cannot access repository. Maybe repository GPG keys "
"are not imported\n"
msgstr ""
"[error]\n"
"Repository '<repo_name>' is invalid.\n"
"<repo.pem> Valid metadata not found at specified URL\n"
"History:\n"
" - [|] Error trying to read from '<repo.pem>'\n"
" - Permission to access '<repo.pem>' denied.\n"
"Please check if the URIs defined for this repository are pointing to a valid repository.\n"
"Skipping repository '<repo_nam' because of the above error.\n"
"Could not refresh the repositories because of errors.\n"
"HH:MM:SS RepoMDError: Cannot access repository. Maybe repository GPG keys are not imported\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-rh-cdn-channel-and-multiple-certs.adoc:4
msgid ""
"To resolve this issue, merge all valid certificates into a single `.pem` "
"file, and rebuild the certificates for use by {productname}:"
msgstr ""

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-rh-cdn-channel-and-multiple-certs.adoc:5
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Resolving Multiple {redhat} CDN Certificates"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການແກ້ໄຂບັນຫາໃບຢັ້ງຢືນ Red Hat CDN ຫຼາຍໃບ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-rh-cdn-channel-and-multiple-certs.adoc:6
msgid ""
"On the {redhat} client, at the command prompt, as root, gather all current "
"certificates from `/etc/pki/entitlement/` in a single `rh-cert.pem` file:"
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-rh-cdn-channel-and-multiple-certs.adoc:7
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"cat 866705146090697087.pem 3539668047766796506.pem "
"redhat-entitlement-authority.pem > rh-cert.pem\n"
msgstr "cat 866705146090697087.pem 3539668047766796506.pem redhat-entitlement-authority.pem > rh-cert.pem\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-rh-cdn-channel-and-multiple-certs.adoc:8
msgid ""
"Gather all current keys from `/etc/pki/entitlement/` in a single "
"`rh-key.pem` file:"
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-rh-cdn-channel-and-multiple-certs.adoc:9
#, no-wrap
msgid "cat 866705146090697087-key.pem 3539668047766796506-key.pem > rh-key.pem\n"
msgstr "cat 866705146090697087-key.pem 3539668047766796506-key.pem > rh-key.pem\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-rh-cdn-channel-and-multiple-certs.adoc:10
msgid ""
"You can now import the new certificates to the {productname} Server, using "
"the instructions in xref:client-configuration:clients-rh-cdn.adoc[]."
msgstr "ຕອນນີ້ທ່ານສາມາດນຳເຂົ້າໃບຢັ້ງຢືນໃໝ່ໄປຫາເຊີເວີ {productname} ໄດ້ ໂດຍໃຊ້ຄຳແນະນຳໃນ xref:client-configuration:clients-rh-cdn.adoc[]."

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-rpctimeout.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Troubleshooting RPC Connection Timeouts"
msgstr "ການແກ້ໄຂບັນຫາການໝົດເວລາການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ RPC"

#
#
#
#. PUT THIS COMMENT AT THE TOP OF TROUBLESHOOTING SECTIONS
#. Troubleshooting format:
#. One sentence each:
#. Cause: What created the problem?
#. Consequence: What does the user see when this happens?
#. Fix: What can the user do to fix this problem?
#. Result: What happens after the user has completed the fix?
#. If more detailed instructions are required, put them in a "Resolving" procedure:
#. .Procedure: Resolving Widget Wobbles
#. . First step
#. . Another step
#. . Last step
#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-rpctimeout.adoc:2
msgid ""
"RPC connections can sometimes time out due to slow networks or a network "
"link going down.  This results in package downloads or batch jobs hanging or "
"taking longer than expected.  You can adjust the maximum time that an RPC "
"connection can take by editing the configuration file.  While this does not "
"resolve networking problems, it does cause a process to fail rather than "
"hang."
msgstr "ການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ RPC ບາງຄັ້ງອາດຈະໝົດເວລາເນື່ອງຈາກເຄືອຂ່າຍຊ້າ ຫຼື ການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ເຄືອຂ່າຍຂັດຂ້ອງ. ສິ່ງນີ້ສົ່ງຜົນໃຫ້ການດາວໂຫຼດແພັກເກດ ຫຼື ວຽກແບບແບັດຊ໌ຄ້າງ ຫຼື ໃຊ້ເວລາດົນກວ່າທີ່ຄາດໄວ້. ທ່ານສາມາດປັບໄລຍະເວລາສູງສຸດທີ່ການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ RPC ຈະໃຊ້ໄດ້ໂດຍການແກ້ໄຂໄຟລ໌ຕັ້ງຄ່າ. ເຖິງແມ່ນວ່ານີ້ຈະບໍ່ໄດ້ແກ້ໄຂບັນຫາເຄືອຂ່າຍໂດຍກົງ, ແຕ່ມັນຈະຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ຂະບວນການລົ້ມເຫຼວແທນທີ່ຈະຄ້າງຢູ່."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-rpctimeout.adoc:3
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Resolving RPC connection timeouts"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການແກ້ໄຂການໝົດເວລາການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ RPC"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-rpctimeout.adoc:4
msgid ""
"On the {productname} Server, open the `/etc/rhn/rhn.conf` file and set a "
"maximum timeout value (in seconds):"
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-rpctimeout.adoc:5
#, no-wrap
msgid "server.timeout =`number`\n"
msgstr "server.timeout =`number`\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-rpctimeout.adoc:6
msgid ""
"On the {productname} Proxy, open the `/etc/uyuni/proxy/config.yaml` file and "
"set a maximum timeout value (in seconds).  The proxy containers need to be "
"restarted for the change to be effective:"
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-rpctimeout.adoc:7
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-rpctimeout.adoc:11
#, no-wrap
msgid "timeout =`number`\n"
msgstr "timeout =`number`\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-rpctimeout.adoc:8
msgid ""
"On a {sles} client that uses zypper, open the `/etc/zypp/zypp.conf` file and "
"set a maximum timeout value (in seconds):"
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-rpctimeout.adoc:9
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"## Valid values:  [0,3600]\n"
"## Default value: 180\n"
"download.transfer_timeout = 180\n"
msgstr ""
"## Valid values:  [0,3600]\n"
"## Default value: 180\n"
"download.transfer_timeout = 180\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-rpctimeout.adoc:10
msgid ""
"On a {rhel} client that uses yum, open the `/etc/yum.conf` file and set a "
"maximum timeout value (in seconds):"
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-rpctimeout.adoc:12
msgid ""
"If you limit RPC timeouts to less than `180` seconds, you risk aborting "
"perfectly normal operations."
msgstr "ຖ້າທ່ານກຳນົດການໝົດເວລາ RPC ໃຫ້ໜ້ອຍກວ່າ `180` ວິນາທີ, ທ່ານອາດຈະມີຄວາມສ່ຽງທີ່ຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ການເຮັດວຽກປົກກະຕິຖືກຍົກເລີກ."

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-salt-clients-down-and-dns.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Troubleshooting Salt clients shown as down and DNS settings"
msgstr "ການແກ້ໄຂບັນຫາເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍ Salt ສະແດງສະຖານະປິດ (down) ແລະ ການຕັ້ງຄ່າ DNS"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-salt-clients-down-and-dns.adoc:2
msgid ""
"Even if the Salt client is running, actions such as package refresh or apply "
"states can be marked as failed with the message:"
msgstr "ເຖິງແມ່ນວ່າເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍ Salt ຈະເຮັດວຽກຢູ່, ການກະທຳຕ່າງໆເຊັ່ນ ການຣີເຟຣຊແພັກເກດ ຫຼື ການນຳໃຊ້ states ອາດຈະຖືກໝາຍວ່າລົ້ມເຫຼວດ້ວຍຂໍ້ຄວາມ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-salt-clients-down-and-dns.adoc:3
#, no-wrap
msgid "Minion is down or could not be contacted.\n"
msgstr "Minion is down or could not be contacted.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-salt-clients-down-and-dns.adoc:4
msgid ""
"In this case try rescheduling the action.  If rescheduling succeeds, the "
"cause of the problem can be a wrong DNS configuration."
msgstr "ໃນກໍລະນີນີ, ໃຫ້ລອງຕັ້ງກຳນົດເວລາການກະທຳໃໝ່. ຖ້າການຕັ້ງກຳນົດເວລາໃໝ່ສຳເລັດ, ສາເຫດຂອງບັນຫາອາດມາຈາກການຕັ້ງຄ່າ DNS ທີ່ຜິດພາດ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-salt-clients-down-and-dns.adoc:6
msgid ""
"When the Salt client is restarted, or in case the grains are refreshed, the "
"client calculates its FQDN grains, and it is unresponsive until the grains "
"are proceeded.  When a scheduled action on {productname} Server is going to "
"be executed, {productname} Server performs a `test.ping` to the client "
"before the actual action to ensure the client is actually running and the "
"action can be triggered."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-salt-clients-down-and-dns.adoc:7
msgid ""
"By default, {productname} Server waits for 5 seconds to get the response "
"from `test.ping` command.  If the response is not received within 5 seconds, "
"then the action is set to fail with the message that the client is down or "
"could not be contacted."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-salt-clients-down-and-dns.adoc:8
msgid ""
"To correct this, fix the DNS resolution on the client, so the client does "
"not get stuck for 5 seconds while solving its FQDN."
msgstr "ເພື່ອແກ້ໄຂບັນຫານີ້, ໃຫ້ແກ້ໄຂການແປງຊື່ DNS ໃນເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍ, ເພື່ອໃຫ້ເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍບໍ່ຄ້າງຢູ່ 5 ວິນາທີໃນຂະນະທີ່ກຳລັງແປງຊື່ FQDN ຂອງມັນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-salt-clients-down-and-dns.adoc:9
msgid ""
"If this is not possible, try to increase the value for "
"`java.salt_presence_ping_timeout` in the `/etc/rhn/rhn.conf` file on the "
"{productname} Server to a value higher than 4."
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-salt-clients-down-and-dns.adoc:11
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"mgrctl term\n"
"vim /etc/rhn/rhn.conf\n"
"java.salt_presence_ping_timeout = 6\n"
msgstr ""
"mgrctl term\n"
"vim /etc/rhn/rhn.conf\n"
"java.salt_presence_ping_timeout = 6\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-salt-clients-down-and-dns.adoc:12
msgid "After that, run:"
msgstr "ຫຼັງຈາກນັ້ນ, ໃຫ້ເປີດໃຊ້:"

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-salt-clients-down-and-dns.adoc:14
msgid ""
"Increasing this value will cause {productname} Server to take longer to "
"check if a minion is unreachable or unresponsive, causing the {productname} "
"Server to be slower or less responsive overall."
msgstr "ການເພີ່ມຄ່ານີ້ຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ເຊີເວີ {productname} ໃຊ້ເວລາດົນກວ່າໃນການກວດສອບວ່າ minion ເຂົ້າເຖິງບໍ່ໄດ້ ຫຼື ບໍ່ຕອບສະໜອງ, ເຊິ່ງຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ເຊີເວີ {productname} ຊ້າລົງ ຫຼື ຕອບສະໜອງໜ້ອຍລົງໂດຍລວມ."

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-schema-upgrade-fails.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Troubleshooting Schema Upgrade Fails"
msgstr "ການແກ້ໄຂບັນຫາການອັບເກຣດ Schema ລົ້ມເຫຼວ"

#
#
#
#
#
#. PUT THIS COMMENT AT THE TOP OF TROUBLESHOOTING SECTIONS
#. Troubleshooting format:
#. One sentence each:
#. Cause: What created the problem?
#. Consequence: What does the user see when this happens?
#. Fix: What can the user do to fix this problem?
#. Result: What happens after the user has completed the fix?
#. If more detailed instructions are required, put them in a "Resolving" procedure:
#. .Procedure: Resolving Widget Wobbles
#. . First step
#. . Another step
#. . Last step
#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-schema-upgrade-fails.adoc:2
msgid ""
"If the schema upgrade fails, the database version check and all the other "
"spacewalk services do not start.  Run `mgradm start` on the container host "
"for more information and hints how to proceed."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-schema-upgrade-fails.adoc:4
msgid "You can also run the version check directly in the container:"
msgstr "ທ່ານຍັງສາມາດເປີດໃຊ້ການກວດສອບເວີຊັນໄດ້ໂດຍກົງໃນຄອນເທນເນີ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-schema-upgrade-fails.adoc:5
#, no-wrap
msgid "systemctl status uyuni-check-database.service\n"
msgstr "systemctl status uyuni-check-database.service\n"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-schema-upgrade-fails.adoc:7
#, no-wrap
msgid "journalctl -u uyuni-check-database.service\n"
msgstr "journalctl -u uyuni-check-database.service\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-schema-upgrade-fails.adoc:8
msgid ""
"These commands print debug information if you do not want to run the more "
"general `mgradm` command."
msgstr ""

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-sync.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Troubleshooting Synchronization"
msgstr "ການແກ້ໄຂບັນຫາການຊິງຄ໌"

#
#
#
#. PUT THIS COMMENT AT THE TOP OF TROUBLESHOOTING SECTIONS
#. Troubleshooting format:
#. One sentence each:
#. Cause: What created the problem?
#. Consequence: What does the user see when this happens?
#. Fix: What can the user do to fix this problem?
#. Result: What happens after the user has completed the fix?
#. If more detailed instructions are required, put them in a "Resolving" procedure:
#. .Procedure: Resolving Widget Wobbles
#. . First step
#. . Another step
#. . Last step
#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-sync.adoc:2
msgid ""
"Synchronization can fail for a number of reasons.  To get more information "
"about a connection problem, run this command:"
msgstr "ການຊິງຄ໌ສາມາດລົ້ມເຫຼວໄດ້ຍ້ອນຫຼາຍສາເຫດ. ເພື່ອໃຫ້ໄດ້ຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບບັນຫາການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່, ໃຫ້ເປີດໃຊ້ຄຳສັ່ງນີ້:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-sync.adoc:3
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"export URLGRABBER_DEBUG=DEBUG\n"
"spacewalk-repo-sync -c <channelname> <options> > "
"/var/log/spacewalk-repo-sync-$(date +%F-%R).log 2>&1\n"
msgstr ""
"export URLGRABBER_DEBUG=DEBUG\n"
"spacewalk-repo-sync -c <channelname> <options> > /var/log/spacewalk-repo-sync-$(date +%F-%R).log 2>&1\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-sync.adoc:4
msgid "You can also check logs created by Zypper at `/var/log/zypper.log`"
msgstr ""

#. type: Labeled list
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-sync.adoc:5
#, no-wrap
msgid "GPG Key Mismatch"
msgstr "GPG Key ບໍ່ກົງກັນ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-sync.adoc:6
msgid ""
"{productname} does not automatically trust third party GPG keys.  If package "
"synchronization fails, it could be because of an untrusted GPG key.  You can "
"find out if this is the case by opening `/var/log/rhn/reposync` and looking "
"for an error like this:"
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-sync.adoc:7
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"['/usr/bin/spacewalk-repo-sync', '--channel', 'sle-12-sp1-ga-desktop-\n"
"nvidia-driver-x86_64', '--type', 'yum', '--non-interactive']\n"
"RepoMDError: Cannot access repository. Maybe repository GPG keys are not "
"imported\n"
msgstr ""
"['/usr/bin/spacewalk-repo-sync', '--channel', 'sle-12-sp1-ga-desktop-\n"
"nvidia-driver-x86_64', '--type', 'yum', '--non-interactive']\n"
"RepoMDError: Cannot access repository. Maybe repository GPG keys are not imported\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-sync.adoc:8
msgid ""
"To resolve the problem, you need to import the GPG key to {productname}.  "
"For more on importing GPG keys, see "
"xref:administration:repo-metadata.adoc[]."
msgstr "ເພື່ອແກ້ໄຂບັນຫານີ້, ທ່ານຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງນຳເຂົ້າ GPG key ໄປຫາ {productname}. ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບການນຳເຂົ້າ GPG keys, ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງທີ່ xref:administration:repo-metadata.adoc[]."

#. type: Labeled list
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-sync.adoc:9
#, no-wrap
msgid "GPG Key Removal from `spacewalk-repo-sync`"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-sync.adoc:10
msgid ""
"When a GPG key for repository has been manually imported using "
"`spacewalk-repo-sync`, and this key is no longer needed (for example if the "
"key was compromised, or was used for testing purposes only), it can be "
"removed from the zypper RPM database used by `spacewalk-repo-sync` with the "
"following command:"
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-sync.adoc:11
#, no-wrap
msgid "rpm --dbpath=/var/lib/spacewalk/reposync/root/var/lib/rpm/ -e gpg-pubkey-*\n"
msgstr "rpm --dbpath=/var/lib/spacewalk/reposync/root/var/lib/rpm/ -e gpg-pubkey-*\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-sync.adoc:12
msgid "where `gpg-pubkey-*` is the name of the GPG key to be removed."
msgstr ""

#. type: Labeled list
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-sync.adoc:13
#, no-wrap
msgid "Renewing GPG Key"
msgstr "ການຕໍ່ອາຍຸ GPG Key"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-sync.adoc:14
msgid ""
"If you want to renew a GPG key, first remove the old key, and then generate "
"and import a new one."
msgstr "ຖ້າທ່ານຕ້ອງການຕໍ່ອາຍຸ GPG key, ໃຫ້ລຶບຄີເກົ່າອອກກ່ອນ, ແລ້ວຈຶ່ງສ້າງ ແລະ ນຳເຂົ້າຄີໃໝ່."

#. type: Labeled list
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-sync.adoc:15
#, no-wrap
msgid "Checksum Mismatch"
msgstr "Checksum ບໍ່ກົງກັນ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-sync.adoc:16
msgid ""
"If a checksum has failed, you might see an error like this in the "
"`/var/log/rhn/reposync/*.log` log file:"
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-sync.adoc:17
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Repo Sync Errors: (50, u'checksums did not match\n"
"326a904c2fbd7a0e20033c87fc84ebba6b24d937 vs\n"
"afd8c60d7908b2b0e2d95ad0b333920aea9892eb', 'Invalid information uploaded\n"
"to the server')\n"
"The package microcode_ctl-1.17-102.57.62.1.x86_64 which is referenced by\n"
"patch microcode_ctl-8413 was not found in the database. This patch has\n"
"been skipped.\n"
msgstr ""
"Repo Sync Errors: (50, u'checksums did not match\n"
"326a904c2fbd7a0e20033c87fc84ebba6b24d937 vs\n"
"afd8c60d7908b2b0e2d95ad0b333920aea9892eb', 'Invalid information uploaded\n"
"to the server')\n"
"The package microcode_ctl-1.17-102.57.62.1.x86_64 which is referenced by\n"
"patch microcode_ctl-8413 was not found in the database. This patch has\n"
"been skipped.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-sync.adoc:18
msgid ""
"You can resolve this error by running the synchronization from the command "
"prompt with the `-Y` option:"
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-sync.adoc:19
#, no-wrap
msgid "spacewalk-repo-sync --channel <channelname> -Y\n"
msgstr "spacewalk-repo-sync --channel <channelname> -Y\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-sync.adoc:20
msgid ""
"This option verifies the repository data before the synchronization, rather "
"than relying on locally cached checksums."
msgstr "ຕົວເລືອກນີ້ຈະກວດສອບຂໍ້ມູນຄັງເກັບກ່ອນການຊິງຄ໌, ແທນທີ່ຈະອີງໃສ່ checksums ທີ່ແຄຊ໌ໄວ້ໃນເຄື່ອງ."

#. type: Labeled list
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-sync.adoc:21
#, no-wrap
msgid "Connection Timeout"
msgstr "ການໝົດເວລາການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-sync.adoc:22
msgid "If the download times out with the following error:"
msgstr "ຖ້າການດາວໂຫຼດໝົດເວລາດ້ວຍຂໍ້ຜິດພາດຕໍ່ໄປນີ້:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-sync.adoc:23
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"28, 'Operation too slow. Less than 1000 bytes/sec transferred the last 300 "
"seconds\n"
msgstr "28, 'Operation too slow. Less than 1000 bytes/sec transferred the last 300 seconds\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-sync.adoc:24
msgid ""
"You can resolve this error by specifying `reposync_timeout` and "
"`reposync_minrate` configuration values in `/etc/rhn/rhn.conf`.  By default, "
"when less than 1000 bytes per second are transferred in 300 secs, the "
"download is aborted.  You can adjust the number of bytes per second with "
"`reposync_minrate`, and the number of seconds to wait with "
"`reposync_timeout`."
msgstr ""

#. type: Labeled list
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-sync.adoc:25
#, no-wrap
msgid "Manually Trusting the Key During reposync"
msgstr "ການຍອມຮັບຄີດ້ວຍຕົນເອງໃນລະຫວ່າງການເຮັດ reposync"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-sync.adoc:26
msgid ""
"It is possible that in some cases when `reposync` is run, you may need to "
"accept the GPG key manually.  For example:"
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-sync.adoc:27
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"# spacewalk-repo-sync -c nvidia-compute-sle-15-x86_64-we-sp3\n"
"17:07:40 ======================================\n"
"17:07:40 | Channel: nvidia-compute-sle-15-x86_64-we-sp3\n"
"17:07:40 ======================================\n"
"17:07:40 Sync of channel started.\n"
"New repository or package signing key received:\n"
"  Repository:       nvidia-compute-sle-15-x86_64-we-sp3\n"
"  Key Fingerprint:  610C 7B14 E068 A878 070D A4E9 9CD0 A493 D42D 0685\n"
"  Key Name:         cudatools <cudatools@nvidia.com>\n"
"  Key Algorithm:    RSA 4096\n"
"  Key Created:      Thu Apr 14 16:04:01 2022\n"
"  Key Expires:      (does not expire)\n"
"  Rpm Name:         gpg-pubkey-d42d0685-62589a51\n"
"    Note: Signing data enables the recipient to verify that no modifications "
"occurred after the data\n"
"    were signed. Accepting data with no, wrong or unknown signature can lead "
"to a corrupted system\n"
"    and in extreme cases even to a system compromise.\n"
"    Note: A GPG pubkey is clearly identified by its fingerprint. Do not rely "
"on the key's name. If\n"
"    you are not sure whether the presented key is authentic, ask the "
"repository provider or check\n"
"    their web site. Many providers maintain a web page showing the "
"fingerprints of the GPG keys they\n"
"    are using.\n"
"Do you want to reject the key, trust temporarily, or trust always? [r/t/a/?] "
"(r):\n"
msgstr ""
"# spacewalk-repo-sync -c nvidia-compute-sle-15-x86_64-we-sp3\n"
"17:07:40 ======================================\n"
"17:07:40 | Channel: nvidia-compute-sle-15-x86_64-we-sp3\n"
"17:07:40 ======================================\n"
"17:07:40 Sync of channel started.\n"
"New repository or package signing key received:\n"
"  Repository:       nvidia-compute-sle-15-x86_64-we-sp3\n"
"  Key Fingerprint:  610C 7B14 E068 A878 070D A4E9 9CD0 A493 D42D 0685\n"
"  Key Name:         cudatools <cudatools@nvidia.com>\n"
"  Key Algorithm:    RSA 4096\n"
"  Key Created:      Thu Apr 14 16:04:01 2022\n"
"  Key Expires:      (does not expire)\n"
"  Rpm Name:         gpg-pubkey-d42d0685-62589a51\n"
