"defaults to English (`en_US`)."
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ===
#: en/modules/administration/pages/users.adoc:74
#, no-wrap
msgid "User Default Interface Theme"
msgstr "ຮູບແບບ (Theme) ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຂອງຜູ້ໃຊ້"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/users.adoc:75
msgid ""
"By default, the {productname} {webui} uses the theme appropriate to the "
"product you have installed.  You can change the theme to reflect the {uyuni} "
"or {susemgr} colors.  The {susemgr} theme also has a dark option available."
msgstr "ຕາມຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ, {webui} ຂອງ {productname} ຈະໃຊ້ຮູບແບບທີ່ເໝາະສົມກັບຜະລິດຕະພັນທີ່ທ່ານໄດ້ຕິດຕັ້ງ. ທ່ານສາມາດປ່ຽນຮູບແບບເພື່ອສະທ້ອນເຖິງສີຂອງ {uyuni} ຫຼື {susemgr} ໄດ້. ຮູບແບບຂອງ {susemgr} ຍັງມີຕົວເລືອກແບບມືດ (dark option) ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ງານນຳ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/users.adoc:76
msgid ""
"You can change the default theme in the `rhn.conf` configuration file.  To "
"change the default theme, open the `/etc/rhn/rhn.conf` file and add or edit "
"this line:"
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/users.adoc:77
#, no-wrap
msgid "web.theme_default = <THEME>\n"
msgstr "web.theme_default = <THEME>\n"

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/administration/pages/users.adoc:78
#, no-wrap
msgid "Available WebUI Themes"
msgstr "ຮູບແບບ WebUI ທີ່ມີໃຫ້ໃຊ້"

#. type: Table
#: en/modules/administration/pages/users.adoc:79
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Theme Name     | Colors    | Style\n"
"| `suse-light` | {susemgr} | Light\n"
"| `suse-dark`  | {susemgr} | Dark\n"
"| `uyuni`      | {uyuni}   | Light\n"
msgstr ""

