#. type: Title ====
#: en/modules/administration/partials/image-mgmt-container-inspection.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Image Inspection"
msgstr "ການກວດສອບຮູບພາບ (Image Inspection)"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/partials/image-mgmt-container-inspection.adoc:2
msgid ""
"A base container image (BCI) comes with all the software to run it, but "
"because BCIs are lightweight they may not come with all tools and libraries "
"you may need for inspection."
msgstr "ຮູບພາບຄອນເທນເນີພື້ນຖານ (BCI) ມາພ້ອມກັບຊອບແວທັງໝົດເພື່ອເປີດໃຊ້ງານມັນ, ແຕ່ເນື່ອງຈາກ BCIs ມີນ້ຳໜັກເບົາ ພວກມັນຈຶ່ງອາດຈະບໍ່ມີເຄື່ອງມື ແລະ ໄລບຣາຣີ (libraries) ທັງໝົດທີ່ທ່ານອາດຈະຕ້ອງໃຊ້ສຳລັບການກວດສອບ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/partials/image-mgmt-container-inspection.adoc:3
msgid "When inspecting a container image you can see an error message such as:"
msgstr "ເມື່ອກຳລັງກວດສອບຮູບພາບຄອນເທນເນີ ທ່ານອາດຈະເຫັນຂໍ້ຄວາມສະແດງຂໍ້ຜິດພາດເຊັ່ນ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/partials/image-mgmt-container-inspection.adoc:4
#, no-wrap
msgid "libssl.so.1.1: cannot open shared object file: No such file or directory\n"
msgstr "libssl.so.1.1: cannot open shared object file: No such file or directory\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/partials/image-mgmt-container-inspection.adoc:5
msgid ""
"A BCI can be used in the other scenarios than with the container build host "
"and using the {salt} bundle for the inspection, but if you need inspection "
"to work you must add all needed software in advance."
msgstr "BCI ສາມາດຖືກນຳໃຊ້ໃນຮູບແບບອື່ນໆນອກຈາກການໃຊ້ກັບໂຮສບິວຄອນເທນເນີ ແລະ ການໃຊ້ {salt} bundle ສຳລັບການກວດສອບ, ແຕ່ຖ້າທ່ານຕ້ອງການໃຫ້ການກວດສອບເຮັດວຽກໄດ້ ທ່ານຕ້ອງເພີ່ມຊອບແວທີ່ຈຳເປັນທັງໝົດເຂົ້າໄປກ່ອນລ່ວງໜ້າ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/partials/image-mgmt-container-inspection.adoc:6
msgid ""
"To avoid such issues you must add `libopenssl` to the image with "
"`Dockerfile` and rebuild the image."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/partials/image-mgmt-container-inspection.adoc:7
msgid "The same can happen with `libexpat`."
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/administration/partials/install_scap_security_guide_package.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Install the SCAP security guide package"
msgstr "ຕິດຕັ້ງແພັກເກດ SCAP security guide"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/partials/install_scap_security_guide_package.adoc:2
msgid ""
"For executing remediations you need to install the SCAP security guide "
"package on the Ansible control node."
msgstr "ສຳລັບການດຳເນີນການແກ້ໄຂ (remediations) ທ່ານຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງຕິດຕັ້ງແພັກເກດ SCAP security guide ໃນ Ansible control node."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/administration/partials/install_scap_security_guide_package.adoc:3
#, no-wrap
