msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການຕິດຕັ້ງແພັກເກດ SCAP security guide"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/partials/install_scap_security_guide_package.adoc:4
msgid ""
"From menu:Systems[Overview], select the client.  Then click "
"menu:Software[Packages > Install]."
msgstr "ຈາກ menu:Systems[Overview], ໃຫ້ເລືອກເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍ. ແລ້ວຄລິກ menu:Software[Packages > Install]."

#. type: delimited block _
